window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Big Sis Slaps Him Damn Hard","paragraphs":["Perhaps because all the supporting actors performed too brilliantly, the audience's thoughts were completely carried away.","So they ignored Ji Fei, who had been standing at the edge of the stage, coldly observing everything.","It wasn't until Ji Fei appeared, running a sword through the Emperor Lord who had just been pouring his heart out to the Goddess, that everyone suddenly woke up.","Oh right, it was previously established that Ji Fei came from the human purgatory and ascended through cultivation.","So that line, \"I am the countless wronged souls who died because of you!\" suddenly made people's scalps tingle and their hearts surge.","Not to mention the people at the scene were caught off guard, the netizens watching through screens were even more unprepared, with exclamation marks filling the screen.","\"This plot twist nearly broke my back!\"","\"I've been wanting to kill these two love-struck idiots for a while now.\"","\"If Sister Fei hadn't acted so quickly, I would've reached into the screen myself.\"","\"The world is about to be destroyed, and you're still here hugging and crying, talking about stupid love questions. It's truly speechless to the extreme. All I can say is, well killed!\"","\"Although this comparison may not be appropriate, but if you look at the livestream of the waiting area, Sun Mo's expression... I'm sorry, but I laughed.\"","Even though he knew he shouldn't lose composure, Sun Mo's expression management still failed.","His face was ashen, his expression twisted, as if it was really them performing a deep emotional scene on stage, only to be suddenly stabbed by Ji Fei, turning all their supposedly touching actions into a complete joke.","It was too damn humiliating.","Although he knew it was just acting, who could endure such humiliation? The fact that he didn't storm off in anger was already his greatest patience.","And such a Sun Mo naturally aroused sympathy from some of his fans.","\"This is too much, what did our brother do wrong to be targeted like this? Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's hearts are too dirty!\"","\"Let's be objective, why can't immortals fall in love? Why must the Emperor Lord sacrifice his love for the sake of the world? Why must the Goddess sacrifice herself? Stop with the moral coercion! You don't know how it hurts until it happens to you.\"","\"Exactly, if you're so capable, why don't you sacrifice your own loved ones?\"","It must be said that the fans of the male god group and the fans of immortal romance dramas were not easily defeated.","The stage performance continued.","...","The Emperor Lord naturally wouldn't die from just one sword strike, but he was severely injured and fell into the Goddess's arms.","The Goddess anxiously used her divine power to save him, looking at Ji Fei with sadness and confusion, \"What are you saying? What wronged souls?\"","Ji Fei stepped forward and slapped her directly, \"Still pretending not to know?\"","The Goddess's cheek was struck askew, but she still wore an innocent expression, looking at Ji Fei in disbelief.","Ji Fei grabbed the Goddess's neck, forcing her to look back, as if using immortal arts to make the Goddess see the sins they had committed.","On the big screen, all the tragedies flashed by quickly.","The Goddess's face turned pale, her pupils trembling, tears streaming down her face, then she shook her head frantically in denial, as if unable to face it.","\"I didn't know it would be like this! I really didn't know,\" the Goddess cried out.","Ji Fei slapped her again. \"You still say you didn't know? You were once a mortal too, how could you not know? Or did you also start seeing them as insects, so you simply didn't care?\"","The Goddess shook her head in denial. \"I'm not... I really am not. I am the Goddess, the Goddess loves all people, I...\"","\"Fine, you're playing deaf and dumb, aren't you? Then earlier, when the Emperor Lord killed so many people to force you out, why didn't you come out?\"","\"I was preparing to sacrifice myself to save all living beings! I couldn't let the Emperor Lord stop me.\" The Goddess seemed to suddenly find her confidence.","\"Then why didn't you hide until the end, secretly go to sacrifice yourself? Why did you only come out when he was about to kill the Demon Lord? How come you weren't afraid of failing halfway then?\"","This question directly left the Goddess speechless, her lips trembling.","...","This part of the plot was almost the same as what the male god group had performed, so when Ji Fei threw out these soul-striking questions...","Whether at the scene or online, everyone felt as if they had been struck by lightning.","\"I can't believe I didn't realize this problem earlier!\"","\"Damn, you keep saying you're the Goddess, treating all living beings equally, but when mortals were being killed you didn't show up, yet when the Demon Lord was about to be killed, you were suddenly forced to act?\"","\"If you had persisted in hiding until the end to complete your mission, I could still respect you as following the great way.\"","\"Exactly, if you don't persist to the end, weren't all those mortals killed by the Emperor Lord earlier just a joke?\"","\"Not just a joke, they were merely pawns in their love game. Look carefully, isn't it like the male and female leads having a lovers' quarrel, the female lead runs away, so the male lead torments a bunch of pawns, and when the female lead has no choice but to come back to save the remaining pawns, and for this, they expect us pawns to be grateful? It was an undeserved disaster to begin with.\"","\"I can't believe I was moved by that kind of plot earlier. My God, I feel sick.\"","\"Hypocritical, just hypocritical. Sister Fei, slap her good!\"","At this point, even the opposing fans couldn't come up with any favorable arguments, and could only weakly say: \"The Goddess didn't know the Emperor Lord would be so ruthless... When she found out, she could only try to protect those remaining.\"","\"The Emperor Lord here had already fallen into demonic ways, how could she not have anticipated this? It's just that those sacrifices were insignificant in her eyes!\"","The performance on stage continued.","...","\"I really didn't mean to, I'm sorry, I'm sorry...\" The Goddess's expression was remorseful, unable to defend the calamity caused by them, but the next moment, seeing the Emperor Lord continuously coughing blood, she anxiously tried to heal him.","Ji Fei immediately put her sword to the Goddess's neck, \"You still want to use your divine power to save him? Is this what your divine power should be used for?\"","The Goddess looked at her lover with grief: \"He was originally the noble Emperor Lord of the celestial realm, it's all because of me that he temporarily fell into demonic ways, the fault is not his.\"","\"The fault is not his? Have you asked those living beings he slaughtered?\" Ji Fei's tone was icy, \"What right does this evil demon have to be saved? He neglected his duties, indulged in love, for his own selfish desires, in a fit of anger, caused corpses to float for thousands of miles, bloodied the world, killed innocents indiscriminately, and became tyrannical and vicious.\"","The Goddess trembled all over from these words, but refused to stop her healing hands, \"He only developed an obsession because of his love for me.\"","Ji Fei sneered and said: \"Is your love measured by the number of lives lost to prove how deep and unforgettable it is? You're truly sick!\"","Ji Fei seemed too lazy to say more, picked up the Emperor Lord and walked away.","The Goddess anxiously hugged the Emperor Lord, \"What are you going to do?\"","\"Evil demons must be eliminated, sacrificed to save the world!\" Ji Fei said coldly, then directly kicked the Goddess away and threw the person into the mist on the stage.","The Goddess immediately became extremely anxious: \"No, why... Please don't hurt him, sacrificing to save the world is my duty.\"","Ji Fei sneered: \"So you still remember that this is your duty. The Heavenly Way let you descend to the mortal world, only asking you to do this one thing well, and you couldn't even do that. You're useless!\"","Watching the Emperor Lord disappear into the mist, in no time at all, the world returned to peace.","The Goddess broke down crying, unable to save her lover, and finally began to question the ways of the world: \"Was I born just to be sacrificed? If so, then let me be sacrificed, why let the Emperor Lord take my place? Without him, how am I supposed to live on alone?\"","Just as she was saying this, Qin Zhao, now dressed in white robes, appeared again, similar to the state of a soul returning in the previous scene. After all, immortal dramas love this kind of setup, so there's nothing wrong with them using the same trick.","The Goddess immediately cried tears of joy, but before she could rush forward to welcome their final happy ending, Ji Fei threw out a chain, which wrapped around the Emperor Lord's neck, imprisoning him.","\"It's not over yet!\""]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: You're Sick Too, You Should Die","paragraphs":["The Goddess looked at Ji Fei in shock. \"He barely survived, what more do you want?\"","\"I told you, I'm formed from the grievances of countless wronged souls. I must have my revenge,\" Ji Fei smirked evilly. \"Do you think one can commit evil deeds without atonement? Where is the justice in this world?\"","The Goddess pleaded tearfully, \"This is all my fault. As a Goddess, I should never have given in to personal feelings...\"","Ji Fei interrupted her abruptly: \"Then why did you? You play both sides, habitually playing the passive role. After all, this way you don't have to bear any guilt or infamy, right?\"","The Goddess was stunned into silence.","Though the Emperor Lord couldn't struggle, he immediately defended the Goddess: \"We've already saved the world, what more do you want!\"","The Goddess also came to her senses, \"The Emperor Lord sacrificed his true form to save the world. Isn't that enough to atone?\"","\"Laughable. Saving the world is your duty. What does that have to do with the evil you've committed?\"","The Emperor Lord hated such arguments the most. \"Why? You all want her to sacrifice everything, but who has ever considered her feelings? Isn't it enough that I took her place?\"","Ji Fei sneered, pointing at the Emperor Lord: \"You are the Emperor Lord nourished by the world's vital energy. Once in power, you should maintain the order of heaven and earth, and keep peace among the three realms.\"","Then she pointed at the Goddess: \"You are the Goddess created by Heaven's Will for a special purpose. Your responsibility from birth is to protect all living beings and shelter all creatures.\"","As the Emperor Lord and Goddess were about to retort, Ji Fei cut them off.","\"Because of these duties, you've enjoyed all the privileges this world has to offer from the very beginning. Those privileges are formed by the power of mortal faith and worship. This is an equal exchange! To speak of sacrifice is utterly ridiculous!\"","\"Instead, you neglected your duties, only thinking of romance, causing so many to die because of you. Now you're using what you should have done in the first place as merit to atone for your sins?\"","\"You are unworthy to be the ruler of heaven and earth, receiving the worship of millions.\"","\"You are unworthy to be Heaven's Goddess, receiving the faith of the three realms.\"","Ji Fei's barrage left the Emperor Lord and Goddess speechless. Finally, the Emperor Lord couldn't help but roar: \"I just love her, that's all. Are immortals not allowed to fall in love?\"","Ji Fei coldly laughed: \"You want to be in love? Fine. Dig out your immortal bones, become mortals, and love each other to death for all I care.\"","The Emperor Lord and Goddess were both stunned.","\"What, never thought of that? If you shed your identities, naturally you won't need to sacrifice anything. Heaven's Will will find a way to fill the void.\"","\"Can't you see the mountain of mortal corpses piled at your feet because of your selfish desires? Since when did sacrificing a city for one person become a love story worth praising?\"","\"You delusionally want to be like mortals, marrying and having children, talking of love, fighting at the drop of a hat for personal feelings. What right do you have to be high and mighty immortals? Since you're in that position, enjoying the worship, faith, and offerings of the world, reaping the benefits, you should do what you're supposed to do.\"","\"How can you want to be immortals worshipped by all, enjoying all the world's benefits, yet be unwilling to sacrifice personal emotions? Such greed can be fatal.\"","...","\"Damn, well said!\" Someone in the audience shouted, standing out in the quiet studio. But it didn't disturb anyone's viewing experience, because everyone was thinking the same thing. At this moment, almost no one would stand on the side of the Emperor Lord and Goddess.","Because Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's stage play finally clarified one thing for everyone.","The aftereffects were profound.","Online, the trend finally became one-sided.","Those stubbornly resisting fans were all submerged by the great tide, then gradually assimilated. Although they were unwilling to admit that their idols were bad, they had to acknowledge that the script was problematic.","\"Sister Fei, I get it now. Isn't this like receiving a lifetime of salary and then not wanting to work at the end? How shameless!\"","\"We pray and make offerings to you every day, not for you to fall in love. Just do your job properly and bless us, for goodness' sake!\"","\"Can you do it or not? If not, then step down! There are plenty of immortals who want your position. Worst case, I'll switch to a faith that benefits me.\"","\"If the god I believe in doesn't bless me, why should I believe? To watch you fall in love as spiritual food? I'm not sick!\"","\"We put you on a pedestal to guide us towards hope and happiness in life. We've given you all our faith, yet you don't want to repay us, only caring about yourselves?\"","\"To become an immortal, one must cut off emotional ties. If immortals develop feelings, they must descend to the mortal world to be fair!\"","\"You have the audacity to ask why we demand repayment? If you had the guts, you shouldn't have let us believe in you in the first place!\"","\"Here we have a master-disciple romance, there an immortal-mortal love, then a celestial-demon affair. At the slightest provocation, you start a big fight. Is the power we bestowed upon you just for you to be jealous and affect us?\"","Xu Meng wasn't in the waiting area, so she could check her phone anytime. At this moment, she bit her lower lip, staring intently at the barrage of comments.","She suddenly had a bad feeling.","Their original plan was to use the stage effect to evoke people's sympathy and resonance. When they revealed their relationship issues later, fans would think of their heart-wrenching love on stage and be more accepting, allowing for a smooth transition.","But now the situation was completely opposite.","After all, the comments criticizing the immortals on stage could also be... criticizing idols who fall in love.","Although Sun Mo and Yang Hong weren't strictly idols, their current status was indeed supported by fans.","The reason why no one opposed Yang Hong's relationship with her was that she didn't harm Yang Hong's career. She was a qualified and low-key partner.","But now, their stage play was already disliked due to the impact of the top-tier group, even ridiculed mercilessly. If their relationship issues were exposed at this time, it would likely remind people of the current heated discussion.","No, this plan must be shelved. And to be safe, they must shift the blame for the script they performed.","It must not be that they willingly chose this script.","They were... they were forced to perform this script by Pei Mingxuan.","Yes, only this way could the three of them escape their predicament.","At this moment backstage, Gao Hao looked at his phone and suddenly exclaimed in surprise.","Qin Rong and Xiao Tao looked over curiously.","But Gao Hao handed the phone to Pei Mingxuan to see.","\"Someone captured photos of Xu Meng and Sun Mo kissing. It's already starting to spread on a small scale that Sun Mo is cheating on Yang Hong. This kind of internal conflict will spread very quickly.\"","If it were before, Pei Mingxuan would have been shocked to see such photos.","Now she just sneered coldly, beyond caring: \"Who told them to be so complacent? They deserve it.\"","When Qin Rong and Xiao Tao heard the news had broken, they immediately became excited, their smiles radiant as they started browsing forums and super topics, sharing the gossip with others.","\"A cornered dog will jump over a wall. Will Sun Mo choose to abandon...\" Gao Hao worried.","Pei Mingxuan said: \"It doesn't matter, because I've abandoned him too.\"","Online, the smoke of war was rising, a storm was approaching, and the final stage began!","...","Faced with Ji Fei's mockery, the Emperor Lord and Goddess could no longer say a word.","But when Ji Fei was about to make a move against the Emperor Lord, the Goddess pleaded again: \"He knows he was wrong, he's awakened. Look, hasn't he already removed his heart demon? I promise you, from now on I'll lead him into seclusion to atone for our sins.\"","This was also the gratifying ending of the previous stage. Of course, many viewers who felt gratified then are now thoroughly disgusted.","They couldn't help but wonder, how would Ji Fei handle this? Surely she wouldn't disappoint them.","The next second, there was a flash of cold light.","Without a word, Ji Fei thrust her sword through the Goddess's chest.","\"Do you take me for a fool? Secluded atonement? Bullshit, you just want to go to some paradise to indulge in your love, don't you? Your hands are stained with the blood of countless wronged souls. What right do you have to be reborn and find happiness? You're sick too, you deserve to die!\"","\"If you truly want to atone, then go to the Reincarnation Path and taste all the suffering endured by those who died because of your selfish desires!\"","\"Heaven's way is just, good and evil will be rewarded in the end, without discrimination based on anyone's status or background.\"","\"If the heavens and gods are unjust, then I shall slay the gods! I'll only believe in myself!\""]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: The Consequence of Dismissing the Audience Like This","paragraphs":["At the end of the stage play, the goddess and emperor's bodies are killed by Ji Fei, and their souls are cast into the Reincarnation Path by her. The Reincarnation Path is not true reincarnation, but a kind of illusion that can project someone else's entire life.","Ji Fei makes them continuously experience the lives of all those they had harmed, from hopeful beginnings to helpless despair, finally dying and regaining their memories as immortals before being thrust into the next life. This allows them to personally feel what they, as objects of mortal worship and offerings, truly brought to their followers.","Ji Fei scatters the divine power she stripped from the goddess across the land, allowing the wronged souls who died because of them to ascend to bliss early, and restoring vitality to all things.","This power originally came from the faith of all living beings in the three realms towards the way of heaven. Since the goddess didn't intend to use it properly, Ji Fei helps her use it instead.","Ji Fei's exit is a gradual disappearance into the dimming lights. It's as if countless wronged souls have finally gotten their wish and dispersed.","Until the deep voiceover sounds again:","\"Do you have the qualifications to accept others' worship and admiration? Are you ready for it?\"","...","As the performance ends, everyone holds their breath. This unconventional script has shown everyone a different world.","The final question resonates powerfully.","The audience doesn't need any prompting; they spontaneously erupt in cheers and applause, the sound thunderous.","Among them, Qin's Father, Qin's Mom, and Qin Yan look around delightedly at everything, proudly standing up to cheer and wave flags for the top-tier group along with everyone else.","The director and producer, seeing the online buzz and various skyrocketing metrics, are dumbfounded.","They had considered various possible answers to the theme of \"faith.\"","Yet they never expected the top-tier group to end with a challenging question.","If you want to enjoy the offerings of believers and be someone's faith, do you have that qualification? Are you prepared? Will you constrain yourself and lead by example in the future?","It's not just about being given power; you also have to fulfill obligations. Otherwise, what's the point of you?","In comparison, the male god group's idea of love as faith now seems very shallow.","Perhaps there truly is great love that can rise to the level of faith, but the comparison between the two stage play scripts is too brutal - it's like being ground into the dirt. Now, who would dare say the love portrayed by the male god group has this kind of depth?","Even the fans of the male god group are now as quiet as if they don't exist.","In the bullet comments and on Weibo, there are no more voices praising the male god group's play. Even mentions of it are just to compare and criticize.","The debate online grows more intense, even dragging out past years' immortal dramas for discussion. Naturally, Sun Mo's almost identical roles become a focal point.","\"This is what happens when they don't choose scripts carefully and take the audience for granted.\"","\"If they hadn't chosen such a formulaic script, they wouldn't have run into the top-tier group's gunfire.\"","\"Sun Mo posted on Weibo before joining the show, telling fans to look forward to his transformation, but he's still relying on his old tricks. His fans are still making excuses, saying it's for better coordination.\"","\"Coordination my ass. Look at the top-tier group with Ji Fei, a newcomer with stiff acting. How dare they use such excuses?\"","\"Where are the male god group's fans? Come out and show yourselves. Weren't you bragging loudly before? Do you still think your idols' performance was moving?\"","Finally, some die-hard fans jump out, stubbornly saying: \"It was just a script selection mistake. Do you know how hard our brother works? We always believe our brother is working hard for his future. It's just that this time didn't have a good result. We will always support our brother!\"","\"That's right, Yang-ge's girlfriend made a huge sacrifice too! It was all for a good stage performance. You can't negate all their efforts because of one small mistake.\"","\"It must be the studio's fault. Why did they choose such a script? They're clearly harming our brother. Staff, come out and give us an explanation.\"","Now that Sun Mo and Yang Hong are in the same company, the company's PR department naturally rushes to contact them to discuss a response.","However, at this moment, the furious male god group members are waiting for the culprits to return.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao make their way back after leaving the stage.","A worried supporting actress asks, \"Weren't we... a bit too targeted with that?\"","Qin Zhao says, \"Don't worry, I chose the script. It won't implicate you.\"","Ji Fei also smiles and says, \"It's fine. We're just like them, performing tropes. How could they blame us?\"","The actors who performed with them look at the two very skeptically, feeling these two just love stirring up trouble. Such a blatant face-slapping behavior is rarely seen even in the entertainment circle, to the point of being bizarre.","It makes them unable to resist the gossip, wanting to follow along to the backstage to see if the two groups will clash when they meet.","It would be a shame not to join in on such excitement.","Everyone has a heart for gossip, after all.","Backstage, before people even appear, the Qin family, who had pulled strings to get in, hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[They performed so intensely earlier, they must be very embarrassed now. I regret not being able to see their expressions in person in the waiting area.]","The Qin family members suppress their smiles. No need for regret, because the current expressions are also very entertaining.","Sun Mo, Yang Hong, and Xu Meng are gathered together.","Sun Mo's expression is like a suppressed volcano, Yang Hong's expression is gloomy as if a storm is about to hit, and Xu Meng naturally stands in the middle looking pitiful, her eyes as red as a rabbit's.","Seeing them approach, Sun Mo directly snorts coldly, his eyes signaling to Pei Mingxuan, but sweeping over, he finds Pei Mingxuan isn't even looking at them.","In the past, when encountering such troubles, it was always Pei Mingxuan who took the lead in helping to handle and resolve issues. Even if they had disagreements, Pei Mingxuan would still strongly defend him to outsiders and strive to fight for his interests. But now...","For a moment, Sun Mo really feels unaccustomed to this, but remembering the conflict they just had, he can't bring himself to ask, and can only stiffen up, not knowing if he should go directly to Qin Zhao to demand an explanation.","Yang Hong, however, has no such reservations and directly questions: \"You two, isn't it a bit unethical to sabotage us like this? We haven't offended you, have we?\"","Qin Zhao stops in his tracks and looks at Yang Hong.","The surroundings immediately fall silent. Restless elements float in the air, and the atmosphere instantly becomes tense.","Yang Hong has some small capital backing him, and he doesn't really care about mixing in the entertainment circle anyway, so he's not afraid of offending Qin Zhao.","But even so, Ji Fei didn't expect Yang Hong to be so brave. She thought they would maintain surface harmony and swallow this matter. Moreover, Yang Hong's usual temperament didn't seem so impatient.","[I see, it's not just about their stage play being crushed, but also because our anti-trope performance forced them to postpone their original plans. Huh? Wait, bro, are you so eager to give up your girlfriend and step down to become an underground lover? I can only say, as expected of you, Yang Upside-down.]","Hearing this, the Qin family members almost burst out laughing.","Even Qin Zhao, facing Yang Hong's anger in confrontation, almost couldn't keep a straight face, and could only look at Yang Hong with a complex expression."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: Self-directed Shift of Blame","paragraphs":["At this moment, Sun Mo also stepped forward to stand beside Yang Hong, expressing the same stance. However, he failed to notice that Yang Hong's eyes lit up at his action, unable to resist glancing at him.","Qin Zhao came to his senses and said nonchalantly, \"We didn't actually offend anyone. It's just a competitive PK, survival of the fittest. If we can come up with better methods, why shouldn't we use them? Haven't you ever done anything to target others for your own benefit?\"","[Vocal, Third Brother, you're sounding like a villain here. But you have a point. Not to mention these three in front of us, they even wanted to sacrifice Sister Pei to complete their love story. How dare they question us? We're all pushing our own agendas in the stage play, but at least we're openly tricking you.]","The Qin family members listened and stifled their laughter, desperately suppressing their smiles.","The trio, however, were stunned by Qin Zhao's response.","They hadn't expected Qin Zhao to admit it directly. They had thought Qin Zhao would make excuses, giving them a way out. This response left Yang Hong and Sun Mo at a loss.","Sun Mo was the least adept at handling such situations. He instinctively looked towards Pei Mingxuan again, but still received no response, not even a glance.","For the first time, Sun Mo felt he had no support behind him, as if he were walking a tightrope alone, feeling inexplicably uneasy.","Just as the atmosphere became unbearably awkward, Yang Hong's agent hurriedly came over, breaking the deadlock.","The commotion ended, and the group went to a meeting, clearly about the stage performance.","Outside, the post-match interview live stream was underway, and they would have to go on stage later. They probably wanted to use this opportunity to make up for their earlier performance.","But Pei Mingxuan returned shortly after, her face gloomy.","People around naturally peeked curiously.","\"Why did she come back alone? Weren't they meeting together?\" The Qin family members gathered around Ji Fei, gossiping curiously.","After all, Pei Mingxuan was still Sun Mo's agent, without terminating their contract, so she naturally had to work for Sun Mo.","Ji Fei, who was retouching her makeup, couldn't help but check when she saw this.","[Haha, it's laughable.]","The Qin family members immediately pricked up their ears.","[The company wanted to salvage the reputation of the two male idols and provided several PR strategies. Sister Pei, being professional after all, helped them choose the most suitable one. That is to apologize for choosing the wrong script, admit the mistake, and promise to work hard to adjust next time. No need to do anything else unnecessary.]","The Qin family members thought about it and felt it was reasonable. If they really apologized, the netizens naturally wouldn't feel comfortable saying much more. After all, what they performed was indeed a common routine. This would instead earn them a wave of goodwill from the general public. Knowing one's mistakes and being willing to correct them is a great virtue.","Qin Zhao, as a performer, felt that this was the best PR strategy. Sometimes, it's better to let things flow than to block them. Even if it costs a bit of popularity and face, it's the most beneficial in the long run.","[But none of the three were willing. Xu Meng even deliberately asked Sister Pei if it was because of her relationship with Sun Mo that she wasn't thinking of good solutions for everyone. Then she pretended to be pitiful, apologized, and begged Sister Pei for help in a submissive manner.]","The Qin family members: Tsk~ The drama is too thick here, they could smell it just from hearing the report. Needless to say, Xu Meng was just acting for Sun Mo to see, wanting Sun Mo to make up his mind to stand on her side, so they could set up Pei Mingxuan later.","[The pig-brained Sun Mo immediately blew up at Sister Pei, telling her to get out if she wasn't willing to think of a good solution. That's why Sister Pei came out.]","The Qin family members couldn't help but despise Sun Mo in their hearts for being so blind. Did he really think he was all that?","[As a result, as soon as she was driven out, these three bastards started plotting... Damn! They've already taken action? Sun Mo, you really have no conscience, not even hesitating? I'm truly disgusted.]","The Qin family members immediately curiously moved closer to Ji Fei again, wondering what they had done.","As a result, they saw Ji Fei stop her inner monologue and immediately take out her phone, quickly scrolling through it.","The Qin family members, quick to catch up on gossip, immediately opened Weibo along with Ji Fei.","At this time, many people's phones also rang, especially Pei Mingxuan's.","Pei Mingxuan picked up her phone and looked, her face instantly freezing.","#The culprit behind the male idol group's stage play flop# had already topped the hot search. The topic quickly fermented.","Someone provided various rehearsal photos to marketing accounts, all showing scenes of Pei Mingxuan supervising with the script in hand.","A so-called insider began to frantically leak information,","\"Actually, the original script for the male idol group was about faith in a great cause, not petty romance. It was forcibly changed by his agent.\"","\"Those intimate scenes were originally refused by everyone, but the agent insisted on adding them to attract attention.\"","\"Sun Mo's old fans should know that his agent Pei Mingxuan has always been in charge of all of Sun Mo's affairs, taking full responsibility. Sun Mo has no say in decisions, he just listens to her. So this stage performance failure really isn't the fault of the male idol group. It can only be said that the agent's judgment was poor, thinking that using this familiar field could resist the top-tier group, but ended up shooting herself in the foot.\"","Someone immediately responded below: \"How could an agent be so stupid, not letting Sun Mo transform, but instead making him rely on old tricks? Isn't that asking for criticism? Could there be some other purpose?\"","\"She used to be very shrewd. I wonder if she's trying to ruin my brother's career,\" a fan arrived at the news and immediately became indignant.","Soon, a highly liked comment was pushed to the top, \"Rumor has it that they might be terminating their contract.\"","This immediately stirred up a storm, after all, it's not uncommon in the entertainment industry for agents to backstab artists after contract termination.","Perhaps it's because of unresolved benefit negotiations, or harboring grudges, so they're taking the opportunity to teach a lesson.","With this explanation, it instantly shifted the fans' target of hatred. After all, compared to their own brother, they're more willing to believe others are the villains, and their own brother is definitely the victim.","Hashtags like #Sympathize with Sun Mo and Yang Hong# #Artists' right to choose scripts# #You said you wanted to transform, what's stopping you# appeared one after another, as if trying to portray Pei Mingxuan as an all-controlling evil demon.","These messages also affected the bullet screen comments. Previously full of mockery towards the male idol group, they gradually began to sympathize, and even started demanding Pei Mingxuan to apologize in the live stream.","It can only be said that once public opinion is guided, it really changes in an instant.","The real staff who knew the truth all looked sympathetically at Pei Mingxuan, knowing she was being pushed out as a scapegoat.","But they were powerless, and didn't have the big capital to spend money on buying hot searches and hiring water armies. So even if they stood up and said something, it would be useless. It would only be drowned in the information flow.","The director and producer still didn't dare to show their faces, clearly not wanting to be involved in this dispute, after all, it's all their own internal affairs. The circle is deep, and there's no shortage of wronged people.","However, the Qin family members who were watching the drama unfold were quite angry, frantically hinting at Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao gave Gao Hao a look.","Gao Hao helplessly took his phone and walked towards Pei Mingxuan, \"Need any help?\"","Pei Mingxuan slowly raised her icy face, sneering, \"If I can't handle this little matter, would you still want to poach me?\"","Seeing this, Gao Hao raised an eyebrow and said, \"Looks like it's not too difficult for Sister Pei after all.\""]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: I want to appoint Pei Jie as the Master of Yin and Yang","paragraphs":["\"We can only say that this move by Sun Mo and his group will only work if Pei Mingxuan is willing to sacrifice herself,\" Qin Zhao analyzed for the Qin family.","Ji Fei said, \"If it were the old Pei, as a manager taking the blame for her artist wouldn't be a big deal. After all, artists and managers are a unit. As long as the artist doesn't lose public support, they can still make money. You can't let your money-making tool have problems. But now...\"","Qin Rong sighed, \"It's unbelievable that Sun Mo would dare to do this when his relationship with Pei has become so strained.\"","Qin's Mom said, \"That brat is fearless, thinking Little Pei won't ruin him.\"","Qin Yan said in astonishment, \"He's really confident, isn't he? He doesn't still think Pei Mingxuan likes him, does he?\"","Qin's Father and Qin Zhao exchanged a glance, wanting to say that Sun Mo couldn't be that stupid.","Gao Hao came back, and everyone looked at him curiously.","Gao Hao smiled and said, \"We don't need to worry.\"","\"Is there some call record or chat message that can be posted online as proof?\" Qin Rong asked excitedly.","Gao Hao laughed, \"How could we use that tactic? That would be hurting the enemy a thousand while losing eight hundred ourselves. Pei Mingxuan can't take such a loss.\"","Several of the gossip-loving Qin family members didn't understand and looked at Gao Hao in confusion.","Gao Hao explained, \"Think about it, all those rumors are from other people's leaks. The Male God group hasn't said anything publicly. If Pei Mingxuan comes out now to leak information and provide evidence, shifting all responsibility to the Male God group, it would be seen as betraying her clients. Rational fans would look at the truth, but irrational ones...\"","Everyone instantly understood and felt deeply emotional.","Rational fans would still remember who chose the script and why Pei Mingxuan was brought out as a scapegoat.","But irrational fans would take it to another level.","They wouldn't think that their idols were behind this instigation. They would only feel that their idols didn't do anything wrong, that others were sowing discord, and wonder how a manager could betray her clients instead of protecting them, accusing her of betraying their trust!","Everyone could already imagine what those people would say.","\"Most importantly, her reputation in the industry would suffer, and no one would dare to use her anymore. Unless she leaves the industry and wants to fight for herself, she could do it, but she's not that reckless,\" Gao Hao analyzed calmly. Seeing everyone's curious expressions as they stared at him, he suddenly felt satisfied with his managerial urge to explain.","If only the artists under his management would listen so attentively when he spoke.","Qin Zhao was always indifferent, and Ji Fei would start daydreaming while listening. They were really uncooperative.","Just as Gao Hao was preparing to launch into a grand analysis of what Pei Mingxuan would do next,","He saw everyone's expressions quickly change, then look as if they suddenly understood, and in an instant, lose interest in what he was about to say.","Gao Hao: ?","Ji Fei, who had already seen Pei Mingxuan's moves through the Gossip System, started gleefully scrolling through posts.","And the others, having already heard the inner thoughts, began to witness how those fans bombarding Pei Mingxuan were about to be slapped in the face.","Actually, the operation was very simple. Previously, there had been a leak of photos showing Sun Mo and Xu Meng kissing.","Although they spread quickly, they never gained traction online due to waves of other high-traffic information. Those who saw them dismissed them as Photoshopped fakes due to the unclear images.","All Pei Mingxuan had to do was secretly buy some traffic for them, give them an explosive title, and everything fell into place.","#It seems Sun Mo wasn't forced after all, look, he's rehearsing so seriously off-stage too#","[Pfft, Sister Pei knows how to talk, say more! I hereby crown Sister Pei as the master of sarcasm. Wait... I've never seen this photo before, so they're this desperately hungry in private too? What is this? The company's rooftop?]","[I'm very curious, did Yang Hong join in the relay this time?]","The Qin family had actually seen the photos before, but with this title, they were desperately trying not to laugh.","Sure enough, some sharp-eyed marketing accounts quickly discovered it and immediately reposted.","They were just waiting for it to blow up, but they were just invited on stage for the final segment.","Perhaps not daring to face Pei Mingxuan, Sun Mo and his group came on stage from elsewhere.","After Qin Zhao and Ji Fei went up, they saw that their expressions had recovered, obviously feeling that their harmful method had already pulled them out of their predicament.","Qin Zhao and Ji Fei held back their expressions and accepted the interview, discussing everything from acting skills to the script, step by step.","Sun Mo and his group even slyly expressed their helplessness about the script they performed and agreed with the Top Flow group's script ideas.","At that moment, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao started coughing. Their faces were red from holding back.","The Male God group probably thought it was their magnanimity that surprised the Top Flow group.","In reality, those two were about to burst out laughing.","This time there were no mishaps, and they smoothly left the stage. However, before leaving, they didn't see the directors and producers behind the cameras facing a sudden flood of changing barrage comments, looking bewildered.","Then they quickly closed the live broadcast room.","Their show was over, and the subsequent storm had nothing to do with them, nothing!","Just a moment ago, netizens were excitedly gossiping, watching the fans of both Male Gods come up with various conspiracy theories, but when they looked back, they were all shocked.","\"What is this?! As an outsider, I don't understand. Do actors have to do these kissing scenes for real during rehearsals?\"","\"Rehearsal my ass, this isn't even a rehearsal room! They're doing this outside, don't say it's forced rehearsal! Contemporary netizens aren't easily fooled!\"","\"Look at that posture, kissing so deeply, they're completely caught up in the moment! If this is forced, I'll wash my hair while doing a handstand.\"","\"The clothes in this photo... I think I've seen their fans post set photos, but this is just casual, not work. It's definitely an affair.\"","\"Damn, they were just saying that the manager forced them to perform such a script, forced them to film kissing scenes...\"","\"I was saying, don't those fans use their brains? Even if the manager could control Sun Mo's decisions, could she control Yang Hong and Xu Meng too? Ridiculous!\"","\"Even with Sun Mo's status, it's impossible for him to have no say with his manager. Pretending to be a victim is just wanting to shift blame for this failure, right? As a man, he's too irresponsible. I hereby declare that I'm no longer a fan.\"","\"Everyone, don't jump to conclusions, we might be misled. What if it's antis deliberately using fake photos to smear our brother? Maybe it's from another shoot...\"","Before Sun Mo's fans could find excuses to comfort themselves, Yang Hong's fans got angry first. The sister-in-law they had just reluctantly accepted was cheating?!","It was bad enough that Sun Mo had stolen Yang Hong's role before, we were magnanimous about that, but now he's stealing his girlfriend? No way, we must get to the bottom of this.","At this point, the live broadcast had just reached its final segment. Comments flooded in like a tidal wave. But the actors had already turned away, and the big screen was no longer projecting, so no one saw it.","As Yang Hong's fans unleashed their fighting spirit,","After a round of professional verification, the photos were 100% real and effective, captured accidentally by someone's drone while they were secretly kissing.","This was a direct hit! Yang Hong's fans exploded. They immediately got into a fierce argument with Sun Mo's fans, throwing dirt at each other.","Xu Meng was also a third-tier small actress with some fans. Her fans had no choice; they couldn't admit that their sister was a shameless cheater, so half of them begged their sister to come out and explain, while the other half started suspecting that Xu Meng had been forced.","In short, it was a three-way battle, with the addition of Qin Top Flow's battle fans and Ji Fei's gossip fans joining in the fun, causing Weibo's servers to crash for quite a while.","When it recovered, some things had basically been concluded.","\"Hilarious! I think it was Sun Mo who arranged this kind of script, with the purpose of getting Yang Hong's girlfriend! They've been hooking up for a long time. Yang Hong's head is covered in green grass, his wife was stolen, and he's still stupidly helping perform the other guy's best scene.\"","\"Holy crap, this is explosive. Earlier, Yang Hong's fans were saying they sacrificed a lot for this stage play, even contributing his own girlfriend. I thought it was for the sake of art, turns out someone wanted to wear a green hat!\"","\"Now that you mention it, I suddenly feel that the scene where they kissed as the Emperor and Goddess was too disgusting. It wasn't for the performance at all, it was just for personal desire. They're simply treating the audience like fools.\"","\"We're still better off, their fans are the real idiots, hahaha, I feel sorry for them.\"","\"Unfollowing, unfollowing, Sun Mo is blacklisted for life!\"","\"Pei-jie has worked hard by your side for so long. It's bad enough that you're not grateful, but to throw her under the bus to protect yourself and your little lover when trouble comes? I've misjudged you!\"","\"Sun Mo, do you have any conscience? We women have poured our hearts and souls into your career, and you're using this important stage play to mess around just to steal someone else's girlfriend? You're absolutely shameless!\"","\"I was wondering why you suddenly wanted to perform something so outdated when your transformation was going well. So that's why. Sun Mo, I won't stop you from dating, but you can't pretend to be ambitious and enjoy our efforts while sabotaging your own career for love. I was truly blind.\"","Onlookers, enjoying the drama, couldn't help but share their opinions.","\"Come to think of it, it does have that flavor of a relationship between a deity and their followers. Isn't an idol ruining their career for love similar to a god neglecting their duties for romance? Both are betraying those who trust, support, and idolize them as spiritual pillars.\"","\"Watson, you've hit upon a blind spot!\"","Of course, there were still some stubbornly resistant fans.","\"Those are just rumors spread by marketing accounts, not what Sun Mo said. He didn't throw anyone under the bus. Be careful of plot twists!\"","\"Just answer this: did he or did he not mess with someone else's girlfriend?\"","\"...\"","\"No, it's all Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's fault. They schemed to harm our brother. Before he met them, our brother was fine! Brother is my eternal faith! I believe in him! I'm going to settle scores with them right now!\"","Only a small number of extreme fans would blindly support Sun Mo, but they couldn't stir up any real waves.","Meanwhile, the two groups returned backstage once again, oddly noticing that there seemed to be more staff members than before.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao knew the truth: they were all fellow gossip enthusiasts coming to watch the drama unfold!"]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: Does Narcissistic Brother Have No Face","paragraphs":["Yang Hong's agent was refreshing his phone when Weibo crashed. So he didn't notice anything unusual and went out to arrange the return journey.","Xu Meng's assistant was protective of her boss, but at that moment was still arranging for trolls to attack Pei Mingxuan online, not paying attention to other news.","So at this moment, Sun Mo was still calmly approaching Pei Mingxuan, and seeing her unpleasant expression, he knew that Pei Mingxuan already understood what they had done.","Sun Mo looked a bit uncomfortable, but still spoke: \"Mingxuan, I need to talk to you. Come out for a moment.\"","Pei Mingxuan raised her cold, phoenix-like eyes, her sharp gaze making Sun Mo uneasy.","\"You have the nerve to do this because you think I'm used to taking the blame for you, so one more time doesn't matter?\"","Sun Mo's expression changed abruptly, his eyes darting around, wondering how she could say this with so many people around.","He glared at Pei Mingxuan in displeasure, \"Let's talk outside.\"","But Pei Mingxuan let out a cold laugh and said: \"No need. Sign this termination agreement, and from now on we'll go our separate ways. I can guarantee that regarding the script blame issue, I absolutely won't make any public statements to refute it.\"","As she spoke, Pei Mingxuan pulled out a freshly prepared termination agreement from her bag and placed it in front of Sun Mo.","At these words, everyone present drew in a sharp breath. Things had escalated to contract termination?","It seemed this time Sun Mo had really hurt his agent's feelings.","After all, the staff present all knew that the agent had previously made a fuss about changing the script, but Sun Mo didn't listen.","Now that he had lost the competition and was being mocked by everyone, Sun Mo shifting the blame to save face was really classless.","His agent was being considerate of their past relationship by not dragging Sun Mo down over this issue, planning to take the blame and then part ways. It could be considered loyal and righteous.","However...","Everyone awkwardly lowered their heads to look at the phones in their hands, with new messages constantly popping up, then raised their heads to look at the three people who had come in... Had they not seen that photo yet?","Was this the time to be concerned about contract termination?","Yang Hong: Strange? Why are so many people looking at me?","Xu Meng: Strange? It seems like a lot of people are sneaking glances at me.","[Not strange, they're just looking at you, haha.]","The Qin family members' excited gazes swept back and forth, wanting to see when their expressions would change.","Sun Mo hadn't noticed the situation around him, and interrupted in shock: \"Pei Mingxuan, is this necessary? It's not like this is the first time... you still want to terminate the contract out of anger?\"","Pei Mingxuan almost rolled her eyes, \"I mentioned terminating the contract before, but you ignored it. After that, I went to prepare. I've already signed my part. Now you just need to sign, and the agreement will take effect. Do you still think I'm acting out of anger?\"","Sun Mo was stunned.","But Pei Mingxuan continued on her own: \"As for other contracts that can't be dissolved, we can handle them gradually according to legal regulations. I'm willing to bear any losses on my part, so, right now, immediately terminate our working relationship.\"","[Pff pff pff, I know Sister Pei can't stand it for another second.]","The Qin family: Trash should be thrown out as soon as possible.","After finishing, Pei Mingxuan took out a pen and held it right under Sun Mo's nose.","\"You... you really want to do this? You just can't tolerate me and...\" Sun Mo glanced at Xu Meng beside him.","[...Man, your name is narcissism.]","The Qin family: It's narcissistic personality disorder!","Pei Mingxuan's mouth twitched in disgust, and she said incredulously: \"You still think I like you and I'm jealous? I really didn't know your imagination was so rich. I can only say your delusions disgust me.\"","[Sigh, why say such harsh truths, and in front of so many people too. Doesn't Mr. Narcissist care about face?]","The Qin family: Pff pff pff!","The onlookers busied themselves, pretending to be occupied, but they couldn't help but prick up their ears.","Say more, say more! Someone block the door, don't let them leave! You can't only eat half the melon!","The backstage really is the best place for gossip!","Sun Mo's face turned from red to pale in an instant. Flushed with shame and anger, he said: \"You... if it's not jealousy, then what? You clearly did so much for me before. You drank until you had a stomach bleed while negotiating contracts, you could go days without sleep to corner producers for opportunities for me. No matter how hard I worked, you would always be there to encourage me. You...\"","Sun Mo gradually fell silent as he spoke.","The others listened in amazement. So Pei Mingxuan had done so much for him! For Sun Mo to treat her like this, he really was heartless.","\"You don't actually think I did all this because I had feelings for you, do you?\" Pei Mingxuan sneered haughtily. \"Even if I were training a dog to be an actor, I would put in this much effort, because it's my career!\"","Sun Mo was so humiliated and angry he could barely stand, taking a step back.","[Sis, do you have to be so harsh! A dog actor would be more professional than him, never causing scandals and never backstabbing its owner!]","The Qin family: ...Can't tell which of you is more vicious.","\"In my eyes, you used to be a potentially useful tool, but now you're nothing. I don't want to go down with you, being tied to you for even one more second makes me feel uncomfortable. So hurry up and sign, otherwise, you should know I have plenty of evidence to prove you lied!\"","The color seemed to drain from Sun Mo's face layer by layer, probably finally waking up from his narcissism. His lips had turned white and were trembling: \"You really want to be this ruthless! To cut all ties with me?\"","[How can he have the nerve?]","Everyone: Why does he still look like the victim?!","\"Keep talking, and I'll...\" Pei Mingxuan took out her phone threateningly.","\"Brother Mo!\" Yang Hong called out in warning. Sun Mo looked over, and the two naturally had some tacit understanding. Looking at Xu Meng, although she hadn't spoken, her eyes were full of worry.","Seeing the three exchanging glances, everyone present's pupils trembled slightly, their toes curling in embarrassment.","They still didn't know! Well, no one had taken out their phones.","Damn, someone should tell them!","But... but no one wanted to miss out on this drama!","Sun Mo took a deep breath, calming down. He took the contract, his expression complex as he said: \"You really want to terminate our contract?\"","Pei Mingxuan nodded.","Sun Mo's eyes flickered, \"Then you promise you won't...\"","\"I always keep my word. If I say I won't make any public statements on the matter, I won't. If you really pin it on me, I'll accept it by default!\" Pei Mingxuan's eyes were deep as she made the promise.","\"Fine! I trust you!\" Sun Mo signed quickly in several places, in duplicate. He looked up with a solemn expression and exchanged contracts, \"I owe you for this. In the future...\"","\"No need. We're even now. In the future, may the best person win.\" Pei Mingxuan contentedly took the contract, finally becoming a free agent.","Ji Fei finally couldn't hold back and burst out laughing, [Pff hahaha! Sister Pei is amazing! She won't make public statements, but she's already counterattacked secretly.]","The Qin family members: Pff pff pff pff, that's right, the premise of her accepting by default is that you actually manage to successfully shift the blame. What if the blame falls on your own head!","[As expected, someone at Sister Pei's level can only be ruthless, never soft-hearted. And she was able to use this opportunity to successfully terminate the contract. Sister Pei, you'll always be my idol!]","The Qin family: Killing two birds with one stone. Perhaps from the moment Sun Mo stepped in here, Pei Mingxuan sensed the opportunity to terminate the contract.","The other onlookers could only see the surface and couldn't help but marvel: \"Pei Mingxuan is really generous. But indeed, heaven has eyes. They accidentally made a mistake themselves, so now...\"","Just then, Yang Hong's agent and Xu Meng's assistant rushed in, almost colliding at the doorway.","\"Yang Hong, something's happened!\" The agent shouted while glaring angrily at Xu Meng.","\"Meng Meng, quick, check your phone...\" The assistant said anxiously.","Sun Mo immediately had a bad feeling. He quickly took out his phone to look. As soon as he saw, it was as if he'd been struck by lightning. His legs went weak, and he swayed for a moment before barely managing to stand.","He suddenly raised his head to look at Pei Mingxuan, \"Was it you?\""]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Encounter with Crazy Fan Attacks","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan wasn't that foolish; her acting skills at this moment were on par with an award-winning actress.","\"What?\" Sun Mo's expression was inscrutable; he couldn't distinguish between truth and falsehood.","\"Say no more, let's quickly return to the company and discuss this...\" Yang Hong hurriedly came over to pull Sun Mo away, turning back to glare fiercely at Pei Mingxuan.","He absolutely wouldn't allow anyone to hurt Sun Mo like this; they were being forced to take the final step!","After these people left, Gao Hao stepped forward and said, \"It seems there's still more drama to come.\"","\"Then let them try,\" Pei Mingxuan sneered.","Qin Zhao came forward and said, \"Miss Pei, I officially invite you on behalf of our studio.\"","Pei Mingxuan was stunned. She looked over and saw Ji Fei behind him, blinking her clear almond eyes at her.","The top-tier group was truly a breath of fresh air in the entertainment industry.","\"Thank you, but I can't join a new company when I might be embroiled in scandal. After this blows over, I'll come find you,\" Pei Mingxuan nodded in gratitude before leaving alone.","Clearly, Pei Mingxuan still planned to face the coming storm by herself. The possibilities that Qin Xian could analyze, she could likely guess as well.","It's just that she might not have good ways to counterattack.","[Looks like there'll be a good show to watch tonight. Better keep an eye on my phone to get the first-hand gossip.]","The Qin family thought the same, after all, they had followed the drama to this point.","\"Let's go, Second Brother said he's coming to pick us up to celebrate your successful performance tonight,\" Qin Yan came forward smiling.","Gao Hao then approached the Qin family and said, \"You all should leave through the back door with Little Tao. Let Ji Fei and Qin Zhao use the main entrance; quite a few fans have arrived.\"","When Qin Zhao and Ji Fei followed Gao Hao to the entrance, Ji Fei was stunned.","The crowd outside was almost endless. The show's crew had even arranged security guards.","\"This is so exaggerated?\"","Qin Zhao said, \"It can't just be our fans, right?\"","Qin Zhao had a good idea of how many fans might come to support him, and if it was too many, the studio would intervene.","As for Ji Fei, she was still considered a newcomer. Although she had attracted quite a few fans, those who could spontaneously come to support her were still relatively few. After all, strictly speaking, Ji Fei was still mainly known for variety shows.","\"There are also fans of the male god group.\"","Qin Zhao exclaimed in surprise, \"They haven't left yet?\"","\"How dare they face their fans now? They snuck out through the back door,\" Gao Hao said mockingly.","\"Didn't the staff tell the fans they had already left?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","\"They did, but no one believed them.\"","Qin Zhao turned to Ji Fei and said, \"There are too many people. Be careful not to get squeezed later.\"","Ji Fei nodded.","As soon as they stepped out, they heard various excited shouts. Fans on both sides were pushing forward, and the security guards could barely hold them back by linking hands.","Besides the supportive fans, Ji Fei heard many inquiring about the male god group. Judging by their tone, it was as if they had come to interrogate criminals. No wonder they didn't dare to leave through the front door.","However, it made it difficult for them to move. Several times, the human wall of security guards could barely withstand the pressure.","After a while, black-clad bodyguards came up to help maintain order. These were the Qin family's bodyguards.","In the distance, Ji Fei saw Qin Xian in a formal suit, standing by the roadside, waiting for them.","Clearly, he was worried about them, so he had arranged for the car's bodyguards to come and help.","With the Qin family's bodyguards present, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao quickly got into the car.","Qin Zhao had collected a pile of fan letters. Ji Fei saw them and became quite curious about what fans would write to their idols.","Just as she was thinking this, she heard a shrill cry. \"Ji Fei, I'm your fan, please look at my letter.\"","Ji Fei suddenly jolted, not out of vanity, but pure curiosity. So, before the car started moving, she lowered the window and saw a young girl being held back by bodyguards. When the girl saw her, her excited expression became distorted, and she frantically waved a pink letter in her hand.","The bodyguard looked back, saw Qin Xian behind Ji Fei nod slightly, and let the girl rush to the car.","The girl clung to the car door. Ji Fei was about to say thank you and reach for the letter.","But then she saw a flash of cold light, and immediately heard Qin Xian's urgent breathing beside her.","\"Move away!\"","Before Ji Fei could react, she was pulled back by her collar and crashed into a solid embrace.","Inside the car were mixed cries of alarm, while Ji Fei was already dazed, only hearing the thunderous heartbeat of Qin Xian behind her, with one arm stretched across her eyes.","The blade sliced through the sleeve of the black suit and then the white shirt underneath, and blood immediately soaked through.","\"It's all your fault! You must have schemed to harm Brother Mo. Brother Mo is so good, all those exposés were deliberately slandering him! It's you who would do anything to win, bribing the manager to harm him together. It must be like this!\"","The girl outside had a distorted expression, trying to pull out the knife to stab again, but was seized and pinned to the ground by the bodyguards who had rushed over.","People around were shocked, some constantly taking photos and videos.","Qin Zhao, enraged, got out with Gao Hao to report this girl to the police.","The car immediately started, and the others accompanied Qin Xian to the hospital to treat his wound.","Ji Fei, feeling guilty, helped support Qin Xian's hand and said, \"I'm sorry, it's all my fault. If I hadn't been curious...\"","\"What does this have to do with you? Qin Zhao set up the script, and the fan belongs to someone else. You were just unlucky,\" Qin's Father said while urging the driver to go faster.","\"It's okay, the wound isn't deep.\" Qin Yan, having studied medicine, could at least provide some emergency treatment.","Sitting opposite, Qin Rong was actually scared to the point of reddened eyes, but still patted Ji Fei's hand and said, \"Second Sister-in-law, don't be afraid. Third Brother has encountered this kind of thing before. Some fans are just quite irrational.\"","Qin's Mom also worriedly said to Ji Fei, \"Feifei, don't blame yourself. It was this boy Qin Xian who told the bodyguard to let the person approach. He brought this trouble on himself.\"","Ji Fei felt a tightness in her chest and turned to look at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian calmly looked at Ji Fei, his cold, ink-like eyes gleaming with a soft light. \"It's alright.\"","Ji Fei opened her mouth, not knowing what to say. She actually felt a bit uncomfortable inside. It was the first time someone had protected her like this, and it just felt a bit awkward.","[That fruit knife would have at most scratched my arm. Taking a hit myself wouldn't have been a big deal. Qin Xian's actions... were quite heroic. He's really a good person. I should thank him properly later.]","Qin Xian gave her a helpless sidelong glance, and could only continue, \"Protecting you is what I should do.\"","It wasn't just being heroic, it was a husband protecting his wife.","[Ah, right, right, right, I forgot. This guy values responsibility above all else. Protecting his nominal wife is his duty. I've enjoyed the benefits of this identity.]","Qin Xian: ... That didn't seem to be what he meant to express.","Hearing this, the Qin family members exchanged glances, seeing the worry in each other's eyes. How to put it? Although they knew Qin Xian and Ji Fei were a marriage of convenience, Ji Fei's subconscious attitude towards her husband seemed too distant.","She used to cling to him, but now not only did she not cling, she had the attitude of an outsider.","Even Qin Xian's self-sacrificing rescue didn't move Ji Fei to tears, which was really worrying.","So while Ji Fei was accompanying Qin Xian to treat his wound, everyone gathered to secretly discuss the matter.","While treating the wound, Qin Zhao brought the police to collect evidence.","It was then that they learned the situation. The girl was an underage fan, and when her family received the call and rushed over, they caused a scene.","\"Seeing how unreasonable the parents are, it's clear how they spoiled such a fanatical child,\" Qin Zhao fumed. \"At the police station, they were still yelling for the police to arrest me and Second Sister-in-law, saying we framed Sun Mo.\"","\"It's our fault that Sun Mo gave a disappointing performance on stage, and it's our fault that Sun Mo hooked up with someone else's girlfriend. Because everyone who goes against us ends up in a bad situation, they even cited the Best Actor Team as evidence.\"","\"They're so obsessed with their idol that they've lost their minds, like they've joined a cult.\"","\"What's even more ridiculous is that she asked Sun Mo to come save her, saying Sun Mo cares about his fans the most.\"","\"Will he care?\" Ji Fei asked in shock.","\"Of course not. This is the fan's personal behavior. Forget Sun Mo, even his company won't care. If it were the old Pei Mingxuan, she might have come to handle it, trying to minimize the negative impact and win some hearts along the way. But now, when Sun Mo is in such a predicament, how could he possibly deal with fan issues? At most, they'll issue a statement apologizing to us and then severely condemn the fan's behavior.\"","After Qin Zhao finished speaking, Gao Hao came in and said, \"The other side has already responded. After all, it's trending on social media, so they handled it quite quickly. Otherwise, given their current situation, they'd truly be in dire straits.\"","Qin Zhao sneered, \"I wonder what those crazed fans will think when they see their idol apologizing to us and distancing themselves from her. Second sister-in-law, what do you think? I'm planning to sue them to the fullest extent.\"","Gao Hao frowned and looked at Ji Fei. Knowing Qin Zhao's stubborn temperament, he could only try to persuade Ji Fei, \"The other party is a minor. If they do something extreme... There are many such examples in the entertainment industry, and it could be very troublesome. You should know that public opinion usually sides with the weaker party, not the one who's right. Moral blackmail is terrifying. You've just entered the industry, and it's not good to get involved in something like this. It's best to downplay the issue and resolve it peacefully.\"","Qin Zhao moved his lips, looking unsatisfied.","Ji Fei looked at Qin Xian, \"You're the one who got hurt. What do you think?\"","Qin Xian said, \"The target was you and Qin Zhao. You two decide.\"","Gao Hao was about to breathe a sigh of relief, feeling that Ji Fei was more reasonable.","Ji Fei glanced at Qin Xian's wound and said, \"Then let's sue them to the fullest extent.\"","Qin Zhao immediately broke into a smile.","Gao Hao let out a surprised \"Ah!\"","Ji Fei continued, \"Age has never been a get-out-of-jail-free card. Everyone must face the consequences of their actions. Depression, suicide threats - we'll address all of these upfront. We won't fall for any of it. If she harms herself, that's her and her parents' responsibility. They'll have to bear it themselves; it has nothing to do with us. We only seek justice under the law. We want anyone who encounters this kind of situation to receive the fairest response possible. Even if the outcome isn't good and public opinion doesn't side with me, at worst, I'll leave the entertainment industry. It's not like I have to be in it.\""]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Oh no, People are gone","paragraphs":["Gao Hao was surprised - it was rare for Ji Fei to be so serious.","But since she had said so, Gao Hao could only go and issue a statement to handle the situation.","Ji Fei turned around to see both brothers looking at her.","\"What?\" Ji Fei said uncomfortably.","\"You're actually this angry?\" Qin Zhao asked in surprise.","\"Huh? I'm not angry,\" Ji Fei said, confused.","Qin Zhao gave a dry laugh and got up to leave.","Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei and said, \"Don't be angry.\"","\"I'm really not angry!\" Ji Fei was exasperated.","[Argh, I'm so mad! I've already said I'm not angry. It's not like I'm the one who got hurt. I just think it's unfair that someone gets special treatment because of their age. She hurt you, made such a big cut that the flesh was exposed, needing stitches, and you lost so much blood. She should face the appropriate consequences.]","The corners of Qin Xian's mouth turned up slightly.","Soon, a phone chimed. Ji Fei took out her phone and saw that the studio had already posted on Weibo. The tone was very firm, and it also expressed Ji Fei's earlier sentiments.","It especially emphasized that the person injured was Ji Fei's very important family member.","Perhaps because the entertainment industry had experienced too many instances of being morally hijacked by so-called young fans, there weren't many people criticizing the strong stance. There were even quite a few bystanders supporting it.","This put Sun Mo in the hot seat, since it was his fan who caused the trouble.","Many of Sun Mo's current fan base were present at the time. Not only had they not received an explanation from Sun Mo about the night's events, but one of their own had caused such an embarrassing situation, and Sun Mo wasn't coming out to address it.","They didn't blame Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, because even if they were biased towards their idol, they knew this incident had nothing to do with the top-tier group.","All of this was due to Sun Mo's inappropriate behavior.","His fans were furious. Fan sites shut down, and fan leaders came out threatening to unfollow, demanding Sun Mo come out and explain everything.","Finally, Sun Mo's Weibo account posted a live statement announcement. Yang Hong and Xu Meng's Weibo accounts reposted it, with the three jointly stating they would clarify everything in the livestream.","By this time, Ji Fei and the others had already returned home. Ji Fei had just lain down when she saw the livestream announcement and was about to wait for the upcoming broadcast.","Then she received a message from Qin's Mom.","Ji Fei: ?","After returning home, when Qin Xian, with his arm in a sling, needed help undressing and bathing, he was surprised to find the housekeeper wasn't around. He called his father.","\"My back hurts, I need to rest. Ask your wife.\"","Qin Zhao had gone to find a lawyer, so they could only hope for their young nephew Qin Xi. But before the call even connected, there was a knock at the door.","Opening it revealed Ji Fei standing awkwardly at the doorway with her phone, saying, \"Mom told me to come help you.\"","[I absolutely did not come because I heard I could help Qin Xian undress and bathe. I'm definitely here to repay a debt of gratitude!]","Qin Xian: ...","In the bathroom, the shower was already running. Qin Xian's injured right hand was wrapped in several layers of plastic wrap. His expensive clothes had already been cut at the sleeve when treating the wound, so it was simple for Ji Fei to handle.","As she removed each piece of clothing, revealing the top-tier physique underneath, Ji Fei could barely keep the corners of her mouth from turning up.","[Could this be considered a blessing in disguise? Well, it's Qin Xian's misfortune but my fortune. Oh my, is it bad of me to think this way? Hehe!]","Qin Xian leaned against the sink, lowering his gaze, but his ear tips were turning red from Ji Fei's constant inner monologue.","On the surface, Ji Fei maintained a serious, all-business demeanor, but inwardly she was whistling wildly, constantly appraising.","Who isn't a female critic in private?","[That neck, that Adam's apple...]","Qin Xian's Adam's apple bobbed.","[Those collarbones, those shoulders...]","Qin Xian took a deep breath, his collarbones tensing.","[Those abs, I wonder if kneeling on them would hurt my knees! Those V-lines, if only I could touch them...]","Qin Xian felt goosebumps rising on his body, feeling completely uncomfortable. He even involuntarily imagined what Ji Fei would look like doing such things, immediately feeling like he must be going crazy.","Feeling somewhat embarrassed and annoyed, he raised his eyes to look at her, wanting to give a warning, but her gaze had never lifted.","[The steam plus that healthy skin tone, perfect lines, broad shoulders, narrow waist... Wow wow wow...]","Qin Xian: I'm done, I'm completely done. We're married, right? We didn't meet through some weird channel, did we?","[Qin Xian, you're truly a male bodhisattva. You're more pleasing to the eye than all the beautiful men crossdressing in my short video collections!]","Qin Xian: ... What on earth have you been collecting?","[Sisters, who understands? This atmosphere, I really want to take a picture and share it, let the girls enjoy this beautiful scenery!]","Qin Xian, alarmed: You're quite generous with me, aren't you!","[Next is... Oh my, should I sneak a peek? I haven't seen it before. No, no, no, better not. That would be too weird.]","Qin Xian suddenly understood what Ji Fei meant by \"weird.\"","When embarrassment reaches a certain level, you probably stop feeling it.","Moreover, they were married. Sooner or later, they would reach this stage.","But Qin Xian still inexplicably lost his composure. He felt his body stiffen and quickly moved away.","\"I can handle the rest. You can go now.\"","[Eh? Tsk, that's right, we're only married in name. How could he be comfortable being naked in front of me? Hm? He seems very nervous. Should I tease him a bit? I could pretend to be helpful, tug a little, and then accidentally... Haha... I'm so bad.]","Qin Xian, red-faced, stood up, trying to appear calm. His voice was a bit hoarse as he said, \"Don't you have a livestream to watch? You'd better go. Otherwise, you'll miss... the excitement.\"","[Ah? Right, the gossip! How could I forget? Has it started already? I've got to go! It's starting!]","Ji Fei immediately abandoned the bathroom Adonis. As she walked out, she said perfunctorily, \"Don't let the wound get wet. I'll be right outside. Call me if you need anything!\"","Then she ran out like the wind.","Looking at the closed door, Qin Xian didn't know whether to be relieved that he hadn't been awkwardly observed by someone, or to be exasperated that his wife cared more about gossip than about him.","What Qin Xian didn't know was that there was now a group of people crouching outside their door.","They were very concerned about the sounds from inside, but being far away and behind closed doors, they couldn't hear much of the inner thoughts.","Just as they were wondering if Ji Fei had started helping Qin Xian bathe, and if bathing might lead to...","Suddenly they heard Ji Fei's inner voice screaming.","[The beginning! What did they say at the beginning of the livestream? Let me check! They actually apologized together, saying the script was indeed chosen by them, it had nothing to do with their manager, and those marketing accounts were spreading rumors. Wow, you guys sure know how to bite the hand that feeds you!]","[Sun Mo and Xu Meng admitted they used to date! Impressive, are they for real?!]","The Qin family gossip-mongers: ?","Wait, livestream?","Their attention diverted, they all took out their phones, found places to sit, and started watching the livestream, enjoying the drama.","Family happiness? They'd worry about that later."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Three People Live in Harmony as a Happy Family, Fans: It Turns Out the Clown Was Me","paragraphs":["The explanation about choosing the script before the livestream was still manageable. After all, no one could be sure who was behind the leak. They could just treat it as a misunderstanding and move on publicly.","Sun Mo even pretended to take all the responsibility on himself, saying it was his lack of confidence in winning against the top-tier group that made him choose what he was best at, without deeper consideration. He said it was all his fault.","Actually, this approach could have resolved everything from the beginning, but Sun Mo was unwilling to back down, feeling that admitting failure was embarrassing. He'd rather shift the blame to others than suffer any damage himself.","In the end, he had to step out and admit it anyway. After all, they were about to publicly announce their relationship. If they still claimed the script was the agent's doing, it would be treating the netizens like fools. So they had to overturn their previous calculations and start from scratch.","Ji Fei couldn't help but laugh when she thought about how Sun Mo's efforts had been in vain, and he had even easily terminated Sister Pei's contract.","Then, looking at the livestream, she saw Yang Hong and Xu Meng cooperating, saying it was their joint decision, so they would bear the consequences together. It was quite a scene of affection and shared adversity.","Ji Fei wanted to laugh even more.","But the livestream was full of question marks.","Not just Ji Fei, but all the internet spectators had never seen such a brazen operation. It was truly shocking.","The three of them were sitting together for the livestream. Sun Mo sat in the middle, with Yang Hong and Xu Meng on either side.","\"Can someone tell me why you three are so harmonious?!!!\"","\"Yang Hong, are you blind or stupid? If you're being held hostage, blink twice. Don't let those two scumbags fool you.\"","\"Sun Mo, why are you sitting in the middle? Are you visually demonstrating what it means to be a homewrecker?\"","\"What, are male mistresses so brazen nowadays?\"","\"No, our Mo isn't here to break up this family, he's here to join it~\"","\"Forget it, you three just live your lives well, that's more important than anything. I don't understand, but I wish you well.\"","\"Seeing this scene, I'm inexplicably baffled.\"","\"Yang Hong, you're the most open-minded man I've ever seen!\"","\"What's the big deal? To get by in life, you've got to wear some green. Brother, I support you.\"","\"Why don't you compensate me with some money? Otherwise, I can't get over this mental hurdle.\"","Seeing those bullet comments, Ji Fei was no longer just laughing internally.","Qin Xian, struggling to undress in the bathroom, heard the 'fufufufu' laughter like the sound of a barbell.","The Qin family's gossip gathering spot was also filled with uncontrollable laughter.","This generation of netizens had a beauty that disregarded the well-being of both fans and the celebrities involved.","Apart from the mentally unstable gossip-hungry netizens, the fans' mental state was very stable - they were collectively going crazy, roaring and questioning, completely distinct from the gossip-seekers' comments.","\"Sun Mo, say something, you didn't backstab your friend and steal his girlfriend!!!!\"","\"Yang Hong, break up with that bitch!!!!\"","\"Xu Meng, tell everyone you're not two-timing!!!!\"","Probably because they were mentally prepared, the three of them didn't look at the comments, but instead revealed different information.","Yang Hong spoke first: \"We had planned to release a statement after the show ended, but we didn't expect things to blow up like this. Actually, Xu Meng and I broke up amicably a while ago. We're just good friends now.\"","The first sentence was like a thunderbolt from a clear sky, immediately causing the livestream comments to explode.","All kinds of doubts and analyses followed one after another.","\"Are you kidding? You two were still appearing at various events as a couple before. Do you think we're stupid?\"","\"Ah, the entertainment industry is just like this. Maybe they've worked out a deal. There are no permanent enemies, only permanent interests.\"","\"Maybe they really did break up, but due to contractual issues, they had to continue pretending to be a couple.\"","\"Wuwuwu, our Yang Hong is so pitiful, he must not want his former love to face criticism, so he's swallowing his pride.\"","\"Come on, Yang Hong has always been a playboy, he's dated quite a few. Maybe our Meng Meng was the one who got dumped.\"","\"Regardless of what's going on between Yang Hong and Xu Meng, Xu Meng and Sun Mo are definitely together now, right? All I can say is, your circle knows how to play. The ex-boyfriend and current boyfriend are in the same group. Xu girl, you're so lucky.\"","Before the wave of comments from the previous round had subsided, Xu Meng began to speak.","\"It's true that I've broken up with Brother Hong. As for Brother Mo... actually, we dated five years ago when we were both newcomers, but we broke up due to various misunderstandings. This unexpected collaboration resolved those misunderstandings, so... we got back together.\"","After saying this, Xu Meng turned to look at Sun Mo shyly, and Sun Mo returned her gaze affectionately.","Yang Hong smiled and added, \"Although we broke up, I still hope she can find a good person to entrust herself to. Coincidentally, Mo and I are in the same company, and we have a good relationship. I learned about some of the misunderstandings from back then, so I helped to bring them together. I guess I played matchmaker for a while.\"","Xu Meng's statement was already explosive enough, as her past with Sun Mo was truly little known, so it immediately turned all the comments into exclamation marks and question marks.","By the time Yang Hong spoke, the comments went blank for a moment.","It was as if everyone behind the screen was processing the information, their brains crashing.","[Hahaha, I've heard of unexpected revelations, but never of forcing gossip down netizens' throats. Did you consider your fans' capacity to handle this?]","The comments were refreshing at 99+ speed constantly, all netizens had a belly full of words they wanted to spew out, the information became incredibly mixed.","New trending topics kept appearing on Weibo.","#SunMoNotAThirdPartyButAnEx,NotCheatingButRekinldingOldFlame#","#ExYangHongSoOpenMinded,SecretlyMatchmakingAsACupid#","#YourSister-in-lawIsAllTheSame#","#ThreeHappyFamilyMembers,Fans:TurnsOutI'mTheClown!#","So, should the fans of the three congratulate them or be angry?","It seemed that none of their idols had crossed any fundamental lines, and they even appeared to be very happy.","But why did they have this stifled feeling of being played? They had been defending their idols for so long, fighting hundreds of battles online for their idols, finding all sorts of reasons to protect them, and some crazy fans even ended up in jail because of those rumors.","In the end, their idols were dating?","Even that stage play about the future transformation of relationships might not have been a misjudgment at all, but more like a tribute prepared for the two to get back together.","Just as the direction of fan sentiment was becoming uncontrollable,","Sun Mo began to speak.","Sun Mo said, \"We sincerely apologize to everyone for the trouble caused by the relationship issues between us three. This was originally our private matter, and we didn't expect it to be brought into the public eye. But I don't want my loved one and my friend to face criticism, which is why we're officially clarifying here. There is no improper relationship between us three, everything is in line with morality and ethics.\"","[Hahaha, how can you say that with a straight face? Among the three of you liars, yours is the funniest. I really want to slap the evidence in your face.]","[At this moment, I admit that the three of you are great actors.]","[But this explanation is much better than the malicious method you originally planned. At least you didn't smear Pei Mingxuan, so you still have some conscience.]","Hearing this, most people could make sense of it. Although there would be a backlash in public opinion later, and even a large number of fans might leave, it was still a peaceful resolution to the problem.","While Sun Mo was rattling off official-sounding words,","The sound of a door opening came from behind.","Ji Fei hurriedly looked back, and her gaze became difficult to move away.","She saw Qin Xian with his hair half-dry, steam blurring his brows like ink diffusing on canvas. He raised his eyes, clear and deep.","A towel was draped over his broad, solid shoulders, and he wore black silk pajama pants, with a matching robe draped over one arm.","His body, freshly washed with hot water, had a faint lustrous quality, like the finest jade after being meticulously carved by a master craftsman, displaying its best state.","Faced with Ji Fei's gaze, Qin Xian was now calm. He walked over to Ji Fei with his clothes.","[A water-fresh man is indeed... slurp, truly gorgeous!]","Qin Xian froze.","\"You're done washing, why didn't you call me? Come, let me help you.\"","Ji Fei excitedly stood up, directly snatching the clothes from Qin Xian's hands, and cheerfully helped him put them on, moving from one arm around to the back, then to the other arm.","Ji Fei was extremely careful, as if afraid to touch Qin Xian's arms. Her fingers, however, inadvertently brushed against the taut muscles, feeling the power hidden beneath, making those areas unusually sensitive.","Qin Xian lowered his head and eyes, watching Ji Fei move to his front to help him tie the bathrobe belt. Just as she was tying it, Sun Mo's voice came from the background livestream.","\"Additionally, I have another announcement to make on this occasion. Due to differences in our development philosophies, my manager Pei Mingxuan and I have officially terminated our working relationship as of today. From now on, we will each pursue our own paths.\"","Ji Fei's attention was instantly diverted. The bathrobe belt wasn't tied properly, leaving the robe loose and revealing a patch of skin, but Ji Fei was too preoccupied to notice. She immediately sat back down to continue watching the livestream.","[What's going on? Weren't we not supposed to mention Sister Pei anymore? Why do I have a bad feeling about this?]","Qin Xian looked helplessly at his bathrobe, took a towel to dry his hair with one hand, and sat down in the chair next to Ji Fei to watch the livestream with her."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: You're really a money-making genius","paragraphs":["Another wave of shocking information for the fans.","The celebrity and their agent have terminated their contract? They've gone their separate ways? What's this all about?","Immediately, many people began to speculate.","Sun Mo also seemed to start looking at the danmu (scrolling comments) to answer some questions.","\"It has nothing to do with the stage play. I've already stated that it was a rumor. The script was entirely arranged by me.\"","\"The rumors about me and my agent are also false. We've never been in love or dated, we were just colleagues.\"","As Ji Feizhen listened in confusion,","She heard Sun Mo change his tone, speaking seriously with a determined look in his eyes as if talking to someone specific.","\"I know you're watching the livestream. I'm very grateful for your companionship these years. I've grown to where I am today thanks to you. I'm sorry I let you down.\"","\"Although you didn't approve of us from the beginning and wanted us to break up, I'll prove to you that our love is real. Even if we're together, it won't affect my career.\"","\"We'll work hard together. This time, no one can separate us.\"","After saying this, Sun Mo firmly grasped Xu Meng's hand and raised it.","\"Something doesn't sound right about this,\" Ji Fei frowned.","Qin Xian said coldly: \"It's ambiguous talk, meant to guide people's thoughts. Although the current breakup and reunion have nothing to do with Pei Mingxuan, Sun Mo avoided the main reason for the breakup five years ago and only mentioned Pei Mingxuan's part. But everything he said is true. Pei Mingxuan can't refute it, so they can still successfully gain sympathy and shift negative public opinion.\"","Ji Fei turned to look at Qin Xian, dumbfounded. \"Why go in circles?\"","Qin Xian analyzed: \"Because their original plan always had moral issues. To counteract this, they must portray Pei Mingxuan as a clearly villainous character to shift the conflict. But this would not only provoke Pei Mingxuan's retaliation but also lead people to accuse Sun Mo of being ungrateful. Moreover, since it's a frame-up, there would always be evidence that could backfire on them. So they switched to a safer method, letting the fans' imagination do the work.\"","\"After all, the real villain in this matter, Second Young Master Lin, won't come out and say what methods he used to steal someone else's girlfriend. Xu Meng also won't admit that she broke up because she was vain.\"","Qin Xian gestured for Ji Fei to look at the livestream chat.","After Sun Mo finished speaking, the comments in the livestream paused for a moment, then suddenly erupted like hot water poured into oil.","\"Why do I sense something else in this?\"","\"Didn't Xu Meng and Yang Hong both mention earlier that Xu Meng and Sun Mo's breakup five years ago was due to a misunderstanding? Could it be that someone interfered?\"","\"Since the agent wanted them to break up, could it have been the agent's doing?\"","\"Even if they say they were never in love, it doesn't rule out the possibility of someone having a one-sided crush and driving away someone else's girlfriend! After five years of not getting what they wanted, now that the couple has reunited, they can only slink away, right?\"","\"Oh my god, if that's the case, Sun Mo and Xu Meng are so pitiful!\"","\"So our Yang Hong, being the righteous person he is, helped them clear up the misunderstanding and exposed the agent's plot? Is that why they suddenly terminated the contract at such a strange time?\"","\"I feel like we've figured out the truth.\"","\"This twist... I feel like I've been mentally contaminated.\"","Qin Xian said: \"It's going to be difficult for Pei Mingxuan to get past this.\"","Indeed, it was difficult. The things Pei Mingxuan had prepared could only be used if Sun Mo and the others explicitly made her out to be the villain and fabricated lies. Only then could she use the various pieces of evidence she had kept to prove that she had always worked diligently and never had any improper actions or thoughts.","She had even thought about revealing the affair between Second Young Master Lin and Xu Meng. Under the premise that their various lies were exposed, the affair with Second Young Master Lin would become the final straw to crush them.","But there isn't just one smart person in this world, and naturally, there are ways to break the deadlock.","Three men make a tiger. At this point, no matter what Pei Mingxuan says, people will only curse at her. If she reveals the affair with Second Young Master Lin, not only will she offend him, but people won't believe her and might even think she's making baseless accusations.","In fact, as a smart agent, she should remain silent at this moment, ignore the public opinion that has been guided, and only respond to Sun Mo's surface meaning.","But this grievance, she really couldn't swallow it.","Yet... she had no choice but to swallow it.","It wasn't until the livestream ended that everyone saw Pei Mingxuan's response on Weibo.","\"As an agent, I didn't want my artist to be in a relationship. At that time, I was young and stubborn. Now that you've reunited, it's truly a cause for celebration. I wish you lovebirds all the best, and I'm grateful for your hard work along the way, which has allowed me to build my own career. Thank you very much.\"","Comments were disabled.","Because Pei Mingxuan knew what she would face, after all, the internet was already full of conspiracy theories about her.","Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei, who was hanging her head nearby, and brought over a cup of hot milk. \"She's a smart agent. This is the best way to handle it. It shows everyone her professionalism. But don't worry, since we chose her as your agent, my side and Qin Zhao's side will...\"","Ji Fei's shoulders trembled.","Qin Xian's words trailed off, his heart suddenly in disarray. He wanted to quickly offer comfort, but then he heard an explosive laugh.","[I thought I wouldn't get the chance! I had just convinced myself to let bygones be bygones, that forgiveness is a virtue, not to cause trouble, that some juicy gossip is best kept to oneself rather than stirring up chaos. But since you're asking for it, don't blame me for unleashing my inner universe. Hehehe!]","Qin Xian: ?","Well... I can hear how hard it was for you to restrain yourself, how you had to persuade yourself so much.","But what juicy gossip do you have that can turn the situation around?","Then he saw Ji Fei take out her phone, do some operations on his computer, and upload two video files.","Then she found two marketing accounts that had been most skeptical about this incident and sent private messages from a secondary account.","\"Hey, I've got big news that will reverse all of tonight's drama. I have video evidence. Let's discuss the price.\"","Qin Xian: ? You're even selling it? You really are a money-making genius. No wonder you were suppressing yourself earlier, almost missing out on a fortune, huh?","While Qin Xian watched Ji Fei haggle with people, he also saw her open the videos and edit them slightly to avoid revealing some other private thoughts.","His own phone was full of messages from the family group chat.","The Qin family members thought there was no more gossip to be had and were clamoring in the group chat, feeling very indignant and asking Qin Zhao to find a solution.","Qin Zhao was quite bewildered outside with Gao Hao. He could only contact Qin Xian, since Qin Xian had said before that if he really predicted something, they should come to him and he would have a way to handle everything.","Seeing that his third brother had come to ask, Qin Xian looked at the videos on the computer and then lowered his head to reply: \"No need to rush. There will be headlines solving everything in the morning. Your second sister-in-law has taken action.\"","Qin Zhao: \"? Isn't it you taking action?\"","Qin Xian: \"There's no need for me.\" He couldn't interfere with his wife's money-making plans.","Those two videos, one was of the various confrontations on the balcony, not only exposing that the timing of their breakup was wrong, but also showing the extreme kissing operation, and explaining that Pei Mingxuan, as an agent, had only suggested the breakup five years ago but had never really used any tactics, it was someone else who had interfered.","The other was the scene of contract termination backstage today, not only bringing out the script scapegoating issue for flogging, but also emphasizing Sun Mo's narcissism and Pei Mingxuan's innocence.","[I can't imagine what kind of world they'll face when they wake up tomorrow. It must be very exciting. I'm really looking forward to it, hehe.]","Qin Xian also smiled helplessly. Indeed, it would be very exciting, completely crushing them with no chance of recovery.","[Damn, this is incredible. They actually went back to Sun Mo's place together to drink and celebrate. Drink up, drink up, it's the last joyful drink of your lives.]","Ji Fei laughed while picking up the warm milk beside her. She took a sip and realized it was Qin Xian who had poured it for her.","This was awkward. Qin Xian was injured, she should be the one taking care of him.","And how did he know that she likes to drink warm milk before bed?","Ji Fei turned to look at Qin Xian, who was intently watching the video, and started to explain about the videos.","Qin Xian said: \"Mm, it's fortunate you recorded it.\"","Ji Fei glanced at his injured arm resting on the table. Someone who usually worked every night, rarely taking time off to relax and enjoy snacks together, was probably not here to keep her company. Most likely, his right hand was injured, making it difficult to do anything. She sighed, thinking about how this was hindering the big shot from making money.","\"I guess this counts as getting revenge for you. After all, if they hadn't caused trouble, this kind of thing wouldn't have happened. It's all their fault!\"","Qin Xian was taken aback. He turned his head to look at Ji Fei's indignant little expression. His heart trembled, and his eyes sparkled with a glimmer of light. He smiled gently and said, \"Mm, then thank you for avenging me.\""]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: My home is not a garbage dump, no matter how garbage is classified","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan was the type of person who would swallow her own blood rather than let others see her weakness.","She locked herself in her room, blocking out all information, waiting for this turbulent night to pass.","She knew she had lost this round, but she wouldn't admit defeat. Someday, she would find a way to get even.","After a sleepless night, as dawn broke, she put on her makeup, turned on her phone, and prepared to go to the company to handle the handover matters.","As soon as she turned on her phone, it was flooded with calls.","Pei Mingxuan sneered, assuming it was Sun Mo's obsessed fans, still unwilling to let her go, able to call as soon as she turned on her phone.","But when she looked at her phone, it was the company.","At the top of her phone, the latest hot topic on Weibo popped up.","#Shocking! The chaotic love triangle, the truth is actually like this!#","#Sun Mo's manager became the biggest scapegoat#","#Was last night's livestream intended to incite fans to cyberbully the manager and shift the focus?#","#Two-faced Sun Mo, cuckold king Yang Hong, master player Xu Meng#","Faced with such a sudden change in the narrative, Pei Mingxuan was stunned. She immediately opened Weibo to find several explosive revelations topping the hot search page.","Just an hour ago, at 7:30 in the morning, right as the morning rush hour was starting.","Videos leaked by two marketing accounts, riding on the heat from last night, directly set the internet ablaze.","Pei Mingxuan's pupils gradually dilated as she answered the incessantly ringing phone. The roaring voice on the other end was the company's vice president, after all, this had directly hit three money-making tools at once.","\"Pei Mingxuan, did you do this?\"","Pei Mingxuan coldly replied, \"If I had this ability, I would have done it last night.\"","\"Nevermind, go to Sun Mo's house quickly and find him. We can't reach him. You need to discuss how to resolve this situation immediately.\"","Pei Mingxuan sneered, picking at her ear, and said, \"We've already terminated our contract. His crisis is none of my business!\"","\"You... he was cultivated by your own hands, how can you be so heartless?\"","\"Ah yes, yes, I'm the most heartless.\"","The other party seemed to be choked up, \"You're determined not to get involved?\"","\"My home isn't a garbage station, I don't deal with trash sorting.\"","The other party could only say, \"Then at least delete your Weibo post from last night.\"","Pei Mingxuan laughed, \"That's my Weibo, I'll do what I want with it, it's none of your business!\"","That was her, the victim's, helpless self-protection measure when she was framed. How could she delete it?","She must constantly remind those fans about the despicable things their idol had done.","Not only would she not delete it, but she would also open the comment function.","If she didn't kick them while they were down, she'd be letting down those who helped her.","Both videos might have come from the same person, and they were willing to release them to help her. She could only think of the top-tier group. Picking up her handbag, the professional manager stepped out of the door, heading towards Qin Zhao Studio.","Even though it was early in the morning, the heat on the internet was no less intense than last night.","\"What did I just see? Xu Meng first kissed Sun Mo, performing a scene of tortured love, then kissed Yang Hong, emphasizing that she still loved him. You call this an amicable breakup and rekindling of an old flame?\"","\"Damn it, the relationship between these three really has me confused.\"","\"So when Xu Meng broke up with Sun Mo initially, it was because she was forced by another bad person, then why last night...\"","\"She couldn't offend that person, right? A coward who bullies the weak and fears the strong. I thought the manager was right yesterday, which manager would allow their idol to date during their rise to fame?\"","\"So it really was a frame-up tactic. Even the script selection could be blamed on the manager. It's true that you can't judge a book by its cover, you can't tell if it's human or beast under that human skin.\"","\"So the manager did try to save our eyes, not wanting us to see that kissing scene on stage. Unfortunately, it didn't work, so we were subjected to Sun Mo and Xu Meng's eye-searing display.\"","\"Fortunately, the manager sister successfully terminated the contract, at least escaping from this misery. Their movie is too crowded with the three of them, it's better not to be involved.\"","\"I was halfway through writing a small essay condemning the manager, and now you show me this?\"","\"I'm worse off, I had just finished recommending to my friends how those three people face their feelings openly, how true love prevails in the end. Now my face hurts so much, my friends are all looking at me strangely! My reputation is ruined!\"","\"There are too many points to criticize, I really don't know where to start. Forget it, I can't suffer alone with this disgusting thing. I'll forward it to my sisters first, my sisters are always a step behind me!\"","The door of Sun Mo's apartment was being frantically knocked on.","Sun Mo's assistant, Xu Meng's assistant, and Yang Hong's manager were all crowded at the door.","All three were holding their phones, sweating profusely with ashen faces, but no one had opened the door for a long time.","Xu Meng, who was sleeping in the first-floor room, was finally awakened by the noise. Supporting her hungover head and aching body, she groggily woke up.","Remembering something, she was startled and quickly got up, turning to look, only to find the bed empty. She immediately breathed a sigh of relief.","It was very noisy outside. Xu Meng quickly tidied herself up and went to open the door, trying to avoid waking Sun Mo upstairs.","Looking through the peephole and seeing who had come, she opened the door with a frown and said, \"What's all the noise about so early in the morning? Be quiet.\"","\"Meng Meng, something's happened!\"","\"Where's Yang Hong?!\"","\"Where's Brother Mo!\"","The three speaking simultaneously left Xu Meng bewildered. \"Yang Hong... he went back long ago, right? Sun Mo should still be upstairs. What's wrong with you all?\"","\"Yang Hong didn't go back, didn't you see? His shoes are still on the floor!\" the manager angrily said.","Xu Meng was stunned, not quite understanding.","\"Meng Meng, something big has happened, quick, look at your phone!\" Xu Meng's assistant hurriedly took out her phone to show Xu Meng.","First were two familiar videos, then the hot search topics, comments...","\"If I hadn't seen the video, I really wouldn't have known that the hardworking, drama-free little sister I've been a fan of for so long was actually like this...\"","\"Your idol has no shame, cheating isn't enough, she even psychologically manipulates Yang Hong!\"","\"Don't be so anxious, Yang Hong fans above. Isn't your idol willingly downgrading himself to a backup? Maybe he's into that kind of thing. Really, what a perfect match, haha.\"","\"Anyway, I'm disgusted. These three should all get out of the entertainment industry. People with such twisted values and corrupt morals will only bring down the entire industry.\"","\"But to be fair, the breakup five years ago really was forced. I still feel quite sympathetic towards the initial young couple. If they hadn't broken up, would they have ended up like this today?\"","\"You're so naive. Looking at her subsequent behavior, she's clearly a master player. How could she sacrifice for others? Only an idiot like Sun Mo would believe that.\"","Xu Meng's face turned deathly pale from the moment she saw the first video. Her lips trembling, she snatched the phone and stared at it intently. \"How could this happen? How could this happen?!\"","Those comments targeting her seemed to expose all her thoughts, nailing her to a pillar of shame.","The public image she had carefully cultivated seemed to be crumbling.","And there was one more troublesome issue - in the video, she had slandered Second Young Master Lin from back then.","If Second Young Master Lin saw this...","The color drained from Xu Meng's face due to those comments, and finally, her whole body began to tremble. It's over, it's really over.","She immediately rushed upstairs in a panic, charging towards the master bedroom. The other three quickly followed.","Xu Meng suddenly pushed open the door and shouted, \"Sun Mo, something terrible has happened, ah ah ah ah ah ah ah!\"","[Ah ah ah ah ah! I just wanted to see if those three had seen the news and what their reactions were. Why am I subjected to this mental pollution!!!]","On this rare occasion of a family breakfast, although everyone was enthusiastically discussing the satisfying gossip from this morning, they were startled by Ji Fei's sudden mental outburst, almost dropping their utensils."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: Behind one melon, there is another melon, melon melon melon","paragraphs":["The Qin family couldn't help but look at Ji Fei. She appeared to be in a state of shock.","What was going on? What kind of mental pollution could make even Ji Fei, who was used to juicy gossip, look so stunned?","Everyone was burning with curiosity.","Finally, someone couldn't resist asking, \"I wonder how those three are doing now?\"","The question snapped Ji Fei out of her daze.","[This world is too fantastical. The hospital is so big, you can find all kinds of bizarre patients!]","The Qin family immediately held their breath. What on earth was it? Just say it already! Don't keep us in suspense!","[This gossip is too explosive, I really want to share it!]","The Qin family: You can say it in your mind, you can share it with us!!!","[If I don't say it, who would know that last night, after they got drunk celebrating, Sun Mo took Xu Meng back to his room and they rekindled their old flame.]","The Qin family: That's not hard to imagine, they've already gotten back together.","[After they finished, Xu Meng received a message and was surprised that Yang Hong hadn't left. She immediately went out and saw Yang Hong standing at the door with a complicated expression, awkwardly trying to say something. But then Yang Hong carried her downstairs, and the two of them again... in the guest room of Sun Mo's apartment.]","The Qin family: ...Our minds have been polluted too. These three are too...","[After Xu Meng fell asleep from exhaustion, Yang Hong still felt uneasy. He had an epiphany - he didn't just see Sun Mo as his idol, he actually wanted to have Sun Mo. So... is this why I couldn't accurately verify his gossip at first? Because he himself hadn't figured out his own mind?]","The Qin family: Why do we have a bad feeling about this? Why do we want to cover our ears?","[Then he pushed open the door to Sun Mo's room... Yuck~ Yang Hong, oh Yang Hong, who could be more shameless than you!!!]","The Qin family: !!!!","What did they just hear? Was it what they thought it was?","For the first time, they really didn't want to hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts!","Especially the men present, their faces turned a shade paler.","Qin Zhao, as their colleague, was even more dumbfounded. He had guessed that Yang Hong might have had some of those intentions, but he never thought Yang Hong would dare to act on them directly!","How could Sun Mo not resist? Didn't Sun Mo love Xu Meng? He wasn't gay!","[Although Sun Mo was sleeping, drunk and exhausted, he still woke up at the crucial moment. He immediately exploded with anger and started fighting, while Yang Hong, having nothing left to lose, simply tried to forcibly take him...]","The Qin family, though not wanting to hear, couldn't help but be curious. What happened? What was the result?","[One knew he only had one chance, the other was determined to defend his chastity to the death. They both used too much force and ended up knocking each other unconscious. But since neither of them was wearing clothes at the time, and Yang Hong had already left some marks on Sun Mo, so when Xu Meng and the other three pushed open the door...]","The Qin family: What?! It was Xu Meng... and four people pushed open the door?!!!","Silence echoed around the Qin family's dining table.","Screams, however, erupted one after another in Sun Mo's bedroom.","Xu Meng leaned weakly against the door, looking at the two people on the bed in disbelief, then turned her head and started retching.","The remaining three people screamed even louder than each other. But they still couldn't wake the two men up. Seeing the blood at the corners of their mouths and their faces swollen like pig heads, they realized something was terribly wrong.","In an instant, all hell broke loose, and both men were hospitalized.","[I didn't expect it to end with violent hospitalization. I wonder if Sun Mo can hold up when he wakes up. After all, Second Young Master Lin has also been provoked and started to leak information. He's about to know the truth about how he was set up back then. Tsk tsk tsk... Without Sister Pei's protection, it's really... Thinking about his words last night, sigh~~~~]","The Qin family also echoed in shock, estimating that Sun Mo probably wouldn't be able to hold on.","The gossip had pretty much reached its climax, and they had lost their appetite to continue eating breakfast anyway.","\"Second son, don't go to work today. Wait until your wound is a bit better,\" Qin's Father said, changing the subject.","Qin Xian nodded, \"Mm.\"","\"Are you going to the hospital later for a check-up and to change the dressing?\" Qin's Mom asked.","Qin Xian nodded again.","\"Then I'll accompany...\" Qin Yan was about to speak but was stopped by a look from Qin's Mom. She immediately realized and turned to Ji Fei with a smile, \"I was just saying Ji Fei got up so early today, it turns out it was to accompany my second brother to take care of his wound.\"","Ji Fei nodded.","[After all, he was injured because of me. I should help where I can while Qin Xian is inconvenienced.]","The corner of Qin Xian's mouth twitched almost imperceptibly.","[At least he's the big boss who helps me make money, I must have this much conscience.]","Qin Xian's smile froze.","The Qin family wanted to laugh but didn't dare.","When they arrived at the hospital and finished treating the wound, they were about to leave when suddenly they saw a group of reporters rushing into the hospital.","Ji Fei's first reaction was to think that she hadn't disguised herself well and had been exposed.","But then she thought, she didn't have that much star power to warrant so many entertainment reporters coming in person.","\"So many reporters coming to the hospital to find someone... is there some celebrity hospitalized?\" Suddenly, Qin Xian spoke up, then glanced at Ji Fei, feeling he had given a good hint.","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment, then her mind started turning.","[Damn, it's really the same hospital, I didn't realize before! Are those reporters here to ask about the video and Second Young Master Lin?]","[Oh no no no! It's not about the video anymore!]","Qin Xian was shocked. After all, the big gossip they got from Ji Fei's thoughts was very secret, it shouldn't be possible...","[Hahaha... I don't want to laugh, I really don't want to laugh, but it's really... Is this karma?]","Seeing Ji Fei beside him trying so hard not to laugh that she was about to have a fit, Qin Xian had already started guessing the most bizarre scenarios.","\"Should we... go take a look?\" Qin Xian couldn't help but suggest.","Ji Fei was already speechless, she could only nod frantically.","On the other side, half an hour earlier, Sun Mo, who had woken up, asked about Yang Hong's ward. He didn't notice the nurse's strange look, still not satisfied and dragging his severely injured body over. Thinking about what happened last night, he felt sick and his blood boiled. He never thought he would be tricked so badly by a young man, almost losing his chastity.","But just as he reached the door, he heard a commotion from inside.","\"Yang Hong, you lied to me. So this was your intention all along! You're disgusting!\" Xu Meng cried hysterically.","Sun Mo was about to feel heartbroken, but then he heard Yang Hong's voice.","\"Hmph, weren't you the one who slept with me behind your new boyfriend's back last night? Weren't you the one who promised to secretly sleep with me in the future? We're equally disgusting!\"","Sun Mo's face changed dramatically. He suddenly pushed the door open and rushed in, \"You... what are you saying!\"","Xu Meng was stunned, even forgetting to cry. Yang Hong's face changed several times.","Finally, the two of them said in unison: \"I was drunk, it was all his fault for seducing me!\"","Sun Mo's face turned from green to white, his mind buzzing, his eyes burning with rage. He didn't even know who to look at.","Worried that Sun Mo might lash out again, Yang Hong's manager protected him and quickly said, \"Where's your assistant? Didn't they tell you? There's a big scandal online. You're still here discussing your love affairs? Whatever internal conflicts you have, deal with them later. First, we need to come up with a strategy. If this isn't handled well, you can all say goodbye to your careers in the entertainment industry!\"","The threat of these words finally cleared Sun Mo's confused and angry mind for a moment.","\"What?\"","\"Look at your phone!\"","Sun Mo finally picked up his phone.","Because the people involved were in trouble, they couldn't give any explanation for the leaked video. Their studio could only issue lawyer's letters, warning some netizens who made excessively harsh comments. Then they stalled for time, saying they would give the netizens a satisfactory explanation later.","The netizens could only continue to digest the previous gossip, analyzing frame by frame, continuing to dig.","Seeing those things, Sun Mo could barely stand, slumping against the wall.","His face, already pale, now looked lifeless.","The internet was filled with mockery of him.","\"I'm really going to die laughing at Sun Mo. He's just like those greasy, narcissistic men who always think that women who are nice to them must have a crush on them. Even if the other person denies it, he still stubbornly believes it. I want to interview Mr. Sun Mo and ask, exactly what kind of answer do you need to hear before you'll believe that she doesn't like you at all?\"","\"Haha, no matter what you say, he'll think you're just putting up a front, that you actually love him. He's exactly like those delusional men who think you have a crush on them just because you glanced at them once.\"","\"Sun Mo, you shameless bastard! I never thought you were this kind of person! You've disappointed us so much!\"","\"To think I've always supported you unconditionally, how could you betray our trust like this?\"","\"I must have been blind. You know how much Sister Pei has done for you, and this is how you repay her? You and Xu Meng deserve each other - you're a perfect match made in hell!\"","\"Sun Mo, you idiot, you don't even realize Xu Meng is just using you like a fish in her pond. You deserve this!\"","\"Oh Sun Mo, Sun Mo. Give you an inch and you take a mile. Too stupid to even know you're stupid.\"","...","Sun Mo's hands began to tremble as he held his phone.","\"Don't look, Brother Mo, don't look...\" Xu Meng seemed to suddenly remember something and rushed over to snatch the phone away. Her expression was almost distorted.","But it was too late, because Sun Mo had already seen the new trending topics that had just popped up.","#Second Young Master Lin angrily clarifies: Xu Meng pursued him back then#","#Xu Meng, how can you do this to Sun Mo? Don't you have a conscience?#","Sun Mo suddenly came to his senses and shoved Xu Meng away, clicking on those two trending topics.","It was a post made by Second Young Master Lin himself.","\"Damn it, talk about rotten luck. You two rekindle your old flame and make me out to be the villain? You don't deserve that! Sun Mo, do you want to know how Xu Meng and I met? It was during that movie audition. To pave the way for my buddy's artist, I approached Xu Meng and offered her 500,000 yuan to hold you back during the final selection. She thought it was just a regular opportunity, so she sold you out for 500,000 yuan, not knowing it was your one chance closest to success!\"","\"And your injury back then was also Xu Meng's idea. She was afraid you'd cling to her after she broke up with you. She came to me willingly. I never force anyone, you can ask around and find out. When she was with me, she was happier than ever. After leaving me, she dated quite a few rich guys before ending up with Yang Hong. You're just the last sucker to pick up the tab!\"","\"If you keep slandering me with past events, I'll have to bring out the evidence and sue you. I still have the transfer records and chat logs from back then!\"","The netizens were shocked, mocking, and in an uproar.","There were layers upon layers of drama, and it kept coming. They were like badgers in a melon patch, eagerly devouring every bit.","In contrast to the excitement of the netizens, Sun Mo's heart felt like it had died. His expression gradually turned demonic.","The shock was so great that he didn't notice new trending topics popping up.","He looked up, his eyes fixed on Xu Meng. Frightened, she took a step back, wanting to make excuses, but the evidence was too damning, leaving her no room to defend herself.","\"Brother Mo, this kind of woman isn't worth it,\" Yang Hong added fuel to the fire.","Thinking of his current situation and all that had happened in the past, Sun Mo finally couldn't take it anymore. His sanity snapped, and he lunged at Xu Meng, grabbing her by the throat.","\"You bitch! You fucking bitch! I'll kill you!\"","But he was already badly injured, so Xu Meng managed to break free after struggling desperately. She cried out as she violently pushed Sun Mo away.","Sun Mo staggered back towards the hospital bed, caught by Yang Hong.","At this critical moment, the door to the hospital room burst open.","Countless reporters poured in.","\"Sun Mo, are you with Xu Meng or Yang Hong?\""]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: The Twists and Turns I Can't Stand as a Broken Reader","paragraphs":["As the reporters burst through the hospital room door, Qin Xian pulled Ji Fei back to avoid getting caught up in the commotion. Mindful of Qin Xian's injured arm, Ji Fei stayed with him in a distant corner to watch the scene unfold.","Despite being on the VIP floor, the incident drew quite a crowd of onlookers. Some medical staff called for security to handle the situation, while others huddled together to gossip. A few happened to be standing right in front of Ji Fei and Qin Xian.","\"The ambulance group chat was buzzing earlier. When they picked up those two and did an emergency check in the ambulance, they stripped off their clothes and saw some telling marks. Someone must have leaked the conversation.\"","\"That conversation is nothing. At most it's just wild speculation. The real scoop came from paparazzi who secretly photographed Sun Mo's apartment. They caught Xu Meng on the first floor and then saw a bunch of people carrying Sun Mo and Yang Hong down from the second floor. That's what really got people talking.\"","\"No, the smoking gun was Sun Mo's assistant booking him an appointment with a proctologist!\"","\"What? So Sun Mo really was...\"","\"Actually, no. It was probably just an accident while they were... preparing. The assistant panicked during the examination, which is why...\"","Although Ji Fei already knew the truth from her Gossip System, hearing others gossiping in person still amused her to no end.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian's mouth twitched uncontrollably.","[What's meant to be will be. Tsk tsk tsk.] Ji Fei thought to herself, trying not to laugh. [Sun Mo's really in a pickle now. Even if it's not shit, it might as well be.]","Qin Xian was put off by Ji Fei's crude analogy, but he had to admit it was apt. He couldn't help but remark sarcastically, \"Without Pei Mingxuan, he really is nothing but his acting skills.\"","After all, with both of them sent to the hospital and so many prying eyes around, the lack of Pei Mingxuan's strict confidentiality measures meant others had been careless.","\"You said it,\" Ji Fei gloated. \"For something like this to leak out... just goes to show you can't do shady things and expect to get away with it forever.\"","Suddenly, someone exclaimed, \"They're hugging each other!\"","Ji Fei immediately perked up. \"What? What?!\"","As people rushed forward, Ji Fei realized she couldn't squeeze through the crowd. She started jumping up and down, trying to peek over the top of the doorway.","In the next moment, she felt a strong arm wrap around her waist and effortlessly lift her up. Ji Fei's view suddenly improved dramatically.","She let out a small gasp and looked back in surprise to see Qin Xian holding her up with one arm, his expression completely unchanged.","Qin Xian looked up at her, their eyes meeting. Ji Fei's almond-shaped eyes were wide open, like a startled cat with its fur standing on end.","\"Don't you want to look?\" he asked.","Ji Fei's brain short-circuited for a moment before remembering the juicy gossip at hand. She quickly turned back to watch.","Although she could only see part of the scene, she still caught a glimpse of two male figures pressed together on the bed.","[Hahahahaha~ How is this even possible? What on earth are they doing? Shooting themselves in the foot? Hehehehe~]","Although Qin Xian couldn't see, hearing Ji Fei's internal laughter brought a glimmer of amusement to his eyes.","When the reporters had burst in, they were hoping to get a scoop, but they never expected to witness such an explosive scene before even asking a question. In an instant, everyone forgot about their questions as camera flashes went off non-stop, capturing the image of Yang Hong tightly embracing Sun Mo on the bed from every possible angle.","By the time the people inside reacted, Sun Mo immediately broke free from the embrace. But his mind had gone blank. He was still unaware of the wild rumors circulating about him and Yang Hong, so he was caught off guard by the sudden barrage of questions. His manager and assistant quickly stepped in to push the reporters out.","But the reporters kept firing off relentless questions:","\"Sun Mo, if this is the nature of your relationship with Yang Hong, were you just using Xu Meng as a cover?\"","\"Sun Mo, did you already know about Xu Meng's betrayal years ago? Is that why you stole her boyfriend as deliberate revenge?\"","\"Yang Hong, you've always dated women connected to Sun Mo. Have you been coveting him all along?\"","\"Yang Hong, who do you really love - Xu Meng or Sun Mo?\"","\"Xu Meng, what's your take on the relationship between these two? Did you know you were actually the outsider?\"","The rapid-fire questions felt like a series of slaps to Sun Mo's face.","It wasn't until hospital security arrived to drive the reporters away and close the door that Sun Mo seemed to breathe again.","\"What's going on? What the hell is going on?!\" Sun Mo stared at the others, his eyes bulging.","The others appeared equally confused and quickly pulled out their phones to check. As they looked, everyone's expressions turned grim.","Sun Mo hurriedly checked his own phone. The internet was no longer filled with insults about his character or mockery of his gullibility. Instead, it was flooded with news of him being sent to a proctologist and leaked photos of his apartment. All the speculation laid bare the events of last night that Sun Mo found most difficult to face.","Even worse, someone in the group that had just barged in was live streaming.","Viewers in the live stream were losing their minds. They never expected the outrageous rumors to be true, let alone confirmed so dramatically!","\"Am I some kind of masochist? Why am I witnessing this love triangle firsthand!\"","\"I can't help it, my brain is shrinking from this.\"","\"Even I, a mere reader of stories, can't handle this level of plot twists.\"","\"My worldview is shattered!\"","\"What kind of annual soap opera drama is this!\"","\"I must have opened this live stream wrong. I'm a seasoned gossip consumer, but this is too much for me to swallow. I'll choke!\"","\"I thought it was Sun Mo and Xu Meng vs. Yang Hong and Xu Meng. Turns out it's Xu Meng and Sun Mo vs. Yang Hong and Sun Mo. So the winner is Sun Mo, with a partner on each arm!\"","\"You've dried up my silence. Tell me, you three, how many more shocks do you have in store that I don't know about?\"","\"Folks, remember last night's live stream of the century reunion? The three of them... turns out it was a throuple all along! No wonder Sun Mo was sitting in the center!\"","\"I always thought Yang Hong was unusually indulgent towards Sun Mo. I mean, who else would be so generous as to give away their wife and then give them a big break on stage? Yang, you're loving too hard!\"","\"I suddenly realized that every one of Yang Hong's ex-girlfriends has had a connection to Sun Mo.\"","\"Damn, one of Yang Hong's exes just spilled that he would always ask if they'd ever been involved with Sun Mo during their relationship. This is really hard to judge, it's truly difficult to assess!\"","\"Before, I only felt sorry for Yang Hong. Now I don't know who to feel sorry for.\"","\"Is Xu Meng actually just a pawn? Being a beard is too pitiful.\"","\"You must have consumed too much gossip and forgotten all the previous tea. These three are all villains, okay?\"","\"But they're all injured, aren't they? And with the proctology visit, isn't Sun Mo actually the victim here?\"","\"If you put it that way, Yang Hong forced himself on Sun Mo, which is a crime!\"","\"So, Sun Mo really was... by Yang Hong?\"","\"No, what good does it do you to laugh me to death? Are you trying to inherit my credit card debt?\"","\"I suggest you all send me 50 yuan, or I'll expose all three of you with one click!\"","The stream of humiliating comments exploded like landmines, causing sharp ringing in the hospital room.","Sun Mo's gaze fixed on the pale-faced Yang Hong. \"It's you! This is all because of you, you sick pervert!\"","He then turned to Xu Meng, who was trying to sneak away. \"And you, you slut. It's all because of you two. If you had never appeared, none of this would have happened. You've ruined me!\"","Sun Mo lunged at them in a frenzy, trying to attack. Some tried to break up the fight while others shouted.","The commotion grew so intense that medical staff had to intervene to separate them. Everyone ended up with injuries.","The expelled reporters managed to capture some evidence of the brawl.","The family that claimed to be in love just last night was now at each other's throats, a complete mess.","Some netizens spliced these videos together with Sun Mo's earnest declarations from the previous night, spawning countless memes.","It was hailed as the fastest self-contradiction case in entertainment history.","[This just goes to show you shouldn't speak in absolutes,] Ji Fei chuckled to herself.","\"Someone actually started a poll?\" she said aloud.","Qin Xian looked over curiously. \"What kind of poll?\"","\"They're voting on how the three of them will end up paired off,\" Ji Fei said with amusement. \"These netizens are really something else.\"","She then proceeded to vote.","Qin Xian was surprised to see she had voted for Sun Mo and Yang Hong. \"You really think so?\" he asked.","Ji Fei waved her hand dismissively. \"I just voted for the least likely option. Hahaha!\"","Qin Xian thought for a moment, then said, \"Not necessarily.\"","\"Huh?\""]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Finally Cheating Sister Pei","paragraphs":["Qin Xian's unexpected statement left Ji Fei puzzled. She wanted to ask more, but Qin Xian simply said, \"It's just a wild guess. After all, this option isn't without its benefits. Let's see how they choose.\"","This really piqued Ji Fei's curiosity. In fact, she thought the most likely outcome for them would be going their separate ways.","As they were about to leave the hospital, they received a call from the lawyer.","The fan who had harmed them had confessed.","Due to the waves of revelations online, all the fans eventually ran out of excuses to defend them.","They had completely fallen from grace.","As if their love and support had become a joke, fans of all three began to collectively unfollow them, and not a single supportive comment could be found anymore.","After all, there had been too many outrageous stunts; it was more than most people could bear. They felt like clowns, making those who once idolized them feel exhausted. Even the most blind love couldn't withstand such erosion.","Even the young girl who had been detained, when the lawyer came to handle her case and she learned the whole truth through her phone, broke down crying. She cursed Sun Mo in anguish, and finally stopped her ranting, as if all her spirit had been drained away.","Her parents, who had originally intended to emotionally blackmail Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, realized the powerful forces behind them and didn't dare to cause trouble. They then thought about pressuring Sun Mo instead, to make him stand up for the fans. But they hadn't expected him to fall so hard that he could barely save himself. Now, these eccentric parents became as meek as quails, accepting the fairest judgment of the law.","After dealing with the young girl's case, they were called to the studio by Qin Zhao.","When they arrived, Gao Hao had already finished reviewing the contract with Pei Mingxuan.","Seeing Ji Fei and Qin Xian arrive, Pei Mingxuan stood up and bowed to Ji Fei.","\"Thank you, Miss Ji, for your righteous help. I owe you a favor.\"","Ji Fei waved her hand and said, \"I was just watching the drama unfold. No need to be so formal.\"","As they were speaking, Pei Mingxuan's phone began to vibrate frantically.","It seemed to have happened many times before. As Pei Mingxuan was about to decline the call again, Gao Hao spoke up, \"Why don't you answer it? Some people just won't give up, they'll keep at it endlessly.\"","Ji Fei looked at them curiously, and Qin Zhao explained, \"It's Sun Mo. He keeps calling her from different numbers.\"","\"He's still calling you?\" Ji Fei asked in surprise. \"What does he want? Is he begging you to go back?\"","\"Hmph.\" Pei Mingxuan let out an involuntary cold snort, clearly not wanting to deal with it at all. If it weren't for fear of disrupting the current business, she would have turned off her phone long ago.","Perhaps it was Ji Fei's overly curious gaze that made Pei Mingxuan feel as if she had to satisfy her curiosity.","She had no choice but to answer the phone in front of everyone, even putting it on speakerphone.","\"Mingxuan, help me...\" Sun Mo's voice was almost like a cry for help. Clearly, he had been mentally crushed by the events of the past twelve hours, and he instinctively sought out the person he trusted most and relied on the most.","\"I seem to remember that we've already terminated our contract,\" Pei Mingxuan said coldly. \"So please, Mr. Sun, stop harassing me.\"","\"Mingxuan, I was wrong, I was deceived, this is all fake. Mingxuan, please come back, let's sign a new contract. We can split the profits however you want, I'll go along with whatever you say. From now on, I'll do whatever you tell me to do, I'll listen to you completely. The company has decided to give up on me. If you don't save me, I'm really finished this time. I still have dreams to fulfill, I still have...\"","\"Sun Mo, have you lost your memory? Have you forgotten how you treated me? Do you think I'm stupid enough to help someone who's my enemy?\"","Sun Mo paused, then quickly said, \"I really didn't want to do that, it's just...\"","\"It's just that compared to the guilt of dealing with me, you couldn't bear to give up your own interests, right? So... hah, I'm the same, you know! I have to protect my interests too! You're now a completely disgraced artist. I don't see any value in you anymore. What makes you think I would take back a piece of trash like you? Are you dreaming?\"","\"No, no, I still have value, I have acting skills, I could have become a movie king, it's all because of that bitch, it's all Xu Meng's fault!\"","Sun Mo's voice was choked with sobs, probably crying his eyes out.","\"Oh? You've fallen out? Didn't you say you would be together forever? Didn't you say it wouldn't affect your future? Didn't you say no one could separate you? What happened? Did you turn around and cheat with Yang Hong? I've known you for so many years, and I never knew you swung that way.\"","[Pfft hahaha, Sister Pei, you're really cutting him to the bone!] Ji Fei had been able to hold it in before, but now she really couldn't help but laugh inwardly, her shoulders shaking with mirth.","The others were also trying to hold back their laughter.","On the other end of the phone, Sun Mo seemed to have stopped breathing, probably not expecting Pei Mingxuan to mock him so deliberately.","After taking several deep breaths, Sun Mo finally managed to speak with difficulty, \"Pei Mingxuan, we've been together for so many years, we swore to climb to the top together when we were nobodies. I was good to you back then too, and you were grateful to me. Have you forgotten all that? I just made one mistake, you can't abandon me at a time like this.\"","But Pei Mingxuan's heart had long since turned to ice. \"You were the first to break our oath. The way you're clinging on now is really unsightly.\"","Sun Mo had been pampered too much before, and even though he had suppressed his temper to beg, he could only keep it up for a short while. Now he finally couldn't keep up the act anymore. As if with the mindset of mutual destruction, he began to roar in anger.","\"Pei Mingxuan! Do you think you'll have any good prospects after leaving me? You're just a woman with no background. I just need to spread a few rumors, and you'll be ruined in the industry. Let's see who dares to risk using you!\"","[Wow, is this a case of 'if I can't have you, no one can'? I didn't know a person's despicable side could keep expanding like this.]","Faced with Sun Mo's almost frenzied behavior, Pei Mingxuan merely said lightly, \"Oh? The conversation just now, I recorded it.\"","At this, Sun Mo instantly fell silent.","It was only then that the others noticed that Pei Mingxuan's phone had indeed been recording. She truly was a shrewd manager.","Qin Zhao smiled with satisfaction and turned to look at Qin Xian, who had been quietly watching the show. Qin Xian nodded.","Qin Zhao suddenly spoke up, \"Mr. Sun doesn't need to worry about Miss Pei's future. We're in the middle of discussing a contract with her.\"","\"Qin... Qin Zhao? You want... want her?\" Sun Mo seemed to have come to his senses, asking in disbelief.","Pei Mingxuan looked at Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao smiled and said, \"If you sign with us, the Qin Group will be your strongest background. We'll provide you with the most comprehensive resources, and you'll have full control over how to use them.\"","Pei Mingxuan was stunned for a moment, then glanced at Qin Xian. After all, when she came in earlier, she had already learned about Ji Fei and Qin Xian's identities and relationship. Becoming Ji Fei's manager would indeed mean having the backing of the Qin Group.","Gao Hao also smiled and said, \"Our studio doesn't have many artists right now. In the future, you'll have the final say on who to sign. Apart from me, you'll be the top manager, fully responsible for developing the artists under you. I believe in your abilities and vision. With your skills, the top actors and actresses, the most popular stars of the next decade, might all come from your hands.\"","Pei Mingxuan's eyes lit up almost instantly, her ambition burning fiercely.","\"As long as you sign with us, we'll help you deal with the part of the performance-based contract you need to bear. How about it?\"","This truly left her with no worries.","Pei Mingxuan immediately said, \"It would be my honor to join you. I'll sign.\"","From the other end of the phone came constant cries: \"Impossible, this is impossible... Pei Mingxuan, don't leave me, don't...\"","But Pei Mingxuan was eager to sign and couldn't be bothered with him anymore. \"If you keep harassing me, I'll release the recording I just made.\" After this threat, she hung up the phone.","Having chased away the annoying fly, Pei Mingxuan took the contract from the table. Although excited, she still carefully read through it.","Of course, before she could discover it herself, Gao Hao honestly said, \"There's a supplementary agreement regarding Miss Ji.\"","The supplement stated that Ji Fei had the right to freely choose her work.","Pei Mingxuan felt quite disappointed. After all, Ji Fei's performance in the two episodes of the show had made Pei Mingxuan very optimistic about her. She felt that with proper grooming, given Ji Fei's natural acting talent and innate physical attributes, her future potential was limitless.","However, no one had expected her to be the wife of the Qin Group's CEO. It was understandable for someone with such high-level connections to have requirements about their work.","Feeling that there were no issues, Pei Mingxuan promptly signed the contract.","When she lowered her head, she didn't see the evil smiles that appeared on Gao Hao and Qin Zhao's faces.","Hehehe, they finally tricked someone in.","As Pei Mingxuan enthusiastically prepared to dive into work handover, even staying up all night without needing to catch up on sleep, she gradually realized something was amiss.","She had indeed become the head of the studio, because Qin Zhao and Gao Hao were about to run off.","She did have control over the artists, but her only subordinate was Ji Fei, who planned to slack off at any moment and had special privileges.","The only consolation was that the studio was indeed backed by the Qin Group, provided that the relationship between this couple didn't run into problems.","After this round of setbacks, Gao Hao and Qin Zhao were treading carefully around Pei Mingxuan in the studio.","Finally, Pei Mingxuan made up her mind and approached Gao Hao and Qin Zhao in the office, saying, \"Before you leave, let's trick a few more people in.\"","Hearing that she had come around, Gao Hao immediately expressed his willingness to cooperate, \"Do you have any targets in mind?\"","Pei Mingxuan raised an eyebrow and said, \"Aren't there still a few episodes of 'My Acting, Cut!' left?\"","Gao Hao frowned and said, \"The remaining ones all have their own issues. They're tricky.\"","Pei Mingxuan smiled and said, \"Problems create talking points, and talking points generate traffic. I'm not afraid of their issues; I'm afraid they lack talent. I don't want useless people under me, nor do I want ungrateful ones. So, I need to evaluate them carefully.\"","Gao Hao looked at Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao shrugged and said, \"It's your decision.\"","Gao Hao reminded her, \"By the way, you can post on Weibo to announce your joining.\"","Pei Mingxuan immediately smiled and said, \"Oh? Has Sun Mo's side produced results?\" Originally, they had planned to use the buzz around those few controversial characters to find an opportunity to announce her becoming Ji Fei's manager.","Gao Hao's expression was complicated as he turned the computer screen around to show her the latest trending topics.","#Xu Meng's love-hate relationship with two ex-boyfriends, claims to have suffered the same malice#","#Yang Hong and Sun Mo admit to loving each other, originally asked Xu Meng for help in covering up, but unexpectedly got backstabbed#"]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: The Entertainment Judge, Future Sealed","paragraphs":["Looking at the trending topics on her phone, it seemed both sides were constantly slinging mud at each other, but neither had absolute proof. Ji Fei truly didn't understand this combination.","She hadn't expected the poll to come true.","Under Second Young Master Lin's exposé, Xu Meng's scandals were impossible to whitewash. She had completely fallen out with Sun Mo and Yang Hong, so she could only use the other two's forever unexplainable rumors to disguise herself as a victim.","Her latest Weibo post was frantic: \"I just had feelings for both of them and couldn't bear to let either go. I'm just a girl longing for happiness and afraid of being alone. But I never thought they were deceiving me from start to finish! Just to use me as their shield. I respect different orientations, but I don't want to be a beard wife.\"","This was her usual tactic, always managing to win back some self-proclaimed clear-sighted fans who understood conspiracy theories and continued to defend her.","Various ideological defenders would also blindly stand up for her.","But she probably didn't expect that in this situation, Yang Hong and Sun Mo would actually cooperate, finding a tricky angle to drag her down with them.","The two directly released a video to explain.","First, they honestly apologized for all the previous fabrications about Sister Pei, saying they were bewitched and did immoral things.","As for the relationship between the three, Yang Hong first realized his feelings for Sun Mo were more than just idol worship. He felt very painful, thinking Sun Mo still loved Xu Meng, so he broke up with Xu Meng, willing to let them be together.","Unexpectedly, during this process, Sun Mo also fell in love with Yang Hong, but was afraid of others' views, so he asked Xu Meng, who was close to both of them, to help cover it up. They knew this was a bit unfair to Xu Meng, so they promised to give her resources later, and Xu Meng agreed.","So they cooperated in acting out the appearance of a happy threesome, so that if they were caught being intimate in the future, it wouldn't be exposed. Xu Meng was the bridge between them.","They just didn't expect Xu Meng to be greedy and try to harm them to protect herself.","And those intimate interactions that were photographed were just for show to outsiders, otherwise the paparazzi wouldn't have caught Xu Meng sleeping alone in the downstairs guest room.","[They can even explain it like this? I'm impressed without even needing to lean on a wall. Such a forced explanation, surely no one will believe it, right? Oh crap, people are really taking sides? It must be paid posters, definitely paid posters!]","[And how did Sun Mo compromise? He almost got XX-ed and was so angry he beat the person into the hospital! Why? Why? This plot twist is truly incomprehensible.]","[What am I seeing? They're even shoulder to shoulder? Yang Hong is practically leaning on Sun Mo, and Sun Mo can actually endure it? Is Yang Hong really that powerful? Did he really turn Sun Mo gay?!]","[Sun Mo's expression even has a hint of tenderness, I can only say Sister Pei's strict selection, his acting, he's a professional.]","[Oh my god, Yang Hong is directly holding hands with Sun Mo, fingers intertwined, ahhhhh!]","\"Ahem.\" Ji Fei came back to her senses and turned to look at Qin Xian working at the desk beside her. \"What's wrong?\"","At this time, she and Qin Xian were both in Qin Xian's CEO office.","After all, as a workaholic CEO, he only took three days off before coming back to work.","The Qin family all acted very concerned. At first, Ji Fei thought that with various secretaries and assistants in the CEO's office, it surely wouldn't be inconvenient.","But the Qin family members kept mentioning various details, making Ji Fei feel that only being able to use the left hand was still very inconvenient. Coincidentally, her studio gave her time off, so she took on the role of Qin Xian's little follower.","Qin Xian was quite good, not getting up insanely early as before, trying hard to delay until 9 o'clock before leaving home.","But after Ji Fei arrived, she found that there weren't many places that needed her help.","So ninety percent of the day she was playing on her phone and reading gossip on the extra boss chair next to the desk.","However, Ji Fei was still very discreet, basically not disturbing Qin Xian, just laughing internally while maintaining a very quiet exterior.","Until this moment.","Ji Fei thought Qin Xian had some instructions, \"Thirsty? Should I ask the assistant to bring in water?\"","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei with a rather troubled expression.","Although he was used to it, he was still disturbed by Ji Fei's sudden internal outburst. On the surface, he could only go along with it and say, \"Mm. I need a cup of coffee to focus.\"","Ji Fei immediately made a call, and ordered a milk tea for herself as well.","Seeing him take a break, Ji Fei finally couldn't help sharing the gossip, then asked, \"How did you guess so accurately?\"","[You should know, I forwarded the poll to other Qin family members, only I hit the jackpot!]","Qin Xian's eyelid twitched. So the earlier commotion in the group chat was analyzing the poll? He had only glanced at it, saw they were still talking about gossip about those three, and didn't look further.","His whole family even played with this kind of poll?","Sure enough, they were all very idle, only he was busy working.","The overworked Qin Xian suddenly felt a hint of resentment at being exploited.","Seeing Ji Fei looking at him very curiously,","Qin Xian explained, \"It's nothing, just the principle of maximizing benefits. Sun Mo had already reached a dead end, the rumors could no longer be explained away, and he had other scandals entangling him. Rather than being an object of ridicule, the smartest move is to use the rumors in reverse. Entertainment circle news is always a mix of truth and falsehood that can't be distinguished. People only need to see a more explosive point, and they won't nitpick about previous matters, making it easier to fool them.\"","[So that's why there are those explanations full of loopholes, because they know the fans' focus will be shifted by other things they reveal.]","\"The only thing Sun Mo knows how to do is act. He wouldn't be willing to retreat to being an ordinary person with his arrogance, after all, he once almost brushed shoulders with a top actor. So the path left for him is to develop overseas, using this rumor to directly act in related types of films, which is actually a shortcut to blaze a new trail.\"","\"Modern society is much more tolerant, especially abroad where people are more open-minded. As long as he can endure the humiliation, it's not impossible to make a comeback. He just needs resources and connections.\"","\"And now, only Yang Hong can give him these. In the entertainment industry, many people can pretend to be straight for resources and fame, so naturally the reverse is also possible.\"","Ji Fei listened with her eyes wide and mouth agape.","Soon after, her phone showed the two announcing their temporary withdrawal from the domestic entertainment industry to develop abroad.","Ji Fei's mouth formed an O shape as she looked at Qin Xian admiringly.","\"You're too smart.\"","Faced with Ji Fei's sparkling eyes, Qin Xian felt slightly embarrassed. \"It's just... normal speculation.\"","[As expected, a shrewd businessman's mind is extraordinary.]","Qin Xian: ...","Can't you praise people properly?","But Ji Fei's attention had already shifted.","[Even knowing it's like this, Yang Hong is still being used... no, it was actually his initiative, so this is a battle between obsessive crazy Yang and enduring Mo.]","[Will we see crazy Yang take down dark Mo first, or dark Mo use up crazy Yang first?! Thinking about it... it's actually a bit exciting.]","Ji Fei smiled as she sipped her milk tea and surfed the internet.","Netizens were also shocked by those statements in all sorts of ways. They seemed to be fatigued, so the most common comment was \"Finally the male god duo has replaced the previous top actor duo as the biggest joke of the past half month.\"","In the end, Yang Hong and Sun Mo also announced their withdrawal from \"My Acting, Cut!\"","The same ending.","\"I can imagine the scene of the director and producer embracing and crying.\"","Qin Xian leaned over to take a look and said, \"Probably not. After their incident, this show likely already planned not to let them participate, after all they were just one step away from being officially named. The production team wouldn't want to keep blurring them out later.\"","Ji Fei was stunned, \"Then... we only have three pairs left? Don't they still have several episodes to record? How will they record this?\"","\"Maybe... find other people to fill in?\" On this point, Qin Xian didn't know either.","But the two soon found out, because many people were also concerned about how the remaining shows would be handled.","Urged on, the production team directly posted on Weibo stating that the remaining three pairs would engage in a round-robin tournament, with the next draw deciding the theme and competition opponents.","\"This... isn't it still not enough?\" Ji Fei was curious and couldn't help using her gossip system to check.","As a result, she almost spat out the milk tea in her mouth.","Qin Xian looked over strangely, only to see Ji Fei's mouth twitching.","[Heh, it turns out that after the incident with the male god group, the director and producer were going to terminate their contract and had already started contacting new groups to fill the vacancy. However, after reaching out to several groups with no response, they even contacted those artists who had previously tried to pull strings to participate, but were also rejected.]","Qin Xian: Huh? Why?","[What do you mean they're afraid of clashing with the top-tier group, worried this might be the last show they participate in, saying we're jinxed and hard-fated, so they need to avoid us. Damn! Why not admit you're guilty and afraid we might dig up some of your dirty laundry!]","Ji Fei was very displeased.","[Although currently, the two groups in the PK, each one of them is sending them a thousand miles away... uh...]","Qin Xian listened, feeling both angry and amused.","Who would have thought that the once most popular variety show, having reached its peak of popularity this season, would now be shunned by everyone.","[I guess right about now, the director and producer are probably crying their eyes out in the bathroom.]","Qin Xian: Probably...","While criticizing the show's production team, Ji Fei received a message from Gao Hao, asking her to repost a Weibo. It was only then that Ji Fei noticed Pei Mingxuan had mentioned her on Weibo, but she had been too busy following the drama to notice earlier.","Pei Mingxuan announced becoming her manager, and Ji Fei immediately reposted the Weibo.","Now that she was also an artist with millions of followers, the comment section immediately became lively.","Ji Fei waited a while and refreshed, originally thinking Qin Zhao's formulaic congratulations would have the highest number of likes at the top.","Surprisingly, Qin Zhao's reply was pushed to the second position.","The top comment was actually: \"Join my Fei clan, slaps forever endure, entertainment industry judge, career-ending seal. Come, let's follow Sister Fei and enjoy the drama!\"","Ji Fei: ?????????"]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Is the Internet Entertainment Judge Going to Be On Duty","paragraphs":["[\"Isn't this too ridiculous? You can eat melons carelessly, but you can't play with memes recklessly! They used to call me Palm Sister, then Bibi Sister, and now they've come up with something so bizarre...\"]","Ji Fei was truly worn out by these unscrupulous netizens and complained tearfully to her new manager, Sister Pei.","Sister Pei coldly and mercilessly rejected Ji Fei's complaints.","\"It's a great thing, this is spontaneous traffic. Others couldn't even dream of it, and it's positive for you too,\" Pei Mingxuan said while aiding and abetting by liking that reply.","An exasperated Ji Fei gulped down the remaining half cup of milk tea in one go.","Suddenly, a light chuckle came from beside her.","Ji Fei immediately glared over with wide eyes.","Qin Xian quickly pretended to be seriously looking at documents, as if he hadn't just been amused.","\"Hey!\"","Qin Xian coughed and said, \"Pei Mingxuan probably wants to shape your public image this way. This way, ordinary people won't dare to mess with you in the future, and they won't dare to offer you shady work.\"","Ji Fei was stunned, \"Ah? Is that so?\"","Qin Xian nodded and said, \"She also wants to use this meme about you to establish an implicit image of never falling from grace for the studio. In the future, artists who join your studio will spontaneously gain an extra measure of trust in people's hearts, making it easier to gain fans' favor and collaborators' peace of mind. So it's all benefit and no harm.\"","Ji Fei immediately pointed at herself, indicating that she had been harmed, as she didn't want to bear such a strange public image.","Qin Xian thought for a moment and then said, \"If you really don't want to, just tell Pei Mingxuan directly and let her handle it.\"","Ji Fei was stunned, \"Is that okay?\"","Qin Xian nodded seriously, \"No one can force you to do things you don't want to do. If she can't handle it well, I'll handle it.\"","Being suddenly answered so seriously by Qin Xian made Ji Fei have to seriously consider it.","Actually, if it wasn't happening to her, it would seem quite amusing.","After thinking about it, she decided to let it go. After all, she entered the entertainment industry not only to pass the time and gossip, but also to earn some money. Sister Pei was right, having traffic was a good thing.","However, as time passed, by the afternoon, the online trend gradually became strange. It seemed that if any artist dared to compete with their top-tier idols and survive unscathed, it would prove that they wouldn't fall from grace and were worth following.","Some fans were quite aggressive, directly demanding that their idols go head-to-head to prove themselves and clear up any negative rumors.","But those artists who really had scandals could only fool their fans, who would dare to respond at this time? They all became turtles hiding in their shells.","For a time, many amusing stories burst out.","Ji Fei laughed heartily all afternoon, and in the end, Qin Xian didn't dare to take her to his meeting, as she was too distracting.","\"Ah? You don't need me to go? Then I...\"","\"Help me organize the files on the computer,\" Qin Xian instructed before leaving.","Ji Fei nodded in agreement and stayed in the office.","Actually, throughout the day, Ji Fei mostly helped by opening some files, looking for contracts, typing on the computer, and replying to messages on Qin Xian's phone for him.","Because files, contracts, phones, and computers were all important things, especially after Secretary Jin's incident, Qin Xian didn't let anyone have the chance to access them.","Unexpectedly, after all the twists and turns, Ji Fei became the only one allowed to be close to these things.","[If Secretary Jin knew this in prison, he would probably spit blood.]","Ji Fei couldn't help but smile. After finishing organizing, she was about to leave when she suddenly saw an email notification pop up on the screen.","Ji Fei had previously helped Qin Xian handle emails, and seeing it was from an unfamiliar source, she directly opened it.","As soon as she opened it, Ji Fei was stunned.","\"Xian, I'm returning to the country in half a month. Can we meet?\"","Ji Fei blinked, immediately realizing that this should be the message from Yu Zhi, Qin Xian's first love.","She let go of the mouse and scratched her head, wishing she hadn't been so quick to open it, as it made things awkward.","Ji Fei couldn't help but stare at the email for a while longer.","Strange, shouldn't she be happy?","After all, because of so-called fate, she couldn't actively propose divorce, only Qin Xian could initiate a successful divorce.","So her plan all along was to behave well, wait for the first love to return, wait for them to start entangling, wait for Qin Xian to feel guilty towards her, and then she could get a huge divorce settlement, divorce, and be free and easy.","This was the exit script she had arranged for herself.","She should be happily preparing a countdown, right?","Emmm~ I understand!","The days had been too comfortable, she had taken the way of living in the Qin family as her comfort zone, so thinking about leaving the habits that had already formed still made her feel uncomfortable inside.","But it's okay, thinking about the future with more than 200 million in divorce settlement, plus various investments, and the path already paved in the entertainment industry, Ji Fei's expression instantly became as bright as a flower as she looked at the email.","[Dear, I'm just waiting for you~]","Ji Fei made a heart gesture at the email, then got up and left Qin Xian's office.","Anyway, Qin Xian's meeting would still take a long time, so she might as well go downstairs and sit for a while, she hadn't had enough milk tea earlier.","The place where the assistant bought her milk tea was the leisure bar inside the group company.","Since it wasn't afternoon tea time, there were very few people who could come here to sit and rest.","She had just gone to the front desk to order when the staff recognized her and respectfully told her she could sign the bill later.","Suddenly, a woman's voice came from behind.","\"Teacher Ji?\"","Ji Fei was stunned. It couldn't be someone from the company who would call her like this, it was usually people from the entertainment industry who would address her this way.","She turned around and saw unexpected people.","Not far away, in an elegant booth sat five glamorous women. They all had an imposing manner, adorned with jewels and pearls, sitting elegantly inside drinking tea. However, their gazes as they looked over were full of haughty appraisal, with a hint of contempt and condescension in their eyes.","The one who called her was the woman in the middle, Madam Zong.","She was the wife of Zong Chun, the old-school actor known for his loving husband image, who was a guest in the third group.","Apart from the first time when Ji Fei was introduced and greeted her, she had never formally communicated with her. After all, she was mainly there to keep an eye on her husband and Yu Rouyin, who had been ostracized by the circle of wealthy wives and was known as the Most Beautiful Noble Consort Yang.","Their two groups had never encountered each other, so naturally there was no other interaction.","Ji Fei thought it was a chance encounter, and since the other party had called her...","A hint of craftiness flashed in Ji Fei's eyes, and she politely went over to greet them.","Madam Zong didn't stand up, just nodded slightly, then introduced her to her old sisters, \"This is Ji Fei.\"","This was introducing her to the others, but the others also just nodded arrogantly, without any intention of introducing themselves.","Ji Fei wasn't angry at being looked down upon. Instead, she tried very hard to hold back her laughter.","Because she knew why these people had this attitude towards her.","They didn't know her identity, and probably always thought she was a little mistress kept by some senior executive of Qin Corporation.","Actually, Ji Fei and Qin Xian weren't exactly in a secret marriage, it's just that general business family enterprises don't like to expose their family privacy situations.","So even though Qin Zhao's fans wouldn't know that he was the third young master of Qin Corporation, his identity would still circulate within the industry.","As for Ji Fei's identity, it was still a mystery in the entertainment circle. They only knew she wasn't Qin Zhao's lover, and that she came from the upper class to play around.","Madam Zong knew Qin Zhao's identity. A newcomer that Qin Zhao would bring must have a significant connection to Qin Corporation, she just didn't expect her to be the CEO's wife. After all, whose CEO's wife would come to be a variety show celebrity?","Ji Fei thought she could leave after greeting them, but unexpectedly, after introducing her, Madam Zong said, \"Please sit.\"","\"Ah?\" Ji Fei was stunned, \"Wouldn't this disturb your gathering?\"","\"No, strictly speaking, we also came to find you. Since we've met you first, let's just say it directly. We have something to ask for your help,\" Madam Zong spoke directly and seriously. Her gaze seemed to leave no room for refusal.","Ji Fei became curious, \"What is it?\"","\"Aren't you the judge of the domestic entertainment industry? We hope that in your next PK, you'll help us collectively ostracize Yu Rouyin! We want this mistress to be ruined and disappear from the domestic entertainment industry.\""]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Life is really persecuted by dog me(Come to Dream API https://opus.gptuu.com)n","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's mouth twitched, already unable to comment on this \"entertainment industry judge\" point.","[I thought it was just netizens joking around, but I didn't expect this noble-looking Madam Zong to actually take it seriously. Doesn't she feel embarrassed saying that out loud? I'm so uncomfortable my scalp is tingling. This is truly absurd.]","Ji Fei was internally ranting, but her face remained expressionless. However, her inner monologue caused Qin's Mom and Qin Rong, who were about to enter, to stop in their tracks.","The two of them were currently the most idle people in the household. Curious about how Qin Xian and Ji Fei were getting along at the company, they decided to come and sneak a peek. But when they arrived, they heard that both were not in the office. With no other choice, they came here to rest for a bit.","Unexpectedly, they stumbled upon a juicy scene.","They exchanged glances, both fully equipped with fisherman's hats and sunglasses. With a bit more face covering, infiltration shouldn't be a problem.","Taking advantage of the ongoing conversation, the two snuck in, found a nearby booth to hide in, and sat down to secretly observe the drama.","\"Madam Zong, are you joking with me?\" Ji Fei asked with a forced laugh.","Madam Zong's eyes flashed sharply as she said, \"Of course not. You did so well with the first two groups, didn't you? I believe Teacher Ji is a person with a strong sense of justice who would surely eliminate those shameless, immoral people without hesitation.\"","In fact, Madam Zong thought that even if they hadn't come to find Ji Fei today, following the usual pattern of top-tier groups, whether for their own popularity or whatever reason, they would surely catch the vixen's mistakes and deliver a fatal blow on stage.","It's just that the vixen was too good at seducing people. Every time something happened, she would lay low for a while, but always found a way to come back.","So, this time they came seeking cooperation to eliminate the problem once and for all.","\"As long as Teacher Ji is willing to cooperate, we'll arrange everything,\" Madam Zong finished, her gaze fixed on Ji Fei, her aura imposing.","Ji Fei asked curiously, \"How do you plan to arrange it?\"","Madam Zong frowned slightly, apparently dissatisfied with Ji Fei's nonchalant attitude.","\"Although the PK is decided by drawing lots, with the pressure from us five working together, the director's team will obediently let your two groups face each other first.\"","\"I'll provide the theme. Let's set it as: 'Beauty'.\"","\"I'll hint to the scriptwriters working for my husband to write a script about a 'confidante beauty'. Then you just need to portray the so-called 'confidante beauty' as a shameless person who seduces other people's husbands. Don't use 'confidante beauty' to beautify these bitches. Show that those who destroy families should face karmic retribution.\"","\"We'll leak information online at that time, create buzz, and let her completely rot and stink!\"","Madam Zong's tone was filled with jealousy and hatred, as if she could no longer endure it. The others also had vicious looks on their faces.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong listened in surprise, unable to help whispering to each other. Such a grand scheme?","\"Could it be that because of this show, what the netizens were worried about has come true?\" Qin Rong said in shock. \"Weren't Madam Zong and Teacher Yu able to get along before? How did it suddenly...\"","Qin's Mom had been at the forefront of gossip recently, so she also knew a bit about the situation between Zong Chun and Yu Rouyin.","Because of the TV drama about Imperial Consort Yang, Zong Chun, who played Emperor Xuanzong of Tang, and Yu Rouyin, who played Imperial Consort Yang, had once been a hot topic of discussion among netizens.","Everyone was guessing whether Teacher Zong, known for his devoted husband image, would end up in rumors like other men who had worked with Yu Rouyin.","In fact, everything was fine until the end of the TV drama filming, with no suspicious scenes captured.","\"Judging by Madam Zong's sudden change in attitude, something must have happened,\" Qin's Mom frowned.","\"So... Teacher Yu really seduced Teacher Zong and was discovered by Madam Zong?\" Qin Rong asked in astonishment.","[Damn, that's harsh. Anyone who doesn't know the situation would think Teacher Yu really seduced your husband.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: Isn't that the case? Why else would Madam Zong suddenly blow up like this?","[Isn't it just that your husband wants to divorce you?]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: He actually wants to divorce her? No wonder...","[Have you forgotten that he has his current status because of you?]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong's eyes widened. So even a veteran actor rose to fame by relying on his wife, and now he's not grateful and wants a divorce?","[If you can't let go, you should blacklist your husband and make him come back obediently.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong almost burst out laughing, quickly suppressing it, but couldn't help wanting to give Ji Fei a thumbs up.","[Why do women always deal with other women first when encountering such situations, instead of dealing with the man? You should solve the problem at its root, sister!]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong couldn't help nodding, agreeing that Fei Fei was right!","After Ji Fei's internal rant, the other party continued speaking.","\"This should be simple for you, almost the same as the situation with the first group,\" Madam Zong said coldly.","Ji Fei, thinking that Madam Zong was pitiful in a way, raised an eyebrow and said, \"We knew all the truth about the first group's situation before we acted that way, but now... I don't know what happened at all. Madam Zong says Yu Rouyin is a mistress, do you have any evidence?\"","[Come on, sister, think about it. Do you have any evidence? You're going to deal with someone just like that? Don't be so presumptuous, okay?!]","\"Is Teacher Ji refusing us? Do you want to help that vixen?\" Madam Zong immediately said sternly.","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"After all, I can't plot against someone just because of what Madam Zong says, right?\"","[Joking aside, you want to use me as a weapon? Do I look like a weapon to you? Without any proof or evidence, just because netizens now call me the entertainment industry judge, it seems I don't need evidence, and I can ruin someone's life with just a little guidance. I won't casually bear such karma.]","Hearing this, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong became dissatisfied.","Their Fei Fei was not a weapon. These wives wanted to hide beautifully behind the scenes, but what if Yu Rouyin could prove her innocence and turn the tables? Wouldn't that ruin Fei Fei's reputation and destroy her name?","Ji Fei's request was reasonable, but it enraged Madam Zong.","\"She's just a bitch. She instigated my husband to divorce me. Isn't that enough? A woman with moral flaws, unsatisfied with her life, seducing men everywhere - keeping her in the entertainment industry is a disaster! What more evidence do you need?\"","Madam Zong looked at Ji Fei as if she were looking at an unreasonable person who favored the wicked.","As a pitiful original wife, shouldn't everyone stand on her side and help her beat the mistress?","Ji Fei was quite speechless. The words 'Did you hear her instigate him yourself?' were on the tip of her tongue, but she didn't say them out loud, feeling that if she did, it would surely cause a commotion.","After all, Madam Zong didn't know that Ji Fei could access all the gossip information.","[In fact, it's your husband who wants to have her. She, under pressure from the ongoing live broadcast and relying on his group for the PK, only said tactfully, 'I won't be a mistress,' because she knew your husband rose to fame because of you and thought he wouldn't dare to leave you. But your husband became obsessed, thinking he was being deep and romantic by wanting to divorce you and give her a proper status.]","Hearing this, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong finally understood some of it.","It's unclear whether Yu Rouyin was at fault in this matter, but the main fault definitely lay with the man. It was the man who couldn't control himself and betrayed his original wife.","Judging by Madam Zong's attitude, she wouldn't analyze right and wrong. As long as Zong Chun wanted to divorce her for Yu Rouyin, she would firmly believe that Yu Rouyin used tricks to break them up.","Yu Rouyin was the only villain, while her husband was pure and innocent, simply confused by seduction.","Seeing that Ji Fei wasn't very cooperative, the other wives couldn't sit still either.","\"Yu Rouyin is definitely a mistress, what's there to question?\" Finally, another wife couldn't help but speak up.","\"When she was acting with my husband, she always used the excuse of rehearsing lines to enter my husband's trailer.\"","\"When my husband was directing her, she actually sat on my husband's lap, asking him to explain the scene.\"","\"She was caught entering my husband's room in the middle of the night, claiming they were studying the script.\"","\"When my husband was filming with her, she deliberately rubbed against him, bewitching my husband so much that he would sneak out to find her every day!\"","Everyone was indignant, accusing Yu Rouyin from all sides, forming a perfect victims' alliance.","[Sure enough, they're the wives' group that blacklisted Yu Rouyin before, and now they've joined forces with Madam Zong. Let me see...]","Ji Fei took out her phone and started searching right in front of everyone.","Nothing could interfere with her steps in following the gossip.","\"What are you doing?\" The wives' group had just finished their outburst, staring dumbfounded at Ji Fei's dismissive attitude.","\"Oh, I hadn't paid attention before. I'm looking up what you were talking about,\" Ji Fei said with a beaming smile, instantly infuriating the wives' group.","They comforted each other, feeling that Ji Fei was arrogant. They thought that if they met the man behind Ji Fei later, they would definitely report her behavior!","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong, hearing this, couldn't help but take out their phones to search, as the group's outburst had shocked them too.","It seemed that the title of \"mistress\" was firmly attached to Yu Rouyin's name.","In the entertainment industry, it's always a mix of truth and lies. Yu Rouyin's true nature was hard to determine.","Ji Fei didn't interfere, only gossiped, because she never liked to meddle in others' affairs. Respecting others' fates had always been her principle, unless it was an absolute right or wrong situation like the previous two times, where she might do a good deed in passing to accumulate some karma.","So at this moment, Ji Fei's curiosity outweighed her desire to be a judge of the entertainment industry.","[Hmph, the one who went into the RV was because your husband forcibly demanded Yu Rouyin to go in and rehearse with him! He deliberately tried to pull her onto the bed, getting handsy.]","[The lap-sitting incident was your husband forcibly pulling her to sit. If she didn't, he would deliberately make her do retakes, causing the entire crew to blame her for wasting time. When she tried to leave, he forcibly hugged her and acted like a pervert.]","[The late-night script discussion was your husband making excuses to revise her script, asking her to discuss it at midnight. If they didn't sort it out, it would delay work! He deliberately got her drunk, pretended to be drunk himself to take advantage, and tore her clothes, which is why she was photographed coming out disheveled.]","[The deliberate physical contact, why don't you mention that your husband got lustful, turning a simple peck into a disgusting forced kiss, groping her all over, almost turning fake acting into reality, even getting aroused on the spot. After filming ended, he couldn't control himself and harassed her every day like an animal in heat.]","[Damn, the more I read, the angrier I get. I used to think Yu Rouyin was composed and flirtatious, but I never imagined she was living such a life behind the scenes. It's sexual harassment everywhere. The entertainment industry is truly dark and dirty, it's terrifying.]","[Now she's even facing these wives defending their men and blaming everything on the vixen outside. I truly feel sorry for Yu Rouyin.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were also furious as they listened. As they searched, they discovered that their husbands had rumors with women other than Yu Rouyin... Doesn't this indicate that the problem actually lies with their husbands?","What a life, persecuted by these scumbags!"]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: Nobod(Come to Dream API https://opus.gptuu.com)y can steal my show","paragraphs":["Ji Fei, Qin's Mom, and Qin Rong all sympathized with Rou Yin's situation.","However, seeing the attitudes towards Rou Yin online was truly confusing, and one could easily be brainwashed into sharing the same views as everyone else.","Men made lewd comments about her sexy figure and alluring face, with eight out of ten remarks being vulgar jokes. Yet they claimed it wasn't slander, but rather praise from men for Rou Yin, as if it was something she should be proud of.","They even argued with other women over Yu Rouyin, creating a battle between the sexes, but this kind of defense felt uncomfortable.","Women were divided into two camps. One group, like Madam Zong and her friends, mocked and despised her, as if they had personally witnessed her seducing men and behaving shamelessly. They worried their idols would be tainted by this \"dirty thing.\" The other group consisted of actual mistresses who envied Yu Rouyin's circumstances, saw her as a role model, and were called brainwashed fans with questionable values just like Yu Rouyin.","Only a very small number of people genuinely praised Yu Rouyin's beauty and acknowledged her professional acting skills.","In this situation of being infamous yet popular, even Ji Fei found it overwhelming. The online fans she once found cute and amusing now seemed terrifying.","[Indeed, those who can survive in the entertainment industry through infamy are truly tough.]","Ji Fei had no intention of prying too much into others' privacy, at most just enjoying some gossip.","She stopped reading at this point.","Looking up, she found the group of ladies still staring at her intently, waiting for an answer.","[Women should be more understanding of other women's predicaments. But some women often become accomplices to men in persecuting other women.]","\"Do you see clearly now? Do you know what kind of person she is?\"","Ji Fei quickly nodded, indicating she understood very clearly.","Madam Zong, thinking Ji Fei agreed, righteously declared, \"We must purge her and keep the entertainment industry clean!\"","Ji Fei thought for a moment and asked, \"Madam Zong, aren't you afraid this might implicate Mr. Zong? After all, we were previously... completely wiped out.\"","Madam Zong's expression immediately changed as she said, \"Of course not. I'll find a way to make my husband see through that bitch's true nature. She seduced my husband, but he will stay true to his principles!\"","Ji Fei couldn't help but smirk, \"A man who wants to divorce you for another woman has already changed his heart, hasn't he? Do you still want him?\"","Madam Zong frowned and said, \"What would a little girl like you know? My husband and I have a deep bond after years of marriage. I can't give up on him just because he's temporarily bewitched. I need to save him. You don't need to meddle in this matter; just do what we've asked you to do.\"","Ji Fei shrugged and grinned, \"I refuse.\"","\"What?\" Madam Zong probably hadn't expected that after all their talk, this so-called justice warrior and judge of the entertainment industry would refuse.","The other ladies immediately exploded.","\"Have you considered the consequences of refusing us?\"","\"Do you really think you're that important? Did you think we were actually begging you?\"","\"You ignorant little girl, don't you want a future in the entertainment industry?\"","\"Stop wasting words with her. Let's talk to the man behind her. She's just a kept woman after all.\"","Madam Zong also looked at Ji Fei fiercely and said, \"Your man is in the upper management of Qin Corporation, right? My cousin is a director at Qin Corporation. I was originally planning to talk directly to your man and have him tell you what to do. I didn't expect you to be so ungrateful. There are plenty of women like you in the industry. I don't mind finding a new kept woman for your man.\"","Ji Fei: ... Pfft! Hold it in, don't laugh.","In the distance, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were already bent over the table, their bodies shaking.","\"Oh, so you didn't approach Qin Zhao because you know his identity and that you can't order him around, so you came to me instead?\" Ji Fei said, suppressing her laughter.","The ladies' expressions became subtle for a moment.","One of them suddenly spoke up, \"Come to think of it, you and Qin Zhao seemed quite close on that show. If we were to collect some videos and photos to show your man...\"","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment.","[Hahahahaha... She's trying to intimidate me, using Qin Zhao to intimidate me, hahahahaha! Genius, absolute genius.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were also dumbfounded, and the table they were leaning on shook even more violently.","At this point, Madam Zong had already taken out her phone, seemingly about to make a call. \"The wise adapt to circumstances. If I contact my cousin, things will get complicated. Since we've met by chance, it must be fate. And it's for a good cause. Miss Ji shouldn't refuse us again, right?\"","Ji Fei pressed her lips together, looking troubled.","[What should I do? Such a classic scene of pretending to be weak and then turning the tables, I'm about to perform the face-slapping act, so exciting! How should I act? The waiter nearby knows my identity, should I have him come over and assist? Or should I just let her call her cousin, since all the directors know me anyway, and then shock them all? Ah, how should I start? This is so frustrating!]","Hearing Ji Fei's inner thoughts, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong also got excited. They wanted to come out and assist, revealing their identities directly. Perhaps these ladies still wouldn't believe it and end up offending them.","That way, they could play the roles of the tycoon's mother and sister, being arrogant and throwing their weight around... The thought was quite thrilling.","The three of them were preparing to flex their muscles from various angles.","But suddenly, someone pushed open the door and entered.","\"Little sister, why are you here?\"","\"Cousin! I came to find you.\" Madam Zong looked at the door in surprise, waved her hand, and then gave Ji Fei a cruel smile.","\"Looks like your luck has run out. I gave you a chance, but you didn't give face. Little girl, you need to learn your lesson the hard way.\"","\"Looking for me? Why are you scolding someone? Is she an employee of our company? Did she make a mistake and upset you?\"","Because Ji Fei hadn't turned around and only showed her back, the newcomer didn't recognize her.","Since the stage was set, Ji Fei was waiting for the perfect moment to make her entrance.","\"Indeed. Some young girls have questionable values. They think they're untouchable because they're currently being pampered, and they can't tell right from wrong. They have no respect for their elders. Cousin, please take a look and see whose girl this is, so we can ask them to take her back and teach her a lesson.\"","The director chuckled, immediately understanding the situation, and was about to step forward to ask whose mistress she was.","Qin's Mom and her sister got excited, thinking it was time to stand up and answer!","Ji Fei was elated, thinking it was time to stand up and shock everyone.","Just then, a cold voice, utterly lacking in creativity, came from the doorway, \"She's mine. Is there a problem?\"","Instantly, everyone looked towards the door. The person who had just finished a meeting entered a step behind the director.","The director was startled. Mr. Qin?","Wait, what's going on? Qin Xian doesn't have any mistress, only the one he's currently keeping by his side... Oh... This is bad.","The director stood frozen with a blank expression.","Madam Zong, due to her cousin being a director here, had naturally met Qin Xian a few times before. Qin Xian's face was unforgettable once seen.","For a moment, Madam Zong's brain seemed to short-circuit, not quite processing what Qin Xian had just said.","It wasn't until Qin Xian walked to their position and stood beside Ji Fei that it sank in.","Someone kept quietly asking Madam Zong, \"Who is this...\" After all, they had sensed from the atmosphere that something was off.","\"Mr. Qin, she... she's yours...\" Madam Zong's eyes darted back and forth.","Qin Xian placed one hand on Ji Fei's shoulder, as if embracing her, ignoring Madam Zong and instead lowering his head to speak to Ji Fei in a gentle tone, \"What happened?\"","Ji Fei looked up, her face full of dissatisfaction as she looked at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian: ?","[My show, my entrance, my act of pretending to be weak and then turning the tables... Qin Xian, how are you going to make it up to me... Wuwuwu. The satisfaction was interrupted, how is this any different from being stopped halfway through taking a dump!]","Qin Xian: Wait, we can talk about this, what kind of description is that!?","Suddenly, Ji Fei narrowed her eyes, abruptly turned her head and tightly hugged Qin Xian's waist, frantically rubbing against his firm abs that could be felt even through his shirt.","Qin Xian's body stiffened.","\"Wuwuwu, honey, I was scared. I just refused to help them do something, and they said they would find women for you to replace me. They even wanted to slander my relationship with Third Brother. Wuwuwu, I've been wronged!\"","Qin Xian: !","[No one can steal my show... Oh ho, abs~ This... wasn't intentional... Hehe, so firm, let me bury my face a bit longer.]","Qin Xian: ...","The group of ladies turned to stone."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Wanted to support her, but someone bowed for money in the end","paragraphs":["[Pfft, I ask you, isn't this awkward? Doesn't your face hurt?]","Ji Fei mocked inwardly while putting on a show outwardly.","Her feigned grievances and fake crying floated through the air, causing thunderbolts to strike the Ladies' Club and the Board Director.","Ladies' Club: She... she... she's not some bigshot's kept woman, but the legitimate wife of the Qin Corporation heir! What kind of proper wife leaves home instead of supporting her husband and raising children, only to become a variety show celebrity?!","Board Director: Introducing women, speculating about uncle-sister-in-law relationships... Cousin, when did I ever offend you that you'd want to harm me like this?!","Qin Xian knew Ji Fei was playing around, but he could only stiffly play along. He gently embraced her, and when he raised his eyes, his expression had turned ice-cold.","Although Ji Fei wouldn't be at a disadvantage, Qin Xian wouldn't allow anyone to offend his wife like this.","\"Everyone, my wife is young and has always disliked causing trouble. You come to Qin Corporation to bully my wife with such threats and provocations. Don't you think you owe us an explanation and my wife an apology?\"","Qin Xian's voice sounded cool and detached, yet it carried an aura that made people tremble with fear, crushing everyone with shame.","[Qin Xian delivered that line quite well. As expected of someone with tycoon potential. I'll give him a thumbs up.]","Qin Xian felt helpless. His originally serious mood was instantly disrupted by Ji Fei's inner voice.","[Their expressions are so colorful now, it's truly spectacular. They must be regretting their actions to the core. I bet they wish they could dig a hole and bury themselves in it.]","Ji Fei gleefully peeked at the few people, reveling in their misfortune.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong had missed their chance to perform earlier, and while they felt a bit disappointed initially, their attention had now completely shifted.","They watched the Ladies' Club like spectators at a good show. Serves them right for their arrogance and bullying!","Coming to our territory to bully our people, are you tired of your current life and want to challenge yourself with some excitement?","Although the Ladies' Club's status in the entertainment industry was unshakeable, they were now facing a true socialite from a wealthy family.","They had just been threatening this wife, and now just thinking about it made their scalps tingle. They wished they could turn back time.","It's worth noting that their husbands often need to secure investments to create a production. If they offended Qin Corporation, it wouldn't be the Ladies' Club blacklisting others, but their husbands being blacklisted instead.","Realizing they had offended someone they shouldn't have, the Ladies' Club panicked. They quickly stood up, forcibly making a 180-degree turn in their attitude.","\"Oh, so you're Mrs. Qin. Why didn't you say so earlier? We thought you were a newcomer in the industry, so we said a bit too much, thinking we could guide a junior.\"","\"It's all a misunderstanding, Mrs. Qin. We apologize to you. We really didn't mean anything by it earlier, it was just a joke.\"","The four ladies' faces were piled with awkward smiles as they apologized profusely and tried their best to placate the young girl they had just looked down upon. Compared to before, it was like watching a face-changing performance in Sichuan opera.","Moreover, the more they spoke, the smoother they became, as if pretending not to be embarrassed would make the embarrassing situation disappear.","[Although it's wise to know when to back down, I still prefer your imperious manner from before.]","Seeing that Ji Fei remained unmoved, the Ladies' Club suddenly remembered that they had gone shopping together earlier. They each took out their newly acquired latest jewelry and handbags, offering them to Ji Fei as a gesture of apology.","\"We've offended Mrs. Qin earlier. This is a small token of our sincerity. Please accept it.\"","Judging by their pained expressions and forced smiles, it was clear that these items were not only valuable but also quite rare.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong, watching from behind, were also very surprised. This was practically bleeding money. It seemed they were truly afraid of offending Qin Corporation.","Ji Fei immediately let go of Qin Xian's waist and looked at the pile of gifts in front of her.","[Suddenly, I find their ability to read the room quite appealing too. Hehe, who doesn't like unexpected windfalls? Being criticized a bit is nothing. One can't refuse money just for the sake of pride, right? All of this together... it's at least a few million. A small fortune, yoohoo!]","Qin Xian: ... He had wanted to stand up for her, but someone had readily bent over for money.","Ji Fei put on a hypocritical performance before finally accepting the gifts.","The four ladies watched as their gifts were accepted. Those were all their favorites, barely warmed in their hands before being given away. Their hearts ached terribly.","Earlier they had talked about teaching the little girl a lesson, but in the end, they were the ones who learned a lesson. This is what they call reaping what you sow.","What was even more infuriating was that Madam Zong hadn't made a move. Surely they couldn't be the only ones to compensate and apologize? The incident was started by Madam Zong, and it was Madam Zong who misunderstood Ji Fei's identity, causing them to offend her.","So the four of them frantically glanced at Madam Zong.","They had transitioned from the entertainment industry to the world of capital, so it was easy for them to put aside their pride. But Madam Zong was born into wealth, so it wasn't as easy for her to lower her face.","Not to mention that she had just faced a divorce crisis with her husband, making her prone to hysteria.","But under the frantic hinting from her cousin's eyes, she still took the initiative to offer an apology gift. She didn't care about the gift, but the words of apology burned her tongue.","Madam Zong, choking back her anger, said, \"Some of what I said earlier was indeed due to misunderstanding Miss Ji's identity, but it's also because Mr. Qin's wife is too disappointing.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the whole room was shocked. The Board Director was on the verge of tears, knowing his stubborn cousin had acted up again.","\"Cousin, shut up. You were the one who was rude to Mrs. Qin in the first place. Hurry up and apologize.\"","But Madam Zong gritted her teeth and said defiantly, \"I merely invited her to join forces in dealing with an evil person. I always thought Miss Ji was young but had good values, but I didn't expect her to be so confused at this moment, actually wanting to protect a mistress. I only spoke harshly because I was afraid she was going down the wrong path.\"","These words startled the Board Director, who immediately cast a speculative glance at Ji Fei. After all, the original Ji Fei did have a rather unsavory reputation, only recently becoming more well-behaved.","[It seems her husband wanting to divorce her for Yu Rouyin has really hit her hard. She's now desperate for everyone's sympathy and approval, wanting them to unite with her against Yu Rouyin. If anyone holds a different opinion, even if it's just not helping her, she has to force them to her side? Well, I have a rebellious nature, and you just can't bend me. How about that? Does it drive you crazy? Nyah nyah!]","Although she had accepted the apology gifts, the other party still refused to admit their mistake. She was just thinking about how to respond and counter when Qin Xian, who had been listening to Madam Zong's words and caught a few key pieces of information from Ji Fei's inner thoughts, roughly understood the situation and spoke up coldly.","\"Madam Zong, it seems you've arbitrarily placed expectations on Miss Ji, and then arbitrarily criticized her because her thoughts didn't align with yours. Isn't that a bit too presumptuous?\""]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Has the melon-eating reached your own head","paragraphs":["Madam Zong froze, her face instantly turning pale.","Qin Xian was unrelenting, his gaze sharp as he said, \"Teacher Ji can live her life however she chooses. Whether it's right or wrong is not for an outsider to judge.\"","At this, the Board Director's hair stood on end, as he could tell that Qin Xian was truly angry.","\"To casually accuse someone of defending a mistress - do you realize how much damage such a statement can do to Teacher Ji's reputation? It seems we'll need to have our lawyers have a serious talk with Madam Zong. I hope by then, Madam Zong will be able to provide concrete evidence to prove that Teacher Ji has indeed defended a mistress.\"","The final sentence nearly made Madam Zong lose her balance. The Board Director had to steady her.","This wasn't how she had imagined it would go. She thought that by mentioning Ji Fei's defense of a mistress, Mr. Qin would at least inquire about the situation and reprimand Ji Fei. She never expected Mr. Qin to react this way.","Moreover, the way the couple spoke was so similar - Ji Fei had also just asked her for evidence that Yu Rouyin was a mistress.","From a distance, \"Wow, it's the first time I've heard Second Brother say so much to put someone down,\" Qin Rong exclaimed in surprise.","Qin's Mom was stunned for a moment, but then couldn't help but smile.","\"What is it?\" Qin Rong looked at her mother in confusion.","Qin's Mom said, \"I just feel like your Second Brother has changed a bit. Fei Fei could have easily handled the situation and countered on her own. Usually, in these situations, your Second Brother wouldn't interfere. This time... he suddenly lost his cool.\"","Qin Rong thought for a moment and asked, \"Hasn't Second Brother always protected Second Sister-in-law?\"","Qin's Mom smiled and said no more. Qin Xian would protect his wife out of a sense of duty, but not like this. He had never reacted so quickly before, immediately countering and delivering a fatal blow, not giving the other party any chance to go after Ji Fei again.","That kind of protection came from the heart, a reflexive action that had nothing to do with duty.","Not just them, even the Special Assistant who was always by Mr. Qin's side was somewhat surprised.","After Mr. Qin had spoken so firmly, anyone who still dared to argue back would either be crazy or stupid.","Even though Madam Zong felt wronged and unwilling, she had to recognize the situation. In the end, the Board Director accompanied her in sincerely apologizing for their inappropriate words.","But Qin Xian still didn't give them a pleasant expression. He said directly, \"If there are any similar rumors spread in the future that affect Teacher Ji, we will pursue this to the end.\"","With that said, there was no need for further discussion. Qin Xian turned to Ji Fei and asked in a low voice, \"Shall we go?\"","Ji Fei was staring at him intently, her clear eyes reflecting Qin Xian's image.","Qin Xian was puzzled, then he heard Ji Fei's inner voice roaring.","[Damn, he got me! Those CEO lines were so smooth, he's kind of cool!]","The remnants of frost on Qin Xian's face instantly melted, his cheeks suddenly burning hot.","What had been a perfectly normal situation became embarrassing with Ji Fei's mental commentary.","As expected, when it came to ruining the mood, Ji Fei was a professional.","Qin Xian lightly patted Ji Fei's shoulder, and she finally stood up.","Qin Xian asked his Special Assistant to help carry the gifts of apology they had received. After all, it was Ji Fei's unexpected windfall, and they couldn't leave it behind.","They left behind the others who were still frozen in place, not daring to move after being intimidated by Qin Xian's aura.","As they neared the door, Qin Xian stopped and addressed a nearby private booth, \"Mom, Little Sister.\"","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong had thought Qin Xian hadn't noticed them.","The two awkwardly removed their sunglasses and greeted him.","Ji Fei, on the other hand, was quite surprised, clearly unaware that they had been there.","This revelation shocked the others even more. The Ladies' Club members had no idea when the CEO's mother and sister had arrived, but they must have come earlier than Qin Xian and definitely heard their unkind words about Ji Fei.","This was like being caught red-handed, which was even more unsettling than hearsay.","However, since they hadn't stood up to defend Ji Fei earlier, did that mean the relationship between mother-in-law, sister-in-law, and daughter-in-law wasn't good? Perhaps they wouldn't remember how the ladies had been unkind to Ji Fei...","Just as they were feeling uneasy, they saw Qin's Mom and Qin Rong leave their private booth and excitedly run forward. Qin Xian automatically made way, and Qin's Mom and Qin Rong intimately linked arms with Ji Fei, one on each side.","\"When did you arrive? Why didn't you call me?\"","\"We came just in time to see quite a show. We were very curious about who could have such influence to order our Fei Fei around.\"","\"Second Sister-in-law, Second Sister-in-law, we were about to make a grand entrance, but Second Brother interrupted us.\"","\"What? You were planning to steal the show too?\"","The three women chatted and laughed non-stop, while CEO Qin Xian obediently helped them open doors and led the way.","The people left in the lounge naturally had ashen faces, only praying that the gifts they had given were substantial enough to appease the other party.","The Board Director didn't give Madam Zong any face, directly sending her away.","The other four ladies left in embarrassment as well. When they reached the main entrance, they couldn't help but blame Madam Zong.","\"Enough, this was just an accident. Even if they want revenge, I'll take the brunt of it for you. What's the point of arguing now? Don't you want to boycott Yu Rouyin anymore?\"","\"Then what do you suggest? Your plan obviously won't work now, and we don't dare to provoke them again.\"","A fierce look flashed in Madam Zong's eyes. \"We don't need them. I can still make that vixen suffer the netizens' scorn.\"","Meanwhile, Pei Mingxuan, who had just taken over Ji Fei's related work, received an unexpected phone call. She raised an eyebrow in surprise.","\"Teacher Yu, are you asking for my help? You want to join our studio? The conditions you're offering... you'd be at a big disadvantage, you know.\"","On the other side, Ji Fei and the others returned to the CEO's Office together. It was almost time to get off work, so they just needed to wait for Qin Xian to finish up some work before they could go home together.","So the three women sat on the long sofa in the office, enthusiastically discussing the recent gossip while unwrapping the apology gifts.","Although the Qin family members were not short of money, they found an unexpected joy in this and were very excited.","Qin Xian went to his desk and sat down. As soon as he touched the mouse, the computer screen lit up.","His eyes swept over it, then fixed on it, before looking towards Ji Fei, who was holding jewelry and playing a guessing game about its price with Qin's Mom and Qin Rong.","\"Ji Fei, come here,\" Qin Xian said calmly.","Ji Fei thought he needed her help and bounced over happily.","\"What is it?\"","Qin Xian pointed at the screen.","Ji Fei turned her head, and her smile froze.","[Crap, I completely forgot about that.]","The corners of Qin Xian's mouth twitched, his eyes dimming slightly. \"Reply to it.\"","Ji Fei put on a completely confused expression. \"Huh?\"","[He wants me to reply? Reply to what? Doesn't he know this email is from his ex? He should, right? The time and address make it pretty obvious.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong, who were unwrapping gifts: !!!!!","What's going on? Ex? Email?","The Qin family truly didn't know much about Yu Zhi. They only knew that their son had been in a relationship during university, but Qin Xian had never brought this girlfriend home. They had rarely even heard her name from Qin Xian's mouth, and they had never seen him act strangely or lose his head over love. Her presence seemed about the same as his other university friends.","They had always been at ease about Qin Xian, so they hadn't paid much attention to his love life. By the time they heard about it again, the relationship had already ended. Qin Xian didn't seem upset at all, which left them with no way to comfort him. And so it ended in a blur.","Recently, they had heard it was because of something to do with Secretary Jin.","In any case, the other party should know that Qin Xian was married now, yet still sent him an email. And Ji Fei had seen it. This could potentially cause trouble in their marriage.","The little progress Qin Xian had squeezed out after injuring his hand couldn't be destroyed!","The two instantly froze, sneaking glances while straining their ears to listen.","Ji Fei felt that this scene had a bit of a dramatic confrontation feel to it. She wasn't sure how she should react.","Swallowing hard, she cautiously said, \"Okay, you tell me what to say, and I'll help you reply.\"","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei. \"It's not about helping me reply. You should reply yourself.\"","Ji Fei's pupils shook.","[The drama has landed on my own head? What kind of game is this? My CPU is about to burn out because of you. She's asking to meet you in half a month, how am I supposed to reply to that?!]","\"Reply... what?\"","But Qin Xian's gaze was intense as he said, \"Didn't you guess who sent the email? As my wife, don't you know what you should reply?\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: I'm Really Smart, Aren't I","paragraphs":["Thunder rolled in the sky.","[You want me to reply to your ex-girlfriend's email as your wife? Is that really okay?!!!!]","Ji Fei's brain was about to overheat.","Her mind was filled with questions about what Qin Xian meant.","She had originally opened the email by accident and intended to pretend she hadn't seen it, letting Qin Xian discover and handle it secretly.","But Qin Xian directly confronted her about it, and with an accusatory tone.","[Is he hinting that his first love is coming back and I should step down?]","Qin Xian's eyebrows twitched, and a wave of anger rose in his heart.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: !!!!","[No, he's asking how I should reply as his wife?]","Qin Xian: ...Calm down, you'd better think this through!","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong didn't dare to breathe, their emotions fluctuating wildly, their hearts pounding anxiously.","Qin's Mom: Fei Fei, as his wife, you should show the dignity of the rightful spouse and warn the other woman. A proper ex should be like the dead - there's no need to even show up at the grave.","Qin Rong: Sister-in-law! My brother asking you to reply means he's being open and honest with you. He won't have any lingering attachments to his ex. That's a huge sign of trust! Even though my brother didn't value you before, don't give up on him. Seize this chance to eliminate the threat! Tell the ex to get lost!","Unfortunately, Ji Fei couldn't hear Qin's Mom and Qin Rong's inner thoughts. The perpetually single Ji Fei's mind was still muddled, though there was a hint of excitement and curiosity in her heart.","Are they really going this far?","Seeing Ji Fei's eyes wide as saucers, Qin Xian softened. His tone became gentle and even a bit indulgent as he said, \"You can reply however you want.\"","Ji Fei's eyes flickered, her inner fantasies running wild like stampeding cattle, impossible to rein in.","[Really? Then I could reply normally: Okay, waiting for you.]","Qin Xian's expression froze.","[Or I could reply like a domineering CEO: You wanted to break up back then, so we broke up. Now you want to come back? What do you take me for!]","Qin Xian's expression cracked.","[There's also the tsundere option: If you don't love me, then don't say anything and don't come see me.]","Qin Xian felt like he was choking on blood.","[Or the coy option: I'm not divorced yet.]","Qin Xian put on a friendly smile.","[Or maybe...]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: Stop, stop, our hearts can't take it anymore, wuwuwu!!!!","\"Honey, have you thought it through?\" Qin Xian suddenly spoke up, interrupting Ji Fei's wild imagination.","Ji Fei shuddered at being called 'honey'. Although she often playfully called Qin Xian 'hubby' and he played along, he had almost never called her 'honey' face to face.","[W-w-why is he suddenly calling me honey? Did he take the wrong medicine? Is he shocked by his ex wanting to see him?]","Qin Xian: No, I'm shocked by you!","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: It's you, it's you, it's you!","Ji Fei looked at Qin Xian in disbelief, suddenly realizing that although he was smiling, his eyes were very strange. She couldn't read his expression, but her instincts were screaming: Danger, danger, danger!","Ji Fei's whole body broke out in goosebumps.","\"How about... how about I scold her?\"","Qin Xian's eyes flickered. He was about to speak when he heard Ji Fei backtrack: \"She didn't really make any unreasonable demands. It might be a bit much if I scold her. How about... we just pretend we didn't see it? Don't reply.\"","[That way I can't be wrong either way. A perfect, safe answer. I'm so smart!]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong deflated instantly, unsure if Ji Fei was afraid of angering Qin Xian, testing him, or if she truly didn't care about him anymore.","Qin Xian's deep black eyes quietly observed Ji Fei for a while, making her start to doubt herself. In the end, he just lowered his gaze and emotionlessly grunted an \"Mm.\"","Actually, he had his reasons for wanting Ji Fei to reply. Yu Zhi used to be a person with dignity and propriety. He didn't understand why she would contact him again. If his wife objected to his ex appearing, Yu Zhi should stop this inappropriate behavior and cease contacting him. This would solve the problem once and for all.","After all, in Qin Xian's view, if he replied himself, it would count as reconnecting with an ex. The other party might try to continue the conversation. In the past, he had been a man of few words, and Yu Zhi would constantly try to keep their conversations going.","Not to mention Ji Fei's string of silly inner thoughts just now had proven that no matter how he replied, it could lead to misunderstandings. Forget it, might as well go with Ji Fei's idea.","Ji Fei couldn't guess what he was thinking, only feeling that he seemed a bit unhappy.","At least she had given the decision back to Qin Xian. She wouldn't worry about it anymore.","Looking up, she saw the other two watching them gossip from the side. Ji Fei felt a bit awkward. As she walked over, she heard Qin Rong exclaim excitedly, \"Second sister-in-law, why aren't you replying? You should scold her back!\"","\"Huh? Do you know who it is? Why are you telling me to scold her?\"","If you only heard the conversation, it would definitely be vague.","Suddenly, Qin Rong panicked internally. Qin's Mom quickly said, \"Do we need to ask? Judging by your expressions, it must be related to those people from earlier. Of course you should scold them!\"","Qin Rong immediately gave her mom a mental thumbs up for her quick thinking.","Ji Fei laughed dryly, \"It's not them.\"","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong naturally didn't dare to discuss further, feeling it wasn't appropriate to stay and eavesdrop. They quickly made excuses to leave and give the couple some space.","\"I need to use the bathroom. Rong Rong, come with me.\"","\"Okay, okay.\"","The two of them scurried away.","Ji Fei inwardly complained while returning to the sofa to tidy up.","[If I had scolded her, that would have been really stupid. No matter what Qin Xian is thinking now, whether he has intentions or not, if I scold her and they end up getting back together later, I'd be in the wrong no matter what. I might even get my breakup fee reduced for offending his first love. As cautious as I am, I absolutely won't leave such a hidden danger. I won't play the villain for nothing and become a catalyst for their relationship.]","Qin Xian, who was about to delete the email: ...","Qin Xian gave Ji Fei a cold look, seeing her humming a little tune carelessly as she organized the valuable items she had just confiscated. He felt like he couldn't breathe.","He looked away, expressionless, and smoothly moved the mouse with his left hand to click reply.","Then he quickly typed with just his left hand on the keyboard.","Although he wasn't left-handed, he was actually equally dexterous with both hands. However, this was something he had... deliberately concealed.","\"This is Ji Fei, Mrs. Qin. My husband asked me to handle this email. Miss Yu, I don't want you to meet with my husband again. Please don't contact my husband anymore.\"","Send!","The corners of Qin Xian's mouth curled up, as if he had successfully played a prank. But when he looked up and saw Ji Fei, he still felt a bit guilty.","\"Let's go, we'll eat out today. What do you want to eat?\" Qin Xian secretly tried to make amends.","Then he took his family out for a big meal.","Meanwhile, Yu Zhi, who was overseas, saw the reply email. A hint of mockery flashed across her lips.","Her good friend, seeing it, felt indignant: \"What the hell, she really thinks she's Mrs. Qin? I heard she only married Qin Xian through underhanded means. Otherwise, they wouldn't still not have had a wedding by now, and none of Qin Xian's brothers ever mention her. With Qin Xian's personality, he probably just couldn't shake her off. But she dares to snoop through Qin Xian's emails? She's got some nerve.\"","She wouldn't believe that 'my husband asked me to handle it' nonsense. After all, Qin Xian was very particular about boundaries. Even Yu Zhi in the past would never have dared to check Qin Xian's emails or touch his phone without permission.","Yu Zhi smirked disdainfully, \"It's fine. A brainless woman like that is easy to deal with. Seeing how stupid she is, I feel relieved.\"","\"Then you should contact Qin Xian right away and expose her little trick.\"","But Yu Zhi confidently put away her phone. \"That won't do. I won't contact Qin Xian again. When I appear before Qin Xian next time, he'll know what injustice I've suffered.\"","Her friend thought about it and laughed too. \"You're right. Qin Xian will definitely be surprised that you've returned to the country without him knowing. Then when you show him this email, exposing that woman's ugly face for meddling in front of everyone, Qin Xian will surely despise her even more and feel sorry for you. You might become the new Mrs. Qin very soon.\"","Yu Zhi revealed a smile of having everything under control.","At that moment, Ji Fei sneezed heavily.","Qin Xian stepped forward and draped his coat over Ji Fei's shoulders. \"Cold?\"","Ji Fei rubbed her nose, \"No, someone must be talking about me behind my back. Could it be the Ladies' Club?\"","Qin Xian slightly furrowed his brow.","Just as they were pondering this, the phone rang.","Ji Fei picked up the phone and looked at it. It was Sister Pei calling."]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: She Wants to Join Our Studio","paragraphs":["\"What do you think about Yu Rouyin?\" Pei Mingxuan asked bluntly.","Ji Fei was taken aback. [Why are so many people asking me about Yu Rouyin today?]","In the restaurant, the originally lively dining atmosphere suddenly quieted down due to Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","Qin Xian was already quiet, while Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were eager for gossip.","Ji Fei expressed confusion, \"Have you heard about what happened to me today?\"","Pei Mingxuan was surprised, \"What?\"","So she hadn't heard.","Since it was related to the entertainment industry, Ji Fei decided to explain the situation to her new manager just to be safe.","She didn't mention anything she knew through the Gossip System, but she did express her general attitude, \"I think there must be a misunderstanding between them. After all, when I asked Madam Zong for evidence, she couldn't provide any and just kept cursing.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, she heard laughter erupting from the other end of the phone.","\"She actually... actually tried to threaten you to help... Hahaha, that Ladies' Club, still as arrogant as ever. They must have been terrified by your status. I wish I had been there, hahaha.\"","Well, it seemed Pei was also a gossip enthusiast. After laughing for a while, Pei Mingxuan became serious.","\"It looks like Madam Zong is going to target Yu Rouyin. No wonder she was in such a hurry to find me. Zong Chun must have expressed his desire to be with Yu Rouyin, and she knows she has no way out. So she wants to find a backer, which is why she chose us.\"","Ji Fei: \"Huh?\"","Pei Mingxuan explained directly: \"We had exchanged contact information before. Today she contacted me, expressing her desire to join our studio.\"","[What! She wants to join our studio?]","The Qin family members all looked over in surprise.","\"Her contract with her previous company is about to expire, so she either needs to renew or find a new agency. She originally wanted to use this show to prove her acting skills and find a new home for herself.\"","\"She probably hadn't considered us before, since everyone knows that Qin Zhao's studio only serves him. But then you came along, and they headhunted me, plus with that couple's aggressive behavior, she decided to take a gamble.\"","Pei Mingxuan stopped here, seemingly not wanting to say more, and said, \"I called you to ask for your opinion. But...\"","Ji Fei was a bit surprised and said, \"Sister Pei, didn't you have the right to decide on signing artists when you signed your contract? Why are you asking me?\"","Pei Mingxuan was truly amused by Ji Fei's lack of airs.","Gao Hao and Qin Zhao had actually hinted to her that Ji Fei would be the next boss of the studio. Even if she had decision-making power, she should still ask for the boss's opinion.","But this artist might not only slack off as an artist in the future, but probably find being a boss troublesome as well.","Pei Mingxuan explained, \"Since we'd be artists in the same studio, we naturally hope for a harmonious relationship. If you dislike her, I definitely won't sign her.\"","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"How could I? I'm not even familiar with her, how could I dislike her?\"","\"In this industry, at least 90% of female artists who aren't familiar with her dislike her.\"","This was something Ji Fei had learned from reading gossip.","Excluding those messy persona rumors, most female artists don't like Yu Rouyin when they see her and instinctively avoid her, not wanting to be associated with her.","There's no other reason, just her looks.","There are many types of beautiful women, and Yu Rouyin's beauty is the most troublesome kind.","It's the kind of beauty that men find seductive and women find aggressive. With eyes like silk and an inherently alluring nature, she's like a ripe fruit.","Without enough strength, background, or status.","Most men want to sleep with her rather than love her, and most women will first judge her with malice.","The most representative incident was on a show.","The same clothes worn by other female artists looked modest, but when worn by her with one button undone, a middle-aged male host blurted out without thinking: \"If Ms. Yu were standing next to me in this outfit, I'd be worried the police would come to arrest me.\"","The implication was clear to everyone present, so they all burst into laughter.","Yu Rouyin's expression was flawless. She feigned anger on the spot and made self-deprecating jokes to save face.","But the male host, as if possessed, immediately brought up a game of riding a fake horse, though it's unclear if this was intentionally set up by the production team.","When other female guests rode, they could at least say something about looking gallant, but when Yu Rouyin got on, as the fake horse started to bounce, various laughs and indescribable expressions emerged.","Yu Rouyin seemed not to notice and completed the game.","But she was sarcastically commented on by a female guest present: \"Oh my, we don't need to compete anymore, we've definitely lost to Ms. Yu.\"","Just from this one show, you can see the kind of malice Yu Rouyin typically faces.","Her videos are also heavily edited, and she definitely attracts the most hate in the Chinese entertainment industry. But with these also come heat and power.","As Ji Fei was thinking about this, she heard Pei Mingxuan say, \"However, since Madam Zong is determined to ruin her reputation, let's forget about it.\"","Actually, after Yu Rouyin contacted her, she had discussed it with Gao Hao, given Yu Rouyin's special circumstances.","Gao Hao actually didn't agree with signing her. Yu Rouyin had too much negative publicity and was a troublesome artist. Signing her might be more trouble than it's worth. Besides, you can't judge a book by its cover. He still hoped that the studio he left behind would be more stable.","Although Pei Mingxuan was interested in Yu Rouyin's acting skills and her ability to generate buzz through controversy, she was confident she could manage this artist well. It seemed like a good challenge, and Yu Rouyin had conceded on many conditions, which tempted Pei Mingxuan.","Knowing this woman's situation and understanding many inside stories, she was willing to lend a hand.","After all, she had also been helped by kind-hearted people to get through tough times. But with such a group of powerful people watching and wanting to destroy Yu Rouyin.","Pei Mingxuan had to weigh the pros and cons from a professional perspective. She couldn't lose rationality due to a bit of sympathy. After all, she was responsible for the studio and Ji Fei.","Pei Mingxuan was a bit disappointed inside and was about to end the call when she heard Ji Fei say, \"Yu Rouyin hasn't done anything wrong, why would her reputation be ruined?\"","Pei Mingxuan's heart skipped a beat as she recalled Ji Fei's previous actions. Her eyes lit up, \"How do you know she hasn't done anything wrong?\"","Ji Fei uncomfortably rubbed her nose, \"If she really was flitting between men, how could she have no way out and have to come to us, to you?\"","[Madam Zong has connections, but there are also quite a few powerful men who have been rumored to be involved with Yu Rouyin. If she was willing to seek help from those men, sell her beauty a bit, wouldn't she be able to find a good place?]","[Even if she came to us, according to the rumors about her outside, shouldn't she have approached Qin Zhao and Brother Gao first? Coming to Sister Pei, a strong woman, isn't it because she values Pei's focus on professionalism and potential?]","[So, she wants to rely on her abilities to secure her future.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong listened and immediately nodded, feeling that this made sense.","Pei Mingxuan smiled, \"You're not wrong to consider it from this angle. Her demands for compensation and such when signing with us are very low, but she has only one special request.\"","\"What is it?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","\"No sleeping around.\"","Ji Fei's expression immediately changed.","The quiet private room became even quieter upon hearing this, as if even breathing had become lighter.","It was as if they could see a woman toyed with by fate seeking every possible way to save herself."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Ask Me If I Can Be a Backer","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan didn't intentionally try to elicit sympathy for Yu Rouyin, but in this circle, she did know some inside information.","Yu Rouyin's situation was indeed pitiful, but in this industry, those who were even more unfortunate had already committed suicide. Yu Rouyin belonged to the type who was mentally strong and intelligent, so Pei Mingxuan was quite interested in taking her on, believing she would achieve something.","However, the agent was still cautious.","So she continued, \"Although this was her suggestion, it's hard to say what Yu Rouyin's current mindset is like, after all, she's been in this cesspool for ten years and was even blacklisted at one point. The external troubles are already difficult to handle, and if she herself turns out to be trouble...\"","Ji Fei came back to her senses and thought for a moment before saying, \"Isn't signing artists always like this? You only know if they're good or bad after you start working with them. Worst case scenario, we terminate the contract. I trust that Sister Pei won't let herself be taken advantage of in the contract.\"","Pei Mingxuan smiled, \"So, does this mean that Teacher Ji agrees with me signing her?\"","Ji Fei suddenly became confused. Why did Pei Mingxuan keep asking for her opinion? Didn't she say she would go along with Sister Pei's ideas? She didn't understand much about this field.","Suddenly, Qin Xian beside her beckoned her to come closer to whisper something.","Ji Fei held her phone and leaned in to listen. Qin Xian also leaned in, coming close to Ji Fei's ear, \"She wants to make sure that if she signs Yu Rouyin, you can be her backer.\"","The warm breath on Ji Fei's ear made it tickle, and she instinctively flinched, accidentally brushing against Qin Xian's cool lips.","Ji Fei didn't pay attention to what she had touched, but Qin Xian pressed his lips together, retreating uncomfortably, his Adam's apple bobbing.","Ji Fei, however, understood Qin Xian's hint. As expected of a shrewd businessman, his mind was indeed quick.","Ji Fei was quite exasperated. Pei Mingxuan had been beating around the bush with her, but it turned out she was worried that Yu Rouyin would attract too much negativity. Without a powerful backer, even if she was innocent, she would be torn apart by opponents, like this recent blacklisting plan by the Ladies' Club.","After all, in the entertainment industry, right and wrong weren't determined by fairness and justice, but by whose backing capital was stronger. With capital support, fairness and justice became righteous icing on the cake. Otherwise, there wouldn't be so many old cases in the entertainment industry that only come to light after the person involved loses power.","Pei Mingxuan knew Yu Rouyin was full of troubles. If she had Ji Fei, Mrs. Qin, as a backer, then naturally there would be no fear. Instead, it would be like borrowing the east wind – the more vicious the scandals, the higher Yu Rouyin would soar.","But if Ji Fei found it troublesome, then signing Yu Rouyin would be like holding a hot potato.","After all, Qin Zhao was about to become hands-off, so Pei Mingxuan had to be sure of this point, which was the key reason for her call tonight.","Originally, after hearing about the Ladies' Club incident, Pei Mingxuan felt it was too thorny and retreated from the idea of having Ji Fei as a backer, preparing to give up.","Unexpectedly, Ji Fei's attitude towards Yu Rouyin wasn't bad, so she probed again.","[Asking if I can be a backer? That's putting me in a difficult position, who knows...]","Qin Xian's brows immediately twitched, as if knowing Ji Fei would say something unpleasant, and quickly interrupted.","He said seriously, \"Remember, you are Mrs. Qin. You share everything with me. As long as you like, you can be anyone's backer.\"","Ji Fei was surprised that Qin Xian was so accommodating, but she couldn't help thinking, [What if we divorce in the future...]","Qin Xian: ...Could you be a bit more positive about our marriage?","Qin's Mom, Qin Rong, started coughing on the other side.","Qin's Mom quickly said, \"Don't worry, Fei Fei. If it's really a pitiful girl who happens to be known by our Qin family, it's fate. We can help if we can, we're willing to take the lead, just consider it charity.\"","With Qin's Mom's words as a safety net, Ji Fei finally answered Pei Mingxuan, \"Sister Pei, I have no problem with this.\"","Pei Mingxuan probably also heard the conversation on this side and guessed that the other party must be the wealthy Qin family. No wonder they had such a daughter-in-law; it seemed the whole family was kind-hearted.","\"Alright, I understand. Anyway, the time for her contract termination will probably be after the next PK. I'll carefully evaluate her before then.\"","After making her decision, Pei Mingxuan hung up the phone.","Out of curiosity, everyone searched for various information about Yu Rouyin on the way back.","As soon as the search results came up, there were all kinds of terms like \"mistress,\" \"lover,\" \"vixen,\" \"seducing so-and-so,\" making it a mess that gave people headaches to look at.","Everyone preferred to get the inside scoop from Ji Fei to avoid being misled, and Ji Fei didn't disappoint, as she was now genuinely curious.","[Damn it, this is too tragic.]","It was the first time the Qin family members consumed gossip with such heavy concern.","[This appearance is truly original sin.]","The atmosphere in the car was quiet, with everyone anxiously waiting.","[Yu Rouyin developed faster than girls her age from a young age, so she encountered harassment from little boys and ostracism from little girls early on. Fortunately, she still had a happy family, so her personality didn't have any defects.]","[The first terrifying incident happened when she was in sixth grade. A beast of a teacher forcibly embraced her with ill intentions. Luckily, she had always been a fighter, so she smashed the teacher's head and escaped. Her parents, in order to seek justice for her, made a fuss at the school. However, whether the school didn't want to create a scandal or was protecting the male teacher, they completely disbelieved Yu Rouyin's experience. They even said it was a child's fantasy, a lie to attract parents' attention, or revenge for the teacher not giving her high scores.]","[Because there was really no evidence, and Yu Rouyin's parents were honest people, in the end, they could only angrily help their daughter transfer schools.]","Qin's Mom, Qin Rong, was furious upon hearing this. Just then, Qin Rong found a piece of gossip.","It was a primary school teacher revealing that Yu Rouyin was precocious from a young age, loved using vulgar lies to gain benefits, and had even falsely accused him. In fact, she was trying to seduce him and had been promiscuous since childhood.","Qin Rong angrily showed it to everyone.","[Damn, such a scumbag beast can't be left unchecked!]","\"Ahem, there's no evidence for such claims, and every story has two sides. I think we can investigate a bit. If this teacher is the one with issues, who knows how many children he might harm,\" Qin's Mom quickly said.","[Qin's Mom's awareness is high! Very good!]","Qin Xian took a look and said, \"Understood, I'll arrange for someone to handle it.\"","However, as soon as he finished speaking, they heard Ji Fei make a surprised sound.","[It seems there's no need. This male teacher has already been dealt with.]","Everyone was surprised and peeked at Ji Fei, only to see her slightly frowning.","[She also remembered the scumbag teacher after seeing that rumor. Out of revenge, and also worried that more girls like her would suffer, she asked for help from... the sugar daddy she was forced to be with at the time. The sugar daddy couldn't be bothered with legal means and just treated it as someone who had offended Yu Rouyin, so he sent people to break all three of the teacher's legs, turning him into a cripple.]","The car was quiet for a moment.","[Then why didn't they find those three middle school boys and take revenge on them too? They should also have their three legs broken!]"]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: The Beauty's Life of Sorrow","paragraphs":["Qin's Mom and Qin Rong quickly searched to see if there were any rumors.","Sure enough, they found a so-called exposé from a middle school classmate.","\"Yu Rouyin liked to flirt with boys in middle school, hooking up with several at once. She wanted all the boys in school to revolve around her, she was so flirtatious. She bewitched them, but then didn't want to be with them, just playing with people. In the end, the angry boys took revenge on her, and it escalated to calling the police. She even wanted to sue them, causing the male classmates to transfer schools. She's just a troublemaker. None of us classmates liked her, we all knew what kind of person she was.\"","Meanwhile, Ji Fei's inner thoughts told a completely different story.","[Those three were little beasts too, sitting behind Yu Rouyin. Their puberty turned directly into a pervert phase. Unable to control their fantasies and impulses, they watched some dirty things and then looked at Yu Rouyin through colored glasses, misinterpreting all her actions. They constantly bragged and compared, one saying he felt Yu Rouyin liked him, another saying Yu Rouyin deliberately showed off in front of him to seduce him, and one even directly claimed he did this and that with Yu Rouyin in the woods. Some didn't believe and wanted proof, some were jealous and wanted to try too, so the three of them lured Yu Rouyin to the woods.]","[At first, they just questioned Yu Rouyin about who she was interested in. Yu Rouyin hadn't expected to encounter such a thing when she was already trying to keep a low profile. Angry, she scolded them harshly, but a man's face is the most intolerable to harm, regardless of age. Evil thoughts gushed out uncontrollably, rushing towards Yu Rouyin.]","[After all, it was a school. With the screams, people quickly came to stop the crime. The boys came to their senses and were also scared. Yu Rouyin's parents arrived, called the police, and pressed charges. The other parents made a scene, defending their children and frantically cursing Yu Rouyin, saying they could tell she wasn't decent just by looking at her, that it takes two to tango, and so on. The three boys also insisted that Yu Rouyin had seduced them first.]","[Due to the many witnesses and the extremely serious situation, Yu Rouyin received fair legal treatment. But because they were minors, the punishment wasn't severe, and they later transferred schools. Yu Rouyin also transferred schools again because of this.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were so angry they quickly pulled out this exposé and discussed it with Ji Fei, firmly stating they didn't believe it, pointing out logical errors, cursing those three little beasts, saying it was clearly their fault, and also cursing the person who posted it for deliberately distorting the facts.","As they were cursing, their hand slipped and scrolled to another exposé.","\"A male high school classmate once committed suicide for Yu Rouyin.\"","The three of them suddenly fell silent. Qin's Mom and Qin Rong quickly looked at it.","Ji Fei hurried to check.","[Sigh, misfortune always strikes the weakest point, and bad luck always finds the unfortunate. That appearance really is a curse, isn't it? No wonder she almost ruined her own looks in high school out of despair. Who could bear the blow of both parents dying?]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong's breath caught.","[Actually, it was really an undeserved disaster. In high school, Yu Rouyin hardly ever smiled, always keeping a stern face, not getting close to anyone, just to avoid misunderstandings. But she was still secretly loved by a boy.]","[The boy had domineering parents who forced him to study, causing so much pressure that he became a bit unstable. But his parents didn't pay attention to psychological issues, only searching his room when his grades dropped and finding various candid photos of Yu Rouyin he had hidden. They didn't believe their son would secretly photograph a girl, so they went to the school, dragged Yu Rouyin out, and questioned her about why she gave their son photos, seducing him and distracting him from his studies.]","[With the whole school watching, it naturally stimulated the boy. Finally unable to bear the pressure, he jumped off a building. But even after it was proven that Yu Rouyin didn't even know him, the boy's parents still frantically retaliated against Yu Rouyin, slandering her, saying it was all because of her looks, that she caused their son's death, and even wanted to sue her for compensation. They not only harassed her but also her parents, making their work life unstable. In the end, her parents suffered a mental breakdown and had an accident while driving, both dying and leaving behind only a severely injured grandmother.]","[After that, people who knew Yu Rouyin would sigh when they saw her, not because the child was pitiful, but... because beauty brings disaster.]","Hearing this, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong's eyes turned red. How could Yu Rouyin be made to pay such a huge price? This was even more tragic than the sad dramas they had watched. What kind of human tragedy was this?","\"This exposé is even more fake than the previous one. How is this the girl's fault at all?\" Qin's Mom said.","Qin Rong couldn't help but add, \"Exactly! This exposé is inaccurate. I suspect it was because his parents made such a big fuss that the child was driven to jump off the building.\"","Hearing this, Ji Fei quickly said, \"I think so too!\"","Taking a deep breath, Ji Fei continued reading.","[However... I think I've guessed why she entered the entertainment industry... Indeed, it was because of her grandmother's condition, which required a lot of money. Initially, she dropped out of school to work and earn money, but because of her looks, she was harassed everywhere. This made her realize that with her appearance, she would face malice wherever she went. Moreover, normal jobs couldn't support her grandmother's medical expenses. So she tried to use her looks... Is this why there are rumors that she worked as a hostess before entering the industry? Because she worked at a club?]","They didn't need to specifically check their phones for this, as this black material was everywhere.","[Her original personality was very tough, and it was there that she honed her ease in handling situations. The most important thing she learned from the sister who brought her in was how to please men for favors while protecting herself. After all, with such looks and bearing the heavy pressure of life, she had no choice. Until she met her current agency that scouted her and let her enter the entertainment industry.]","[In her view, the entertainment industry was at least safer than the club, but she didn't know that the agency had already thoroughly investigated her background and had a tight grip on her. When she was still naive about the world, they tricked her into signing a ten-year contract with an almost sky-high breach of contract fee. No matter how many jobs they made her take or what they made her do, her monthly salary was only enough to pay for her grandmother's medical care, with nothing left over for anything else.]","[And because of her looks, those men who said they loved her, even if they had power and influence, almost all just wanted to possess her, not save her. She never counted on men, only wanting to rely on herself.]","[Now that the contract is finally expiring, she's about to be free. The conditions she proposed to Sister Pei were merely a slight increase in salary and a breach of contract fee within her acceptable range, and not to sell her out. Because she knows she's constantly in trouble, has a lot of negative publicity, and signing her is a big gamble. But apart from working hard, she doesn't want to encounter anything else anymore.]","[She doesn't want her grandmother to worry about her situation before she dies, listening to everyone cursing her. Even if she tries to deceive her grandmother that it's all just haters deliberately slandering her, there will always come a day when she can't keep up the deception...]","[Wah, wah, wah, I should die, I should have told Sister Pei directly to sign her, sign her, definitely sign her!]","By this point, Ji Fei was already full of regret. When she first saw Yu Rouyin, she was completely thinking about watching the drama unfold, and also thought she was beautiful, sexy, and charming, a natural stunner. She admired her looks and loved watching some of the roles she played, but never imagined that behind this was such a bloody and tearful experience.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong had already lowered their heads, pretending to look at their phones, otherwise their tears would have fallen.","Qin Xian, on the other hand, didn't have as much empathy as them. After all, there are too many tragic people in the world, and girls in the entertainment industry with situations similar to Yu Rouyin's are really not uncommon. In previous eras, there were even many who entered to pay off family debts.","At least Yu Rouyin had found a relative balance of self-protection within it. Although she had countless scandals, she hadn't fallen to become a plaything of capital.","Because she was smart enough to know the hard truth about ability, and also knew how to use others' strength against them. This appearance and acting skills were the reason she could hold on until now without breaking down, and she had kept the only support in her heart, her grandmother.","Seeing Ji Fei's distressed look, Qin Xian was also helpless. Although he knew Ji Fei usually acted as if she didn't care and stayed out of other people's fates, not meddling in affairs, Qin Xian knew she was actually very soft-hearted.","Qin Xian patted her head and comforted her, \"She was very unlucky before, but meeting you all, her luck should start to turn around, right?\"","Ji Fei was taken aback for a moment. She noticed Qin Xian's eyes were deep and dark, yet they conveyed a certain determination that inexplicably made her feel confident about doing anything.","Ji Fei blinked and sent a message to Sister Pei, emphasizing her point of view. Although Sister Pei still expressed the need for careful consideration, she had actually started discussing with the scriptwriters. They planned to follow the style of domestic entertainment judges, paving a bright path for future new members.","Three days later, during the draw, it was indeed \"Beauty.\"","And sure enough, it was their two groups competing!","Online, people were already saying that this time, Yu Rouyin would definitely be the one to leave, even forming a scene of public appeal.","Only the director and producer, looking at the messages from the top-tier group, clutched their chests, unable to sleep through the night.","It was another damn confidential script!"]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Action Stops, There's Drama","paragraphs":["Madam Zong was still a bit uneasy about the confidential script. After all, Ji Fei had previously said, \"Aren't you afraid of total annihilation if you cast me?\" Not to mention that they had somewhat offended them before.","Madam Zong was worried that the top-tier group's script would target Zong Chun. So during today's final rehearsal, Madam Zong couldn't help but approach the Director and Producer to inquire.","\"Madam Zong, we really don't know. Even if we film behind-the-scenes footage of the rehearsal, we can only capture a small part,\" the Producer said helplessly.","The Director was even more impatient with Madam Zong. He wanted to produce a good show, so he was particularly resistant to those who used their privileges to interfere with the program's direction.","\"What does Madam Zong have to worry about? There's nothing wrong with your Zong teacher. Isn't the top-tier group the judge of the entertainment industry? How could they possibly harm Teacher Zong by mistake?\"","Madam Zong frowned and said, \"Of course there's nothing wrong with my old Zong, but who really knows what the purpose is behind the top-tier group always performing those targeted stage plays? Are there really such fools in the entertainment industry who dare to offend all the capital for the sake of justice? I'm afraid their purpose is to target everyone who competes with them. The previous two groups were just coincidences. In the future, they might deliberately smear even good people to maintain their public image.\"","These words left the Director and Producer at a loss for how to refute. Indeed, what the top-tier group was doing seemed quite dreamy. The entertainment industry is a place of fame and fortune; could they really be here to rectify the industry? Even thinking about it seemed absurd.","Madam Zong said, \"In case they deliberately target us, I'd like to be prepared to protect my old Zong. Could you two please loosen up a bit?\"","The Producer felt he couldn't reason with Madam Zong. \"We're really not hiding anything from you. We truly don't know.\"","Seeing no other option, Madam Zong could only say, \"Then about what I mentioned to you earlier...\"","The Director immediately said with displeasure, \"I said no means no. Unless it's part of their own stage play, how can we add someone else's performance video in the middle of a live variety show, especially one that deliberately smears others?\"","Although the top-tier group had done similar things before, it was part of their stage play composition. Madam Zong, on the other hand, had arranged for some people to perform something and wanted it to be broadcast right after the Imperial Consort Group.","Isn't this disrupting the show?","Their program doesn't interfere with the actors, but it also doesn't target them. It all depends on their own performance.","Madam Zong's expression changed slightly. \"What do you mean by smearing? That's the truth. We just had people act it out. Why can't it be added as a stage supplement?\"","The Director no longer wanted to deal with Madam Zong.","The Producer's expression also soured as he said, \"We've given you all the face we can, but interfering with the normal broadcast of the show is absolutely not allowed.\"","Seeing that her best method of dealing with Yu Rouyin had failed, Madam Zong became so angry and embarrassed that she spoke without thinking.","\"The two of you are protecting Yu Rouyin so much, could it be that you're also involved with her?\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the Director and Producer's expressions changed, looking at Madam Zong in shock.","At this moment, Madam Zong suddenly came to her senses, knowing it was absolutely impossible, so she awkwardly apologized and left.","As soon as she came out, she encountered several staff members who awkwardly hurried away. Madam Zong felt inexplicably angry. She turned her head and saw a young man walking over.","Zong Siqi looked worried and asked, \"Auntie, how did it go?\"","Madam Zong's expression improved a bit. \"Didn't I tell you to keep an eye on your uncle and that vixen?\"","Zong Siqi said, \"They're on a break from rehearsal, and that woman went out. Besides, it's useless for me to watch. They're using the rehearsal as a cover to exchange meaningful glances. That woman seems to want to turn her gaze into hooks. Huh, I think the script we gave her has allowed her to release her true nature. She's nothing but a slut who can't wait to jump into bed with my uncle.\"","The more Zong Siqi spoke, the redder Madam Zong's eyes became. If Yu Rouyin were standing in front of her, she would probably want to slap her immediately.","Seeing Madam Zong so angry, Zong Siqi sighed and said, \"Uncle owes everything he has now to you. Even my ability to enter the industry as an actor is thanks to you, Auntie. Back then, our family was so poor. It's all thanks to you that we have what we have today. Uncle is really confused, thinking he's above it all, but he's been bewitched by that vixen. He even dares to mention divorce to you. But don't worry, Auntie, our whole family is on your side. If Uncle dares to wrong you, we'd rather not acknowledge him.\"","Being acknowledged by her husband's relatives still made Madam Zong feel better inside. \"Don't worry, your uncle and I won't get divorced.\"","Zong Siqi's eyes flickered. Seeing that Madam Zong's mood had improved a bit, he quickly stepped forward and said flattering words.","Madam Zong looked at Zong Siqi with appreciation. She and Zong Chun had never had children, so they took very good care of Zong Chun's older brother's children. Otherwise, given Zong Siqi's age of nearly thirty, he wouldn't have had the opportunity to suddenly enter the entertainment industry.","\"Siqi, you're a good boy. You weren't seduced by that slut,\" Madam Zong sighed. It was as if she believed any man who stayed around Yu Rouyin would be seduced by her.","A flash of hatred crossed Zong Siqi's eyes. \"She tried to seduce me, but I was afraid of getting dirty.\"","Madam Zong loved hearing this. \"Isn't she just filthy?\"","The two of them talked as they walked back.","At this time, in the women's restroom.","Ji Fei's legs had gone numb. It was her fault for reading gossip news for too long. Just as she was about to get up, she heard several women come in outside, washing their hands while gossiping.","\"I told you last time, and you didn't believe me. Now you know, right?\"","Ji Fei immediately stopped moving. There's juicy gossip!","\"I'd heard of her reputation before, but I didn't expect it to be true. She really does seduce men wherever she goes.\"","\"People online are betting that she'll be judged by the top-tier group this time, but since she's already slept with the Director and Producer, the top-tier group might hit a wall this time.\"","Ji Fei: ... Fake gossip.","Ji Fei felt a bit upset. She quietly opened the door and peeked at the two women talking. They seemed to be the Director's assistants. They even dared to spread rumors about their own boss. Impressive.","\"Even the Director and Producer would find it hard to stop the top-tier group, right? The first two episodes caught everyone off guard. I saw the Director and Producer drowning their sorrows in alcohol.\"","Ji Fei: ... Well, that's a bit embarrassing.","\"Then doesn't that mean she slept with them for nothing?\" someone said gleefully.","\"It's best if it turns out that way. Women like her who disrupt the normal professional ecosystem deserve to suffer like this. It'll teach her that she can't get everything just by using her body. Shameless.\"","\"Wow, why do I feel like you particularly hate her?\"","\"I know why. It's because her boyfriend came to pick her up and saw Yu Rouyin. Now he compares her to Yu Rouyin every day.\"","\"She must have seduced my boyfriend somewhere too. Otherwise, with my boyfriend's straight-laced personality, he wouldn't have even noticed her.\"","Ji Fei almost laughed out loud. There really are so many jealous wives in this world.","\"Sigh, do you think she slept with the Director and Producer separately, or...\"","\"A threesome. I saw with my own eyes when the Director and Producer were in the break room, she went in alone and stayed for over an hour. When she came out, she had that kind of look.\"","\"What kind?\"","\"Use your imagination.\"","The women laughed together before leaving.","Ji Fei was about to open the door to leave when she heard another door opening.","Ji Fei paused and peeked through the crack to see who was coming out. Her eyes widened in surprise.","She saw Yu Rouyin with a face as dark as ink and slightly red eyes. She came to the mirror, suddenly slapped her face a few times, then practiced smiling at the mirror. After a few tries, she had once again put on that carefree, invincible, charming smile before turning to leave.","Ji Fei clicked her tongue a couple of times and raised an eyebrow.","As soon as she went out, she saw Xiao Tao coming to look for her.","\"Teacher Ji, Sister Pei asked me to come get you.\"","Ji Fei: ...","She thought she had been slacking off for too long and Sister Pei wanted her to go back and continue rehearsing. Unexpectedly, it turned out that the Director had called them over to discuss other procedures.","Ji Fei's eyes immediately lit up.","Meanwhile, on the other side, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong, who had arrived earlier, heard approaching thoughts.","[Hehe, is this so good? I was just feeling annoyed, and now they're giving me an opportunity? Don't blame me for bullying people. You know, there's a reason for the saying 'Misfortune comes from the mouth'!]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Although we don't know what happened, we inexplicably feel like we're about to get some juicy gossip."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: Under the Light, Can Filth Still Be Concealed","paragraphs":["Ji Fei was the last to arrive. As soon as she came, she scanned the room. Good, everyone was present.","Now only Pei Mingxuan was following the top-tier group. Gao Hao was mainly focused on handling Qin Zhao's overseas affairs.","Pei Mingxuan wasn't very familiar with the top-tier group yet. Seeing Ji Fei's excited expression, eager to get started, and how Qin Zhao and Qin Rong's expressions changed the moment Ji Fei appeared, their eyes practically gleaming, she felt somewhat confused.","What's going on with them? Didn't they all just say they didn't want to come? Why did she have a bad feeling about this?","Ji Fei looked at the few staff members behind the Director and Producer. At this moment, they were exchanging meaningful glances and smiles, then secretly peeking at the Director, Producer, and Yu Rouyin.","The Director and Producer, of course, couldn't see any of this.","Diagonally across, Yu Rouyin seemed not to have noticed those unfriendly glances. She still stood to the side with a smile, as if she hadn't heard those malicious rumors earlier. Only when her gaze turned towards their group did it change slightly, her eyes containing a different light, because Pei Mingxuan hadn't given her an answer yet.","No rejection meant there was still hope.","The veteran actor Zong Chun, though still maintaining the air of an approachable senior, kept casting affectionate glances at Yu Rouyin.","[Although age isn't an issue when it comes to love, for someone twenty years older to look at a person like that is a bit... Uncle, can't you see that Yu Rouyin is actually avoiding your gaze?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong couldn't help but look over. In the previous few episodes, Zong Chun wasn't so obvious, but now it felt like he had completely let loose. Was he planning to be unrestrained after his divorce?","However, Madam Zong was still clinging tightly to his side, as if trying to prevent Zong Chun from abandoning her to find Yu Rouyin.","Even his gaze, Madam Zong wanted to block, but she simply couldn't. However, soon a tall figure came to her aid.","Yu Rouyin noticed Zong Siqi standing close to her, and her expression changed almost imperceptibly.","Actually, Zong Siqi was considered their supporting actor. Usually in this situation, he wouldn't need to come over.","\"Who's that?\" Ji Fei asked curiously, seeing this person suddenly appear.","\"Probably a supporting actor, don't know him,\" Qin Zhao said.","Not knowing his name naturally meant they couldn't gossip about him. Ji Fei just felt he was standing too close and was a bit worried he might be a creep too.","Pei Mingxuan immediately answered, \"Zong Siqi, Zong Chun's eldest nephew, a newly entered actor, bit of a slacker. Madam Zong specifically arranged for him to come in, aiming to help her keep an eye on people.\"","Everyone immediately looked at Pei Mingxuan in surprise, as if shocked that she knew so much detail.","\"I'm a manager,\" Pei Mingxuan said displeased, as if everyone's surprise was an insult to her professional abilities.","Everyone immediately gave her a thumbs up, showing their approval.","[If that's the case, then it's not harassment but protection? Not interested then. Let me check how Madam Zong's plans are coming along?]","The Director started talking eloquently about the matter at hand. In the top-tier group, apart from Pei Mingxuan and Xiao Tao, everyone else was lost in their own world, gossiping. It was as if they hadn't come at all.","[It's so toxic, it's really too toxic. It's a good thing the directing team has professional ethics.]","[It's sinful, to think we gave them the inspiration. Is slandering someone like this not considered defamation?]","[Since your Ladies' Club is so willing to smear someone without evidence, then there's nothing for us to be concerned about if we act it out that way.]","Ji Fei's inner thoughts weren't detailed, which made Qin Zhao and Qin Rong very anxious.","What exactly is it? Don't leave us hanging! We're willing to be spoiled, the earlier we know, the earlier we can prepare. What if we can't handle it?","Just as they were internally screaming, they saw Ji Fei suddenly pause. At this moment, the Director had just finished speaking and said together with the Producer, \"That's about it then, wishing everyone good luck in the competition.\"","Just as everyone thought the meeting was about to end, Ji Fei suddenly stepped forward excitedly, \"I have a question I want to clarify, otherwise I'm afraid it might affect the fairness of the competition.\"","These words were clearly directed at the Director and Producer.","After all, they organized the show, so they were certainly responsible for ensuring its fairness.","Ji Fei's sudden statement made the Director and Producer feel a bit guilty. After all, the order and themes of the PK were actually somewhat rigged, but they felt this wouldn't really affect the fairness of the PK, so under the pressure of authority, they had compromised.","Did the top-tier group know about this and were very concerned about it?","Zong Chun and Yu Rouyin were actually unaware, so the only anxious person on that side was Madam Zong. But earlier, Madam Zong had clearly mentioned this to Ji Fei.","After the draw, Ji Fei and the others hadn't reacted, so Madam Zong thought they were turning a blind eye to it.","The Producer was panicking internally, but on the surface, he still smiled apologetically and said, \"The show is going to be broadcast live tomorrow. If you feel there's a problem, we can certainly discuss it.\"","The Director was also sweating profusely, constantly nodding and agreeing.","Ji Fei deliberately turned her head to look at Yu Rouyin.","Yu Rouyin was startled, and just as she was puzzled, she heard Ji Fei speak in a harsh tone, \"I heard that Teacher Yu slept with the Director and Producer for the sake of the PK. How can we trust the fairness of the competition like this?\"","With these words, Yu Rouyin's face lost all color.","She rarely lost her composure when faced with others' malicious words. Perhaps it was because Ji Fei and the others' previous behavior had made her feel they were people full of righteousness, and she had been harboring a kind of naive expectation.","But she didn't expect that three people could indeed create a tiger out of nothing. Such rumors had indeed spread, and she knew that generally in this situation, it was impossible to stop rumors. No one would believe her words. Apart from pretending to be deaf and dumb, nothing she did would be of any use.","She just didn't expect the top-tier group would misunderstand her too. It seemed her contract signing was out of the question now. She suddenly felt greatly discouraged.","She wanted to cry, but tears wouldn't come. She had long been used to such blows.","But this time was different, because it was said in public, equivalent to public humiliation.","She had experienced being slapped and having her hair pulled in public before, and then those men would carry away those crazed women, but they wouldn't leave a single word to prove her innocence. Everyone at the scene would just look at her, those gazes making her feel chilled to the bone. No matter what she said, no one would believe her.","And now it was almost the same scenario. The whole place fell silent, everyone looking at her, their gazes like knife edges.","She instinctively opened her mouth, wanting to defend herself, but felt as if her throat was being choked. In the end, she numbly gave up.","But the next second.","\"What!\" The Director exclaimed in shock.","The Producer's face also turned pale. \"Teacher Ji, you can't speak carelessly like that.\"","The two were clearly angry.","Others were either embarrassed, gossiping, or excited.","Yu Rouyin was stunned. She realized that this time there was indeed a different situation, because the Director and Producer truly had never had any inappropriate thoughts about her. Perhaps this time she could argue a bit.","Yu Rouyin looked up and found Ji Fei watching her. She was slightly taken aback, her throat tightened, and she quickly said, \"Teacher Ji has misunderstood. I don't have any improper relationship with the Director and Producer. Those are all rumors. I... I'm completely innocent...\"","After she finished speaking, there was no questioning or mockery. She looked up and found Ji Fei looking at her with a smile at the corner of her mouth, her gaze filled with delight. Yu Rouyin was dumbfounded.","Ji Fei turned her head and said in a confused manner, \"Ah? It's a rumor? But I clearly heard it from the Director's assistant.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, Ji Fei pointed at three girls behind the Director and Producer whose faces had suddenly turned pale, and said, \"They were just saying in the restroom that Teacher Yu had a threesome with the Director and Producer, and it lasted for an hour. They said they saw it with their own eyes. The purpose was to beat us!\"","Ji Fei ignored the sudden change in reactions of those present and shrugged, \"Hearing such words, I was certainly anxious, so I had to speak up to clarify. Since all parties involved are present, let's have a confrontation.\"","The Director and Producer turned back to look at those three people in disbelief.","The three were instantly exposed under everyone's gaze, their legs trembling.","[Under the light of truth, can filth and corruption still hide?]"]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: Even the paparazzi aren't as dedicated as she is","paragraphs":["Face-to-face accusations and exposures, disregarding any personal relationships or social niceties, not giving anyone a way out - in the adult world, encountering such a situation, wouldn't you find it awkward?","At any rate, Ji Fei wasn't embarrassed. After speaking, she adopted an attitude of \"do as you see fit.\"","Qin Zhao suppressed a smile, covering his mouth, while Qin Rong's eyes lit up with excitement.","Pei Mingxuan, however, wanted to facepalm. As a manager, she hated unexpected situations the most.","But... it seemed like an opportunity to create some buzz.","Yu Rouyin looked at Ji Fei in shock. So she had been in the bathroom too and heard those conversations, which was why she asked this question?","No one expected to encounter such drama today, to get such juicy gossip. Whether true or false, it was quite explosive.","The three girls' faces kept changing colors, clearly frightened out of their wits.","\"This is complete nonsense! What are you talking about?\" the Director angrily questioned.","The Producer also looked at the three with a cold expression. \"You've got some nerve, making up stories about us in our own show? Do you want to lose your jobs? Tell us, which of your eyes actually saw this?\"","Two of the girls were already completely panicked. Although they couldn't produce ivory from their mouths, they were genuinely just listeners in this matter. So they quickly pushed the girl in the middle forward.","She was the one who claimed to have seen it with her own eyes.","But at this moment, where would the girl have the courage to gossip recklessly? She could only speak vaguely: \"Teacher Ji must have misheard. How could our Director and Producer possibly have any improper relationship with Teacher Yu?\"","\"Are you suggesting that I, at such a young age, already have hearing problems? But you were speaking so loudly!\" Ji Fei said with a smile. \"You clearly knew there might be people in the bathroom, yet you deliberately spoke so loudly. Wasn't it because you wanted it to spread, for more people to hear? I heard it very clearly, so why aren't you admitting it now?\"","The girl's face turned extremely ugly, her eyes reddening. She looked at Ji Fei with a mixture of grievance and panic, as if Ji Fei was bullying her using her status.","\"I really didn't say anything...\" If she admitted it, she would be completely finished. She didn't understand why someone of Ji Fei's status would pick on a young girl like her. It felt like too much bullying.","[Laughing to death, how did she become the victim? I get it, she thinks that even if I heard it, I should have kept it to myself and secretly plotted against Yu Rouyin, right? That's why she spread rumors so recklessly?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Tsk tsk tsk, what a despicable person!","\"You clearly said you saw Teacher Yu go into the rest area where the Director and Producer were...\" Ji Fei asked amusedly.","The girl's face turned deathly pale. She quickly waved her hands and said, \"How is that possible? I've been by the Director's side the whole time. Teacher Yu has never met with the Director and Producer alone, so I couldn't possibly have said such things. Please, Teacher Ji, don't make things difficult for me.\"","When the girl said this, the expressions of the two girls beside her changed. But they had no choice but to go along with her words.","\"Teacher Ji, it's all our fault for chatting carelessly. We didn't explain clearly and caused you to misunderstand. We're really sorry.\"","\"Yes, we apologize to you. Our production team will definitely ensure the fairness of the competition.\"","Ji Fei knew they were trying to gloss over the matter.","\"So you're certain that Teacher Yu hasn't done anything to seduce the Director and Producer for the sake of the competition? You've always known that Teacher Yu's behavior is above board?\"","The three nodded in unison.","\"That's strange then,\" Ji Fei said with a smile as she took out her phone.","The three were already sweating profusely, and at this moment they were stunned. It couldn't be what they were thinking, could it?","Sure enough, Ji Fei pulled up a secretly recorded video.","It was the most explosive part of their conversation in the bathroom.","In an instant, the three girls' faces changed dramatically, their eyes wide with shock.","\"After all, to make an accusation, you need evidence, right?\" Ji Fei clicked her tongue twice.","No one expected Ji Fei to have a video. Was she even more dedicated than paparazzi, to think of preserving evidence at the first opportunity?","The crystal-clear dialogue reached everyone's ears, and a gasp of surprise swept through the crowd.","Not only had they really said it, but it wasn't even secondhand information. She claimed to have seen it with her own eyes, making her almost a firsthand witness.","The Director and Producer's expressions became even more ferocious. They couldn't imagine when this rumor had started circulating and for how long.","For a moment, they had thought it might really be a misunderstanding, after all, these three were their assistants and should know their affairs clearly. Plus, they had no grudge against Yu Rouyin, so there was no reason to spread rumors.","Who would have thought there were people in this world who would make up stories out of thin air?","\"You...\" the Producer thundered in anger.","At this point, chaos broke out among the three.","\"We don't know anything, we were just repeating what she said.\"","\"This has nothing to do with us.\"","The girl in the middle was now pale as a sheet, her whole body trembling. She had originally thought she could minimize the situation, but now found herself cornered. Finally unable to hold back, she burst into tears.","But as soon as she started crying, the Director roared, \"You have the nerve to cry? Why did you spread rumors about us? You said it yourself, you've been with us the whole time and never saw Teacher Yu approach us alone. How dare you tell such lies!\"","The girl's legs gave way and she collapsed to the ground. At this point, she finally stopped trying to deny it, given the irrefutable evidence.","\"I'm sorry, I didn't mean to, I really didn't mean to. I was just confused for a moment, I... I...\"","The Director and Producer were furious, but faced with a young woman, they couldn't very well resort to physical violence.","Although they had received an apology and the air had been cleared, they would need to appease the guests next, and then deal with these three in private later.","But why did it still feel so unsatisfying? There was a strange feeling of having been splashed with dirty water.","\"Don't apologize to us, you should be apologizing to Teacher Yu!\" the Producer said impatiently.","The girl was completely flustered by now, doing whatever she was told. She quickly got up and bowed to Yu Rouyin, saying, \"I'm sorry, Teacher Yu.\"","This action reminded people of some rumors. It was said that in the past, when people offended Yu Rouyin and apologized to her, she would always haughtily ignore them.","This gave people a bad impression. People generally don't think that not forgiving is a person's right; they tend to see it as being unrelenting even when in the right, or possibly not even being in the right, but just yielding to tyranny.","So Yu Rouyin gave the impression of being arrogant and abusing her beauty.","And now, hearing the apology, Yu Rouyin indeed didn't acknowledge it, and even showed a mocking smile at the corner of her mouth.","People felt the situation had become awkward again.","Yu Rouyin also realized that Ji Fei had deliberately spoken out directly to stop the rumors.","Ji Fei probably wanted to help her, and she was grateful, but... it was likely a wasted effort.","The rumor-mongers had admitted to spreading false information, but did it matter?","In the past, Yu Rouyin had never thought about confronting these issues. It wasn't out of weakness. Because even if she confronted them and revealed the so-called truth, it wouldn't make any difference.","Yu Rouyin's gaze swept across the onlookers.","In fact, those familiar with the Director and Producer felt this rumor was quite absurd and didn't believe it from the start, knowing the Director and Producer would never do such things. Even Madam Zong understood it was impossible, otherwise she wouldn't have backed down earlier.","But those unfamiliar with them were just watching for the drama.","As the drama reached this point, they exchanged glances, everything understood without words... When they left this place, they would have plenty to gossip about.","Everything was still the same, nothing had changed."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Is there a drama going on now","paragraphs":["Just then, Ji Fei spoke up again: \"You're not apologizing due to pressure, are you? Afraid of retaliation from the Director and Producer? You seemed so sincere in the video.\"","The onlookers were stunned. Ji Fei had voiced exactly what they were thinking.","In this kind of situation, when confronted directly, wouldn't they need to find a scapegoat?","Maybe the young girl was telling the truth after all.","Yu Rouyin suddenly felt a jolt, as if an arrow lodged in her chest had been partially removed. She looked at Ji Fei in astonishment.","The fog was lifting.","\"No, I was just... just talking nonsense. I really...\" The girl was completely bewildered, unsure whether she was supposed to admit or deny it.","What she didn't know was that once certain words are spoken, they're like water spilled from a cup - even if it evaporates, it can never truly be taken back.","At first, the Director and Producer thought Ji Fei's persistent questioning meant she genuinely suspected them of having a relationship with Yu Rouyin.","But as they scanned the crowd and saw the various expressions, they finally realized what was off.","Even if the person who spread the rumor admitted to it, people might not necessarily believe them! Plus, tonight's drama would be exaggerated as it spread.","The Director and Producer now really felt like punching someone.","Suddenly, they had a realization and glanced at Yu Rouyin. Could it be that her previous industry rumors were also like this...","At this moment, the Director and Producer finally overlooked the trouble and embarrassment Ji Fei had caused them, feeling grateful that this incident had come to light.","At least unlike other situations, the Director and Producer could completely prove their innocence.","The Producer couldn't be bothered to speak for himself, so he waved over an experienced cameraman: \"Old Zhang, can you tell us, is it possible for something like this to be true?\"","Old Zhang replied, quite exasperated: \"This is definitely false. New people probably don't know, but our Producer is the Director's brother-in-law! How could they possibly do such a thing together? Not only would they not do it together, but the Producer would also help keep other women away from the Director! That's why our Director hasn't had a single bit of gossip for so many years. The Director is henpecked! And the Producer is a sister complex. They're both super clingy...\"","Old Zhang got more excited as he spoke, but was hastily muffled by the panicked Director and Producer.","\"Enough, enough, that should be sufficient to prove our innocence and Yu Rouyin's, right?\"","The people present were shocked, embarrassed, and on the verge of laughter.","Ji Fei was already laughing internally.","[I wanted the Director and Producer to use their relationship to clarify that they absolutely couldn't have done what the rumor claimed, but I didn't expect so much to be revealed. That's not my fault.]","Pei Mingxuan and Qin Zhao knew about this, which is why these two people were able to put together such a grand program - they had such a powerful woman behind them.","It was Qin Rong's first time hearing this, and she couldn't help but break into a brilliant smile. This should be enough to prove Yu Rouyin's innocence, right?","Qin Rong looked over and saw Yu Rouyin staring blankly at Ji Fei. Her expression was no longer that mask-like charming smile, but rather a youthful bewilderment.","Like a prisoner who couldn't believe good fortune would fall upon them.","Ji Fei, seeing the expressions of those around her, knew she had achieved her goal and decided to wrap things up.","\"Well, if that's the case, then I believe it,\" she said, but couldn't resist twisting the knife: \"Then what you said about Yu Rouyin seducing your boyfriend...\"","The girl seemed to be stabbed again and lost her composure once more. \"I was wrong, I was really wrong. My boyfriend just glanced at Yu Rouyin from afar. It was all my imagination.\"","\"Oh my, how could you do that? Yu Rouyin is so innocent. You should go after your boyfriend, why bother Yu Rouyin? Tsk tsk tsk, why do women make things difficult for other women?\" Ji Fei sighed, then turned to Yu Rouyin with a smile: \"I should also apologize to Yu Rouyin. I almost misunderstood you earlier.\"","Yu Rouyin came to her senses, \"No, I should be thanking you, Ji Fei. Really, thank you.\"","Yu Rouyin's tone was notably different, causing those familiar with her to look at her. She couldn't control her excitement, but her expression remained professionally controlled, showing her most beautiful smile, only her eyes now sparkled with starlight.","She thought, if Ji Fei was willing to help her, did that mean their studio was interested in signing her?","\"It's good that everything was said out loud. Things can't be clarified without discussion. When everything is laid out in the open, there won't be any misunderstandings,\" Ji Fei smiled, sweeping her gaze towards Madam Zong. \"For Yu Rouyin, it was an undeserved calamity, being passively dragged into this dispute. Anyway, in the end, truth can't be made false, and falsehood can't become truth.\"","Ji Fei's group caught her meaning.","Ji Fei was using this incident to give Madam Zong one last warning. Letting her see with her own eyes how a piece of negative news could be attached to Yu Rouyin.","They all heard it, and presumably, so did Madam Zong. Hopefully, she would pull back from the brink. Don't use rumors to vent anger on an innocent person.","But as the matter concluded, watching her husband rush to console Yu Rouyin, Madam Zong's eyes still burned with hatred.","However, she didn't expect Yu Rouyin to actively approach her.","Previously, Yu Rouyin had been avoiding Madam Zong. She knew about the Ladies' Club's plan to collectively target her and sabotage her upcoming performance. But this was her most important gamble as she was about to terminate her contract, betting on her growing passion for performing and her grandmother's future medical expenses. She didn't want to encounter any unexpected issues.","\"Madam Zong, I think there might be a misunderstanding between us. Whatever questions you have, I'm willing to explain clearly,\" Yu Rouyin said sincerely.","Although she had done this many times in her first three years after debut, each time she was met with abuse and slaps. So she stopped subjecting herself to humiliation, letting others think what they wanted. After all, what she encountered would never change.","But today, she wanted to argue her case once more.","However, when she looked up, she was still met with a pair of resentful eyes. \"Misunderstanding?\"","Yu Rouyin's face fell. \"I've never seduced Mr. Zong, nor have I ever intended to destroy your marriage. I clearly rejected Mr. Zong. If you don't believe me, I'm willing to confront this issue with both of you together.\"","But Madam Zong laughed grotesquely. Confront? Did she want her to listen to her husband talk about divorcing her and marrying this mistress in front of her?","Seeing her disbelief, Yu Rouyin continued: \"I can swear that after this performance, I will never work with Mr. Zong again. Will that make Madam Zong believe that I haven't seduced Mr. Zong?\"","\"You want me to believe you haven't seduced him?\" Madam Zong couldn't hear a word, trembling with anger: \"You're really good at lying through your teeth! If you hadn't seduced him, if he hadn't given you benefits, would he come to accompany you for this show? Aren't you just trying to use this show to prove your abilities and step on him to climb higher?\"","\"The company signed me up for the show. I haven't contacted Mr. Zong since finishing the TV drama,\" Yu Rouyin said through gritted teeth. \"You can check all the chat records.\"","\"Then you shouldn't have come to participate! Your participation is a hint to him!\"","Yu Rouyin's eyes reddened. Although she wasn't clear why the company gave her this opportunity, once she realized it was the best path for her future, why should she give it up just to avoid suspicion? Her life didn't have the luxury of choices.","\"It's clearly a conflict between you two, why should I suffer the loss? I...\" Yu Rouyin stopped, knowing it was useless to say this.","\"I can swear on my grandmother's health that I've never given Mr. Zong any hints,\" Yu Rouyin was on the verge of tears, not expecting that after so long, defending herself would still be so hurtful and make her want to cry.","\"Huh, you're so filial, aren't you? I bet you've cursed your grandmother to death several times already.\"","Yu Rouyin's face changed instantly. \"You can insult me, but you can't talk about my grandmother!\"","Perhaps it was Yu Rouyin's fierce tone that momentarily stunned Madam Zong.","But soon, Madam Zong spoke again: \"I know why you came to find me. But you can forget about it. You've destroyed my marriage, I won't let you off!\"","With that, Madam Zong turned and left.","Only Yu Rouyin remained, her face pale. She really didn't know what to say to make others believe her.","That night...","Pei Mingxuan had already edited today's story to incorporate various insider leaks, which was the first step in clearing Yu Rouyin's name.","Since the PK livestream was tomorrow, this kind of post immediately gained a lot of attention when published.","Ji Fei also came across it while browsing at home, but scrolling up and down, apart from this one post, all the attention had already shifted to Yu Rouyin's negative news.","Various old scandals were constantly being summarized and renewed, with visible traces of manipulation. It was estimated that this would intensify starting tomorrow.","This couldn't have been solely the work of the Ladies' Club, as there were many leaked memories about Yu Rouyin's past student days. It seemed like all sorts of attention-seekers had come out, wanting to take advantage of this opportunity to kick her while she's down.","Up until an hour before the livestream began on the second day, everyone was preparing in the makeup room.","Ji Fei had already seen several negative trending topics about Yu Rouyin on the hot search list.","The top one was #OfficialsPleaseCleanUpTheIndustry,YuRouyinGetOutOfEntertainment!#","Ji Fei looked over and saw Yu Rouyin calmly looking at her phone.","Zong Chun and Zong Siqi both looked preoccupied. Madam Zong... where was she?","Ji Fei was curious that Madam Zong hadn't come along. Just as she was about to indulge in some gossip, she heard the Director's team reminding everyone that they would be on stage soon.","At this moment, Zong Chun suddenly stood up, walked to Yu Rouyin's side and said, \"Rouyin, I have something to discuss with you. Let's go outside to talk.\"","Yu Rouyin was startled and followed him out with a puzzled expression.","As soon as they entered an empty room, Zong Chun took out a ring box and said, \"Rouyin, marry me.\"","Ji Fei, who was secretly eavesdropping in the makeup room: [... Holy crap!!!!]","The Qin family members who were about to go to the audience seats to wait for the show to start: ????","There's gossip at a time like this?!"]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Usually looking so righteous, never expected to be so wild","paragraphs":["To get the juiciest gossip firsthand, the Qin family lingered backstage, reluctant to leave.","[Zong Chun gave Madam Zong divorce papers and officially proposed a divorce. Madam Zong was so upset she was hospitalized, which is why she didn't come chasing after him tonight. Zong Chun, isn't this too absurd? Your wife is still in the hospital, and you're proposing to someone else? You usually act so righteous, who knew you could be so fickle?]","The Qin family: This is outrageous!","[What a mess! It turns out that yesterday, Yu Rouyin mustered up the courage to explain the situation to Madam Zong. Although Madam Zong didn't seem to believe her on the surface, she had a moment of doubt when she got home. But as soon as she arrived, she saw the divorce papers, and after a few words, the innocent Yu Rouyin was dragged back into the conflict.]","[Old Zong, Yu Rouyin must have committed some serious sins in her past life to have met you!]","Ji Fei's mouth twitched in disbelief.","The Qin family was left speechless. Indeed, this wasn't about forming a new relationship, it was more like creating a new enemy.","[Ah! So the reason for the early proposal was because Zong Chun was provoked by something Madam Zong said...]","The Qin family: How was he provoked?","[Haha, it turns out Madam Zong also realized that Yu Rouyin doesn't love Zong Chun at all, but Zong Chun doesn't believe it. He thinks she must have feelings for him, saying you can see it in her eyes when she's acting... Don't be ridiculous, old man!]","Qin Zhao: ...She's an actress, for crying out loud. What's wrong with her acting like she likes you when she's performing?","[Zong Chun truly believes that Yu Rouyin, a girl in her twenties, is infatuated with him, a cultured, well-maintained, capable, dignified, and refined man in his forties. Because she would actively approach him and ask about acting, with a very sincere look in her eyes, unlike how she treats other men, Zong Chun believes Yu Rouyin isn't just stringing him along, but genuinely likes him!]","[...I can speak to this. I've seen Yu Rouyin be just as sincere with other professional teachers who don't covet her beauty. When she has questions, she actively approaches them. Is it possible that you disguised yourself too well at first, making Teacher Yu mistake you for some sort of upright gentleman?]","Qin's Father: So he's been full of himself all this time... How does a junior colleague asking for advice on their scenes together equate to her being in love with you? If I thought like that, how many admirers would I have had before I retired?","[He's just secretly coveting her beauty and won't admit it! Even so, Zong Chun still says it's not that he's changed his heart, but that he and Madam Zong have been emotionally distant for years. He claims their lack of intimacy is proof, because Madam Zong no longer arouses his interest as a man.]","Qin's Mom: ...This statement is the greatest insult to a long-married couple. Is it possible that you're the one who can't perform?","[He says Yu Rouyin's appearance has filled his heart, making him feel love and a vibrant life again. Now that he's fallen in love, he's willing to do anything to give Yu Rouyin what she wants. He's ready to face all the criticism from society, just to be with the woman he loves.]","Qin Yan: Good heavens! Have you even asked Yu Rouyin what she wants?","[No wonder Madam Zong is furious, but no matter how angry she is, she shouldn't insult Yu Rouyin like that! She should be cursing her husband.]","The Qin family: Exactly! You're scolding the wrong person, ma'am!","[What a vicious cycle this is. The more viciously Madam Zong scolds, the more Zong Chun defends Yu Rouyin and turns around to scold Madam Zong. This makes Madam Zong hate Yu Rouyin even more. The hatred is escalating. Please, can you two not drag others into your twisted game?]","The Qin family: Ugh, disgusting! How distasteful!","[Because in the end, Madam Zong told Zong Chun about what Yu Rouyin said when she came to clear things up. She emphasized that Yu Rouyin was just using Zong Chun's fame and status to achieve her goals, acting one way in front of her and another way in front of him. Once she gets what she wants, she'll ditch him, just like with her previous rumors. There's no way she'd actually marry him.]","[Although Zong Chun stubbornly said he'd be willing even if he was being used, because his love for Yu Rouyin is real, unlike other men who just want her body. But that blindly confident facade has started to crack, which is why he's in such a rush to propose now.]","The Qin family: Hah, just wait to be rejected, you old fool!","[Oh ho, she rejected him.]","The Qin family: Satisfying!","[Well, it's not so easy to discourage an old man's passion. Now he's making some deep, heartfelt promise?]","The Qin family: What kind of promise?","[\"No matter what your past was like, I don't mind and I won't hold it against you. In the future, I will protect you. I know you must have wanted a stable home for a long time. If you marry me, you can leave the cesspool of the entertainment industry and be content as a good wife and mother. You're only in your twenties, still just a young girl. I'm willing to redeem you. I won't let other men drag you into the abyss. I know about those things from your past, and I understand that deep down, you were unwilling. I understand your struggles. If you follow me, you'll have a clean and pure future.\"]","The Qin family: ...","[Why does this sound so off? It feels weird somewhere... Wait, isn't this a dialogue we cut during rehearsals? It's similar to what a man says when trying to persuade a courtesan to reform. That scene was about a man who thinks he's selflessly saving a fallen woman, but is actually just enjoying the feeling of being superior and changing someone else's fate.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong both remembered that scene. The ending was that the man was essentially just lusting after the girl's beauty and the worshipful look in her eyes when she felt \"saved.\" Once he actually rescued her and married her, after he got bored, he started to resent and despise the girl's past.","As they thought about it, their expressions became utterly indescribable.","\"What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell? Why do you look like that? You're about to go on stage, don't you dare have any issues now!\" Pei Mingxuan suddenly noticed Ji Fei's strange expression, and Qin Zhao looked a bit odd too. She didn't pay much attention to the Qin family, otherwise she would have thought the whole family was acting weird.","[Should we tell Sister Pei about the proposal, just in case?]","Ji Fei thought for a moment, then spoke up: \"I'm just a bit curious.\"","\"About what?\" Pei Mingxuan asked.","\"Madam Zong didn't come. Could it be that they really got divorced? If so, wouldn't Teacher Zong propose to Yu Rouyin soon? What about our plans to sign Yu Rouyin...\" Ji Fei said casually.","\"As long as Yu Rouyin doesn't accept, and he doesn't go crazy and propose to Yu Rouyin right now, it won't interfere,\" Pei Mingxuan said.","\"Huh? As long as it's not right now?\" Ji Fei didn't quite understand.","Pei Mingxuan explained, \"Yes, if he proposes now, wouldn't that be threatening or even exploiting Yu Rouyin? After all... she's about to go on stage. Without our contract, this would be the most important performance for Yu Rouyin! It would determine her future.\"","Ji Fei: !","The Qin family: !!"]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Proposal Rejected, Then...","paragraphs":["As Zong Chun finished his long speech, Yu Rouyin's expression had already soured, but she didn't want to rebuke him too harshly.","\"Mr. Zong, in my eyes, you're a senior, a teacher. I respect you greatly, I...\"","The smile on Zong Chun's face gradually faded, his expression slowly darkening. He could see Yu Rouyin's furrowed brow and her obvious reluctance to agree. He felt Yu Rouyin was being coy and disrespecting him.","\"Rouyin, do you know why your company has only asked you a few times about your expiring contract and hasn't pressured you further?\" Zong Chun suddenly asked.","Yu Rouyin was taken aback. \"Expiring... they can't pressure me even if they want to.\"","In truth, she knew she had certainly offended her former company. The negative trending topics had been increasingly rampant in recent days. The management company should have been handling it, as the contract was still valid, but they had done almost nothing. Yu Rouyin even suspected that her former company was behind some of the forces attacking her online, naturally aiming to force her to return. However, their methods were much milder than she had originally anticipated.","Given all the ways the former company had exploited her in the past, how could such a company that devoured people whole and specialized in deceiving naive young men and women suddenly develop a conscience?","Things had been so peaceful lately that Yu Rouyin thought it was because she had aged, and they felt they couldn't find any more value in her, which was why they hadn't used heavy-handed tactics.","But now, hearing Zong Chun speak this way, Yu Rouyin felt uneasy.","\"Of course they're reluctant to give up a money tree like you who can both earn money and... entertain,\" he said.","Yu Rouyin's expression instantly darkened.","\"It's because of my influence that they've let you off. I told them you're the one I want,\" Zong Chun said slowly. \"The reason your company is still willing to negotiate this show for you before you leave is also because of me. I want to make this show my engagement gift to you.\"","Yu Rouyin's face was full of shock and doubt. \"How would they listen to you...\"","\"I told your CEO that if they give you freedom, I'd help their company secure investments and connections,\" Zong Chun explained.","Yu Rouyin seemed to realize something and suddenly felt nauseous.","Although Zong Chun had made his fortune through his wife, he had been in the industry for many years and had his own network of connections in various channels. But this shouldn't be enough to make the company back down.","What the company really feared was the capital behind Madam Zong.","The company naturally understood that Madam Zong wouldn't be happy to find herself a rival, but what they were more worried about was if they refused Zong Chun, he might find an excuse to whisper in his wife's ear, making Madam Zong hate their company. With her connections, it would be easy for her to deal with them, even if they told Madam Zong the reason, it might not help.","The fact that Madam Zong was willing to let her husband appear on a show with a potential rival showed she wasn't very bright. In a fight between husband and wife, they would be the ones to suffer.","So they didn't dare offend Zong Chun and could only endure this once.","After understanding this, Yu Rouyin suddenly felt that the man before her was both stupid and evil, unknowingly using his wife's influence to obtain other women, yet still thinking he was so great.","Yu Rouyin maintained her composure and could only respond diplomatically, \"Actually, even if the company tried any tricks, it would be useless. My determination to leave is very strong. At most, I'd suffer a bit, but as long as I don't die, it's fine. As for this show... I'm very grateful to you, Mr. Zong. I'll repay you in the future, but this sentiment, I really can't accept it.\"","Yu Rouyin was sincere about repaying him, after all, this show was the best opportunity she could encounter.","Zong Chun hadn't expected that after explaining everything so clearly, Yu Rouyin would still not accept. She was really ungrateful, truly a heartless woman. He didn't want to admit that Madam Zong was right, so he gave Yu Rouyin one last chance.","\"You've really hurt me. I suddenly feel unwell...\" Zong Chun said, pretending to clutch his heart. \"Could you call the Director for me? I probably... can't perform.\"","Yu Rouyin was stunned, and in an instant, all the blood in her body seemed to flow backwards. She couldn't believe he would threaten her so despicably.","\"Mr. Zong... this is your show too. If you don't go on stage, it would be a serious performance incident.\"","\"I'm old, my heart isn't good. I believe the fans won't blame me. Afterwards... if it's serious, I might need to stay in the hospital for observation and withdraw from the show. Anyway, so many groups have already withdrawn, I'm sure the Director will find a way to handle it,\" Zong Chun said, acting like he didn't care about the consequences.","Yu Rouyin, however, began to tremble all over.","\"The whole internet is criticizing you now. I don't think the fans want to see you anyway.\"","Yu Rouyin's eyes reddened, her voice hoarse, \"Mr. Zong, do you really have to be so ruthless?\"","Pei Mingxuan was still in the assessment period. Yu Rouyin knew her situation was very complicated. The other party's studio primarily focused on being an industry watchdog, never harboring any misconduct, so they might not be willing to take her on. Therefore, she had never placed all her hopes on Pei Mingxuan's side.","Her hope had always been to use this live broadcast show to demonstrate her professional abilities and attract attention. During the last episode, she had received some inquiries about signing contracts, but they were still wary of the negative rumors surrounding her. However, she believed that if she continued to perform well, more companies would notice her.","For example, today, although the whole internet was criticizing her, it also brought her the highest peak of attention. As long as she performed well, she could definitely reverse public opinion. She was full of fighting spirit, waiting for this chance to turn things around!","She thought that even if there was a misunderstanding that caused conflict, even if she rejected his advances, as a professional actor, he would choose to respect the stage. Otherwise, it would be a breach of contract! Even if he didn't perform well, she would bear all the pressure and perform well herself.","But she never expected...","If she lost this opportunity, it meant she had no hope left at all...","Seeing Yu Rouyin completely defeated, Zong Chun smiled and resumed his gentle demeanor, raising the ring box in front of Yu Rouyin.","\"Marry me. Be a good girl, and I'll save you.\"","Backstage, Ji Fei's heart suddenly stopped, and she abruptly stood up, startling Pei Mingxuan. But when she turned her head, she saw the Qin family was about to leave the backstage area.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao unexpectedly said in unison, \"I'll see you off...\"","Pei Mingxuan looked confused and was about to tell them to stay, as they were about to go to the waiting area to start the live broadcast. But she saw them leaving the room at an almost jogging pace.","Pei Mingxuan had no choice but to follow, needing to keep an eye on the time. She hated making mistakes the most.","As soon as they came around the corner, they heard the Director's angry shout from the far end of the corridor.","\"What! Mr. Zong is feeling unwell and won't be on stage? You want to find another actor to help at the last minute? This isn't just a matter of whether it's possible or not, it's a matter of time! You're about to perform, there's no time at all! Are you trying to leave me with dead air? Give me some time... What the hell are you guys doing? If you don't want to perform, then don't! I won't put up with this anymore!\"","\"I'm... I'm sorry...\"","That almost colorless voice, choked with tears, filled the corridor.","Then Pei Mingxuan heard Ji Fei's voice.","\"Oh? That...\"","Pei Mingxuan thought: Why do I have a bad feeling about this?","The live broadcast channel opened.","\"It's about to start, I'm so excited!\"","\"Waiting to see a large-scale public execution!\"","\"Yu Rouyin, get out of the entertainment industry!\"","\"The entertainment industry is already criticized enough, and now there's this blatant gold-digger, climbing up through her body, destroying other people's families. If this third wheel isn't dealt with, it's really unacceptable.\"","\"Yu Rouyin, come out and apologize! Apologize to the poor women you've persecuted! Apologize to those innocent men you've ruined!\"","\"I suggest investigating Yu Rouyin's financial transactions. We might find evidence of illegal activities.\"","\"I think both her bedroom activities and taxes might be dirty! She should be sent straight to jail.\"","\"Rouyin is the most beautiful, Rouyin is the best, Rouyin be yourself!\"","\"Wow, there are actually fans with twisted values standing on her side. Looks like they're cut from the same cloth.\"","\"Actually... to be fair, Yu Rouyin's acting skills are quite professional.\"","\"Professional my foot, all her roles are just flirtatious characters. Isn't that just playing herself?\"","\"It's starting, it's starting! Let's watch carefully now, and then we can watch the top-tier group's face-slapping later. We'll definitely get more laughs!\"","\"I've already dug a pit for the Imperial Consort Group in advance!\"","\"Am I the only one who feels sorry for Teacher Zong? It's pitiful that he's being taken advantage of just because he's a kind-hearted senior!\"","\"Everyone, remember to criticize the vixen later, but don't blame the honest man. Our Teacher Zong is like Tang Sanzang, he won't be bewitched by demons!\"","\"A platonic female friend? Hah, what a ridiculous theme. A platonic female friend is just a mistress!\"","\"Quick, everyone! A netizen has posted a self-made short drama video. They say it goes well with the Imperial Consort Group's stage play and can enhance the flavor!\"","Strangely, even before anyone had taken the stage, people had already begun to oddly promote peculiar videos.","At the hospital, Madam Zong's expression was fierce as she spoke into her phone, \"It's been posted? Good, start buying trending topics! I want her to be mocked and cursed by comments throughout the entire stream!\"","But in the next second, the curtain on the stage suddenly dropped again.","A stream of question marks floated across the comments.","The host came on stage and awkwardly said, \"We apologize, everyone. Due to Teacher Zong's sudden illness, we've decided to swap the performance order of the two groups. Next up, please welcome the Qin Zhao & Ji Fei duo with their themed performance: 'The Downfall of a Beauty!'\""]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: The Night's Events Keep Coming in Waves","paragraphs":["The sudden change in the live broadcast caused all the danmu comments to turn into exclamation marks.","\"What's going on? I was waiting to see the Imperial Consort Group perform first, then watch the top-tier group put them to shame with their stage play. After all, their 'bosom friend' theme seemed rather cliché no matter how you looked at it.\"","\"Teacher Zong is unwell? Is that true? What a coincidence. Could there be some conspiracy targeting the top-tier group?\"","\"They don't think we won't compare the plots and shame them just because they're going on later, do they?\"","\"As expected, problematic celebrities are all afraid of the top-tier group. They're so scared they're deserting at the last minute.\"","\"Maybe the vixen saw the negative buzz online, got scared, and didn't dare to go on stage. So she asked the nice guy Teacher Zong to help make excuses.\"","\"Even if they're scared, they still have to go on! Otherwise, are they going to sit around and chat for the rest of the show?\"","\"Waiting to see what kind of mess the Imperial Consort Group can cook up.\"","\"Never mind, let's enjoy the top-tier group's performance first. I'm so curious to see what tricks they'll pull this time.\"","\"'Beauty brings disaster' - just hearing this theme name sounds troublesome. I bet they're going to harshly criticize those bad women who use their bodies to get ahead and harm others!\"","Meanwhile, due to a delay, a different scene was unfolding on Weibo.","A short video drama suddenly topped the trending list, also using the theme name 'Bosom Friend'. However, since the Imperial Consort Group hadn't started performing yet, this trending topic didn't cause much of a stir beyond piggybacking on the name.","Internet users are naturally rebellious. Subtle guidance of public opinion can easily succeed, but blatant smear campaigns, especially mindless ones, will make netizens feel it's gone too far. They become very resentful and instead, some might wake up and view the issue from a fair perspective.","What's even more amusing is that because the video trended, at the same time, members of the Ladies' Club jointly posted the same message on Weibo:","\"Only those who earn roles based on their abilities deserve respect. Those using underhanded means, please leave the entertainment industry. You're not welcome here!\"","Although they didn't tag anyone, everyone knew who they had blacklisted before, so the target was obvious.","If the Imperial Consort Group were performing now, their Weibo posts would have been quite timely. Netizens would have loved to see them stir up trouble and fight, for the sake of gossip.","But now that the group hadn't even performed yet, their posts just seemed incredibly awkward.","The Ladies' Club members were also quite bewildered. Being their usual proud selves, they certainly wouldn't have treated this as a job to be done carefully. They just casually mentioned it in their group chat and everyone posted a Weibo message.","After posting, they looked at the comments and saw netizens mocking them to watch the live broadcast before speaking, saying they posted at the wrong time!","They were suddenly dumbfounded and went to the group chat to find Madam Zong.","However, neither the video nor the Weibo posts could be deleted, as netizens had probably already saved them. They could only wait for the Imperial Consort Group to perform later for their posts to take effect.","Madam Zong was also confused, but she was more worried about her husband's condition. She quickly called Zong Siqi. Although she couldn't go there herself, she told Zong Siqi to keep a close eye on them.","\"I'm not sure either. Uncle said he wasn't feeling well, but didn't need to go to the hospital. He's just resting backstage and will probably go on stage once he feels better. I can only wait for news now. However, Yu Rouyin seems very anxious. Although they've changed the performance order, she's still frantically contacting people to come and save the situation urgently.\"","\"What! As expected, she's just a selfish bitch! My husband is in this state, and she's only thinking about her own stage performance, not even willing to wait for my husband and just wanting to replace him immediately. Indeed, whores are heartless and actors are ungrateful. She's the embodiment of both!\"","Although Madam Zong had just been hospitalized due to her heartless husband's actions, when something happened, her first reaction was still to feel sorry for him. Sick, and then cast aside so coldly - she couldn't stand it.","\"Who is she trying to contact? I'll have a word with them. I don't believe industry insiders won't give me face and still help her!\" Madam Zong raged.","\"That's not necessary. I overheard two phone calls, and neither was willing to help her. Not only is everyone afraid of her current scandal-ridden state, but also, who would dare to perform on such short notice without any preparation? It could ruin their reputation. Only she's still dreaming that she can find someone to replace Uncle on stage.\"","Madam Zong thought about it and agreed, \"Hmph, evil deeds will be repaid. Maybe your uncle has finally listened to me and decided not to help her anymore.\"","On the other end of the phone, Zong Siqi didn't think so. Although he didn't know what had happened, he felt that his uncle's sudden problem was very suspicious.","After hanging up, it wasn't long before he saw Yu Rouyin approach him, her face pale and her expression fragile and helpless, as if she had nowhere to turn. She said, \"Can you... can you replace your uncle on stage? You should know how to act out the plot. Don't worry, even if it's not perfect, it's okay. I'll find a way to make it work. I...\"","\"If I replace my uncle, how do you plan to repay me?\" Suddenly, Zong Siqi smiled, his gaze scanning her up and down. \"You hit me hard last time. Now you're counting on me to help you?\"","Yu Rouyin's face grew even paler. One night when rehearsal ran late, Zong Siqi had tried to take advantage of her, but she had taught him a harsh lesson.","Zong Siqi looked at Yu Rouyin's face, which exuded a kind of fragility, seeming to need a man's protection no matter how you looked at it. Hmph! She's seducing men again.","Unable to resist his body's restlessness, his eyes flashed as he leaned close to Yu Rouyin's ear and said, \"Help you? Sure... come with me to the bathroom. As long as you satisfy me...\"","This bitch dared to reject him. After she serves him well, if he doesn't go on stage, what can she do about it?","He raised his hand, ready to grab Yu Rouyin's arm, but she dodged him.","Zong Siqi's face darkened, and he coldly snorted, \"Ungrateful. Keep looking for someone else then!\" With that, he turned and left.","Yu Rouyin leaned weakly against the corridor wall, her eyes gradually becoming vacant. It was already difficult to find someone to fill in under normal circumstances, let alone for an artist with her kind of reputation.","The top-tier group had worked hard to buy her some time, but... it seemed she was going to let them down.","She couldn't help but wonder if she should stop being naive. Maybe she should compromise.","Otherwise, if her career was ruined, what would happen to her grandmother?","Just as she was on the verge of breakdown, she heard a commotion from backstage.","Yu Rouyin looked over blankly, and as she saw one figure after another, her pupils began to tremble.","Stage props were being prepared anew, and all the staff were bustling about.","Pei Mingxuan was cursing while quickly arranging for all the supporting performers to enter the backstage area and prepare to perform.","The staff members still backstage were plunged into deep self-doubt when they saw the sudden appearance of the large group of supporting performers.","Tonight's unexpected events had come one after another, each more intense than the last.","They had seen performers refuse to go on due to illness.","They had seen the performance order adjusted.","But having supporting performers appear just before going on stage, keeping even the show's staff completely in the dark, was a first.","Unless the supporting performers were famous, people usually didn't pay much attention to who they were.","But as familiar and unfamiliar actresses passed by one after another, everyone was dumbfounded.","Gradually, everyone realized that these people seemed to have one thing in common.","Like Yu Rouyin, they had all been embroiled in romantic scandals before."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Beauty is Not the Source of Disaster","paragraphs":["If it weren't for the last-minute adjustments that had everyone running around like headless chickens, these firsthand gossip consumers would have immediately whipped out their phones to frantically share the juicy news.","As it was, they could only exchange wild glances, silently expressing their inner turmoil.","Explosive! Absolutely explosive!","The top-tier group... they were playing it so well! They were about to blow the roof off!","They could already imagine the entertainment industry would be rocked to its core tonight.","Look! Even their producer and director were bristling with tension.","The confidential script had already kept them on edge all day, prepared to deal with various public opinion storms at any moment. But seeing the current situation, their hearts, which had been hanging by a thread, finally gave out completely.","The director and producer broke out in a cold sweat backstage, lighting a cigarette to enjoy the last moment of calm before the storm.","The stage lights dimmed, and the background music began.","\"In ancient times, there were beauties who served with their looks, disregarding morals and laws, seeking benefits, and bringing harm to everything. Hence the saying, 'Since ancient times, beautiful women have often been the source of trouble...'\" a deep male voiceover resonated.","But just as it reached this point, it was interrupted by a clear, sarcastic female voice.","Everyone recognized it as Ji Fei's voice.","\"Pinning all the blame for trouble on beautiful women, no wonder they're called 'beautiful troublemakers.'\"","The live stream's comment section exploded with question marks: ????","Wasn't this supposed to be a critique of those 'beautiful confidantes' who rose to power?","What's going on?","It seems things aren't quite what everyone expected.","The live audience was also stunned, except for the Qin family sitting in the front row, who were excitedly rubbing their hands together. Here it comes, they thought. Knowing the inside scoop in advance was so satisfying. They couldn't wait to see everyone's reactions.","Speaking of beautiful troublemakers in ancient times, the first one that comes to mind is Su Daji.","Sure enough, as the stage filled with smoke, Qin Zhao, playing King Zhou of Shang, and Ji Fei, playing Su Daji, made their entrance.","There was a huge mock-up of a bath, probably meant to represent the infamous \"pool of wine and forest of meat.\"","Qin Zhao and Ji Fei were in the pool, listening to the surrounding music and enjoying a decadent atmosphere.","Ji Fei was obediently feeding Qin Zhao wine, and she wasn't the only beauty around him.","Suddenly, a court official rushed in, kneeling with a desperate air, \"I beg Your Majesty to withdraw the order. The Star-Plucking Tower is a burden on the people and a drain on the nation's resources. It has caused public resentment to boil over. It cannot be built!\"","Qin Zhao immediately flew into a rage, \"What's wrong with me building the Star-Plucking Tower for my beloved consort? What I do is none of your business.\" He then pulled Ji Fei closer by the shoulder and said, \"My beauty, continue... I want more wine.\"","Ji Fei, however, remained stiff and unmoving.","The online viewers initially thought Ji Fei's acting was wooden, that she was nervous about coming on stage early and hadn't performed well. They felt a bit disappointed.","But in the next moment, they saw Qin Zhao smile and grasp Ji Fei's chin, forcing her to look up. \"Does my beauty also think I should listen to them? Don't you want to ascend the Star-Plucking Tower with me, invite the immortals, and ask about eternal life?\"","Ji Fei trembled, her hand shaking, not daring to look up at Qin Zhao. She stammered, \"I do, of course I do.\"","Now everyone could see that Ji Fei was genuinely afraid of this brutal king. It seemed quite different from the legendary enchantress who supposedly manipulated King Zhou of Shang like a puppet.","\"Wicked enchantress! You are indeed bewitching the king!\" The official immediately pointed at Ji Fei and cursed, \"You've monopolized the king, making him neglect state affairs and indulge only in pleasure. I should kill you and bring the king back to his senses!\"","Ji Fei immediately cowered behind Qin Zhao in fear.","The official was promptly restrained by the guards.","Tears streaming down his face, the official cried, \"Your Majesty, she is a beautiful troublemaker! She will ruin you and the kingdom! You cannot disregard the foundation of the Shang dynasty for this woman! Kill her, and everything can be salvaged!\"","Ji Fei trembled, her face pale.","Qin Zhao, however, smiled cruelly, \"I'd rather kill you first!\"","In an instant, swords fell, and the official was executed.","The lights suddenly changed, and the big screen lit up. Ancient characters appeared, scrolling frantically, as if countless people were hurling accusations and curses.","\"Su Daji is a demon, seducing the king, bewitching him, making him lose his mind. She's cruel and vicious, here only to bring calamity to the Shang dynasty!\"","\"All those cruel acts were done because Su Daji bewitched the king!\"","\"Without Su Daji, everything in the Shang dynasty would be fine.\"","\"Kill the troublemaker Su Daji, kill the wicked enchantress Su Daji!\"","The stage plunged into darkness, as if time had stopped. Only a single beam of light shone on Ji Fei, who was still hiding behind Qin Zhao.","Ji Fei trembled all over, crying out in a hoarse, desperate voice: \"What have I done? Why are you pouring all this trouble on my head?\"","She stood up and slapped Qin Zhao hard across the face, saying, \"I was just a young girl in my family's home. I had a sweetheart, a fiancé. He forcibly summoned me into the palace. He loved my looks, he pursued me. What position am I in? Could I refuse? I'm just a concubine, can I scold the king? Why do you say I monopolized him? That I made him neglect court affairs?\"","\"You only see that he doesn't attend court, that he wants me to serve him. Which of you can actually prove that I have the power to influence a king's decisions!\"","She then walked towards the court official and slapped him too, saying, \"The Star-Plucking Tower was the king's idea. He wanted to build it, he wanted to become an immortal and live forever. What does that have to do with me? He wanted to take me along, is that my fault? He neglects state affairs and only seeks pleasure - that's his fault. Why don't you kill him? Why kill me?\"","\"If he succumbs to depravity because of my beauty, that's his own problem. Even if it wasn't me, someone else would have led him down this path. If serving him as ordered is wrong, then you should kill every servant in this palace! Why only kill me?\"","Finally, Ji Fei turned and pointed at the big screen, shouting in anguish, \"You're nothing but a bunch of cowards! You want to use romantic affairs to cover up your own incompetence. The king is foolish, the court officials are useless. You men in power have ruined the kingdom, and you don't want to bear the blame, so you throw mud at a weak woman like me! I don't accept this. I've done nothing wrong. I may be beautiful, but I am not the source of trouble!\"","After her outburst, the text on the big screen exploded, and the entire stage was plunged into darkness.","The first act ended.","The audience was left speechless, probably not expecting to see such a performance.","Online viewers were also quite moved.","\"I get it now. The top-tier group wants to present different perspectives on King Zhou of Shang and Su Daji to challenge the misconception of 'beautiful women causing trouble.'\"","\"It's quite a rare angle. Actually, I've always thought it was strange. In ancient times, could these beautiful women who supposedly influenced emperors all have had a penchant for cruelty? Did they really need to do such brutal things for enjoyment? It always seemed odd to me.\"","\"Moreover, many facts now prove that the so-called 'national calamities' were very likely just men shifting blame.\"","\"In the male-dominated ancient world, it's hard to imagine a woman having such a significant impact.\"","\"Didn't Sister Fei say it? Romantic rumors are easier to spread. The public won't care about the complex politics of running a country at the time. If the country falls, rather than the king and court officials taking the blame, it's easier to pin it on a woman who has no voice.\"","\"That's true. We gossip-mongers naturally prefer to hear these kinds of rumors. They spread widely and are more easily accepted by everyone. In the future, all they need to do is raise a banner saying they won't be like the previous emperor who was befuddled and lustful, bewitched by women.\"","\"Cunning. When men get cunning, women always end up being the ones schemed against.\"","\"King Zhou of Shang used Su Daji as a shield for his indulgences, and the court officials used Su Daji as an excuse for their inability to persuade the king. In the end, it's all Su Daji's fault, right?\"","Seeing the serious discussion of the plot in the comments, the director and producer swallowed hard, hoping the rest would go as smoothly.","But in the next moment, the comment section exploded.","\"Wait? Who did I just see? Why isn't it Ji Fei on stage?\"","\"Qin Zhao is playing King You of Zhou, so shouldn't Ji Fei be playing Bao Si?\"","\"Isn't that actress supposed to have left the entertainment industry?\"","\"Yeah, because she seduced a wealthy investor who poured tens of millions into her big movies, but they all flopped. The investor's wife then released her private videos online, accusing her of destroying their family and ruining his career, calling her a bloodsucking vixen!\"","\"Back then, she was criticized all over social media, mocked by everyone. She even came out crying to apologize and announced her retirement from the entertainment industry.\"","\"Has the top-tier group gone crazy? How could they invite someone with such a scandalous history as a supporting actress?\"","\"Wait, it looks like she's the main actress for this scene!\"","On the side of the stage, Yu Rouyin stared blankly at the actress who had returned to the spotlight. She remembered her—the one who had once tearfully tried to explain that she had done nothing wrong, that it was all the old CEO's unrequited feelings. But no one believed her.","Because of the video incident, she had fallen into depression and attempted suicide, ultimately retreating from the entertainment industry and vanishing without a trace.","All that remained on the internet were scandals and insults.","Yet Yu Rouyin had seen her movies. The scripts were terrible, but her acting... was excellent..."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Trust Sister Scarlet, There Must Be Something Fishy Going On Here","paragraphs":["On stage, the classic scene of King Zhouyou lighting the beacons to trick his vassals in order to amuse the beautiful but cold Bao Si was being performed.","The performance naturally continued the style of the previous act.","The actress was a beautiful woman with delicate features. Although she had left the entertainment industry for several years, her makeup restored her to about 70-80% of her peak beauty from when she first debuted. She leaned despondently on the windowsill, her expression sorrowful, her eyes full of emotion. It was a look of melancholy, as if she were a bird in a cage.","Qin Zhao, playing King Zhouyou, passed by, seemingly quite troubled: \"How can I make the beauty smile?\"","A treacherous official stepped forward and suggested putting on a grand show to trick the various feudal lords, which would surely amuse the beauty.","King Zhouyou thought this sounded very interesting, so he laughed heartily and immediately made up his mind.","Soon, Bao Si was brought up to the high platform, looking listless as King Zhouyou held her in his arms and joked with her. Her whole demeanor screamed that she was there against her will.","Until the beacons were lit and thousands of horses galloped, the feudal lords and generals urgently rushed to the base of the high platform with great fanfare, inquiring where the enemy was.","But on the high platform, there was only the sound of King Zhouyou's laughter, with the sycophants around him joining in.","Bao Si looked at the scene below, her expression as if stunned. How could she understand the meaning of the beacons? How could she have seen such a spectacle before? She only felt that the people below were imposing and terrifying, as if something very serious had happened.","\"My beauty, this is the good show I specially arranged for you. Why aren't you laughing? Don't you find it funny?\" King Zhouyou asked.","Bao Si's eyes were full of panic, as if she felt at a loss in such a grand scene. Faced with King Zhouyou's questioning and hearing the laughter around her, not smiling seemed out of place, so she could only force a stiff smile.","With the beauty's smile, King Zhouyou was naturally pleased, while the feudal lords below naturally realized they had been made fools of. Some angrily questioned him.","But King Zhouyou foolishly said: \"Being able to amuse my beauty is your honor.\"","Bao Si's face turned pale in an instant, because she saw countless eyes below staring at her, as if she were someone unforgivable, deserving to be cut into a thousand pieces.","\"You actually bewitched the king to do such an absurd thing!\"","\"This witch has made fools of us! She should be executed!\"","\"...\"","Countless accusations and curses, accompanied by the background sound of a nation's downfall, continued until rolling text appeared on the big screen, displaying centuries of historical criticism of Bao Si.","\"The great Zhou dynasty ended because of her.\" \"She brought chaos to the world.\" \"A beautiful woman brings disaster.\"","The stage went dark, with a spotlight on the actress.","She stood up trembling, stumbled a few steps, as if unable to face the big screen, and covered her face, crying and pleading.","\"It wasn't me, it wasn't... Why do you say such things about me!\"","\"I was originally a beauty captured by King Zhouyou when my hometown was defeated. Far from home, forcibly married, I was unhappy, I missed home, I couldn't smile, not deliberately refusing to smile waiting for the king to coax me.\"","\"Even though I didn't find the trick with the beacons funny at all, the king had gone to such lengths to make me smile, making such a big fuss, and everyone was laughing, how could I dare not to smile?\"","\"But I never thought that just one smile would make me bear the blame for the downfall of a nation.\"","\"I don't understand, I don't know, why is it me!\"","It was real crying, every word dripping with blood and tears.","...","The audience was stunned. Compared to Ji Fei's amateur acting, this was truly professional. Just one look conveyed the emotion, immersing everyone in the play, feeling Bao Si's helplessness and injustice.","The comments section couldn't help but discuss.","\"I have to say, great acting, great looks, if she hadn't retired, she'd be a top star now.\"","\"She entered the acting department with the highest score in her major, so of course she has this level of skill.\"","\"What? Does the internet have no memory? She was kept by a sugar daddy as soon as she entered university, using someone else's husband's resources to forcefully promote herself, but failed miserably, nearly bankrupting the guy's company. His wife even angrily posted a video questioning if she had no shame climbing into her husband's bed. This kind of morally bankrupt woman is just like Yu Rouyin.\"","\"I used to support the top flow group, after all, they had the reputation of being the judge of the entertainment industry, but how could they think of using this kind of person to perform? I'm very disappointed.\"","\"Is she trying to make a comeback? I have to say, the buzz is really big. Even the original wife who drove her out of the entertainment industry has spoken out, condemning the top flow group for using such a morally corrupt actress.\"","\"Please, use your brains, will you? Our top flow group doesn't lack capital or popularity. Inviting her to perform this theme is clearly intentional. She's already a retired actress, apart from being the judge of the entertainment industry and upholding justice, I can't think of any other reason. So now I'm going to check the gossip from back then, see if there's any twist.\"","\"My intuition tells me that believing in Sister Fei is not wrong, there must be something fishy here.\"","\"Regardless of the truth, back then the man beautifully disappeared, only saying he was bewitched by a woman and lost his mind. The whole time it was the actress who came out to take the beating. It's very similar to this play, clearly it was King Zhouyou who lost the kingdom playing around, but most of the blame fell on Bao Si.\"","\"It really is similar. King Zhouyou did a bunch of things to amuse Bao Si and lost the kingdom, that CEO invested in a bunch of projects to please the actress and nearly ruined the company. The result is the same, the man hides behind the woman, and when the spit of curses comes, it's the woman who gets drenched first.\"","The comments and online attitudes were almost evenly split, at least not blindly smearing this actress. Perhaps because this actress had indeed been retired for a long time, people's feelings of disgust were not as strong as they are now towards Yu Rouyin.","...","On stage, Bao Si's weeping voice grew quieter, but at a certain moment, her voice suddenly changed, as if she had suddenly awakened and exploded.","\"Why!\"","She turned and frantically grabbed King Zhouyou's robe.","\"It was clearly you who couldn't distinguish between important and trivial matters, who acted recklessly, wanting to use your power to show off in front of a woman.\"","\"Did I ask you to do this for me? It was all your one-sided desire to please a beauty!\"","\"Why, when problems arose, did you become a coward, allowing others to blame all the mistakes on me!\"","Then she turned and kicked down those feudal lords.","\"What? You don't dare to blame your king for foolishly making fools of you and losing the country, you don't dare to blame yourselves for not fulfilling your duty to advise, you only dare to vent your anger on me? Just because I'm a weak woman? Hypocrites, disgusting, shameless!\"","The camera gave her a close-up shot of her face. She was cursing frantically, her eyes full of grief and resentment, as if venting something, acting even more convincingly than when she was crying earlier.","It was as if she was really cursing at someone.","Finally, she picked up a bow and arrow from the ground and shot an arrow at the big screen.","The big screen cooperated by playing a special effect, instantly shattering the words criticizing her.","As the wind rose and clouds surged, Bao Si stood alone, turning to face the camera. Tears still hung at the corners of her eyes, but her gaze was resolute.","\"I am a beauty, but not a disaster.\"","As the scene ended, the audience below couldn't help but applaud for this excellent performance.","However, the comments section suddenly changed tone, as netizens were checking various gossip in real time.","Just as this actress finished her performance, a exposé post was released, revealing the truth behind the actress's retirement from the industry.","It stirred up a huge wave on the internet.","The comment section of the CEO's wife who had earlier criticized the actress completely flipped, from enthusiastic support to angry questioning.","Actually...","When she was still a student, the actress caught the eye of the CEO. To pursue her, he specially invested in a movie and invited her to play the lead role. As a new actress, of course she would seize every opportunity to act. It's not like she could investigate before accepting a role whether the investor wanted to sleep with her.","So the student new to society accepted the role, worked hard on her acting, was shown favor by the CEO, realized what was happening and quickly refused. But how could an old man easily let go of a young, naive girl? He used various methods, using the failure of the movie as an excuse, using both soft and hard tactics to make the girl keep acting in the movies he invested in. He thought this way he could let the girl see his financial power, and ultimately be corrupted by fame and fortune, willingly understand the rules of adults, and obediently become the CEO's kept woman.","However, due to poor management and poor investment vision, the funding chain broke, nearly bankrupting the CEO's company.","Those so-called videos were actually the result of the boss's fury after losing money and failing to get the girl. In his humiliation and anger, he drugged her and filmed videos. These eventually fell into the hands of the boss's wife, who was even more enraged and chose to publicly release the blurred videos. Although only the girl's face was visible, it was enough to ruin her reputation.","The leaked post also contained various audio and chat evidence proving the girl's non-consent, as well as financial reports showing that their company was already in trouble.","This revelation caused quite a stir. Due to the psychological suggestion created by this unique twist on the \"beacon tower\" story, netizens began to consider the issue from a different perspective and were no longer harsh solely towards the girl."]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: The Entertainment Industry Tonight Won't Sleep","paragraphs":["\"If the leak is true, it seems like her final line was meant for those who caused her to leave the entertainment industry back then.\"","\"No wonder it sounded so genuine and heartfelt. What a great injustice!\"","\"For them to dare leak this information, it must be true.\"","\"If there's evidence, why did they wait until now to reveal it?\"","\"Is it possible that she didn't have any backing before, so even if she spoke out, she would have been suppressed by the powers that be? But now she has the 'Entertainment Industry Judge' supporting her?\"","\"You guys actually guessed right. I found a police report from back then about an actress, but due to insufficient evidence, it couldn't be classified as a crime. The news was suppressed, and almost no netizens knew about it. Those who did know thought she was just putting on an act, and in the end, nothing came of it. If even the law couldn't help her, how could we expect her to face public opinion alone?\"","\"I never criticized her back then. Does that mean I've outperformed 90% of the netizens here? At the time, when I saw the news, I thought it was strange. I mean, how could a small-time actress bring down an entire company? It doesn't make sense when you think about it.\"","\"It seems some things haven't changed from ancient times to now. If you're incompetent, don't blame it on women.\"","\"They blame other reasons because those can be disputed, potentially proving their own uselessness. But as long as they blame women, women can't defend themselves. After all, men do everything for women, right?\"","\"As someone in the financial sector, I can only say that she became a perfect scapegoat. The investment in those few films wasn't the decisive factor in the company's near-bankruptcy. It was their own mismanagement that had already caused financial problems. The film incident just happened to be in the public eye, becoming an excuse for the CEO to save his position.\"","\"Haha, I've seen a few D-list actresses come forward, saying they were also victims of the CEO's casting couch. Looks like he's a habitual offender!\"","\"I want to chop off my hands. I just went to the CEO's wife's comment section to support her. How shameless can she be? Her husband drugged and harmed someone, and she still tries to ruin the victim's reputation. They're truly a family of villains united against others!\"","\"Let me see which company this is... What? They're even listed on the stock market? Brothers and sisters, can we let the stock of such villains do well? Absolutely not!\"","Soon, all accounts related to this company were subjected to cyberbullying. Company employees, who were watching a live variety show at home, unexpectedly received urgent calls asking them to deal with the company crisis immediately.","However, no matter what statement they issued, it was useless. After all, the influence of the top-tier group and the 'Entertainment Industry Judge' was too strong. Perhaps they now understood the isolation and helplessness that actress felt back then.","They didn't dare to imagine what kind of impact their company would face when the stock market opened tomorrow.","The CEO's wife, staring blankly at her phone, turned pale. The door burst open, and the CEO rushed in, slapping his wife directly. \"Why did you have to get involved! You just couldn't let it go, and now look what's happened. We've been bitten back. We're finished! Finished!\"","Meanwhile, in the live streaming room, many comments were scrolling by, apologizing to the actress.","The director and producer breathed a sigh of relief when they saw this. They had thought it would cause a huge uproar, but unexpectedly, public opinion changed so quickly, directly suppressing the opposition. It just goes to show how skillful the top-tier group was in manipulating public opinion. Riding on the popularity of the live broadcast, they gave the other side no chance to fight back, and their preparation was thorough, with one plot twist following another.","It seems that when they were selecting supporting actors, they weren't just choosing randomly.","So, for the remaining few...","In the third act, An Lushan uses Imperial Consort Yang as an excuse to start a rebellion, and in the end, Emperor Xuanzong of Tang forces Imperial Consort Yang to commit suicide.","In the fourth act, Wu Sangui, in a fit of anger for his lover Chen Yuanyuan, invites the Qing army to enter the pass.","The fifth act...","Each of these acts illustrates one principle.","There has never been such a thing as a \"beauty that brings disaster.\"","So many emperors and ambitious men have been surrounded by beautiful women, and no small number of them have been spoiled and arrogant, yet we haven't seen them lose their countries or suffer defeat. So, beauty has never been the cause of disaster.","Of course, apart from the audience at the scene paying more attention to the performance, netizens online had already started their feast of plot twists.","They were busy watching the live performance while surfing the internet, their feet barely touching the ground. The hot search topics changed every few minutes, crashing several times, forcing people to switch to other social media platforms.","This was because every actress's appearance on stage stirred up a storm online.","The plot twist surrounding the first actress meant that the subsequent actresses faced less malice. When people saw them, their first reaction was that they must also have been wronged.","Then, they spontaneously organized to investigate negative information, collect data, refute arguments, and combine with anonymous leaked posts to reveal the truths that had been buried by those in power.","They dragged those seemingly upright individuals, who were initially the 'victims' or 'innocent parties' in the public opinion war, into the sunlight to face judgment.","That night, the network of connections spread from the entertainment industry to the world of capital and tycoons. Countless people's phones rang non-stop, some trying to salvage the situation, others threatening, begging, or attempting to bribe.","But it was all too late. The secrecy of the operation had been so good that these wrongdoers had no idea who would be performing on stage. By the time the performance started, it was already too late.","They could only watch as the selfish and despicable truths of the past were slowly stripped bare.","From well-known directors to popular actors, there were both men and women among the wrongdoers. Not one of them could stand tall and stop this growing snowball of revelations.","Those who dared to stand up and refute were bombarded with one revelation after another until they retreated into silence. When the wall fell, everyone pushed, exposing even more serious incidents.","The smart ones immediately went into hiding, but in this catastrophe, everyone was tied together. No one could escape.","The director and producer had long since turned off their phones, only watching the direction of the comments. As long as the criticism wasn't directed at their production team, it was fine.","But there was one point they needed to notify Pei Mingxuan about.","After all, it was their group's competition, and Ji Fei couldn't stay off stage forever.","Pulling out a few scenes for those actresses to perform was already pushing it to the limit.","After receiving the notification, Pei Mingxuan turned to look at Ji Fei, who was engrossed in her phone, giggling as she scrolled.","\"Second sister-in-law, look at this,\" Qin Rong, also excitedly looking at her phone, showed Ji Fei something interesting.","\"Damn, did the top-tier group deliberately find these wronged actresses to clear their names? How is this any different from charity work?\"","\"It perfectly fits the theme of the performance, does a good deed, and conveniently avoids exposing my sister Fei's performance shortcomings. Haha. I knew joining Fei's team was the right choice. I feel like I've accumulated a lot of good karma from tonight's battle.\"","[Suddenly, I feel like being the 'Entertainment Industry Judge' isn't so bad. But this is all thanks to Sister Pei. She actually found so many wrongly accused female artists. And they all have solid evidence. I can only say, impressive.]","[This is killing three birds with one stone. It helps clear their names, helps this stage performance, and paves the way for new members of the studio.]","[When we were about to execute this plan, Brother Hao was crying and begging Sister Pei, afraid that we'd completely offend the entire entertainment industry. But Sister Pei is skilled and daring. I guess it's related to my promise to be Yu Rouyin's backing last time. But in the end, it was Qin Zhao who made the final decision. Looking at the current results, Brother Hao can't say anything now, right?]","[Of course, the best part is that I can slack off for several scenes! How many fewer lines do I have to memorize! Just now, Qin Zhao had a face full of displeasure. As expected, he hates seeing others slack off when he's working.]","Ji Fei had already changed from her historical costume to modern clothes. Pei Mingxuan approached and said, \"It's time to go on stage. There are five more acts.\"","Ji Fei stood up to prepare, \"By the way, how's Yu Rouyin doing?\"","Pei Mingxuan replied, \"We originally thought that after these few scenes, there would be some positive impact on her reputation, and someone would come to her rescue. But impromptu performance is still too difficult. It's likely she won't make it on stage. However, since we've already paved the way for her, it won't be difficult to sign her later.\"","Ji Fei nodded, not thinking much of it. But as she was leaving, she saw Yu Rouyin still actively making phone calls.","Her face was full of unwillingness and defiance.","Ji Fei thought for a moment, then guiltily glanced at Pei Mingxuan.","When she got on stage, the lights flashed.","Before she could even start her lines,","Ji Fei let out an \"Oh no!\" and fell directly off the stage."]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Could You Please Take the Stage for Me","paragraphs":["This unexpected turn of events directly interrupted the live broadcast. The camera immediately shifted to the judges' panel, and the host quickly tried to save the situation: \"An accident has occurred. Let's give Ji Fei and Teacher Qin's stage a moment to adjust. In the meantime, let's hear the judges' comments on the previous performances. We've had many unexpected guest performers this time.\"","The cameras turned to the judges, who had received urgent instructions from the director and producer to cooperate with the host and begin commenting on the acting skills of the previous guest performers. However, the live comments weren't buying it. The situation had already exploded.","Everyone's emotions were running high!","Now the top-tier group's performance was like a great lord passing judgment. Who would be the next wrongly accused case? Who would make a comeback? Who would completely fall from grace? Whether it was gossip-loving netizens or those with guilty consciences, everyone was waiting to see who would be called out next!","Of course, many fans were also concerned about Ji Fei's condition.","\"Where's my sister Fei! What happened to sister Fei?\"","\"What's wrong with your production team? Are you cursed or something? Even someone as virtuous as our sister Fei can have an accident.\"","\"I was still waiting to see sister Fei continue her performance. I feel like there are still more big revelations to come.\"","\"Could it be that those whose truths were exposed are now collectively cursing our entertainment industry judge behind the scenes?\"","\"Damn! It's very possible. After all, their ugly faces were exposed by our sister Fei's judgment. All that awaits them is complete ruin! Of course they'd want to take everyone down with them!\"","\"Come to think of it, some idiots are even threatening to send lawyer's letters accusing the top-tier group of defamation.\"","\"Oh ho, why not sue for rumor-mongering? Don't they want to?\"","\"What? There are still such bastards? Let me grab my keyboard and teach them a lesson!\"","\"Actually, I can't help but think of conspiracy theories. Did the top-tier group touch the capital's arteries? Did the entertainment industry join forces to prevent them from performing, so they had to resort to this trick of pausing the show?\"","\"Maybe they were even warned and threatened.\"","\"Ah ah ah, the entertainment industry finally got a living person who's not afraid of power. Is this how they're going to fall?\"","\"Can't be helped, it's officials protecting officials. We'll have to see if the performance continues later. Hope the top-tier group can withstand the pressure.\"","Everyone anxiously waited in the live broadcast room.","Meanwhile, backstage, everyone was more anxious than the next. Except for the Qin family...","Well, when Ji Fei fell, all the Qin family members rushed to her side immediately, extremely worried and flustered, anxiously inquiring, not daring to touch Ji Fei.","It wasn't until Ji Fei said she hurt her foot that everyone hurriedly helped her backstage.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom wanted to call an ambulance, Qin Zhao suggested driving her to the hospital directly, while Qin Rong and Qin Yan quickly examined Ji Fei's body, afraid she might have hurt other places without knowing.","There was no room for Pei Mingxuan and Xiao Tao to interject, they could only be blocked by the wall of Qin family members on the periphery.","\"I'm fine, I'm really fine... It's not serious, not serious at all!\"","[Damn... I feel so guilty, everyone's so worried about me, but I didn't actually hurt my foot, I jumped down on my own.]","The Qin family members all froze in unison, looking at Ji Fei in shock.","Qin Zhao's eyes widened even more, but before he could react, Pei Mingxuan pushed her way through.","Pei Mingxuan immediately asked: \"What's your situation now, can you go on stage?\"","Ji Fei wore an embarrassed and weak expression, \"I think I've sprained my ankle, it hurts a lot, I can't go on stage.\"","Pei Mingxuan wanted to shout: Can't you endure it a bit, be more hardworking! The performance can't end like this!","But seeing how the Qin family members were treating this precious daughter-in-law, she instantly couldn't say it.","The person before her wasn't just a simple actress. Although she didn't look like it, she was truly the wife of a wealthy family's heir!","Pei Mingxuan's mind was buzzing. At this moment, the director and producer also rushed over, anxiously inquiring about the situation.","The Qin family members didn't dare to speak. Although they didn't know exactly what Ji Fei was up to, as a family, they would unconditionally support her first.","When they heard that Ji Fei might not be able to go on stage to complete the performance, the expressions of the director and producer went from wonderful to lifeless, as if the night's experiences had drained all color from their lives.","After all, the Imperial Consort Group's stage might still be far off. Even if they tried their best to delay the program length and were prepared to sacrifice another group's performance, it would still be quite forced.","In this situation, to further reduce performances would mean they'd be breaking the rules.","They had seen all kinds of storms in the entertainment industry, but they had never seen storms come one after another, as if determined to crush the production team.","Both of them wanted to kneel before the top-tier group. They really weren't asking for the show to be the hottest topic, they just wanted the show to be recorded smoothly.","Afraid they couldn't handle the blood pressure, Ji Fei quickly suggested: \"Don't worry, we'll find someone to substitute and complete the performance.\"","The director and producer instantly grabbed onto this lifeline, \"Do you have actors who can substitute?\"","Ji Fei nodded.","However, Pei Mingxuan looked at Ji Fei in shock. Where did they have any?","After all, to maintain secrecy, the other guest performers had each rehearsed their own parts separately.","How could she make such a promise so casually? She was even thinking of using rehearsal footage to fill in, or having Ji Fei just make an appearance in a wheelchair.","Qin Zhao, as the other main performer, also looked at Ji Fei in surprise. Before he could ask, he heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[Of course we have someone! Far away yet close at hand! It's Yu Rouyin... But... if everyone thinks it's not okay, I can recover and finish the performance later. We can't really ruin the live broadcast, this should work too, let's try...]","When the Qin family members heard this, their eyes widened, filled with admiration. So this was Ji Fei's plan.","The director and producer didn't care anymore about the rule that Ji Fei as the main performer should occupy half the performance. They just wanted the show to go on.","So they quickly said: \"As long as you have a solution, that's fine. We'll give you ten more minutes to prepare. We'll go maintain the live broadcast. Is that okay?\"","Before Pei Mingxuan could react, Ji Fei had already nodded.","The director and producer left as if they had received an imperial edict, fleeing at top speed.","\"Teacher Ji!\" Pei Mingxuan's voice was somewhat out of control.","Ji Fei hurriedly put on an apologetic smile, just in time to see someone arriving at the door.","Yu Rouyin had come to check on Ji Fei's condition out of concern. Her hand was still tightly gripping her phone, her expression tired. As soon as she reached the doorway, she saw Ji Fei waving at her.","Yu Rouyin walked in, confused.","The others also looked towards the person Ji Fei was waving at.","Especially Pei Mingxuan, who seemed to realize something the moment she saw Yu Rouyin. Her eyes lit up like a wolf seeing a sheep.","\"Teacher Yu, I probably can't go on stage to perform. We can't find anyone to help on such short notice. Could I trouble you to substitute for me on stage?\"","With these words, even the other staff members who were secretly observing the drama backstage were stunned.","Yu Rouyin also stared blankly at Ji Fei, as if she had heard wrong, \"What?\""]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: What storms and waves haven't we seen","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan quickly stepped forward and grabbed Yu Rouyin's hand, saying, \"It's difficult to find someone to fill in for your stage performance. The director and producer said if you can't find anyone, they'll cancel your group's play. Why not come perform with us instead? There's no rule saying you can't ask your PK opponent to help out.\"","Pei Mingxuan continued thoughtfully, \"Besides, the fact that you're willing to find a last-minute replacement shows you're confident in your ability to adapt. So you should be able to handle performing in our play on short notice too, right?\"","As Pei Mingxuan spoke, she seemed to become more convinced of her own reasoning. Suddenly, she cast a suspicious glance at Ji Fei.","How strange, what a coincidence?","Ji Fei avoided her gaze, looking guilty, and said with a smile, \"Sister Pei's analysis is spot on. Teacher Yu, are you up for it? This is your chance to prove yourself!\"","Yu Rouyin had been in a daze, but upon hearing \"chance to prove yourself,\" her eyes suddenly lit up.","Wasn't this exactly what she had been desperately seeking when begging everyone for help - an opportunity to prove herself?","Zong Chun had destroyed her chance, but now another opportunity had fallen from the sky.","What was so scary about an impromptu performance? The real fear was not being able to perform at all!","Although this proposal was utterly absurd, as Yu Rouyin looked at the top-tier group that had created so many impossible miracles tonight, she felt an irrepressible surge of excitement.","Ambition swelled in her heart, her eyes growing brighter. She turned to Ji Fei and asked, \"Really? I can really perform in your place? You're willing to give me this chance?\"","\"You just need to answer if you can do it or not,\" Pei Mingxuan said with a smile.","Yu Rouyin nodded quickly, as if afraid she'd miss the opportunity if she hesitated. She was someone who seized any chance that came her way.","Without another word, Pei Mingxuan handed Yu Rouyin the script for the final five scenes. The remaining time was just enough for Yu Rouyin to go through it once.","All the bystanders backstage looked at this group as if they were insane.","It was a nerve-wracking scene of throwing someone into the deep end.","At this moment, Qin Zhao finally couldn't hold back anymore. \"Hey,\" he called out.","Everyone looked at Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao wore a constipated expression, about to speak.","\"I believe in you!\" Ji Fei said firmly. \"If it goes badly, blame me!\"","\"Teacher Qin is a professional!\" Pei Mingxuan had only just remembered there was another lead actor. \"Just adapt as you go. The first part was already brilliant, so it doesn't matter if the latter part doesn't go well.\"","The Qin family members looked around, seemingly more interested in seeing how this would play out. They were curious about how netizens would react to such juicy gossip, which they got to witness firsthand. As for Qin Zhao's feelings...","\"Good luck!\"","Qin Zhao: ...Damn it!","Meanwhile, Yu Rouyin, who had received the script, paid no attention to her surroundings. She stood rooted to the spot, completely focused on reading the script. It was Pei Mingxuan who pulled her to the makeup table and ordered their makeup artists to quickly make some adjustments.","Yu Rouyin was like a puppet, allowing others to fuss over her while her eyes remained glued to the script.","She didn't even ask if Pei Mingxuan was planning to sign her, instead throwing herself into the intense script analysis. Her complete lack of reaction surprised the top-tier group.","After all, those final five scenes were loosely based on the various accusations against Yu Rouyin provided by the Ladies' Club that day.","Yu Rouyin seemed to have no mental capacity left to realize this fact, as if the entire world had shrunk down to just her and the script.","She couldn't let others down; this was her response to desperately seizing an opportunity.","Ten minutes flew by quickly.","Zong Siqi, who had been wandering backstage, got wind of the news and immediately rushed to inform Zong Chun.","Zong Chun had been leisurely sipping tea, waiting for Yu Rouyin's final surrender. Upon hearing this news, he was shocked. He immediately rushed to find the director and producer, insisting that such an absurd thing couldn't possibly be allowed.","By this point, the director and producer had reached a state of enlightenment.","After all, what storms hadn't they weathered before!","Switching performers? Having an opponent help out? No big deal!","This no longer fazed them.","They had already mentally prepared themselves to move on to other shows after this, so they were fine with any shenanigans for what would be their swan song.","However, looking at the person about to take the stage...","They nervously watched the stage, knowing from Yu Rouyin's earlier demeanor that she was going on completely unprepared.","This meant Yu Rouyin would have to improvise based on the brief plot summary she'd been given and the dialogue cues provided by her scene partner, Qin Zhao.","And all this during a live broadcast...","\"If she can't pull it off, the entire performance will fall apart here. Everyone will blame her, and she'll bear the brunt of criticism she doesn't deserve. No sane person should accept such a risky invitation,\" the director said.","The producer added, \"But if she can pull it off... she'll create a performance miracle in the entertainment industry. No one will be able to deny her professional abilities anymore or just focus on her beauty. Since Zong Chun clearly wasn't going to let her complete her own performance, this is her only lifeline. No matter how difficult...\"","As they were speaking, they noticed Zong Chun approaching.","The two exchanged a glance, not inclined to be pleasant to someone who had caused trouble for their show. They simply said, \"Teacher Zong, if you still can't perform later, we're planning to arrange other content to fill the time and delete your stage performance.\"","\"She...\" Zong Chun wanted to say more, but saw that the director had already started arranging all the staff.","\"Everyone, let's work together and give our absolute best support, to ensure this 'all-or-nothing gamble' has no regrets.\"","Zong Chun's expression changed several times. Understanding their meaning, he could only slink away to the side of the stage, intending to stop Yu Rouyin. After all, this was a competition - how could she help her opponent? Had she gone mad?","But when he arrived, he saw Yu Rouyin and Qin Zhao already standing on the steps, ready to go on stage at any moment.","\"In a moment, you perform according to the script, and I'll do my best to support you!\" Yu Rouyin said nervously.","Qin Zhao glanced at her before finally speaking, \"This is a collaborative performance. The pressure won't be on you alone, don't worry.\"","Yu Rouyin was stunned, her eyes suddenly glistening. Since entering the industry, she had rarely received such respect and trust as an actress.","\"Thank you, I definitely won't let you down!\"","After speaking, Yu Rouyin's gaze swept across the room, landing on those who wanted to drag her to hell.","She flashed them her most contemptuous smile. As if silently saying: You won't destroy me!","Zong Chun and Zong Siqi stared at her in shock.","Just then, the host began the introduction.","As the announcement was made in the livestream, the comment section went blank for several seconds. Then it was flooded with an overwhelming army of comments, causing the stream to lag.","\"What?! What did I just hear? Yu Rouyin is going to perform in place of Sister Fei?\"","\"Yu Rouyin is going on? So the change in performance order wasn't because she was afraid to go on stage, it really was because Teacher Zong's side had a problem?\"","\"Hey hey hey, aren't they competitors? Of all people, why did the entertainment industry's judge ask her to help with the performance?\"","\"What kind of bizarre operation is this? I've been in the mortal realm for years and never seen anything like it.\"","\"Could they be using the plot to humiliate her? Maybe it's the entertainment industry judge's way of punishing bad people.\"","\"Right, right, we'll definitely see Yu Rouyin make a fool of herself. They'll probably make her act out how she seduces others, haha!\"","\"Professional haters get out of the livestream! Please, if you've seriously watched the previous stage performances, how can you still firmly believe Yu Rouyin is a bad person? Everything is still up for debate!\"","\"Exactly, looking at those actresses who came to help out, haven't you all figured out the top-tier group's intentions?\"","\"Folks, this early bird has already gone digging in past gossip fields! I have a feeling that the top-tier group dares to pull this move because they know the truth behind certain scandals!\"","\"Wait, am I the only one worried about how the entire play will turn out? Sister Fei's injury was an accident, and Yu Rouyin is a last-minute replacement. She hasn't even read the script, how can she perform?\"","\"How will she perform? By improvising, of course. After all, Top Star Qin knows all the plot points and dialogue.\"","\"If they'd found some super-skilled veteran actor, there might be a chance. But picking an actress who mainly relies on her looks... I can't deny she has some acting skills, but she's not classically trained. She's only done TV dramas, this kind of situation... I can't even imagine what the performance will be like.\"","\"No, you should think about it this way! If Yu Rouyin can handle even this... Wouldn't that prove even more that all those past scandals were absolute nonsense?\""]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: That Posture Was Actually Going to Lift Ji Fei Horizontally","paragraphs":["Zong Chun and Zong Siqi returned in a fluster. As they passed through the backstage door, Pei Mingxuan asked with a grin, \"Mr. Zong, how are you feeling?\"","The veteran Zong Chun couldn't even manage his facial expressions at this moment. He shot an almost ferocious glance at Pei Mingxuan, as if blaming them for meddling.","\"Oh my, judging by that look, you're still not well. Are you sure you don't need an ambulance?\" Pei Mingxuan asked with feigned concern.","Zong Chun ignored her completely and left.","Zong Siqi's eyes were also filled with malice. That little vixen had found a way out, and he hadn't even gotten his hands on her yet. Moreover, if things turned out this way, wouldn't his uncle avoid divorce?","Zong Siqi left with a gloomy face.","Ji Fei caught sight of the two and was secretly delighted.","[It's rare to see Sister Pei so undiplomatic. Indeed, what old Zong Chun did was truly despicable.]","Pei Mingxuan turned back and said, \"I guess we accidentally did a good deed.\"","Ji Fei was smug: [Of course it's a good thing. We need to make sure Zong Chun's schemes backfire.]","Though gloating internally, she didn't dare show it too much in front of Pei Mingxuan, lest she arouse suspicion.","The Qin family was still accompanying Ji Fei. Recalling the reason for the program's sequence adjustment, they felt a surge of pride.","While arranging for PR personnel to monitor online trends, Pei Mingxuan said, \"Originally, we were going to wait until Yu Rouyin's stage play was over before planning the whitewashing campaign against the Ladies' Club's accusations. Now we've saved ourselves the trouble.\"","Qin Rong asked curiously, \"We don't need to whitewash anymore?\"","\"Because of the trend our theme has sparked, when people see Yu Rouyin perform those five acts, they'll definitely go looking for related dirt. Even if we haven't prepared any evidence for the last five acts, those incidents will hardly escape the netizens' sharp eyes if viewed from a different angle.\"","Pei Mingxuan's fingers flew over her notebook, then she said coldly, \"Sure enough, it's started.\"","Everyone was very curious, but seeing Pei Mingxuan's excited expression, clearly preparing for a big move, they didn't dare to ask further.","However, Ji Fei soon provided an explanation.","[Sure enough, those clowns just can't stand to see Yu Rouyin doing well. Seeing that Yu Rouyin has a chance to clear her name, they immediately start making noise.]","The Qin family: The Ladies' Club?","[They're just ordinary people, how dare they? Do they really righteously believe they're the victims? To dare to come out and smear someone at this time, they truly haven't felt the hammer of justice! Go for it, Sister Pei, crush them!]","The Qin family understood now. The old dirt about Yu Rouyin's student days had been dug up again.","Those people originally could stand on moral high ground and vent their malice towards Yu Rouyin to transfer their own stains, how could they be content to let Yu Rouyin see the light of day again? After all, once Yu Rouyin clears her name, they would become the villains.","Pei Mingxuan was already well-versed in handling such situations: release exposé posts, buy water armies, buy trending topics.","In fact, the incidents from back then all depended on people's perspectives.","If one viewed Yu Rouyin with malice, naturally everything would still be blamed on her, just like before. But if viewed with goodwill, it would completely overturn the narrative.","So Pei Mingxuan only needed to release the complete course of events, not allowing those people to find opportunities to take things out of context. The rest would depend on which way the wind blows.","\"We might be able to arrange a perfect grand finale.\"","Ji Fei immediately became curious, \"Are you planning to invite Yu Rouyin to our studio right after the performance ends, in front of the live broadcast cameras?\"","[That would definitely push tonight's excitement to its peak.]","Hearing this, the Qin family also looked at Pei Mingxuan with full of expectation.","Pei Mingxuan felt strangely pressured, but the cautious manager still suppressed it, saying, \"Let's wait for the public opinion.\"","After all, the Ladies' Club was planning to blacklist Yu Rouyin. Although their various tactics were put on hold due to the disrupted performance order, they wouldn't sit idly by in the current situation.","If it became uncontrollable, they would have to avoid the sharp edge and prepare other plans.","At this moment, the Ladies' Club was indeed getting anxious. The top-tier group's move had left them bewildered. The short video Madam Zong had prepared to mock Yu Rouyin was now directly invalidated. Moreover, due to the reversal of public opinion stirred up by the actresses in the previous acts, they were all feeling somewhat uneasy now.","\"What do we do now? We've already spoken out, we can't just stop, can we?\"","\"Can't you see? Ji Fei and Qin Zhao are on Yu Rouyin's side. Don't forget Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's identities, we can't afford to offend them.\"","\"Why don't we see how Yu Rouyin performs before deciding? If she messes up, we won't need to say much, the whole internet will criticize her.\"","\"Madam Zong, say something, will you?\"","At this point, Madam Zong had already learned from Zong Siqi that it was actually Zong Chun who had pleaded for Yu Rouyin to get this opportunity.","Madam Zong's eyes turned bloodshot at the thought of her husband so wholeheartedly protecting another woman. She finally sent a message.","\"Look at what happened to those people before. Now it's either you die or I live. Mobilize all resources, we must completely nail Yu Rouyin! Otherwise, we're all finished.\"","Sobered by Madam Zong's words, the other ladies immediately arranged their personnel.","A large number of paid commenters began posting leading comments across the internet, and some even came to the live broadcast room to muddy the waters. However, there were so many gossip-loving neutral parties and passersby that the effect was not obvious.","Naturally, Madam Zong had other things to do. She contacted her family, hoping to find connections to persuade Qin Corporation not to interfere in this matter. She promised not to harm the Qin family, only targeting Yu Rouyin.","\"No need for you to say that, many people have already reached out,\" the other party replied wearily.","After all, they had offended too many people in one night, and their network of relationships would always lead back to Qin Corporation one way or another.","At this time, Qin Zhao couldn't possibly answer his phone on stage, and not many people knew Ji Fei's phone number.","So some people called the phone of another person who could handle this matter.","Qin Xian ignored the vibration of the phone in his pocket and pushed open the backstage door. He saw Ji Fei alone, watching the live broadcast on the screen while gleefully typing on her phone, seemingly without any problems.","Qin Xian finally let out a sigh of relief and hurried over.","The few staff members who remained here suddenly saw such an imposing man walk in, heading straight for Ji Fei. They immediately lost interest in the gossip about Yu Rouyin and curiously watched these two.","Before, they had speculated whether Ji Fei had some relationship with Qin Zhao, otherwise why would all of Qin Zhao's family members be so close to Ji Fei?","Now another man appeared, looking even more handsome and wealthy than Qin Zhao. Everyone's gossiping hearts were about to take flight. Although they couldn't hear what they were saying, they could observe the atmosphere between the two!","\"Ji Fei!\" Qin Xian called out, his voice slightly tense.","Ji Fei turned her head, immediately surprised to see the newcomer. \"Why are you here?\"","Qin Xian looked odd tonight. His usually impeccable attire was no longer neat due to running, and his hair was slightly disheveled.","Qin Xian's gaze was intense as he leaned forward to look at Ji Fei's feet, unable to tell which foot was sprained, as both were casually propped up on the footrest.","\"I saw you fall on the live broadcast and asked Dad. He said you injured your foot. Now that the stage performance is over, I'll take you to the hospital to have it checked.\"","As he spoke, he actually reached out towards Ji Fei, seemingly intending to carry her in his arms."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: Did you have fun tonight","paragraphs":["Ji Fei was suddenly alarmed and quickly pushed Qin Xian's shoulder, forcing a laugh, \"No need, no need. It's just a small sprain, not serious. It'll be fine in a moment. I have experience with this.\"","Qin Xian frowned, about to scold Ji Fei for being too careless with her body.","[Good heavens, indeed one lie requires a hundred more to cover it up.]","Qin Xian froze, looking at Ji Fei, and sure enough, saw her expression was uncomfortable.","Qin Xian allowed himself to be pushed away by Ji Fei, \"Are you really okay?\"","Ji Fei hastily smiled awkwardly, \"I'm fine.\"","[How could I not be fine when I jumped down myself?]","Qin Xian thought for a moment and understood what Ji Fei had done. He looked at her with a mix of exasperation and amusement. But in the end, he didn't expose her.","Then, remembering Qin's Father's reply, he couldn't help but twitch his mouth and ask, \"Why are you alone? Where are the others?\"","Ji Fei was also quite puzzled. Just now, Qin's Father and Qin's Mom had suddenly called everyone to go watch the show by the stage.","She thought at least Xiao Tao would stay to keep her, the fake injured person, company. But unexpectedly, she was also pulled away by Qin Rong with some excuse. In the end, only she was left here alone, watching the drama unfold.","However, Ji Fei didn't mind.","After explaining to Qin Xian, she saw his expression become a bit strange. He then seemed to resign himself as he pulled a chair over to sit beside her.","\"Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital? Even if it's just a little pain, we can go get some medicinal alcohol applied.\"","After all, that stage was about a meter high. Jumping down could easily cause some pain if one wasn't careful.","Ji Fei firmly insisted there was no need. As they were talking, they heard the sound of a phone vibrating again.","\"Are you very busy? Am I interfering with your work?\" Ji Fei asked.","After all, since Qin Xian's arm had healed, he had resumed his routine of working overtime. Now he had rushed over here specifically for her false alarm, which made Ji Fei feel quite guilty.","Qin Xian calmly said, \"It's fine.\" Then he took out his phone.","He had been driving here in a rush and hadn't had time to manage his calls.","As soon as he answered, he wasn't surprised by the caller's intention. After all, he had already received several similar calls at the office.","Ji Fei seemed to hear the other person mention something about Qin Zhao and a performance. She looked over curiously, realizing that her and Qin Zhao's actions had indeed caused some trouble.","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei, then responded coolly, \"Of course my wife and my brother know what they're doing. I have no objections to it. If someone got hurt, they should be the ones to reflect on it. What does it have to do with my wife and brother? That's right, I support them completely.\"","The other person seemed to be angered and was silent for a long time. Qin Xian politely said goodbye.","Looking up, he saw Ji Fei staring at him with sparkling eyes. Qin Xian's heart fluttered, and his gaze softened.","\"Did you have fun tonight?\"","Ji Fei couldn't contain her excitement as she shared the gossip, and Qin Xian was always a good listener.","\"Come on, look how well Yu Rouyin performed. Can you believe this is the result of just ten minutes with the script? Look at the comments in the live stream, hahaha, I'm dying of laughter. I can just imagine how shocked they must be in front of their screens.\"","Qin Xian smiled indulgently and leaned closer to Ji Fei to watch the live performance on the screen. \"She's a professional actress. It looks like your studio is gaining a powerful new member.\"","\"But Sister Pei is still a bit worried...\"","...","At this moment, Yu Rouyin was playing the role of a nervous, inexperienced new employee at a company. Despite her alluring looks and sexy figure, her facial expressions, clear eyes, and some stiff body movements perfectly portrayed a sense of innocence.","In an instant, even the male audience couldn't look at her with appreciative eyes for her appearance. It felt more like watching a junior or a younger schoolmate.","That youthful feeling of having just graduated from university was palpable.","This scene alone stunned the online viewers, as if they didn't recognize Yu Rouyin at all.","After all, most of them had seen Yu Rouyin in roles that were devastatingly beautiful and alluring. No director had given her the chance to portray other types of characters, so people didn't know that Yu Rouyin could effortlessly transform into a completely different person when away from her typical roles.","Qin Zhao, who was acting opposite her, and the other supporting actors had imagined various emergency scenarios to save the scene. However, they never expected that from the start of the performance, she barely missed any lines. Even if there were differences, the meaning was the same.","Her acting was flawless, as if it had been Ji Fei rehearsing with them all these days instead of her.","Qin Zhao felt particularly smooth in their dialogue, without any hitches. His partner was living up to her promise - he just needed to play his part well.","In the first act, due to an important contract that needed to be discussed during a business trip, she had to communicate clearly with her superior.","Everyone watched as Yu Rouyin nervously yet earnestly called Qin Zhao, communicating the details clearly, afraid of making any mistakes.","Meanwhile, Qin Zhao was sitting on a bed on the stage, wearing a flashy bathrobe and holding a phone, saying, \"It's not clear enough over the phone. Come to my room, and we'll go over it carefully.\"","\"Ah?\" Yu Rouyin's expression clearly showed bewilderment, as if she didn't know what to do. Theoretically, she knew this wasn't appropriate, but internally she was torn because it was her superior's request.","\"Let's get it done quickly so there won't be any mistakes in tomorrow's work, otherwise...\" His tone already carried the pressure of a person in power.","Yu Rouyin portrayed the clarity and foolishness of a newcomer, the hesitation and helplessness, and finally the reckless decision to come to the room.","Upon arriving at the room, Yu Rouyin looked uncomfortable seeing Qin Zhao's appearance. She stood far away, took out the contract, and was about to speak when Qin Zhao beckoned, \"Bring it here, let me see.\"","Seeing her superior's serious demeanor, Yu Rouyin walked over. But as soon as she approached, Qin Zhao pulled her to sit on the bed, saying, \"Sit down, let's look at it together!\"","Yu Rouyin was startled and immediately stood up, but Qin Zhao kept pulling and tugging at her. He acted as if she was overthinking things and that he was offended by her behavior, scolding her, but in reality, he was being handsy.","Finally, Yu Rouyin managed to maintain her dignity and escape, only to find that her entering and leaving the room had been seen by other colleagues.","Back at the company, a woman rushed up to her and slapped her directly, \"You slut! With that seductive face of yours, you shamelessly used work as an excuse to enter my husband's room and seduce him!\"","Yu Rouyin was stunned by the slap, with a circle of people around her whispering.","Yu Rouyin could only helplessly cover her ears, constantly murmuring, \"I didn't... I didn't... I'm the victim, I'm the one who...\"","Finally, she broke down and screamed. Following the same performance pattern, time froze, and Yu Rouyin angrily returned the slap to the so-called wife, and then slapped the superior.","\"He was the one using his power to pressure me, trying to take advantage of me. Such despicable behavior, why... why don't you condemn the bad person? Why do you bully me? Is it because of my looks? Is it because I'm a woman, so I'm easy to bully? You can't distinguish right from wrong, you turn things upside down, constantly slandering me...\"","Yu Rouyin was panting, screaming at the top of her lungs, her whole body trembling as if she had been bullied by the entire world. She portrayed a newcomer who had suffered great injustice and couldn't defend herself, yet it seemed as if she was venting years of pent-up grievances.","\"You want to drag me down into the mud, but I won't let you have your way!\"","Her eyes were bloodshot, as if she could cry tears of blood at any moment, yet not a single tear fell. But that silent crying was heart-wrenching. Such an intense emotional outburst in such a short time was something even the previous supporting actors couldn't achieve.","This was a first for this stage, even the director and producer were stunned.","Even though she had returned those slaps and gotten her revenge, the pain still infected the audience below. People couldn't help but clench their fists, as if they could empathize with her.","The live stream went crazy.","Those specially arranged professional haters were completely drowned out by the viewers' amazement at the stage performance, disappearing without a trace.","In a nursing home ward, some medical staff looked at the big screen in astonishment. Having interacted with Yu Rouyin privately for a long time, they knew she was a nice person, but they weren't clear about her private life. This time, hearing about an important live performance, they decided to watch it with Grandma Yu.","They never expected to see such a different character portrayal. Which judge had said she could only act with her face? That was nonsense.","Just as they were watching, a sound came from the hospital bed. Everyone looked over to see Grandma Yu with tears in her eyes but a joyful smile on her face. She raised her hand with difficulty, pointing at the screen, and proudly mumbled, \"My granddaughter, it's my granddaughter, my granddaughter... she's the most amazing.\""]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: What the Hell Do You Call That Improvisation","paragraphs":["\"Damn, I've got goosebumps.\"","\"Is this really unrehearsed, with a script they just received?\"","\"You call this improvisation? Teacher Yu, that's insulting! Does that mean other actors who have to recite lines like '1,2,3,4,5,6' need to go back to square one?\"","\"Fei, I'm sorry, but in this moment I've switched allegiances. Yu Sister, you acted so brilliantly!\"","\"Impossible, absolutely impossible! How can someone be so beautiful, have such incredible acting skills, and not even be professionally trained? I don't believe it! This must be an illusion. I need to wake myself up!\"","\"Did the person above manage to wake up?\"","\"I beat myself into a pulp. I woke up and realized it wasn't an illusion. Oh my, Your Highness, your subject has arrived late!\"","\"She's truly a hidden gem of an actress! Is everyone in the entertainment industry blind? How has no one realized until now that she's actually a powerhouse performer?\"","\"Don't you feel that the plot of this stage play hits even closer to home?\"","\"I want to say... I've experienced the same thing. They all said I was seducing the boss, but I was actually being sexually harassed. I was even warned by the boss's wife and ostracized by colleagues. Then I resigned because... you really can't fight against those in power.\"","\"I've been through something similar. I slapped the boss right then and there, calling him a stupid bastard! But I can understand those who couldn't react on the spot. As women, we've been conditioned from a young age with some unspoken behavioral reflexes - not daring to make a scene, not daring to go public, and some even being too scared to resist... Sisters, don't be afraid. They're the ones who did wrong, they should be the ones afraid!\"","\"I just want to say that flirting with unequal power dynamics is sexual harassment. Especially when the other person can control your professional future.\"","\"Is it because of my looks that I haven't encountered this... If I looked as good as Yu Rouyin, would it be impossible to avoid such situations? Why do they bully us girls and then make up stories about us?\"","\"As a man, I just want to tell the ladies above, when you encounter such situations, you need to make a fuss. Let them know you're not pushovers! That's how you take away their guts to try anything!\"","\"Hey hey hey, am I the only one reminded of that scandal that trended for a day, with netizens hurling tens of thousands of insults?\"","\"I remember, was it the one about entering the screenwriter's room and getting photographed?\"","\"No, it was the one about entering the male lead's trailer...\"","\"I knew something was fishy. If we look at it from the perspective of this stage play, all those incidents are problematic!\"","\"There was no evidence, just the man staying silent, his wife lashing out, and some hearsay and photos. Damn, it's exactly the same! So this is what the truth looks like when revealed!\"","\"I feel like I was used as a pawn all those years. Damn, I want to curse them to death!\"","The Ladies' Club hadn't even reacted yet, but two of their Weibo accounts were already overwhelmed, and their husbands were being cursed on the trending topics alongside them.","As the remaining acts of the play unfolded, one old case after another was dug up. The Ladies' Club never expected this stage play to be targeting them, hitting the mark without missing a single one.","No matter what emergency measures they took, it was useless, just like the previous situations.","Some men even threw their wives under the bus, since they had stayed silent and invisible back then.","Their die-hard fans still insisted on believing them.","But karma came around, and other victims came forward to attack their husbands. Suddenly, new trash was hung on the wall, despised by countless netizens, sitting in a row with the scum that came before.","Yu Rouyin's superb acting skills continued to attract new fans, with her Weibo follower count steadily increasing. Some were captivated by her acting, some felt guilty about past events, some sympathized with her experiences. In an instant, public opinion completely reversed.","It seemed that only professional trolls remained among the haters, along with some so-called 'victims' from back then.","As the performance ended, the masks of those 'victims' were finally completely torn off. Not just online, but even people around them couldn't help but curse at them, after all, they had been so self-righteous in slandering Yu Rouyin before.","...","\"Oh, didn't you say your husband offended Yu Rouyin when she was young, so he was persecuted by her patron?\"","\"You heartless scum, come out! I actually believed you and felt sorry for you. I even let my daughter come to your house for tutoring. Only today did I realize why my daughter said she didn't like coming here. It wasn't because she didn't like studying, it was because you kept touching her inappropriately! I'll beat you to death!\"","\"You three-legged monster, still lustful despite your condition. Back then you must have targeted the young Yu Rouyin because she was pretty. You're simply a hypocrite, a beast in human clothing!\"","...","\"The boss fired her. Who told her to have such low moral character, saying their middle school classmate was forced to transfer schools because of Yu Rouyin. I think she was just boy-crazy herself, and seeing the boys all focus on Yu Rouyin made her jealous, so she made up stories about her.\"","\"I saw the exposé. Yu Rouyin was clearly the victim. It's bad enough that the perpetrators refuse to admit their wrongs, but even bystanders treat her like this. If this happened to my daughter, I'd really want to kill someone.\"","\"As a fellow woman, not only does she not stand in solidarity, but she continues to spread rumors and throw mud after the fact. She's just pandering to men, it's disgusting.\"","\"I heard the identities of those three middle school students have been uncovered. They're all married now, with harmonious families, doing well for themselves. Now that this layer has been peeled back, it's time for them to atone for their past misdeeds.\"","...","\"I always thought that family was pitiful, losing their good son because of a girl. Turns out he never even had contact with her! It was just his one-sided crush, and they were so unlucky to be entangled with such a family.\"","\"Moreover, they're the ones who killed their own son. How could they disregard a child's dignity like that, causing such a laughing stock? With pre-existing mental health issues, how could he possibly survive? I heard even the psychiatrist warned them, but they completely disregarded it. Then when their son died, instead of self-reflecting, they blamed others. There really are all kinds of weirdos out there.\"","\"I'm laughing too. Just because someone died, they think they can persecute others like this? She's already suffered family ruin because of them, and after so many years, they still curse her viciously when talking about her. Where's their conscience? Who's really the one with deep sins? They should be afraid of karmic retribution.\"","\"Maybe karma has come. I heard they were in a car accident not long ago...\"","...","Meanwhile, some clever fans had already discovered some deeper issues.","Why had Yu Rouyin been smeared for so many years without her company ever helping to clear her name, and now it took a PK opponent to restore her reputation?","Something's fishy. Her company is very problematic!","Gradually, people started to dig into Yu Rouyin's company.","At this point, some attention-seeking insiders naturally leaked some internal information, letting the public know how Yu Rouyin had been oppressed all these years.","Seeing some outrageous clauses, all netizens were shocked beyond belief.","A ten-year contract, with a fixed salary? While others get millions or tens of millions, Yu Rouyin is just a wage worker?","Some netizens even began to question the legality of the contract. If it's legal, then it's unethical. Faced with an unethical company, what should be done? Report its tax issues! If it exploits a female celebrity like this, there's no way its taxes are in order!","In an instant, the power players at Yu Rouyin's former company were furious, angrily contacting Yu Rouyin, wanting her to help clarify the situation.","However, at this moment, Yu Rouyin was already mentally exhausted from wholeheartedly performing all five acts. Amidst thunderous applause, she was dazedly led backstage to rest.","Seemingly not yet realizing that her fate had changed, she fell asleep leaning against a chair, as if having survived a calamity."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Falling from Grace in Old Age","paragraphs":["At this moment backstage, Pei Mingxuan stood beside Yu Rouyin with a look of satisfaction and affection, protecting her from disturbances. It seemed she had finally found a promising talent she could wholeheartedly nurture, and she couldn't wait to cherish and support her.","Moreover, the online situation was even better than Pei Mingxuan had anticipated. She knew all of this was due to Yu Rouyin's groundbreaking acting skills.","The Qin family had also arrived. Seeing Ji Fei and Qin Xian sitting together, they smiled approvingly.","Qin Zhao leaned tiredly against the wall, talking to Qin Xian. He was perceptive enough to know that someone must have approached Qin Xian.","Qin Xian simply said, \"Don't worry.\"","Meanwhile, Ji Fei was quietly gossiping with the Qin family women about the various rumors circulating online.","Just then, the annoying uncle and nephew pair showed up.","All eyes turned to them, faces barely concealing excitement at the prospect of drama unfolding.","[Look at their complexion, whiter than someone dead for three days. I bet even the veteran actor Zong Chun didn't expect Yu Rouyin's acting to be this good. Indeed, talent is the ultimate weapon.]","The Qin family: They really do look deathly pale.","But before they could reach Yu Rouyin, the director and producer arrived.","\"Mr. Zong, we were just looking for you...\" the director began.","Seeing the two, Zong Chun remembered the upcoming event and reluctantly stepped forward, saying, \"I think we can go on stage and perform...\"","He had lost his bargaining chip, and Yu Rouyin had made a spectacular comeback. He and Yu Rouyin were now at odds.","If she were to spread rumors later about him not performing, it would cause trouble. Although he was furious and wanted to tear her apart, he had to do something at this moment.","However, the producer smiled and said, \"Mr. Zong, you don't need to perform anymore.\"","Zong Chun's expression froze. \"How can that be? This is a competition.\"","\"But Ms. Yu looks exhausted, clearly unable to continue performing,\" the director said with a cold smile. \"She doesn't need to... perform anymore.\"","Zong Chun's face changed, and he was about to argue when the producer interrupted, \"We've already adjusted the program according to the audience's expectations. Besides, initially it was Mr. Zong who couldn't go on stage. We can't always accommodate your situation.\"","The onlookers nearly burst out laughing.","[Exactly, they don't owe you anything. How can you expect to perform just because you say so? Moreover, the director and producer aren't fools. Can't they see that you're using their show as a tool to manipulate women?]","The Qin family held back their laughter at Ji Fei's sarcastic comments.","Perhaps the surrounding gazes were too intense, and Zong Chun couldn't bear it anymore. Losing face in such a situation, he angrily said, \"What does this mean? Does it mean I won't be appearing in any future live broadcasts either?\"","Zong Chun still wanted to use the threat of quitting to pressure the production team.","But the director and producer looked at him with expressionless faces, as if to say: Losing one group in a live broadcast was their fate, and they had already accepted it.","[Threatening with that, hahaha, I'm dying of laughter. He'll soon find out that he really won't need to appear anymore. The netizens have already started protesting, firmly opposing him and Yu Rouyin participating in this show together. I bet it won't be long before it trends on social media. Indeed, when netizens strike, no one is spared.]","Upon hearing this, the Qin family, who had been watching the confrontation, became curious. How could this be?","After all, regardless of what despicable things Zong Chun had done in private, he still maintained a false facade. The netizens shouldn't know about his situation with Yu Rouyin.","They were dying of curiosity, but Ji Fei's inner thoughts were focused on gloating and didn't explain the reason.","Everyone had to take matters into their own hands and quickly searched on their phones.","The results nearly made them laugh their heads off.","It turned out that because the \"wife squad\" had suffered heavy losses, they saw that Zong Chun and Madam Zong were unscathed and immediately felt they had been used as pawns.","When they were questioned about how they still had the nerve to come together to boycott Yu Rouyin, someone couldn't resist dragging Madam Zong down with them.","They declared that this time it was all instigated by Madam Zong because her husband, Zong Chun, wanted to divorce her for Yu Rouyin!","The exposure of this incident naturally caused a huge uproar. But today's netizens were not the same as before; they were now Nuohuolu·Netizens (a playful term implying they were now more discerning and powerful).","With so many revelations tonight, they had accumulated several rounds of experience and could piece together the truth in a matter of minutes.","\"Please, don't tell me you're going to say our beautiful Yu seduced your old Zong and made him want to divorce you. I'm dying of laughter! With our Yu's acting skills and looks, why would she be interested in your old Zong? Is it for his old age or his parasitic lifestyle?\"","\"It must be Mr. Zong coveting our beautiful Yu's looks, that's why he wants a divorce, right? But what does this have to do with our Yu?\"","\"You can't control your own man, but you're good at bullying the weak and fearing the strong, causing trouble for an innocent woman. Women like you who can't distinguish right from wrong should have your 'woman card' revoked!\"","\"Folks, I suddenly remembered the video that trended earlier. It seems the mastermind behind this is quite obvious now.\"","\"Come to think of it, you're right. Someone released a script that seems to be Yu's original performance script. If you compare it with the video, the situation is unimaginable.\"","The script was about a story of national affairs, a confidante, and a tragedy of dying for a friend in troubled times. It transcended the relationship between men and women, aiming to prove the concept of a 'female confidante', as this term is often used in a derogatory context in modern times.","Yu Rouyin's goal was to use her appearance and acting skills to create a contrast, proving that even with her looks of a femme fatale, she could meet a kindred spirit who understood and trusted her, and their relationship would be free of ulterior motives or ambiguity.","If she could achieve that effect, it would be the strongest proof of her acting skills.","The video Madam Zong created showed a mistress affectedly using her status as a female confidante to curry favor with a man, subtly pressuring and provoking the man's original wife. The man was only interested in romance with the female confidante, completely ignoring his suffering wife. In the end, the original wife was forced into a pitiful state before exposing the true nature of the female confidante.","The minor plot points all corresponded to the script, making it easy for people to compare.","But now it had become a joke, also proving that Madam Zong was indeed involved in the joint boycott.","\"Indeed, the judge of the entertainment industry punishes all sins, letting you face the consequences of your black-hearted attempts to harm others.\"","Seeing the online abuse directed at her, Madam Zong finally cracked. She never imagined she would face cyberbullying one day. Not only her, but even her family background was dug up by netizens, and various relatives had started calling to check on her.","She turned pale, at a loss for what to do, and wanted to call her husband.","However, netizens began to speculate on the reason why Zong Chun wasn't performing, and someone quickly analyzed it.","\"Is it because he planned to propose to Yu after the divorce, but Yu refused, so he's teaching her a lesson and threatening her? Otherwise, the events of tonight don't make any logical sense!\"","\"Folks, we're waiting outside the live broadcast hall with other fans right now, and from beginning to end, we haven't seen any ambulance or Zong Chun coming out. I really don't believe he's too sick to perform!\"","\"Damn, that's disgusting. Old men should stay away.\"","Madam Zong was stunned seeing these comments.","Meanwhile, Zong Chun was still stupidly trying to argue with the director and producer.","Qin Zhao, having seen the online trends, couldn't resist stirring up more trouble: \"Mr. Zong, you'd better check the online sentiment. The director not letting you perform now is actually for your own good, to save you from ruining your reputation in your twilight years.\"","[Pfft... It spread so quickly indeed. But Qin Zhao's words... 'perform', his reputation is already ruined!]","Zong Chun was taken aback and anxiously took out his phone to check. As he looked, his pupils constricted in shock."]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: A Completely Hypocritical Person Losing It Is Really Too Entertaining","paragraphs":["The director and producer had become numb to what was happening online, not even bothering to check anymore, as they had no intention of letting Zong Chun go on stage. They turned to discuss the upcoming arrangements with Pei Mingxuan.","Meanwhile, Zong Chun had completely lost his composure.","Regarding the decision to divorce and remarry, Zong Chun had originally felt justified, but now seeing such news actually appear online, accompanied by various mockeries and insults, he finally realized that he truly couldn't bear the impact of such public opinion.","Not to mention that netizens had already begun to widely spread his intentions for tonight.","The four words \"disgrace in old age\" felt like a slap across his face.","It can only be said that middle-aged men who have been well-protected by their wives have no awareness of how foolish they were before, simply assuming they could charge forward for love.","Now filled with regret and anguish, he could barely stand.","[Look at that cold sweat, I wonder if he ever imagined this outcome when making that decision, haha.]","The Qin Family thought that even without tonight's event, if he had actually gone through with the divorce and remarriage, upon discovering the strength of the online public opinion attack, he would probably immediately push Yu Rouyin out to take the bullets.","After all, Zong Chun was inherently selfish and cold-hearted.","Suddenly, as if awakening from a trance, Zong Chun rushed towards Yu Rouyin.","[Oh, is he planning to have Yu Rouyin help him clarify that this isn't true, still hoping to come out unscathed?]","The Qin Family: Indeed, what a thick-skinned old man.","Despite their sarcasm, everyone still moved closer to where Yu Rouyin was resting, intending to block Zong Chun.","Pei Mingxuan, who was talking with the director and producer, immediately reacted and directly blocked Zong Chun's path.","Zong Chun, already anxious, forced a smile that didn't reach his eyes, \"I have something to discuss with Rouyin.\"","Pei Mingxuan smiled insincerely: \"Your performance has been cancelled anyway, so what could you possibly have to discuss now? Ms. Yu has worked so hard, let her rest for a while. We're about to have the supporting actors give interviews, and Ms. Yu needs to be in good condition to go on stage. I suggest Mr. Zong quickly find some PR personnel to handle the online public opinion.\"","Zong Chun's expression was completely out of control, twisting in anger.","\"What does this have to do with any of you? Why are you meddling in my affairs!\"","[He's panicking, he's panicking! It's so interesting to see someone who usually acts so righteous completely lose it.]","Not just the Qin Family, but other backstage spectators were watching with gleaming eyes.","\"It's about to have everything to do with us,\" Pei Mingxuan said with a meaningful smile. \"After all, isn't Ms. Yu's contract about to expire?\"","Zong Chun was stunned, looking at Pei Mingxuan in disbelief. Originally, he dared to imagine getting Yu Rouyin to help him clarify because her contract was about to end, meaning she would be completely without backing. He thought he could still intimidate her a bit.","But now... Zong Chun looked around and suddenly realized that Yu Rouyin was surrounded by people from the top-tier group.","Yu Rouyin was no longer alone.","She was no longer someone who could be easily coerced or enticed.","In the end, Zong Chun left with his tail between his legs.","Zong Siqi was also frightened by the current situation. As a small fry just entering the entertainment industry, he naturally didn't have the courage to do anything, so he quickly ran out after Zong Chun. As soon as he found Zong Chun, he overheard him on the phone with Madam Zong.","Zong Siqi immediately became nervous and moved closer to eavesdrop, afraid that if the two confronted each other, his own small actions would be exposed.","\"What have you done!\"","To Zong Siqi's surprise, his uncle, even at this point, didn't ask for his aunt's help, but started off by scolding her.","This ability to bite the hand that feeds him was truly beyond Zong Siqi's reach.","\"Husband, is it because the proposal didn't...\"","Madam Zong's voice was hesitant, seemingly still confused by the news she had received online.","\"Shut up! Do you know that your arbitrary actions have ruined everything for me? This was supposed to be our private matter, why did you have to tell others, why did you have to team up with the Ladies' Club to do those things? Now it's backfired! Do you know how the director and producer just spoke to me? They won't let me go on stage! They don't even want me to participate in future shows! I've been in this industry for years, and now I'm being treated like this. It's all because of you!\"","Zong Chun, who prided himself on being elegant, had never been this fierce with Madam Zong, even when discussing divorce. This outburst left Madam Zong stunned.","\"Husband... husband, I'm sorry, I didn't know they would turn on me, I really didn't know...\"","The more Zong Chun spoke, the angrier he became, feeling utterly wronged. He had never taken advantage of Yu Rouyin, it was just an unsuccessful proposal, why should he be treated like this? His wife was a fool, and Yu Rouyin was a bitch.","\"Their husbands are truly indecent and have done those disgusting things, why should I be lumped in with them for criticism! All these years, you know what kind of person I am, don't you? You couldn't bear children, did I ever blame you? I even told others it was because I didn't want children. I've been more than kind to you, and this is how you repay me!\"","\"No, husband, I just wanted to deal with Yu Rouyin, this was all an accident, how could I possibly act against you?\"","Zong Chun snarled, \"You better find a way to help me clear this up, otherwise our marriage is truly over.\"","Madam Zong's voice paused, falling silent. It wasn't until Zong Chun grew impatient that Madam Zong spoke softly, \"Husband, let's talk about this when we get home. This can't be resolved quickly.\"","Seeing that she intended to handle it, Zong Chun immediately felt relieved. Fortunately, he had seized the initiative. If Madam Zong had chosen this moment to make a fuss about the previous events, that would have been truly troublesome.","Zong Siqi, watching Zong Chun's hypocritical behavior from the side, was speechless. But what left him even more speechless was that Madam Zong still wouldn't give up on Zong Chun, even after all this.","It seemed he would need to think of another plan.","On the other side, after the troublemaker left, the director and producer began arranging for the supporting actors to go on stage for interviews.","This move naturally won the hearts of netizens.","In the past, people were afraid of vixens clinging to veteran actors, but now they feared old lechers pestering the beautiful Yu Rouyin.","As the beautiful actresses took the stage one by one, the barrage of comments once again erupted in celebration, continuously praising each actress.","But as the host's interview progressed, it became apparent that these actresses were no longer accustomed to facing such cameras, and some were even afraid to face them, having developed significant psychological trauma from being forced out of the entertainment industry by scandals years ago.","\"It seems you're a bit nervous,\" the host said with a smile. \"Understandable, after all, it's been seven years.\"","The actress smiled and nodded, \"Yes, seven years.\"","\"But during the performance just now, you were so natural and excellent.\"","\"Because I love performing.\"","If others had said this, it might have seemed like an official answer, but coming from them, it felt particularly genuine.","If they didn't love it, how could they have performed so brilliantly after being away from the stage for so long?","The host smiled, \"You've won this comeback battle beautifully. Many netizens are already asking in the comments when you'll act again, they're waiting to see.\"","The actress's smile became more natural, but with a touch of resignation.","\"Being able to perform freely in a play is already satisfying for me. I'm grateful to Teacher Ji Fei and Teacher Qin Zhao for giving me this opportunity, letting me understand that good and evil will eventually be rewarded accordingly. I've completely retired from the entertainment industry and won't make a comeback. However, if Teacher Ji and Teacher Qin ever need me for a cameo, I'd be willing.\""]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Beauty Kisses, The Kiss of Beauty","paragraphs":["As soon as these words were spoken, not to mention the live stream comments, even the audience below let out gasps of regret.","After other actresses also gave similar answers, the live stream comments were filled with wails of anguish. How many great actresses had been lost!","They still wanted to see the beautiful sisters!","Angered netizens went to lash out at those sleazy men and scheming women again.","Even the host couldn't help but lament: \"Are you really not considering it? At least after this stage performance, your future acting careers should be smoother.\"","After all, everyone could see that the top-tier group had paved a good path for them. In the future, even if there were marketing accounts spreading rumors or others framing them, netizens wouldn't easily believe it.","In fact, Pei Mingxuan had actively approached them, wanting to sign them, as they were all good talents.","But they all refused, perhaps because their hearts were now at peace.","An actress smiled and said, \"Well, my purpose in coming was never to make a comeback.\"","The host seemed to notice something different in these actresses' eyes and quickly asked, \"Besides performing once to clear your name, is there another reason?\"","Everyone immediately became curious and looked at the actresses on stage.","The actresses exchanged smiles.","\"We came out to write a self-testimony for the entertainment industry with our painful lessons, hoping that actresses who face the same fate as us in the future will have a strong shield to protect themselves, so that those evil spirits hiding in the darkness can never extend their dirty hands towards them again.\"","One of the actresses even playfully quoted the words used by the wives' group to boycott Yu Rouyin.","\"Those who get roles based on their abilities should be respected. Underhanded methods, please leave the entertainment industry. You're not welcome here!\"","When they said these words, the entire venue fell silent. But after they finished speaking, thunderous applause erupted, lasting for a long time.","The comments were no longer trying to persuade them to stay, lamenting their talent, or cursing those evil people. Instead, they kept repeating the actresses' words.","Although their power was small and what they could do was limited, they chose to stand up and do what they could to change the difficult situation for actresses in the entertainment industry.","They were actresses, not playthings of capital, not objects under men's gaze.","Perhaps there were indeed some actresses who wanted to take shortcuts, but most actresses were not like that. Many of them were forced into men's ugly desires, struggling to survive in the cracks, and even if they achieved success, it could be ruined by one or two rumors of promiscuity.","How unfair, but there was always light.","As the spotlight swept towards the audience, it was time for the final supporting actress, Yu Rouyin, to take the stage.","The actresses on stage all smiled at Yu Rouyin, as if waiting for her to walk onto this stage they had cleared.","Yu Rouyin also stared at them in a daze, after all, their fates had once been similar.","Yu Rouyin smiled gently, she turned back, extended her hand, and supported the hopping Ji Fei who came out, with Qin Zhao following behind them.","The three of them went on stage together.","Thunderous applause once again erupted throughout the venue, and the comments were even louder, shouting \"Long live the Fei family\" and \"Clean up the entertainment industry!\"","While Yu Rouyin was being interviewed, Qin Zhao and Ji Fei took the opportunity to extend an invitation, pushing the atmosphere of the evening to its peak.","Although Pei Mingxuan had already informed Yu Rouyin, at this moment Yu Rouyin was still teary-eyed and trembling, immediately turning to hug Ji Fei.","The atmosphere was right, and everyone didn't want to interact with Qin Zhao, so all the actresses rushed towards Ji Fei. In the end, Ji Fei received a kiss from every beautiful woman present, instantly making Ji Fei's little face turn red with excitement, almost forgetting to pretend to limp.","Ji Fei went off stage with a face covered in lipstick marks, still giddy in her heart.","[Girls kissing girls, a girl's kiss is indeed fragrant, my luck, I wonder how many men will die of jealousy, hahaha.]","\"Xiao Tao, help me take a photo to remember this,\" Ji Fei said with a grin.","It was originally a joyful atmosphere, but all the Qin family members secretly glanced at Qin Xian, whose expression had been subtle since earlier.","Qin Xian's gaze was fixed on the lipstick marks on Ji Fei's face. After Xiao Tao finished taking the photo, Qin Xian directly stepped forward and, before Ji Fei could react, picked her up horizontally.","Ji Fei was so startled she almost screamed, \"What are you doing?!\"","\"The show is over, it's time to go home. Your foot is injured, I'll carry you.\"","[So many people are watching! There's no need for this!]","Ji Fei suddenly found herself at a loss for words, and could only say softly, \"Actually, it doesn't seem to hurt anymore... I can walk by myself.\"","\"No.\" Qin Xian didn't waste any more words and directly carried Ji Fei out through the emergency exit of the live broadcast building.","Qin Xian had long legs and took big strides, so Ji Fei didn't feel like she was being watched. Actually, Ji Fei was overthinking it. Given their status, even if someone took photos, they couldn't be posted.","Body heat began to merge with the embrace, and Qin Xian's inexplicably upset heart gradually calmed down.","Seeing that Ji Fei had been very quiet, he couldn't help but reflect, wondering if he had been too forceful and made Ji Fei uncomfortable?","But in the next second, Qin Xian realized he had overthought.","Because a little paw was taking the opportunity to feel around on his body.","Still pretending it was just friction caused by his walking.","By the time they reached the car in the parking lot, Qin Xian's face was flushed from all the touching.","[Kisses from beauties, embraces from handsome guys, what a top-tier experience.]","Listening to Ji Fei's mumblings, Qin Xian knew that she was truly happy tonight.","After placing her in the passenger seat and fastening the seatbelt, he suddenly realized something.","\"Huh? Where are the others?\" Ji Fei asked.","Qin Xian's hand paused as he was closing the door. He had forgotten. He took out his phone and saw the group chat messages without Ji Fei.","Qin's Father: Just left like that?","Qin's Mom: Is this what they call forgetting your mother once you have a wife? [Excited.JPG]!","Qin Yan: Second brother only has eyes for Feifei now, [Laugh.JPG]!","Qin Zhao: [Driving away with everyone.JPG]!","Qin Rong: Picture, picture, picture...","They were all photos of Qin Xian carrying Ji Fei horizontally from various angles.","Qin Xian's expression became embarrassed. He awkwardly saved the photos while walking around to the driver's seat.","\"They're waiting for Third Brother to go together. We'll leave first.\"","By the time they got home, the others still hadn't arrived. Qin Xian chose to continue the act and carried Ji Fei all the way back to her room.","It wasn't until he put her down on the bed that Ji Fei finally felt a bit awkward.","She quickly said, \"Thank you for your trouble, thank you. You don't need to bother anymore from here on.\"","Qin Xian naturally understood and didn't want to make Ji Fei feel uncomfortable anymore. After giving a few reminders, he prepared to leave.","However, just before exiting the door, Qin Xian couldn't help but turn back and say, \"You did a great job with tonight's event.\"","Ji Fei was stunned, not sure what exactly he was referring to. But for some reason, the corners of her mouth curled up. \"I think so too.\"","Qin Xian smiled and then left.","In the end, this so-called PK session ended with the other side forfeiting, so there was no winner or loser.","But the excitement online didn't diminish at all after the live broadcast ended.","New scandals kept breaking, making Ji Fei and the Qin family ladies who came to her room to join the fun eat it up with glee.","Usually, when a big scandal breaks, it tends to overshadow previous big scandals. But on this night, unfortunately, all those exposed were scumbags of the same nature. So whenever a new one came out, the previous ones would be dragged out and flogged repeatedly. Hoping for others to take the bullet was out of the question.","Major fan accounts changed their profile pictures to black, anti-fans stomped on their idols, apologies were made, and careers crumbled.","This was a night of purging scumbags in the entertainment industry.","As for those scumbags who weren't named, they were all trembling in fear, afraid of being called out.","Of course, there were also some ill-intentioned women who took the opportunity to make false accusations and fish in troubled waters.","But these were quickly debunked.","It just goes to show that truth can't be faked, and lies can't become truth. The judgment brought by the internal entertainment industry judge was never aimed at gender, but at the truth.","...","At night in the Zong household, only the couple remained.","After seeing that none of the whitewashing strategies used by those whose careers crumbled tonight worked, Madam Zong finally voiced the idea hidden in her heart, but Zong Chun became a bit cowardly.","\"Madam, are you really sure about this? If this goes wrong, I'll truly be ruined.\"","Madam Zong's gaze was deep as she said, \"Don't worry, darling, leave everything to me!\""]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: To Go to the Hotel and Take Photos of Yu Rouyin and Zong Chun's Affair","paragraphs":["After the show's recording ended, Ji Fei's vacation began, allowing her to relax at home for three days.","During these three days, she naturally spent time browsing the internet, watching the entertainment industry undergo major upheavals.","Her reputation as the \"Entertainment Industry Judge\" grew increasingly mysterious.","In the living room, the Qin family sat together chatting.","Qin Rong laughed uncontrollably as she showed Ji Fei her phone.","On the screen was a netizen's spicy comment: \"We thought the easiest persona to crumble would be hers, but it turns out everyone else is crumbling instead. We have to admit that Sister Fei has some mystical power about her.\"","Ji Fei thought: [Hmm, let's just say I do indeed have some mystical qualities.]","The Qin family, hearing Ji Fei's internal monologue, thought about the system she possessed – wasn't that mystical indeed!","\"Look at this one,\" Qin Yan said with a smile. \"It says that from now on, they'll choose who to follow based on who you get along with. Otherwise, if they invest real feelings and the celebrity's reputation collapses, they'll lose both emotionally and financially.\"","\"Fei Fei has become a trendsetter,\" Qin's Mom said with a laugh.","Ji Fei jokingly complained, \"My Weibo private messages are full of people asking for authentications. I've become an authentication master.\"","[Actually, following celebrities is like getting married. It might start well, but in the end, it all depends on conscience. I can't really predict who might fall from grace in the future.]","The Qin family agreed with this sentiment.","\"By the way, is Yu Rouyin considered an artist of your studio now?\" Qin's Mom asked curiously.","Qin Zhao, who was playing with a model alongside Qin Xi, checked the time and said, \"Should be about now. Today, Pei Mingxuan accompanied her to terminate her contract with her previous company, and then she'll officially sign with us.\"","\"You better not exploit her in the contract,\" Qin's Mom couldn't help but say. \"Such a pitiful girl.\"","Both Qin's Father and Qin's Mom were kind-hearted people, so they had already decided to provide employee benefits for Yu Rouyin, directly helping transfer her grandmother to the best rehabilitation center under Qin Corporation for recovery and care. Qin Yan had taken charge of handling this.","Qin Zhao responded exasperatedly, \"Do we look like we're short on money? The contract gives her a high degree of freedom.\"","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"According to Sister Pei, the plan is to groom Yu Rouyin for the big screen, with the ultimate goal of becoming an international award-winning actress. Given Yu Rouyin's talent, her future value is immeasurable.\"","Everyone was pleased that Yu Rouyin had reached this point.","Just as they were talking, Ji Fei's phone vibrated. She casually looked at it and saw a private message sent to her alternate Weibo account.","\"Are you free to shoot something?\"","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment.","[Oh, I remember now. I used this account to pose as a paparazzi and sell leak videos to marketing accounts before. Is he asking me to shoot something? Does he really think I'm paparazzi? Well, let me see what gossip needs to be captured...]","At first, the Qin family didn't pay much attention to this sudden small incident, until Ji Fei's internal monologue blasted through their ears. Except for the oblivious Qin Xi, everyone else's bodies tilted, almost covering their ears.","What... what's going on?!","[They want me to go to a hotel and take photos of Yu Rouyin and Zong Chun having an affair!]","The Qin family: What?! The whole world has guessed that it was the Zong couple who entangled Yu Rouyin, and Yu Rouyin is just an innocent victim. How could there be idiots asking for affair photos at a time like this?","Ji Fei sat up straight, her thumbs working furiously on her phone, immediately sending a message to inquire about the situation.","[What? Someone secretly tipped off the marketing accounts, saying that Yu Rouyin would be meeting Zong Chun in room YY of XX Hotel tonight. That's why the marketing accounts are looking everywhere for capable paparazzi to capture first-hand photos. Nonsense! How is this possible?!]","The Qin family also found it absurd, clearly a fabrication.","It seemed that although the marketing accounts couldn't discern the truth, they preferred to err on the side of caution rather than miss an opportunity. That's why they were willing to pay paparazzi to take photos.","If they could get concrete evidence at this point, it would immediately reverse the trend and generate massive traffic. Not only would Yu Rouyin be in trouble, but all the female supporting actresses and top-tier celebrities who helped her would also suffer.","Ji Fei could sense the excitement from the other side of the screen. After all, for these marketing accounts, having the most explosive news was like holding a treasure.","If they could get photos, they would first tease the news, waiting for negotiations. If they weren't satisfied, or if a competitor offered more money, they would release the information.","Because Ji Fei had provided exclusive content last time, the marketing account assumed she was some formidable paparazzi. Thinking that ordinary paparazzi couldn't capture such a private setting, they reached out to her for collaboration.","[Haha, you want to ruin my \"Entertainment Industry Judge\" persona? Dream on... Eh? It's not like I particularly want to maintain this persona anyway? Tch, whatever, I need to investigate and see what's really going on!]","The Qin family, sitting on the sofa, immediately fell silent, waiting for answers. Of course, they believed it must be a misunderstanding.","But the next second, they heard Ji Fei unleash a string of expletives.","[What a despicable couple! They're actually conspiring to set up Yu Rouyin!]","The Qin family was shocked. Until now, neither Yu Rouyin nor the Zong couple had come forward to make any statements, which proved that both parties intended to let the matter cool down.","From Yu Rouyin's perspective, she had no evidence and understood the principle of quitting while ahead. She couldn't afford to exhaust the netizens' sympathy, so she was willing to let them off the hook.","As for the Zong couple, if they had any sense, they should be laying low like quails at this time. After all, the gossip about them was unsubstantiated. If they stayed quiet, it might blow over, and they wouldn't end up as miserable as those before them who faced public condemnation and had to apologize and retire from the industry.","But now they were saying the couple was about to cause trouble again.","[They're planning to drug Yu Rouyin to prove that she seduced Zong Chun, have paparazzi photograph it, and then have marketing accounts release it... Damn! So the source of the marketing account's information is actually Madam Zong. It's a self-directed and self-acted catch-the-cheater drama!]","[The goal is to let netizens know that it was actually Yu Rouyin who seduced Zong Chun, attempting to destroy their family. This would explain why Madam Zong misunderstood earlier that Zong Chun wanted a divorce, and why Zong Chun didn't go on stage to perform – it was to reject Yu Rouyin.]","[Since they haven't left much evidence for what they've done, this reversed narrative, coupled with photos of the seduction as proof, could completely turn the situation around and whitewash their reputation.]","The Qin family felt sick hearing the truth! Before, they only thought the couple was shameless, but now they realized they were vicious.","[Wait, isn't Madam Zong blinded by love? How can she bear it? Is she planning to intervene before anything happens?]","The Qin family: Of course! Otherwise, wouldn't that shameless old Zong Chun get what he wants?","[What! She told Zong Chun she would intervene, but she actually plans to drug Zong Chun too, turning the seduction into a real affair, destroying both Yu Rouyin's and Zong Chun's futures. This way, she can permanently keep Zong Chun by her side... Uh... that's quite an imagination.]","The Qin family's minds buzzed, feeling like they had just heard a middle-aged version of a crazy, obsessive forced love story.","[But lady! I don't mind if you want to teach that gold-digging man a lesson, but do it yourself! Why drag an innocent girl into this?!]","The Qin family quickly looked at Ji Fei. What should they do now? Since they know about it, shouldn't they go save Yu Rouyin?"]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Cautious Yu Rouyin","paragraphs":["Ji Fei was visibly uncomfortable, looking as if she wanted to find an excuse to leave.","The Qin family was also nervous, thinking of reasons to follow her.","Suddenly, Qin's Father had an idea. He took out his phone and pretended to exclaim, \"Oh! Qin Xian says a friend's hotel has received some high-quality ingredients and wants us to go out for dinner.\"","Qin's Mom immediately played along, \"Which hotel?\"","\"XX Hotel,\" Qin's Father said while simultaneously texting Qin Xian to corroborate the story.","Ji Fei jolted at the mention of the hotel name.","Qin Yan quickly said, \"That's perfect, we can go there for dinner.\"","Qin Rong nodded in agreement.","Qin Zhao immediately stood up, pulling Qin Xi with him, \"I'll go tell the driver to prepare the car.\"","Only Qin Xi looked around at everyone in confusion.","Ji Fei thought: [What a coincidence!]","The Qin family froze: Was it too obvious?","Ji Fei thought: [It seems even the heavens want us to go save Yu Rouyin!]","The Qin family breathed a sigh of relief and quickly sprang into action.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian, who was handling documents, fell silent upon seeing the text message, then quickly arranged his work to join the family outing.","When the whole family arrived at the hotel in grand fashion, they were thankful it was a private establishment. Otherwise, given Qin Zhao and Ji Fei's current popularity, they might have been recognized even in disguise.","The group dawdled under the waiter's guidance until they heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","[We've arrived just in time. They're still discussing things in the restaurant. The drug has been put in the coffee, but fortunately, it hasn't been drunk yet.]","The Qin family immediately became anxious. If drugs were already involved, things were serious.","They quickly found the nearest private booth based on Ji Fei's thoughts. The restaurant's semi-enclosed booths generally obscured the customers inside unless one walked past.","However, conversations could still be heard if one listened carefully.","The group at the table pretended to play with their phones while waiting for Qin Xian, eerily silent. Ji Fei was so focused on eavesdropping that she didn't notice this oddity.","She was just thinking that if there was any chance of Yu Rouyin drinking the coffee, she would immediately pretend to bump into her and stop her.","From the other side, Yu Rouyin's cool, calm voice could be heard.","\"Madam Zong, you now understand the situation. There's really nothing between your husband and me. The online analyses are true. I won't come out to criticize you publicly. I hope this matter ends here. I've started a new chapter in my life, and I don't want to be entangled with you anymore.\"","[How shameless! Madam Zong threatened Yu Rouyin with continuous future attacks to force her to meet. Otherwise, Yu Rouyin wouldn't have agreed to see her. Yu Rouyin doesn't want to cause trouble for her studio, so she's trying to resolve this herself.]","The Qin family couldn't help but frown. It seemed Yu Rouyin wasn't used to her new status yet. She hadn't realized that as a signed artist of the studio, her management and the studio could handle these mundane issues for her.","Currently, Yu Rouyin was still instinctively fighting alone.","[She's so naive, going in alone. What if something happens...]","The Qin family also shook their heads, disapproving of Yu Rouyin's approach.","\"Huh, women like you exist just to seduce. You're clearly the one who ruined our marriage, and now you're acting all innocent. It's your fault he fell for you. Who told you to be born with such a seductive face and flaunt it around!\"","[She really knows how to hit where it hurts!]","But Yu Rouyin suddenly said, \"I'm not wrong. It's his fault, it's your fault, but it's definitely not my fault!\"","This statement made the eavesdroppers let out a sigh of relief. Well said!","\"You don't think you're wrong at all?\"","\"Someone once told me that being beautiful is a fortunate thing. What's bad is this world. I don't need to reflect on other people's mistakes.\"","\"You... do you know how much we loved each other before you appeared?\"","[Loved each other? The kind of love where he wouldn't sleep with you for half a year under the excuse of filming? Or the kind where he lives off you but still PUA's you, constantly telling you what's wrong with you? Making you feel like you don't deserve his talent? Honey, stop deluding yourself. He never loved you!]","The Qin family was surprised. Was this really how this couple interacted? How could she deceive herself like this?","Yu Rouyin, however, seemed tired of listening to her nonsense. \"That has nothing to do with me. It's between you two. I just hope you stop harassing me.\"","Madam Zong wanted to continue, seemingly endless in her emotional outburst.","By this time, the Qin family had ordered drinks and were whispering to each other. After all, they now knew who they had encountered through the conversation, so there was no need to hide anymore.","[Is Madam Zong always this talkative? She must be stalling for time. Let me see what Zong Chun is up to.]","The Qin family grew curious.","[Damn! Madam Zong had prepared tea in the hotel room beforehand. Zong Chun has already drunk several cups due to nervousness. The drug has taken effect, and he's fallen into a daze.]","The Qin family felt a wave of disbelief.","On the other side, after sending a message and receiving no reply from Zong Chun, Madam Zong gave a cold laugh, immediately stopped talking, and took a sip of coffee.","Usually, when there's a pause in conversation and one person drinks, the other would drink too. But Yu Rouyin didn't.","Madam Zong frowned slightly, then her expression changed to one of sorrow, \"Maybe you're right, it's all our fault... I really...\"","\"It's good that you can understand that. I'm not trying to blame you,\" Yu Rouyin's voice softened.","\"Hehe... we've talked so much, aren't you thirsty, Ms. Yu? Please drink. I specially ordered this for you. It's my favorite flavor, a specialty coffee only available at this hotel.\"","The group next door immediately tensed up.","Ji Fei was about to stand up to greet them, but just as she was halfway up, they heard Yu Rouyin say, \"I'm sorry, but I can't drink it.\"","Ji Fei froze, awkwardly sat back down, and joined the Qin family in listening curiously.","\"What?\" Madam Zong probably hadn't expected this answer either.","Across from her, Yu Rouyin's smile became faint. \"Since I entered society, I've heard many lessons from experience. One of them is to never touch any open drink that hasn't been under my constant visual supervision.\"","This statement was like a sudden enlightenment.","Everyone present exchanged glances. What an impressive lesson, especially for girls. When out, if your food or drink leaves your sight, you must be careful.","For Yu Rouyin, this coffee wasn't ordered by her. It was already on the table when she arrived, so there was no way she would let it enter her mouth.","[Haha, I initially thought Yu Rouyin wasn't cautious enough. But of course, after so many years in the entertainment industry, how could she have reached this point without being sufficiently careful? Looks like I don't need to intervene after all.]","Madam Zong's face was now distorted. \"Ms. Yu, I was just trying to make peace with you. Are you refusing to give me face?\"","[Oh, trying to use status to pressure her? Who cares about your face!]","Ji Fei was worried Yu Rouyin might be in a difficult position and was about to intervene again when they heard Yu Rouyin suddenly ask, \"Is there something in this coffee?\"","With that, the entire place fell silent."]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Should I Not Resist, or Not Resist","paragraphs":["[Oh my god, how does she know?] Ji Fei was truly shocked.","The Qin Family also looked at each other in astonishment.","Madam Zong's expression almost broke for a moment, but she quickly angrily said, \"What are you talking about!\"","Yu Rouyin replied, \"If it really wasn't true, you should be confused, not immediately angered and embarrassed, Madam Zong. You're not an actress, and it's hard to fool a professional actress without superb acting skills. It was already strange that you invited me, and then you gave me something to drink beforehand, insisting I drink it. If I didn't have this level of vigilance, I would have been taken advantage of countless times in the entertainment industry by now.\"","At this point, Madam Zong was really starting to crack.","Yu Rouyin placed her hand on the coffee cup in front of her and said, \"I had hoped to end this peacefully, Madam Zong. But since you're being so vicious, don't blame me.\"","With that, Yu Rouyin took out her phone, about to make a call.","\"Are you going to call the police?\" Madam Zong's voice suddenly became shrill.","Hearing movement from next door, Ji Fei immediately stood up, and the Qin Family followed suit. The surrounding waiters, hearing the commotion, rushed over.","They saw Madam Zong practically lunging to grab the coffee cup.","Yu Rouyin picked up the coffee cup and tried to run, but Madam Zong shoved her hard from behind.","Ji Fei, being the closest, could only manage to catch the falling Yu Rouyin, but the coffee cup slipped out of her hand. The cup, along with the coffee inside, traced a parabolic arc in the air before drenching someone from head to toe.","At this moment, the Qin Family hadn't yet left the semicircular booth and could only stare dumbfounded at the newcomer.","Qin Xian, covered in coffee stains, looked at the scene before him with a frozen expression.","Both Madam Zong and Yu Rouyin were stunned. They both knew Qin Xian's identity and never expected to run into Ji Fei and the Qin Family here.","What a scene this was!","Ji Fei steadied Yu Rouyin and looked at Qin Xian's disheveled appearance. She wanted to laugh but felt it would be inappropriate.","Qin Xian shot her a glance, and Ji Fei quickly grabbed some napkins from the table to haphazardly wipe him, as if she were drying off a wet dog.","Qin Xian didn't resist, allowing Ji Fei to help him.","Madam Zong, having regained her senses and seeing that the coffee was gone, felt a wave of relief. She stepped forward and said, \"Mr. Qin, I apologize. We just had a conflict, and you got caught in the crossfire. I'm truly sorry.\"","Yu Rouyin also came to her senses and quickly apologized, well aware that she was essentially signed to Qin Corporation. After apologizing, she also thanked Ji Fei gently.","However, after speaking, Madam Zong fled in a panic.","Yu Rouyin didn't try to stop her. Her emotions were very stable because she knew that even if she brought it up, Madam Zong would deny it to the death. There was no point in futile arguments.","But she wasn't unprepared. She asked the staff for a copy of the surveillance footage. If Madam Zong tried to cause her trouble again, she would use the video as a warning.","The Qin Family felt quite regretful, looking disappointedly at the fallen coffee cup on the ground. However, after this incident, Madam Zong would likely not dare to mess with Yu Rouyin again.","Qin Zhao, as the boss, reminded her not to act alone in the future and to always bring her manager for any matters.","Yu Rouyin nodded in agreement.","Afterwards, Yu Rouyin bid farewell to everyone and left the hotel safely. As long as she left now, whatever happened here later would have nothing to do with her.","By this time, the hotel manager had rushed over and, showing great perception, invited Qin Xian to the presidential suite upstairs to tidy up.","Although they had managed to stop coffee from dripping from his hair, he couldn't leave looking like this, so he had to go upstairs to wash up.","The Qin Family exchanged glances, immediately wanting to encourage Ji Fei to go along.","But before they could speak, Ji Fei suddenly said, \"I'll go with you.\"","Qin Xian was stunned, looking at Ji Fei.","The Qin Family was delighted. Finally...","[It's the presidential suite, on the same floor. Right now, Zong Chun should be feeling the effects of the drug, and Madam Zong has probably gone to find him. Plus, the paparazzi might try everything to break in. Will they capture something... Haha, what an exciting moment, I want to see!]","The Qin Family: ...It's unexpected, yet somehow predictable.","Well, now they were curious too. They had come to save someone, but now that there was no problem, they could enjoy the drama worry-free.","Qin Xian silently sighed, turned and left, with Ji Fei scurrying after him.","After they left, the Qin Family immediately requested rooms and followed them up.","Upon reaching the room and taking off his clothes, they discovered that Qin Xian's clothes were also stained. Fortunately, he always had spare clothes in his business car, so a quick call to his assistant to bring them up would suffice.","Qin Xian removed his outer garments and went to the bathroom for a quick wash, then came out in a bathrobe to get his new clothes.","However, as soon as he came out, he saw Ji Fei sitting on the soft, large bed, holding his clothes in her arms, staring at him intently.","This scene, no matter how you looked at it, seemed... very delicate. Qin Xian's eyes darkened slightly, unsure if it was the effect of the hotel room's warm lighting or something else... but he felt a flutter in his heart.","Suddenly, Ji Fei turned to look at him, her eyes clear and bright, full of life.","\"What are you doing?\" Qin Xian's voice was inexplicably husky.","Ji Fei suddenly exclaimed excitedly, \"I just thought, can we test these stained clothes for drug effects?\" Ji Fei quickly explained the content of the conversation she had overheard, to avoid suspicion.","Qin Xian: ...","\"I'll have my assistant send them for testing later.\"","Ji Fei nodded, then suddenly stiffened, looking at Qin Xian with confusion.","Qin Xian asked again, \"Is there anything else?\"","Ji Fei quickly shook her head, \"No, are you done washing?\"","Qin Xian was about to nod when he heard Ji Fei's thoughts streaming in.","[Crap, I forgot, did Qin Xian's lips accidentally touch the coffee earlier? If even a tiny bit can be detected for drug effects, will he be affected? His face looks a bit flushed now, is it the drug taking effect, or just from the hot water in the shower?]","Hearing this, Qin Xian was also taken aback. He was about to call someone, and indeed, he might have gotten a little splash...","[What if there are drug effects? Will he suddenly lose control and pounce on me, and then do this and that?]","Qin Xian's cheeks really heated up now. So was that earlier flutter due to the drug?","[If such a restrained, perfect handsome guy takes the initiative, should I not resist, or... not resist...]","Qin Xian's ears burned, his body stiffening as he stole a glance at Ji Fei.","Did she... want it to happen?","[After all, I didn't drug him, I'm the victim here...]","Qin Xian coughed dryly a few times and walked to the bed to get his clothes. He would never do such a thing without clarity.","[Ah, after the divorce in the future, it'll be hard to sleep with someone of this caliber again.]","Qin Xian's movement to grab his clothes froze, and an unfamiliar feeling welled up in his heart. In the past, hearing her talk nonsense like this would have annoyed him or made him helpless, but now it felt like being pricked by a needle, uncomfortable.","[No, no, no, taking advantage of someone is wrong. Calm down, calm down... It's about time, let me check on their situation, to distract myself.]","A dark look flashed in Qin Xian's eyes. His mind heated up, and before she could react, he stood directly in front of her and leaned down."]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: For Uncle's Job","paragraphs":["The overwhelming aura suddenly enveloped Ji Fei, with the masculine pheromones rushing towards her, almost making her body go weak and instinctively lean backwards.","Ji Fei's eyes widened, looking at the approaching Qin Xian in disbelief, her breath catching.","Qin Xian's deep eyes softened, his voice low and filled with cool sexiness: \"Ji Fei...\"","\"What are you doing?!\" Ji Fei exclaimed, reflexively raising her hand to push him away.","Her bathrobe was already open at the collar, allowing Ji Fei's hand to rest directly on Qin Xian's still-damp chest.","Qin Xian couldn't help but feel a surge of sweetness in his heart. As expected, Ji Fei talked tough, but when it came down to it, she immediately retreated into her shell.","He didn't intend to do anything, just... just because of the drug's effects, he suddenly wanted to... kiss her... those panicked eyes, those trembling eyelashes.","[Wait, didn't I just see that the coffee actually wasn't drugged?! Then... then Qin Xian shouldn't be affected by the drug, right? What is he trying to do? Has he suddenly gone mad?]","Qin Xian: ????!!!!","Ji Fei's gaze indeed changed, surprised: \"Qin Xian, you...\"","Qin Xian felt like he was about to bite his tongue in his haste, \"You're... sitting on my clothes.\"","Ji Fei: ...","Qin Xian: ...","Looking down, indeed, a corner of the newly delivered shirt was accidentally sat on by Ji Fei.","Ji Fei gave an awkward smile. Qin Xian stood up, feigning composure, waiting for Ji Fei to move before picking up the clothes.","[Phew, that scared me. I thought... ahem, what a shame. I thought I might get to take advantage of the situation.]","Qin Xian: ... Tough talk.","Ji Fei covered her rapidly beating heart, stealing glances at Qin Xian. Seeing him take the clothes back to the bathroom, she finally let out a sigh of relief.","Remembering the recent gossip, she immediately shifted her attention.","[What's going on? Why wasn't there any drug in Yu Rouyin's coffee? Someone switched the drugged coffee, and now it's Madam Zong who's affected by the drug!]","[What a twist... Then who's with Madam Zong now... Oh God! Ugh~]","[Wait, this isn't incest... no, they're not blood-related... but it's still not right! How dare they!]","Even Qin Xian, who was getting dressed inside, became curious about what was being said.","[Where's Zong Chun? Alone in his room... left to his own devices?]","When Qin Xian came out, he saw Ji Fei crouching at the door, secretly peeking through a crack.","There seemed to be footsteps outside. Qin Xian stood behind Ji Fei.","Ji Fei quickly made a \"shh\" gesture to him.","Qin Xian glanced out and saw someone sneaking around with camera equipment, looking for a room.","They seemed to have locked onto a room, then started acting, pretending to be catching cheaters, shouting and making a commotion. Several guests on the same floor were disturbed and came out.","\"Huh? Why are Mom and Dad all here?\" Ji Fei was surprised and wanted to go out, but Qin Xian held her back.","\"Haven't you noticed Qin Zhao isn't here? You're a celebrity now. If you're accidentally photographed, it could cause trouble.\"","Ji Fei immediately felt dejected.","[I could have gotten first-hand gossip. Oh heavens, oh earth, why do you treat me like this!]","Seeing Ji Fei's pitiful expression, Qin Xian's lips twitched. He turned back, took his black shirt, and draped it over Ji Fei's head, saying, \"Cover your face well. I'll take you out.\"","\"Won't that be more conspicuous?\"","\"It doesn't matter if it's conspicuous, as long as they don't capture your face. My photos usually can't be published anyway.\"","Ji Fei's eyes immediately lit up. She covered herself with the black shirt that still carried Qin Xian's scent, leaving only her eyes visible, then looked at Qin Xian with expectant eyes.","Qin Xian directly put his arm around Ji Fei's shoulders, as if completely shielding her in front of him, and walked out of the door confidently to join the commotion.","When they appeared like this, the Qin Family couldn't help but want to laugh, after all, Qin Xian would never do such playful things.","Qin Xian felt a bit uncomfortable being stared at. On the other side, behind the door, Qin Zhao looked at his second brother and sister-in-law with resentment.","At this point, even if he thought of a plan, it wouldn't work well. With one more person, it would be even more conspicuous.","The people on the same floor didn't pay attention to them, after all, there was a real-life drama of catching cheaters unfolding. Everyone couldn't help but want to get closer to watch.","Before they could gather, the paparazzi burst open the door, and instantly, sounds comparable to a small movie transmitted out.","Before Ji Fei could react, her ears were covered by someone's hands.","Looking at the other Qin Family members, they also quickly covered their ears, but their faces showed surprise and bewilderment.","Their first reaction was, did Zong Chun, who was drugged, find his wife to relieve the drug's effects?","For two middle-aged people to make such a big commotion, it was really... vigorous in their old age.","But the next second, they heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[Zong Siqi is really hungry, he can eat anything?! Not only is there a twenty-year age gap, but she's his aunt!]","Qin Family: ????","Wait, what are you saying? Why do we recognize every word but don't understand?","What Zong Siqi? What aunt?","Aren't Zong Chun and his wife inside?","[No, no, strictly speaking, in their current situation, Madam Zong is drugged, she might not be willing, while Zong Siqi isn't drugged...]","Qin Family: No, no, no, we just let you and Qin Xian have a private date for a while, how did we miss so much information?","When did Madam Zong get drugged? Wasn't she the one who drugged Yu Rouyin?","The Qin Family was so anxious they wanted to scratch their ears and cheeks, wishing they could grab Ji Fei and ask for details. This gossip was too twisted, it had even twisted into a family moral issue.","Along with the noise of the door being smashed open, screams were heard from inside.","They clearly heard Madam Zong's voice and the voice of a younger man.","Then they heard the people who rushed in shouting: \"Oh my God! It's not Yu Rouyin and Zong Chun, it's Madam Zong and Zong Chun's nephew!\"","In an instant, Ji Fei's inner thoughts were completely verified.","The Qin Family all felt uncomfortable. Regardless of their identity, at this moment, they all wanted to shout: Holy shit!","Other curious guests might not recognize them, but hearing those titles made it feel very taboo.","Such a taboo thing, they must take a look! So many people followed the paparazzi inside.","Ji Fei really wanted to go in and take a look, but was afraid it might burn her eyes.","So she stayed at the door, then heard Zong Siqi's angry roar from inside: \"Who are you people? You're invading our privacy, get out!\"","[He's quite the actor, isn't this what you planned? So you've been saving all your acting skills for this?]","The Qin Family didn't go in to watch either, just staying nearby listening to Ji Fei's commentary.","Zong Siqi planned this?!!! What's he after?","[My worldview is truly shattered. He's the one who switched the coffee! When he received Madam Zong, she didn't know she was drugged. She first came to the room next door to find Zong Siqi, asking him to cancel the plan and tell the paparazzi not to come. But Zong Siqi told Madam Zong it couldn't be cancelled. Actually, he secretly told the marketing account to change the room number. That's why the paparazzi targeted this room.]","As they were listening to the cause and effect, a loud slap suddenly came from the room.","\"Are you crazy? How could you...\"","\"...It was clearly Aun... no, Sister Yan, it was clearly you who hugged me first! I wanted to help you, I... I like you, wuwuwu...\"","\"Siqi, you...\"","Qin Family: He's even crying!","Judging from Madam Zong's tone... she actually believed him?!","[This acting, this acting... Your uncle would kneel before you if he were here. To steal your uncle's rice bowl, to skip twenty years of hard work, your acting has reached its peak!!]","At this moment, the door next door suddenly opened, and Zong Chun, pale-faced, stumbled through the crowd and rushed in.","\"What are you doing!\""]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: What the F*** is Tie Guan Yin","paragraphs":["Zong Chun had arrived, making this scene truly spectacular.","At this point, Ji Fei and her group couldn't resist going in to see what was happening.","Inside the room, Zong Siqi and Madam Zong could barely manage to put on their tops, their bodies still buried under the covers, unable to leave the bed.","Meanwhile, Zong Chun stood trembling by the bedside, almost breathless with anger, pointing at them with a face turning green.","\"Honey, I didn't...\" Madam Zong's face was pale, already at a loss for words.","\"Sister Yan...\" Zong Siqi suddenly played the role of a delicate flower, looking pitifully at Madam Zong.","[His posture was very much like: \"Please have mercy on me, sister~\"]","The Qin Family nearly burst out laughing.","Even Qin Xian couldn't help but cough, after all, Zong Siqi was actually quite burly, resembling a gym instructor.","Can you imagine a trainer speaking in a falsetto voice?","In this earth-shattering scene, the paparazzi dropped all pretense and transformed into gold-standard reporters, immediately grabbing Zong Chun to ask: \"Mr. Zong, how did your family of three end up in this particular combination here?\"","[Family of three?! Hahaha, this paparazzi really knows how to ask questions.]","The Qin Family: ...Pff pff pff.","\"Madam Zong, please tell us, between this uncle and nephew, who do you truly love?\"","[Gaga gaga gaga, brilliant!]","At this point, not just the Qin Family, but everyone who heard the paparazzi's questions couldn't help but burst out laughing.","But the paparazzi were professionals, they wouldn't laugh, and would keep asking if they didn't get a response.","\"Is the previous divorce rumor true? Was the reason not Yu Rouyin, but rather your wife's affair with your nephew?\"","\"Mr. Zong, were you too shocked to perform on stage? Did you come here today to catch them in the act?\"","\"Madam Zong, what were you thinking? Having an affair while still joining the Ladies' Club to deal with Yu Rouyin?\"","The reporters' sharp questions left the couple feeling humiliated and angry.","Madam Zong hoped Zong Chun would drive everyone out and close the door to explain, but Zong Chun just glared at them with bloodshot eyes.","[Mr. Zong, don't be such a hypocrite. Weren't you the one who said you didn't love Madam Zong before? So it's okay for you to pursue love, but if your wife gives you a green hat, she's a sinner?]","The Qin Family also realized that Zong Chun's current expression of being betrayed and wronged was quite laughable.","He just felt that Madam Zong was his property, which he could abandon, but couldn't be taken away by someone else.","Zong Chun's heart was indeed in turmoil. He had agreed that once this matter was resolved, they wouldn't divorce and would live happily together. How could she be intimate with his nephew behind his back!","\"You slut!\" Zong Chun finally lost his fake persona. After all, what men can't stand to lose most is dignity and face, and being caught in the act of adultery like this was trampling his face underfoot.","He cursed loudly: \"At your age, how can you be so wanton! If you couldn't bear the loneliness, you could have found a stick! How dare you go after a younger relative, you shameless thing!\"","With Zong Chun's outburst, everyone naturally assumed that Madam Zong had indeed had an affair.","But Madam Zong's face turned pale, looking at Zong Chun in disbelief.","Originally panicked, helpless, and wronged in this situation, she wanted the man she had wholeheartedly devoted herself to stand up and protect her. But instead, she was met with such insults. Madam Zong's composure almost instantly collapsed. Suddenly, she felt that the man before her was repulsive, as if he wasn't the Zong Chun she knew at all.","[Oh my, hasn't Zong Chun realized his position yet? He's currently embroiled in scandal, his reputation in tatters. If he wants to turn things around, he can only rely on Madam Zong. Even if he can't salvage his reputation, living off a rich wife in the future would still be pretty sweet. What on earth is he thinking, cursing his meal ticket like this?]","The Qin Family was also shocked, all feeling that Zong Chun truly lacked self-awareness, having been elevated too high by Madam Zong, becoming increasingly foolish.","In their marital relationship, the one with the power to choose had always been Madam Zong, not Zong Chun, after all, everything Zong Chun had now was given by Madam Zong.","Ji Fei couldn't help but enjoy the show, inwardly mocking, [Oh Zong, you fool! If you want an easy life, what's wrong with wearing a bit of green on your head? At a time like this, you should be swallowing your pride, not putting on such airs. Are you really not afraid your nephew will steal your wife?]","The Qin Family held back their laughter, truly living up to the name of Master Ji, the queen of sarcasm.","[But then again, if Madam Zong's love-addled brain isn't clear...]","\"Zong Chun, shut up!\" Madam Zong shouted tearfully in anger.","Zong Chun was stunned, unable to believe that Madam Zong dared to tell him to shut up in public.","[Oh ho, is she about to awaken? Is a dog-eat-dog drama about to unfold?]","The Qin Family couldn't help but crane their necks to watch, anticipating a good show.","But surprisingly, the first to speak up was Zong Siqi.","\"Uncle, how can you speak to Sister Yan like that? This was an accident! Besides, you were the one who fell out of love first and wanted to divorce Sister Yan...\" At this point, Zong Siqi seemed to suddenly wake up, as if he had said something wrong, and looked helplessly at Madam Zong.","[Who said he was a newcomer who joined halfway? If Sister Pei saw this acting, she'd definitely want to sign him! This rough guy from the gym has perfectly portrayed a delicate, helpless green tea bitch. This is some iron goddess of mercy level acting!]","The Qin Family: They didn't want to laugh initially, but now they could hardly hold it back.","Fortunately, the room was very noisy, otherwise their laughter would probably have affected professional actor Zong Siqi's performance.","However, the tea lovers in the Qin Family decided not to drink Tieguanyin tea anymore.","They were afraid that while drinking, they might suddenly think of this iron man green tea and burst out laughing.","Because of the slip of the tongue, the previous gossip was instantly verified.","The paparazzi immediately bombarded Zong Chun with questions.","Zong Chun's expression was almost distorted as he rushed forward and grabbed Zong Siqi's collar, trying to drag him out.","\"It was you! You planned all this, you did it on purpose!\"","But such tugging would inevitably move the blanket, so Madam Zong naturally instinctively tried to protect the blanket while also trying to break up the fight.","However, in Zong Chun's eyes, this looked like she was protecting the younger man.","Zong Chun immediately slapped her, \"You fool, you're still helping him? He set us up as a couple! Do you think he really cares about an old woman like you? He's after your money and your status. His whole family are leeches. They used to live off me, and now they just want to replace me. How much true feeling could he possibly have for you!\"","[Digging his own grave, Zong Chun is number one. Madam Zong's expression towards him was clearly off, yet he still dared to raise his hand and mock her. He's truly a brave warrior.]","The Qin Family could also see that the tears in Madam Zong's eyes were long gone, replaced by a gradually growing coldness.","\"Uncle, just because you don't cherish Sister Yan doesn't mean others won't. For a long time, Sister Yan has been very kind to me. No one has ever treated me so well. What's unreasonable about me falling for her? Sister Yan has so many good qualities, she's so excellent. You can't see it yourself, but do you think everyone else is blind?\"","Zong Siqi spoke with sincerity.","He almost convinced the onlookers.","And the contrast between the put-down and the praise was really stark.","\"You... you little beast, you had an affair with your uncle's wife, doing such an outrageous thing, do you think you still have a future?\" Zong Chun finished and then shouted at Madam Zong: \"Get up now, and let's call the police to arrest this little beast together!\"","\"Sister Yan!\" Zong Siqi seemed frightened and quickly called out to Madam Zong.","Madam Zong suddenly spoke up: \"You've already given me the divorce papers, so how can this be considered an affair with Siqi!\""]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Real Men Don't Last More Than Two Minutes","paragraphs":["Zong Siqi's eyes lit up, and he immediately said, \"You two have been sleeping in separate beds for over a year, so there's no moral issue with Yan and me being together. It's just that some formalities haven't been completed yet.\"","Zong Chun stood frozen in place as if struck by lightning, looking at Madam Zong in disbelief, his body swaying slightly.","It seemed he was severely shocked by Madam Zong's sudden cold and heartless reaction.","[Oh my, Madam Zong has made her choice, deciding to side with Zong Siqi against Zong Chun!]","The Qin Family was also quite surprised, given Madam Zong's previous reactions, they thought her love-addled brain wouldn't recover so easily.","The paparazzi immediately began questioning Zong Chun about the divorce, and Zong Chun, still in a daze, finally realized the precariousness of his situation.","After his expression changed several times, Zong Chun managed to forcefully regain his usual cultured and refined demeanor, though it appeared somewhat stiff.","Suppressing his anger and putting aside his pride, he spoke, \"My dear, the talk of divorce was just a momentary impulse. Do you really want to break up with me for this little beast? I can forgive you this one mistake. After all, we've been married for many years, and I can endure a bit more for your sake. I still want to continue our life together. Now you choose - do you believe me, or this little beast who's trying to manipulate you!\"","Zong Chun still knew how to push Madam Zong's buttons. After he finished speaking, Madam Zong froze, as if recalling something. In her heart, it was still difficult to let go of so many years of affection, especially considering how much Zong Chun had endured for her when he loved her.","[It's over... how boring.]","Suddenly, Qin Xian whispered in Ji Fei's ear, \"He seems to be implying something. What does he mean by 'endure a bit more' for her?\"","Ji Fei was startled and immediately began investigating curiously.","The other members of the Qin Family who overheard Qin Xian's words couldn't help but become curious as well.","[My God! At this moment, I actually feel a bit sorry for Madam Zong. The most hateful people can sometimes be the most pitiful. Although their sins can't be forgiven, Zong Chun, you really deserve to die!]","The Qin Family members all widened their eyes in surprise.","What's going on?","For Ji Fei to react like this, it must be big news.","What could it be?","But before Ji Fei could reveal the mystery, Zong Siqi had already assumed a righteous expression and spoke up, \"Uncle, you can't be so shameless. Even at this point, you still want to emotionally blackmail Yan and trick her into coming back to you?\"","Zong Chun's face changed, looking at Zong Siqi in disbelief.","Before he could stop him, Zong Siqi had already taken Madam Zong's hand and said, \"I'm sorry, Yan. I only found out about this recently. The one who can't have children isn't you, it's him! Yan, think about it. My uncle only lasts a minute or two each time, how could he possibly get you pregnant? You thought he was truly abstinent and didn't enjoy marital relations? It's because he can't perform! When he saw Yu Rouyin, he felt like he could do it again, so he was desperate to prove he was a real man!\"","Thunder rolled in the sky~","The paparazzi were so shocked they began checking their recording devices, afraid they might have missed this explosive moment.","Other onlookers' faces showed a variety of expressions upon hearing this, and they all turned to look at Zong Chun.","That man who had played so many leading roles in dramas actually... only lasted a minute or two!","How had Madam Zong endured this for so many years? And she even suspected herself of having problems?","\"How... is that possible?\" Madam Zong stared blankly at Zong Siqi, her voice trembling, clearly shaken by this revelation.","Zong Siqi leaned close to Madam Zong's ear and whispered something, causing her face to flush red, then turn pale.","Finally, her eyes, gradually turning bloodshot, fixed on Zong Chun.","Everyone was curious about what was said.","Only the Qin Family knew.","[Zong Siqi told Madam Zong to compare the difference between uncle and nephew, so she'd realize she had never experienced true pleasure in her marital relationship. But because she fell in love with Zong Chun when she was young and inexperienced, she had been psychologically manipulated for half her life. She looked up to her husband so much that she never dared to discuss this with anyone else. So she had no idea that it wasn't supposed to be like that with other men.]","[The two of them had never been able to conceive, but they could never find the problem. Since there had been cases of infertility among women in Madam Zong's family, she always suspected it was her issue, and never thought to check Zong Chun's medical reports.]","[Whenever the topic of them going for treatment together came up, Zong Chun would always act nonchalant, then use sweet words to placate her, until she reached an age where it became difficult to conceive. All this time, she carried the guilt of not being able to give her husband a child.]","[Zong Chun was actually manipulating this point, which is why he was so bold in pursuing Yu Rouyin and pushing for divorce. He believed that even if they divorced, Madam Zong would psychologically never be able to leave him. He's truly cunning and vicious!]","After hearing this, even the Qin Family couldn't help but look at Zong Chun with contempt. He really was a scumbag.","[Tsk tsk tsk, no wonder he recovered so quickly and came looking for her even after being drugged. It turns out he's impotent. The logic checks out.]","The Qin Family also realized this and couldn't help but find it amusing.","By now, Zong Chun had turned pale, seemingly overwhelmed by the situation before him.","\"You... you won't believe him, will you?\" Zong Chun refused to give up until the bitter end.","At this moment, Madam Zong's face was like that of a demon, \"Fine, let's go to the hospital for a check-up. If you've lied to me, Zong Chun, I swear, I'll make you pay the price!\"","\"You... have you gone mad? How can you not trust me like this? This is an insult to me. If you insist on doing this, let's get divorced. Even if my innocence is proven, I will never forgive you.\"","At this point, Zong Chun was still trying to intimidate Madam Zong, pretending to be unyielding in an attempt to scare her out of her idea.","\"Get this straight, you're the one who's cheating now. I've never been physically unfaithful!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, before Zong Chun could claim the moral high ground, a voice floated out from the crowd.","\"Never been unfaithful... isn't that because you knew you couldn't perform and were afraid other women would find out and expose you?\"","No one turned to see who said it, but everyone felt it made perfect sense.","Qin Xian looked down helplessly at Ji Fei, thinking she really wasn't afraid of being discovered by the paparazzi.","Ji Fei also looked up at Qin Xian, her visible eyes blinking innocently.","[I couldn't help it, I accidentally spoke my mind. I just figured out why a scoundrel like Zong Chun had never really made a move on Yu Rouyin before. It made Yu Rouyin think Zong Chun was truly noble and virtuous, a senior who didn't have ulterior motives or look at her with colored glasses. But actually, Zong Chun didn't dare expose his condition. He wanted to get married first and then try, because he thought that once married, his wife would be his property and wouldn't be able to expose his situation.]","Upon hearing Ji Fei's mutterings, the Qin Family also realized this made sense. Indeed, thinking this way was logical and reasonable.","Due to Ji Fei's eye-opening comment, Madam Zong angrily exclaimed, \"We must get checked!\"","\"Crazy... crazy woman, you're not thinking straight. I can't be bothered with you!\" Zong Chun said as he turned to leave. But before walking away, he snarled at the paparazzi, \"He's slandering me. I'll sue him for defamation!\"","Ah, this... Protesting too much?","Even the paparazzi felt sympathy for this stubborn man.","[One impulsive act of catching a cheater in the act has led to a lifetime of shame. Oh Zong, oh Zong, I light a candle for you.]","At this moment, Zong Chun happened to pass by the Qin Family. Although they desperately wanted to laugh, the Qin Family members pinched themselves to hold back their amusement.","The hotel staff finally arrived belatedly to disperse the crowd. Ji Fei suspected they had been watching the drama unfold on the security cameras before coming so late.","The onlookers, not expecting such a twist in the cheating drama, returned to their rooms with satisfied smiles on their faces.","Ji Fei and the Qin Family also went back, waiting until the paparazzi were chased away before leaving together.","When they got downstairs, they found everyone in the lobby, guests and staff alike, huddled together whispering and looking at their phones. The news had probably broken on Weibo.","Ji Fei's group couldn't resist checking their phones as well.","Sure enough, in this short time, their hashtags were trending.","#ZongChunRealManUnderTwoMinutes#","#ZongChunGaslightingWife#","#UncleAndNephewShareOneWife?MoralDecayOr...#","#LovingHusbandImageShattered,ModelCoupleFinallyCracksGoingToCheckInfertilityTruth#","#The Stubborn Man#","#Nephew Determined to Replace His Uncle#","#Who Could Be As Unlucky As Yu Rouyin?#"]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: I Think Their Tolerance Is Quite Strong","paragraphs":["The hotel adultery drama had been trending on Weibo for two whole days, as it was full of juicy details that never got old.","Previously disgraced cheating men seemed pitiful, but compared to Zong Chun now, they didn't seem so unfortunate anymore. After all, they only ruined their reputation, while Zong Chun not only destroyed his name but also had a physical disability, wore a green hat (was cuckolded), and had his wife stolen...","[In a word, miserable~]","In the Qin family living room, the whole family was gathered together. Except for little Qin Xi, everyone else had developed a new family habit of gossiping over tea and meals. Chatting daily left them feeling refreshed and energized.","Even Qin Xian would occasionally join in when he got off work early.","Hearing Ji Fei's schadenfreude and sarcastic comment about Zong Chun's misery, Qin Xian's lips curled into a smile, and others laughed as well.","It seemed... ever since Ji Fei had changed, the whole family spent more time laughing together.","\"I just saw the latest news, Mrs. Zong has officially announced the divorce and will be sending Zong Chun a lawyer's letter to sue him,\" Qin Rong excitedly reported. \"Zong Chun has already been kicked out of the house.\"","\"Looks like the truth has come out,\" Qin's Mom said. \"She must be furious enough not to care about her reputation anymore.\"","Qin's Father added, \"Zong Chun will not only leave empty-handed but probably have to pay compensation too. He's truly failed in both career and family now.\"","\"Paparazzi have caught Zong Siqi living in Mrs. Zong's villa,\" Qin Zhao said incredulously. \"I can't believe he actually succeeded in taking over. Is Mrs. Zong still... Mrs. Zong?\"","Everyone burst out laughing.","Qin Yan shook her head, \"After being hurt so badly by a man, how can she still trust men?\"","\"Maybe she doesn't trust, but she wants to enjoy life now. After all, she has money... It's just a shame that what they did to Yu Rouyin will be left unresolved,\" Ji Fei said regretfully.","Everyone felt it was a pity. They had thought that perhaps drug traces could be detected from the coffee stains on the clothes, but it turned out there were no drugs in the coffee to begin with. The person who was supposed to drug someone ended up being the victim instead. What else could be said?","Qin Xian suddenly spoke up, \"Mrs. Zong's cousin complained at the company that her family on both sides are planning to remove her from the family registry because of the scandals she caused online affecting their family businesses. Since she doesn't work herself, in the future... I'm afraid she won't have much money to squander.\"","Mrs. Zong's cousin was that director at Qin Corporation, so what he said must be true gossip.","However, the Qin family members all looked at Qin Xian in astonishment. Who could have imagined that the man who was always so serious as the boss at the company would actually listen to someone's private complaints and bring the news back to gossip with them?","This was... so unlike 'Qin Xian'.","But when they turned to see Ji Fei's eyes light up upon hearing this news, even reaching out to tug at Qin Xian's arm... the Qin family members instantly gave Qin Xian knowing looks.","So, was this some new way of pleasing his wife?","In the past, Qin's parents had been quite hopeless about the couple's relationship, but now they found ways to enjoy their sweet moments every day.","\"Really?\" Ji Fei asked with great interest written all over her face.","Qin Xian nodded and explained in detail.","Ji Fei laughed outright. \"The bad things you do will always come back to bite you in some way.\"","One could imagine what would happen in the future when Mrs. Zong had no money. And what about Zong Siqi? He had already burned all his career bridges with this expose, seducing his aunt and becoming infamous. What kind of future could he possibly have?","\"Teacher Yu has finally seen the light at the end of the tunnel. No one will try to harm her anymore,\" Qin Rong said happily.","Everyone smiled.","But Qin Yan suddenly remembered something and asked, \"Oh right, Fei Fei, Third Brother, how will your show continue now?\"","Ji Fei had never cared about these things. Work was something to be delayed if possible, ignored if feasible. Being asked this question, she also looked towards Qin Zhao.","\"Yu Rouyin and Zong Chun's group is definitely out,\" Qin Zhao said.","Ji Fei could already imagine that her reputation must be quite precarious now, no wonder her private messages had increased lately.","Qin Zhao continued, \"Yu Rouyin is still our studio's artist, so she'll continue as a supporting performer on our stage.\"","Ji Fei raised her hand and said, \"Actually, I can quit, and let Yu Rouyin perform on stage with you. Didn't Sister Pei want to cultivate her properly?\"","But Qin Zhao replied, \"Do you want to see the director and producer hanging themselves outside your door in the middle of the night?\"","The whole family burst out laughing.","Ji Fei said innocently, \"I thought their endurance was quite strong.\"","Qin Zhao explained, \"The previous groups disappeared because the show didn't dare use them anymore, fearing public condemnation. They were willing to quit, so naturally their contracts were terminated. But you don't have any problems, so if you want to quit, you'll have to pay a penalty for breach of contract.\"","\"Pay money?!\"","The whole family looked at Ji Fei with amusement and exasperation.","Qin Xian, however, said directly to Ji Fei, \"If you really don't want to participate, I'll pay the penalty fee.\"","Ji Fei: \"Never mind, I'll participate after all.\"","[Pay money! No matter whose money it is, that's absolutely unacceptable! It's even more painful than not making money!]","Qin Zhao said wearily, \"There's only one episode left, just participate casually and it'll be over. We were in the spotlight too much before, so ending quietly is fine too. If any more problems arise, I suspect even Nitroglycerin pills won't be enough for the director and producers.\"","Clearly, the director and producers had complained quite a bit, both explicitly and implicitly.","\"Only one episode left?\" Ji Fei asked, puzzled. They had originally signed for a whole season.","\"Yes, there are only two teams left, and they can't come up with any more competition formats. No one dares to come as a guest on the show anymore, so the director and producers have given up and announced that the next episode will be the last one. The empty time slots will be given to other shows,\" Qin Zhao explained.","Ji Fei immediately smiled.","[One of life's joys is getting paid the same amount for less work time.]","\"So that means only your group will be doing the round-robin competition,\" Qin's Father said with a laugh. \"Looks like Fei Fei will be testing every combination.\"","Qin's Mom said, \"I'm quite familiar with the last group. When I was young, I loved Lu Fei's dramas. She's a national treasure-level actress, who hasn't seen her dramas all over the streets? And she's paired with Sun Man, her son's ex-girlfriend, right? I wonder how they'll get along?\"","\"Actually, there were people online betting that the former mother-in-law and daughter-in-law group would definitely forfeit the competition,\" Qin Rong said.","Qin Yan: \"If they forfeit, it would prove they're afraid to face Fei Fei and Third Brother. The netizens probably wouldn't let them off the hook.\"","Qin Zhao nodded and said, \"The producer has talked to them, and they didn't express any intention to quit. Gao Hao and Pei Mingxuan also said they don't have any major issues. Besides, Teacher Lu has some official background, so she should be able to restrain herself well, except for her criticized 'evil mother-in-law' image.\"","\"I've read reports before that she became a widow at a young age and has always relied on her son,\" Qin's Mom said.","\"So her son is a mama's boy? And the mother always interferes with her son's girlfriends?\" Qin Yan asked.","Qin Zhao said, \"That's what they say in the industry.\"","[...You could say that, I suppose.]","Everyone was stunned. This obviously hesitant tone, along with those omitted ellipses, proved that completely different information was hidden beneath the surface."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Qin Ma is Not to Be Trifled With","paragraphs":["[The reason for her interference was that her son's previous girlfriends all had various problems. She would use her connections to investigate and quickly uncover everything, worried that her son would be led astray. So she would force her son to break up, and her son, who had grown up under his strict mother's control, naturally didn't dare to defy her.]","Qin Family: Loving one's child is understandable, but calling her an 'evil mother-in-law' is going too far. After all, she's not just driving people away based on her own preferences, but because she's actually uncovered issues.","[However... her son doesn't need to be led astray. A bad seed will naturally turn bad as it grows. Fortunately, Sun Man doesn't have a love-addled brain and escaped quickly, otherwise I might have really been unable to resist meddling with another couple.]","Qin Family: A bad seed? That mama's boy?","Qin Rong was particularly shocked, after all, she had once shipped those two!","Teacher Lu's son is called Lang Zhe, a rapper with few listenable songs, but who gained quite a bit of fame due to his mother and an ex-girlfriend. Adding to that his inheritance of his mother's good genes, he's truly good-looking, with a bunch of blind fangirls.","When Sun Man was with Lang Zhe, paparazzi caught many scenes of their loving interactions, and for a time, the two were so sweet that netizens were screaming with delight.","Especially after one of Lang Zhe's performances, when he rushed off stage to lift Sun Man and spin her around. It seemed Sun Man had originally been unable to make it but managed to come after all, making him very excited. Regardless of the setting, he hugged her and called her \"sister,\" acting coquettishly.","At that time, netizens joked that Lang Zhe was lucky, spoiled by his mother at home and by his wife outside.","Judging from Sun Man's expressions captured at the time, she also seemed very invested in the relationship.","Moreover, Lang Zhe didn't have any negative rumors exposed online.","Even Qin Zhao, an insider in the industry, hadn't heard much, only knowing that Lang Zhe's music was just for his own amusement, not making much money, and that his basic living expenses were mostly covered by his family, possibly even relying on his girlfriend at times. While this might be embarrassing, it doesn't rise to the level of being a \"bad seed.\"","Moreover, when Sun Man broke up with him, she never exposed any bad things about her ex-boyfriend, only saying they broke up due to incompatible personalities. So outsiders were also unclear about the reason for their breakup.","The Qin Family's curiosity was piqued, very interested in knowing how Lang Zhe had turned bad.","But Ji Fei had lost interest in their affairs since Sun Man had completely dumped the scumbag.","Just then, Qin's Mom's phone suddenly rang. When she saw the caller's name, her expression became somewhat peculiar.","Qin's Father glanced at it and immediately frowned.","After answering, Qin's Mom gave a cool greeting and then immediately furrowed her brow, saying, \"What? You're coming to visit right away?\"","Everyone was startled to hear this. It was already evening, who would suddenly come visiting? It seemed a bit impolite.","But soon, Qin's Mom glanced at Qin Zhao and Ji Fei in surprise, saying, \"You want to see Qin Zhao and Ji Fei? To discuss the next episode of the show?\"","Qin's Mom covered the phone and indicated with her eyes that if they didn't want to meet, she would find an excuse to refuse.","But at this moment, Qin's Father suddenly said, \"Your childhood playmate? Let her come!\"","The atmosphere among the Qin Family immediately changed, as if a battle was about to begin. After the phone call ended, everyone except Ji Fei started bustling about.","Qin Yan and Qin Rong pulled Qin's Mom to the makeup room. There wasn't time to call the makeup team, but fortunately, Qin Rong studied painting and had impeccable aesthetics.","Qin's Father and Qin Zhao started searching for the family's collection of jewelry and valuables.","Finally, Qin Xian also got up to find the butler and housekeeper to arrange for receiving the guest.","Ji Fei only then belatedly dug up some information from the depths of her memory.","Due to their families' long-standing relationship, Qin's Mom had a childhood playmate she had known for many years. Qin's Mom was beautiful and accomplished, so she had always been the target of the other's jealousy. Every time they met, there would be a round of comparisons, and if given the chance, nothing good would come out of her mouth, finding various opportunities to mock.","Qin's Mom wasn't the type to enjoy fighting, so she would often be very upset but couldn't teach the other a lesson because their families were old friends. She could only try to calm herself down and not stoop to the other's level.","The Qin Family had always been low-key, and their attire when going out didn't reveal that they were super wealthy, so they were often caught off guard by the other party's mockery about jewelry and handbags.","The other family members had encountered this a few times and were all holding back their anger.","As the Qin Family became more and more successful, the other party basically stopped appearing before Qin's Mom.","Unexpectedly, this time she was coming on her own initiative, so they must support Qin's Mom. That's why everyone became so active.","Usually, Qin's Mom was very good to Ji Fei, so Ji Fei also wanted to help, but there seemed to be nothing left for her to do, so she could only obediently keep them company.","However, Qin's Mom felt uncomfortable with all the arrangements, \"There's no need, I've never bothered with her before. That kind of low-level comparison is meaningless. Don't I know better than anyone how well I'm living?\"","Looking at her whole family busying themselves for her, how could she possibly be proven to be living worse than others by that kind of comparison?","She was happy.","But the rest of the Qin Family wouldn't have it, insisting on fighting for her honor.","Looking at the auction house collectibles and jewelry placed before her, with everyone trying to make her wear it all, she finally couldn't take it anymore.","At Qin's Mom's insistence, she only chose to wear a jadeite necklace of imperial green, sitting elegantly in the living room, both low-key and luxurious.","Seeing everyone sitting around eagerly, Qin's Mom couldn't help but say, \"What you should be thinking about now is why she's coming? How did it get connected to Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's show?\"","Only then did everyone react, oh yes, what was she coming for?","Soon, the sound of a car was heard, and the butler quickly led in a wealthy-looking woman.","As soon as she entered, they saw the huge pearl necklace wrapped three times around her neck.","She had indeed come prepared. Even Ji Fei, who wasn't sensitive to jewelry, had seen a video about this pearl necklace. It was said to have been auctioned for a sky-high price of 100 million at the last auction.","This time, Qin's Mom's jewelry was slightly inferior.","The Qin Family immediately felt regretful, blaming themselves for not habitually participating in such luxury goods auctions. After all, they truly weren't interested, preferring to do their own things as a family.","\"Long time no see.\" When greeting, the other party obviously looked at Qin's Mom's necklace, the corners of her mouth curling up to the sky, clearly very pleased with herself.","Qin's Mom stood up, still graceful and proper. Sensing the disappointment of her family around her, Qin's Mom smiled and said, \"Oh yes, this is the first time we've met since your divorce. Wow, your pearl necklace is really beautiful, did you get it in the divorce settlement?\"","The guest's expression twisted.","The Qin Family looked at Qin's Mom in astonishment.","Ji Fei: [Who said my Qin's Mom couldn't win in a fight! One sentence for the kill!]","Although very angry, the guest still sat down.","Ji Fei also gradually recalled her name, and when matched with the face before her, she could immediately gossip.","Suddenly, Ji Fei discovered the key point.","[Damn? What kind of fate does Lang Zhe have, to actually be her godson! Relying on women his whole life.]","Everyone was shocked, there was actually this kind of relationship?","They saw the other party had already regained her composure, smiling as she touched the pearl necklace on her neck, habitually showing off, then said: \"By the way, I came this time for my godson Lang Zhe's matter. I hope that in your next competition, you can find a way to make Sun Man get out of the entertainment industry!\"","[...The last person who made a similar request...]"]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: Treating a Foster Son as a Beloved Son","paragraphs":["After Peng Li finished speaking, she waited for the Qin family to respond. However, when no one reacted for a long time, Peng Li's hand froze as she touched her necklace, and she looked around at everyone in confusion.","She saw that everyone was looking at her with subtle expressions.","\"What does this mean? You're not even willing to help with this small favor?\" Peng Li looked at Qin's Mom with displeasure, as if Qin's Mom was being unreasonable.","Qin's Mom replied wearily, \"Haven't you been on the internet? The last person who wanted someone else to leave the entertainment industry has already been disowned by their family.\"","Qin's Father also said with a half-smile, \"Besides, they've also approached our daughter-in-law before, and the result was...\"","The others looked at Ji Fei with amusement, while Ji Fei looked innocent.","Peng Li immediately justified herself, \"How can that be the same? Just based on our years of acquaintance, shouldn't your younger generation show some respect to me as an elder?\"","The Qin family members all disliked Peng Li's tone of voice.","Ji Fei couldn't help but mock internally: [Show you respect? Have you ever given the Qin family's younger generation New Year's money or something? Why should they show you respect?]","She had no idea why Ji Fei's train of thought would lead to New Year's money!","But... it seemed to make a lot of sense.","Qin Zhao indicated that he hadn't even received 100 yuan, so how could she be considered an elder? And she still wanted him to help her with something? What a joke!","Seeing that there was still no response after she spoke, Peng Li became somewhat angry.","\"Hou Lan, do you believe I'll tell your parents that you're not even willing to help me with this small favor?\"","The younger generation of the Qin family was truly shocked by an elder who would still threaten to tattle to their parents.","Qin's Mom, who was already used to this, said, \"Our Qin family has never bullied others with our power. Moreover, this concerns my Fei Fei's future reputation in the entertainment industry. Unless she doesn't care, once she gets involved, she will inevitably become the judge of the entertainment industry, making fair judgments without favoritism.\"","Ji Fei was suddenly enveloped by a sense of embarrassment from the chuunibyou-like atmosphere.","[Qin's Mom has really been poisoned by the internet, saying things that make people so embarrassed!]","Qin's Mom ignored Ji Fei's mockery and still looked proud.","The other members of the Qin family could barely contain their laughter.","\"You!\" Peng Li probably didn't expect that for such a small matter, Qin's Mom would be so unaccommodating. However, she quickly recovered.","\"What do you mean by bullying others with power? I never thought that way. I just came to tell you that Sun Man has character issues, to remind your so-called judge to deal with her properly in the next round. Don't let her slip through, lest she continues to mislead my godson!\"","The Qin family knew that Peng Li had a godson, but they were too lazy to pay attention to her affairs, so they had never been clear about who her godson was. They only knew that her doting on her godson was a famous joke.","It could be said that a large part of the reason for her divorce was because of her godson.","Peng Li actually had a daughter with her ex-husband, but gradually her in-laws discovered that Peng Li didn't care for her own daughter at all and wasn't close to her. Instead, she treated her godson like a treasure, spoiling and indulging him. If it weren't for the lack of blood relation, it would definitely raise suspicions.","However, precisely because there was no problem with blood relations, this unfair treatment was truly disheartening. Finally, after Peng Li repeatedly neglected her own daughter, causing her daughter to develop serious psychological issues, her in-laws firmly decided to divorce. Even finding a loveless stepmother would be better than this biological mother!","After the divorce, the daughter was given custody to the father, and they almost cut off all contact. It wasn't that the other family was heartless, but that Peng Li truly didn't like her daughter and never thought about contacting her.","Someone had asked her why.","Her answer was that she had dreamed that her daughter was her enemy in a past life, born to snatch everything from her, and would cause her to lose her reputation and end up in prison.","This bizarre argument wasn't completely mocked, because rich people sometimes really believe in strange things.","And now, for the sake of a godson, she specially came to ask for help from Qin's Mom, whom she disliked. It really seemed that her godson was more important than her own daughter.","This truly made the entire Qin family curious about how she came to accept Lang Zhe as her godson.","Ji Fei was also curious, so she started to dig into the gossip.","Peng Li was rattling off various methods to encourage them to deal with Sun Man, as if she were Lang Zhe's biological mother, playing the role of the evil mother-in-law who disliked her son's partner.","Meanwhile, the Qin family members were distracted because Ji Fei had started to mutter to herself.","[Ah... I see, Peng Li used to be a fangirl, she was a dream girl of Lang Shidi, Lang Zhe's father.]","Having recently been consuming a lot of gossip, the Qin family members were not unfamiliar with some terms and instantly understood what it meant.","So this was a case of loving the house and its crow?","[Because Lang Shidi and Teacher Lu had been together for a long time, even though Peng Li used her wealth to pursue Lang Shidi frantically, she was still firmly rejected by him. Moreover, they weren't afraid of Peng Li. Although Peng Li was a wealthy heiress, they had military background, so Peng Li didn't dare to go too far. She could only regretfully withdraw. However, when Lang Zhe was six or seven years old, Lang Shidi passed away. Peng Li was very sad and insisted on looking after Lang Zhe together with Teacher Lu, forcibly accepting him as her godson, and from then on, she treated him as if he were her own son.]","The Qin family members really didn't know how to respond to this.","And Ji Fei was still continuing.","[I'm just laughing, it turns out Peng Li suddenly finding the Qin family was out of anger. I was wondering why this visit was so abrupt.]","The Qin family members immediately became curious. Anger? What was she angry about?","[I'm just saying, even Lang Zhe's biological mother, Teacher Lu, after interacting with Sun Man, thought Sun Man was not bad. But you, as a godmother, are opposing it. After Lang Zhe also expressed his desire to reconcile with Sun Man, you actually got angry and came here, wanting to interfere from our side to stop Lang Zhe? I just want to say it's really unnecessary. Sun Man doesn't want to step into that fire pit at all.]","The Qin family members were somewhat surprised. They didn't expect that in the eyes of netizens, the \"evil mother-in-law\" didn't give Sun Man a hard time as everyone had predicted, but instead was quite satisfied after interacting with her. It seems she's also a fair person.","Unfortunately, Teacher Lu didn't know that her son was a bad seed, but Sun Man knew, so her approval was useless.","As for this Peng Li, she really treated him like her own son, even interfering with his relationships. Was she trying to control the child's life?","But then again, how exactly did Lang Zhe go bad? His own mother didn't know, and his godmother didn't seem to know either. What exactly did Sun Man see through that made her choose to break up?","By this time, Peng Li had finished speaking, her mouth dry. Seeing everyone looking distracted, she suddenly became angry, \"Are you even listening to what I'm saying?\"","Everyone perfunctorily indicated that they were listening. If it weren't for the fact that this gossip was related to Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's next competition, they wouldn't even bother entertaining guests.","Everyone's expressions made Peng Li feel choked up. If it weren't for her precious son, she wouldn't have come here to suffer this indignity!","It was all Lu Fei's fault. In the past, with other girls, Lu Fei would have found problems and driven them away without her having to intervene, not letting Lang Zhe be led astray. Why couldn't she see the problems with Sun Man?","If she hadn't promised Lang Zhe to keep that matter a secret, she would have reported Sun Man to the police back then."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: Hard to Guard Against Household Thieves, Day and Night","paragraphs":["Seeing Peng Li's indignation, Qin's Mom directly asked, \"You say Sun Man has character issues, but what exactly are those issues?\"","Peng Li paused for a moment, then said, \"Wasn't there a rumor that she evaded taxes?\"","Qin's Mom was speechless, \"You really don't go online, do you? If a celebrity actually evaded taxes, they basically wouldn't be able to work in the industry anymore. The fact that she's still active in the entertainment circle proves she's clean.\"","\"How is that possible! I think I heard Lang Zhe say she even paid back taxes!\"","Qin Zhao directly replied, \"That was something her family workshop studio did behind her back. As soon as she found out through self-inspection, she dealt with it immediately.\"","This news had been officially reported online, so Sun Man was definitely clear in this regard. She even took the lead in celebrity self-inspection, unlike some stars who were truly reluctant to pay back taxes.","[That's right, Sun Man has really had it tough. I think the reason she was so easily deceived by Lang Zhe's love was because of her unfortunate family background. Her studio was previously completely controlled by her mother and uncle, who often conducted illegal operations behind her back, causing her great suffering. They disregarded her hard work and desperately accepted jobs for her to make money.]","[Even Gao Hao has said that Sun Man was severely exploited. If she hadn't been dragged down by her relatives, her talent might have been better developed. And just when she finally got a boyfriend, she almost got pulled into a deep pit again.]","The Qin family nearly coughed up blood hearing this. What kind of deep pit was it? Why did it always stop at the crucial point!","Peng Li, having her reason refuted, could only say, \"Anyway, there's something wrong with her.\"","Qin's Mom impatiently said, \"You just simply don't like her, do you?\"","Some mothers-in-law just don't like their daughters-in-law, as if their sons have been stolen from them. On this point, Lu Fei wasn't like that, but Peng Li was seriously ill with it.","Peng Li's expression immediately turned ugly. Her hand unconsciously touched the necklace on her neck, and she finally spoke, \"It's really troublesome. Fine, I'll tell you, but you must keep it a secret. I promised my godson not to tell anyone about this. He's a good kid who values relationships, and even though they broke up, he doesn't want to embarrass her. But now that Lang Zhe is still so obsessed, I must stop it. However... I hope when you deal with Sun Man in the future, you won't reveal what I've said.\"","The Qin family could really see how much Peng Li cared about this godson. She was afraid of losing her godson's affection because of another woman.","\"Because once when Lang Zhe brought her to visit me, she actually tried to steal my necklace!\"","As Peng Li spoke, anger rose on her face, and her hand pressed on the large, round pearls. \"How greedy, isn't a little thief like this morally questionable!\"","\"How could that be?\" Qin's Mom immediately asked.","After hearing so much about Sun Man, the Qin family all felt that Sun Man should be a hardworking, law-abiding person with a pure character.","But Peng Li angrily said, \"At the time, I wanted to take out the necklace to show that woman, so I took her to my jewelry collection room. But during dinner, the maid said the necklace was missing. I had all the maids help search for half a day but couldn't find it. Just as I was about to call the police, suddenly the necklace appeared in the bathroom, a place I had personally searched before. How could it suddenly appear there? It must have been her who took it out because she was scared. When I got it back, it was still warm!\"","\"I wanted to take her to the police right then, but Lang Zhe stopped me. After they broke up, I didn't bother with it anymore. Who knew my silly child would want to get back together with this thief? I can't even imagine how she might covet my jewelry in the future. This kind of thief absolutely cannot be with Lang Zhe.\"","Peng Li spoke with righteous indignation, clearly having experienced this incident.","Could it be that the young girl really made a mistake and committed theft in a moment of confusion?","It felt incredibly unbelievable.","[Is this real? I don't believe it, let me check.]","Seeing Ji Fei take action, everyone else actively joined the discussion.","\"Did she admit to it?\" Qin Rong anxiously asked for verification.","Peng Li said, \"We didn't catch her in the act, so of course she denied it!\"","\"Then there's no evidence, right? Could it have been someone else?\" Qin Yan also asked.","\"You mean our maids? They've taken care of me for so many years, how could it be them!\" Peng Li refuted.","\"Did you accidentally take it to the bathroom yourself?\" Qin Zhao questioned.","\"Do you think I'm senile?\" Peng Li became even angrier.","At this point, Qin Xian, who rarely spoke, analyzed, \"Such a unique piece of jewelry is useless to steal. Once it appears, it would inevitably raise suspicion, let alone she's a public figure. Unless she was short on money and wanted to steal it to sell, but given her earning ability, she wouldn't be short on money. Or it could be a personal hobby, a liking for collecting, but taking such a risk, the probability is too small.\"","As soon as Qin Xian finished speaking, he felt Ji Fei suddenly look at him. He turned his head and met a pair of bright eyes, completely reflecting him, seemingly sparkling. It immediately made his heart race.","[Qin Xian is so amazing!]","Faced with such straightforward praise, Qin Xian suddenly felt a bit hot.","The Qin family all had a jolt and began to frantically steal glances at the interaction between the two.","However, Ji Fei just looked at Qin Xian in surprise, while her inner voice had already exploded.","[The analysis is so accurate, it was indeed stolen to sell!]","The Qin family was shocked, immediately having trouble reacting. Could it really be...","[But the thief wasn't Sun Man, nor was it those maids. It was the one person Peng Li never suspected - Lang Zhe.]","The Qin family was stunned, but at the same time breathed a sigh of relief. It somehow felt more reasonable this way.","No wonder Lang Zhe was so against Peng Li pursuing the matter further. It wasn't that he was protecting his girlfriend, but he was afraid of leaving some evidence that might be discovered.","But it was strange, did he need money? Peng Li doted on him so much, why would he steal? If he wanted money, he could just ask directly, and Peng Li would probably give it to him.","While their heads were full of question marks, Ji Fei finally acted human for once and gave the answer directly.","[I see, it's because Teacher Lu's discipline was too strict, so he couldn't get money without limits. Moreover, she would check the money Peng Li gave him, making it very difficult for him to spend freely. That's why he thought of stealing. Originally, he didn't dare to steal the most valuable pearl necklace.]","[Who would have thought his gambling debts were so huge, and he not only wanted to pay off his debts but also wanted to win back his losses and return to the gambling table. That's why he set his sights on the most valuable pearl necklace.]","The Qin family immediately took a deep breath.","So that's it, Lang Zhe was a gambler! And a deeply hidden one at that.","[Bringing Sun Man along was just a cover. He knew his godmother liked to show off and would definitely take them to see her jewelry. He could then steal it when leaving. If discovered afterwards, he could plead for his girlfriend, making his godmother soften and not pursue the matter. Or if he could win it back, he could make up for it. He just didn't expect to be discovered so quickly, so he had to give up.]","The Qin family immediately gained a basic understanding of the so-called scoundrel. But soon, their understanding deepened.","[Oh, I understand now. It was because the theft plan failed that he had to grit his teeth and borrow money from Sun Man! He borrowed it under the guise of startup funds for a concert.]","The Qin family immediately had a guess - did he borrow money and not return it?","[Soon, Sun Man discovered that he wasn't actually holding a concert. After careful investigation in their private interactions, she learned that her boyfriend was an experienced gambler, and he gambled heavily. He had borrowed money from many people, and she knew her money wouldn't be returned, as there were no IOUs. She was an intelligent girl and knew that gamblers who reached this level never turn back, so she immediately cut her losses.]","The Qin family couldn't help but sigh. She was a girl who knew when to cut her losses.","[But... ten million yuan! Just letting this guy off like that! She really is a silly girl! It makes me angry every time I think about it! He even has the thick skin to want to get back together, isn't he just looking for another sucker? Pay back the money first, you bastard!]","[Even now, Peng Li still suspects Sun Man. It's frustrating just thinking about it. Should we...]","\"After all this talk, we haven't mentioned Lang Zhe. Does he have an alibi? Auntie, as they say, you can guard against outsiders day and night, but it's hard to guard against thieves in your own home~\""]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: So Profound","paragraphs":["Ji Fei suddenly came out with this statement, instantly infuriating Peng Li.","It was clear she was fiercely protective of her godson.","\"What nonsense are you spouting? How could it possibly be my godson?\"","Ji Fei pouted, [It is your godson, it is! It is!]","The Qin family was amused. As a result, Peng Li thought they were laughing at her and angrily retorted, \"Don't tell me you also suspect my godson! If my godson wanted anything, wouldn't I give it to him? Why would he need to steal?\"","[Such blind doting, but he wouldn't dare ask you. Once he did, it would let Teacher Lu know about his gambling. He wouldn't dare expose that.]","\"Oh, Peng Li, don't get upset. Even the police treat everyone as a suspect when investigating a case. My little Fei doesn't know your godson, so her guess is quite reasonable. Do you have any evidence that Lang Zhe has never been to your treasure room?\" Qin's Mom said leisurely.","Qin's Mom's words left Peng Li speechless.","After all, she did bring Sun Man and Lang Zhe to the room together at that time, and it could be said that her main attention was on Sun Man, wanting to show off her power as a godmother to Sun Man.","As for Lang Zhe... she couldn't really remember what he was doing at the time.","Peng Li was momentarily dazed, but quickly seemed to recall something and perked up, \"Fine, if you don't believe me, let's talk facts. At that time, only Sun Man was carrying a bag and wearing clothes that could easily hide things, but Lang Zhe was only wearing a simple basketball outfit. How could he steal my necklace in front of everyone?\"","Hearing this, the Qin family carefully imagined the scene. Such a long pearl necklace, no matter where it was hidden, should create a noticeable bulge.","After the necklace went missing, everyone was so anxious to find it, and none of them were blind. If it was really on Lang Zhe, it should have been quite easy to spot.","Thinking about this, the Qin family couldn't help but wonder how the case could be solved without anyone's involvement except Ji Fei.","Fortunately, Ji Fei was also quite curious.","[She's quite good at arguing. Let me check how he actually stole it. Wait!]","Ji Fei's inner voice suddenly rose, startling the Qin family.","[Oh my god! Oh my god! Oh my god! Heavens!]","The Qin family: What? What? What? Why the sudden exclamation?","Everyone furtively glanced at Ji Fei, only to see her eyes fixed intently on Peng Li's necklace, her pupils seeming to tremble, then looking at Peng Li's hands, the hands that habitually caressed the pearls, and then at the teacup Peng Li had held.","This series of glances nearly killed the Qin family with curiosity.","They only heard Ji Fei's inner voice cry out in a tone of having narrowly escaped disaster: [So lucky! Fortunately, Peng Li was arrogant enough not to think about shaking hands when she came in, otherwise our whole family's hands would have been in trouble.]","The Qin family: Huh?","[Who would have thought that such an expensive pearl necklace would have been in that kind of place.]","The Qin family: Why do we have a bad feeling about this? What kind of place exactly?","[Lang Zhe can't possibly be gay, can he? Is he that unfathomable?]","The slower-reacting Qin family members: ... Wait... What?!","They didn't seem to have enough mental preparation to process these keywords and come to a conclusion.","The quick-reacting Qin family members: !!!!","No... All of them? Each of those pearls is as big as a one-yuan coin, and there are... twenty or thirty of them, right? Impossible, this is absolutely impossible!","[Oh, that scared me to death. I knew it couldn't be possible.]","Everyone immediately let out a sigh of relief, almost choked by this wild speculation. How could a man do such a thing just to steal a necklace? Ji Fei must have seen it wrong.","[So many, it's impossible to stuff them all in there. The remaining part was tied to his body, like wearing a G-string. That's why it wasn't visible... Ah, my brain, stop imagining! I didn't think about that scene, I'm just an innocent bystander! Disappear, disappear!]","The Qin family: ... It's too late. Can they control the speed of their brains? And the brain doesn't understand negatives. If you tell it not to think about something, it will definitely think about it.","Ah, disappear, disappear quickly!","Suddenly, they remembered Peng Li saying earlier that when the pearl necklace was found, it was still warm.","Probably not just warm...","Everyone suddenly turned to look at the pearl necklace on Peng Li's neck.","Was it psychological, or a lighting effect? Did those pearls have a slightly yellowish glow?","Seeing the suddenly colorful expressions on everyone's faces, as if they had received some kind of shock, Peng Li became dissatisfied.","\"What do you mean? After what I've said, you still don't believe in Lang Zhe?\"","Just like how parents would never believe there could be anything wrong with their own child, Peng Li completely refused to believe it.","The Qin family finally looked at Peng Li with a hint of sympathy in their eyes.","Peng Li became even more confused, especially noticing that they kept glancing at her necklace. She instinctively raised her hand to stroke the necklace.","But she heard the sound of everyone taking a sharp breath.","What's wrong with this family?","[She's still touching it, she's actually still touching it. How tragic~]","The Qin family's eyes became even more pitying.","Especially Qin's Mom, who after all had known her for so many years, really felt some reluctance to believe it.","But there was no way to remind her, they could only mourn for her silently in their hearts.","[Come to think of it, this necklace was originally bought by her ex-husband. The ownership was on her ex-husband's side. During the divorce, she wanted to take away this priceless necklace. Her ex-husband said as long as she didn't fight for custody of their daughter, the necklace would be hers. She agreed without hesitation, tsk tsk tsk...]","The Qin family didn't expect this necklace to have such a hidden story. Their sympathy for Peng Li immediately faded.","\"Hey, what do you mean? Why are you looking at me like that?\" Peng Li finally felt uneasy under their gaze.","\"There are too many ways to hide things. We can't say he couldn't hide it just because he was wearing little,\" Qin's Mom said flatly.","[Eh? Has Qin's Mom also thought of that method?]","Qin's Mom choked immediately. No, she hadn't!","Qin's Father quickly coughed, \"Anyway, we weren't at the scene, so we can't judge.\"","\"You all!\" Peng Li was furious.","\"In my opinion, since they've already broken up, they're completely unrelated people now. There's no need to cause her trouble anymore,\" Qin Zhao said impatiently.","\"Hmph! They broke up because she must have felt guilty about stealing. But Lang Zhe loves her too much and still wants to be with her. He's been pining for her day and night...\"","[Of course he'd be pining day and night. After all, the free sucker who helped him pay off his gambling debts is gone. If he doesn't get her back, how can he continue gambling under Teacher Lu's nose? Unfortunately, all this information is indirectly obtained from others. If I had met Lang Zhe, I would definitely check if he still owes gambling debts now.]"]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: First Time Seeing Someone Step into a Pit So Accurately","paragraphs":["Since they hadn't met the person, they couldn't gossip from his perspective.","The Qin family also expressed regret about this.","However, Peng Li was still trying to persuade them.","\"I can't let that bitch continue to bewitch Lang Zhe's heart. We must destroy her! I'm not part of your entertainment circle, so I can't find any dirt on her, but a girl with her character must be hiding many unspeakable secrets. You should investigate and use the stage to expose her, just like the others before. Let that foolish Lu Fei open her eyes wide! See what kind of person she thinks is so good, and see if she'll still ignore my advice in the future!\"","Peng Li spoke with such self-satisfaction that it left the Qin family speechless.","\"If we can't find any dirt, could it be that she simply doesn't have any?\" Qin Yan questioned softly. \"The fact that she dares to stay on this stage basically proves it.\"","Qin Rong couldn't help but add, \"Auntie, you really haven't watched any of the previous shows, have you? It's clearly your godson who wants to win back Sun Man. Shouldn't you be trying to stop your godson? Why do you always like to find fault with the passive women? It's clearly your precious son who's entirely to blame!\"","Having seen too much of this, Qin Rong really couldn't stand these people's logic anymore. How could they be so male-pandering and male-loving?","[Big sister and fourth sister spoke so well.]","The two girls immediately lifted their chins proudly, but this made Peng Li flush red with anger.","\"I won't waste words with you ignorant children! Hou Lan! One word, will you help me or not?\"","Qin's Mom's expression turned cold. \"My children are more sensible than you.\"","This comment thoroughly offended Peng Li, who angrily stood up. The sudden movement caused her pearl necklace to sway on her neck, immediately drawing everyone's attention.","Peng Li was about to start cursing, but seeing Qin's Mom staring fixedly at her necklace, she suddenly sneered, \"Oh, I get it. You're just upset that you can't compare to me in some things, so you're deliberately refusing to help. How petty of you.\"","As she spoke, Peng Li tilted her neck, wanting to show off her pearl necklace from all angles.","It could be said that within the city's circle of wealthy ladies, there were few who could surpass her in terms of jewelry.","Watching Peng Li's boastful expression, the Qin family members just wanted to shout: Please stop this horrifying behavior! They really didn't want to look any closer, as they would be unable to resist imagining things.","\"Auntie, is this necklace the only thing you have to show off?\" Qin Zhao was truly afraid that if he looked any longer, he wouldn't be able to resist recalling some bizarre images that would pollute his brain.","Peng Li was immediately choked up, feeling a sense of shame and anger at being exposed. She said, \"How can you be so impolite as a junior? How did your family teach you!\"","Before Qin Zhao could retort, Ji Fei was heard saying, \"That's right, Third Brother, you're being impolite.\"","Qin Zhao immediately glared at Ji Fei, and the other Qin family members also looked at her.","Peng Li, on the other hand, started to smile and was about to say a few more words. However, Ji Fei continued, \"We're in front of people, why are you blurting out such truths! Aren't you just trampling on Auntie's face? Don't expose others' shortcomings, how presumptuous!\"","Qin Zhao couldn't help but let out a \"pfft,\" but quickly composed himself and cooperatively said with a serious face, \"I was indeed presumptuous.\"","Looking at the other Qin family members, they could barely hide the smiles on their faces.","Peng Li seemed to finally realize that this family was treating her like a clown!","She immediately glared at Ji Fei and said, \"Don't think that marrying into the Qin family through some tricks makes you a real young mistress. You're nothing but a beggar without a dowry. How dare you be so impolite, sooner or later you'll...\"","There were quite a few people who had mocked her, but the only one she dared to counterattack was Ji Fei, because Ji Fei was essentially without a natal family. In the eyes of outsiders, she was just living off the Qin family's grace, an outsider who could be discarded at any time.","So Peng Li was picking on the weakest target.","However, she didn't notice that the Qin family members' expressions had changed as soon as she said her first sentence.","Qin Xian suddenly interrupted, \"Ms. Peng.\"","He didn't even call her Auntie anymore, directly addressing her as Ms.","His voice was low and full of frost, allowing people to accurately recognize the anger buried beneath his words.","Peng Li was almost instantly stunned by that icy tone, looking bewilderedly at the young man who was considered the most exemplary heir among all the comments.","Just one glance, and she was frightened by his intimidating gaze.","\"Ms. Peng has spoken rudely to my wife, offending her. You should apologize,\" Qin Xian said coolly.","Upon hearing this, Peng Li was dumbfounded.","Wasn't she the elder here?","Wasn't she his mother's long-time acquaintance?","How could he speak to her like this!","Peng Li's breath caught, and she turned to look at Qin's Mom, expecting her to discipline her child.","However, not only Qin's Mom but all the other Qin family members were coldly staring at her, their attitude clearly showing a united front against an outsider.","Peng Li simply couldn't understand. \"I merely reprimanded an impolite junior. Don't I have the right to do so, given the relationship between the Peng family and the Hou family?\"","\"We, as a couple, don't even dare to reprimand our precious daughter-in-law. What right do you have?\" Qin's Father retorted directly.","Qin's Mom sneered, \"What about the Peng family? Go throw your weight around in your own home. Fei Fei is the future mistress of our Qin family!\"","Qin Zhao coldly laughed, \"Her status in the Qin family is higher than that of us other brothers and sisters. Ms. Peng, it seems you haven't understood your own position.\"","Qin Yan and Qin Rong also nodded angrily.","Ji Fei, on the other hand, was already stunned by this scene.","It was just ordinary banter, right? She was ready to counterattack, how did it turn into this?","However... Although Ji Fei's mind was in chaos, a warm current flowed into her heart. This was a feeling she had never experienced in her previous life.","It felt like sinking into sun-warmed, soft cotton - warm and cozy.","Qin Xian, with a stern expression, coldly said under Peng Li's almost unbelievable gaze, \"Ms. Peng, are you not planning to apologize?\"","Peng Li was immediately provoked and was about to curse back when she heard Qin Xian say coldly, \"It seems the Peng family no longer wants that piece of land they've been eyeing recently.\"","This sentence made Peng Li draw in a sharp breath.","The reason she could still live well after her divorce was naturally because the Peng family was doing well.","The fact that the Peng family had been vying for a piece of land recently was known to everyone in their circle, and she had naturally heard about it too. She also understood that the Qin family had the power to make it happen. If they lost the land because of her, then wouldn't that be...","Peng Li immediately panicked and said, \"What are you saying? The Peng family and your maternal grandfather's Hou family are old friends! Aren't you afraid of what your maternal grandparents will think if they know you're threatening an elder like this?\"","Qin Xian didn't argue but chose to say directly, \"It seems you don't want the chain hotel project either?\"","Peng Li's pupils constricted, and an invisible pressure made her whole body start to tremble uncontrollably.","Qin Xian almost didn't give her a chance to argue, coldly making a move to take out his phone.","But the next second, he heard Peng Li say, \"I apologize, I apologize!\"","There was no time for her to quibble; she only knew she had no choice.","Qin Xian stopped his movement and coldly looked at her.","A wealthy lady, at her age, was actually pressured by a junior to the point where she couldn't catch her breath. Humiliated, her eyes reddened, but she could only bow her head and admit her mistake.","At this moment, she finally understood that her previous attempts to irritate Qin's Mom were just small tricks, mere comparisons. She hadn't truly offended Qin's Mom. If she had insulted her in the same way, she would have definitely met the same fate.","It seemed she finally understood that her so-called Peng family was actually not on the same level as low-key wealthy families like the Qin family. It's just that they never used their power to show off.","If only she had known... she wouldn't have come.","\"I'm sorry! I spoke wrongly.\"","Although she said it through gritted teeth, it still counted as an apology. After saying it, she was so angry that tears came out. Without saying another word, she left with her head down. Before leaving, she couldn't help but say, \"Hou Lan, we're not friends anymore!\"","Qin's Mom shrugged and said, \"As if I really wanted to be friends with her.\" After complaining, she quickly turned to look at Ji Fei, worried that those words might have upset her.","As a result, she saw Ji Fei staring intently at Qin Xian.","[Wow, I just saw a real domineering CEO in action. That threatening posture was so powerful! It gave me a sense of déjà vu of a king breaking the sky! So handsome!]","Although it was a bit embarrassing to be described like that, it was still a compliment after all, and Qin Xian felt a bit happy inside. He couldn't help but straighten his sitting posture, about to look at Ji Fei to speak, when he heard...","[He's so handsome that I can't help but want to pounce on him and give him a big smooch!]","Qin Xian froze, meeting Ji Fei's gaze, and immediately felt his face grow hot.","Does she want to kiss me?!","But the whole family is here!","Though this was just her inner thoughts - people usually think before acting. Maybe she's about to act on impulse, so I... definitely shouldn't avoid it, right?","The other onlooking Qin family members, hearing this, reflexively widened their eyes, not wanting to miss a single moment.","What should I do? This is so nerve-wracking. Are we about to witness something?","In the end, they saw Ji Fei smile at Qin Xian, a smile that made his heart flutter.","\"Thanks!\"","Qin Xian: ?","Ji Fei turned to look at the others, \"Thank you all for standing up for me.\"","Then she continued excitedly gossiping: \"Since she hit a wall with us, do you think she'll try to pull something else on Sun Man?\"","Everyone: ...Suddenly feeling less interested in others' drama.","Qin Xian: So some people only think but don't act!","A few days later, they arrived at the production team's location to hear about the performance theme.","As soon as Ji Fei and her group arrived at the scene, the director and producer came to find them.","Just as Ji Fei was suspecting they had come to warn her not to cause trouble, the director smiled and said: \"There's going to be some excitement to watch soon. We'll draw lots after that.\"","\"What?\" Pei Mingxuan asked curiously.","\"Teacher Lu's son is here. He's prepared a surprise to propose to Sun Man,\" the producer said with a smile.","Ji Fei and her group: ...","[...The last person who tried to propose without considering the girl's wishes... This is the first time I've seen someone step into a trap so precisely.]"]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: Originally Wanted to Recruit","paragraphs":["Lang Zhe and Sun Man were the kind of couple everyone loved to root for. Since they never publicly explained the reason for their breakup, everyone assumed it was because Teacher Lu, the mother-in-law, was too difficult to deal with, and so Sun Man decided to step back.","However, after watching this show, seeing how well Teacher Lu and Sun Man get along, people began to wonder if a reunion might be on the horizon.","Now, Lang Zhe has approached the production team, hoping to use their stage to propose. After all, it's just for announcing the theme and recording, not live broadcast, so the production team is happy to do this favor, perhaps even gaining some good vibes and positive comments in the process.","Given the current controversies surrounding \"My Acting, Cut!\" despite its high popularity, the director and producers are hoping for a smooth ending.","Everyone has been informed except for the parties involved, to prevent any disruption to the atmosphere.","\"So, Teacher Lu knows about this too? Did she approve?\" Pei Mingxuan asked.","The director nodded, \"Although she looked a bit serious, she didn't object.\"","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were present and immediately heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","[Wow, she really didn't object. Teacher Lu already admires Sun Man a lot and would be happy to have her as her daughter-in-law. However, while she didn't object, she doesn't quite agree either. After all, she thinks her son hasn't even gotten back together with Sun Man yet and is already proposing in such a public setting, which is a bit too much to ask. But seeing her son so proactive, she won't stop him.]","[Teacher Lu, you're so clear-headed. This is not just too much to ask; it's daydreaming!]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong agreed wholeheartedly. Without even getting back together, he's jumping straight to proposing. Does he really think Sun Man will say yes? He's delusional!","[Well, it's good. I'll get to see Lang Zhe soon. I want to see what's inside that walnut-sized brain of his.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong stifled their laughter.","Everyone wanted to join in on the fun. As they headed towards the stage, many people gathered to gossip.","Pei Mingxuan, however, wasn't happy. She sighed deeply.","\"What's wrong, Sister Pei?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","\"I was thinking of poaching her,\" Pei Mingxuan frowned.","\"You really had that in mind?\" Qin Zhao was surprised. \"Isn't she with a studio already?\"","\"That kind of makeshift operation?\" Pei Mingxuan said. \"I'm not looking down on family-run studios, but I'm just stating facts.\"","\"After graduating from film school, Sun Man joined a decent film company through her mentor's connections. The company had a good development strategy for her. If she had followed that, her current achievements would be much higher. Unfortunately, she has an uncle and mother who are short-sighted, thinking actresses are just a fleeting career, and wanted to make as much money as possible while she's still young. The original company restricted her too much, so they encouraged her to start her own studio.\"","\"If she's so obedient and lacks her own judgment, she's not clear-headed either,\" Qin Zhao said. \"In that case, you can't poach her.\"","\"I used to think so too. After all, family members interfering in an artist's work is the most troublesome. But you've heard about her tax evasion issue, right?\"","Everyone nodded.","\"So, I think while she's somewhat bound by family, she's still clear-headed. Within her limits, she respects filial piety, but when it's unbearable, she'll act decisively. Choosing to participate in this variety show should be to calm down and hone her acting skills. She hasn't taken on other work recently, which doesn't align with the behavior of making quick money. It seems she's no longer listening to her uncle and mother, so I thought I'd try to contact her. If she's clear-headed, she should know that a family-run studio isn't suitable for her. She needs a better agent.\"","After speaking, Pei Mingxuan proudly lifted her chin.","Pei Mingxuan was genuinely interested in Sun Man. Young and versatile in her roles, she's one of the most talented actresses among the new generation. After interacting with her on this show, it's clear she truly loves acting and doesn't just want to make quick money.","Pei Mingxuan already had Yu Rouyin, and adding a completely different type like Sun Man would basically cover most leading roles in films and dramas.","Then, all the popular dramas might be under Pei Mingxuan's control. Just thinking about it was exciting.","Of course, that's not enough...","\"It seems Sister Pei really likes Sun Man. I like her too,\" Qin Rong smiled.","Pei Mingxuan nodded. \"I like those with talent, ambition, who want to strive, aren't afraid of hard work, and are diligent and willing to work hard.\"","Ji Fei: ...","[Why do you keep glancing at me every time you say a word? Are you trying to compare me unfavorably?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong stifled their laughter, knowing that Pei Mingxuan also wanted to promote Ji Fei.","Apart from other conditions, Ji Fei really had a background. She could get any resource she wanted, and once her identity was revealed, no one would dare to slander her. Plus, she had a rare rich wife persona, and her husband was so handsome. It was a fresh route to market, and Pei Mingxuan really wanted to try it.","Pei Mingxuan couldn't help but say sarcastically, \"Yu Rouyin has been with me for a week and has already started filming and taken on a few endorsements... the more you work, the more you gain...\"","[Even if you wave your invisible whip more fiercely, I, this ox and horse, won't move. Because my dream is to reap without sowing.]","Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts so confidently, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong finally burst out laughing.","\"What's so funny?\" Pei Mingxuan asked.","Ji Fei also looked curiously at the people behind her.","Qin Zhao quickly changed the subject, \"You said you originally wanted to poach her, but now you don't?\"","Pei Mingxuan said, \"Not that I don't want to, but if the proposal today succeeds, Sun Man will have Teacher Lu as her backing and won't need to find anyone else to cooperate with.\"","Hearing this, Ji Fei and the others exchanged a knowing smile.","\"What?\" Pei Mingxuan was puzzled.","Qin Rong couldn't help but gossip, \"Sun Man definitely won't agree.\"","\"Why?\"","Ji Fei was also surprised to hear this, as she thought no one else knew.","Qin Rong, flustered, looked to Qin Zhao for help.","Qin Zhao had to cover up, \"Oh, because I just got a confidential message from Gao Hao.\"","\"What?\" Not only Pei Mingxuan but also Ji Fei was curious.","Qin Zhao's mouth twitched as he continued to use Gao Hao, who had already left for overseas to arrange work.","\"Gao Hao told me that Lang Zhe is a gambler and owes Sun Man ten million yuan. They probably broke up because of this.\"","Pei Mingxuan was shocked. Such a big news, and she didn't know about it.","Ji Fei nodded, [Indeed, if you don't want others to know, you shouldn't do it. Gao Hao knows, so others will find out sooner or later. If Peng Li finds out, will she connect it to the missing pearl necklace incident? If she does, will she suspect how he hid it? No, it's both disgusting and funny. When I see Lang Zhe later, I'm afraid I'll stare at the wrong place.]","Qin Zhao, Qin Rong: Oh no! Don't remind us!","Just as they reached the studio, they saw the stage lights shining on a man in a suit.","The man was facing away from them, directing people to decorate.","And the three of them couldn't help but look at the wrong place."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: Man's Mouth + Gambling Demon, Double Buff","paragraphs":["Lang Zhe's physical appearance was quite decent. With a bit of formal dressing up, he really looked like a handsome young man nervously preparing to propose.","\"You can't judge a book by its cover. Just looking at his appearance, you'd really think his values were as proper as his facial features,\" Pei Mingxuan said. \"Now he's here to propose. Could it be that he's reformed and is ready to pursue true love again? Hah!\"","The \"hah\" indicated that Sister Pei wouldn't be easily fooled.","\"A gambler quitting gambling and a man's words being trustworthy are both absolute lies. This guy has hit both, so we can basically conclude that this is all fake,\" Pei Mingxuan coldly analyzed. \"He's trying to deceive Sun Man.\"","[Agreed. Let me take a look at this guy...]","Ji Fei, who could finally see the person, was ready to enjoy the drama.","Nearby, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong also became internally excited.","[I knew it! This guy owes another 50 million in gambling debts. And he's already been warned by debt collectors.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong watched Lang Zhe on stage with twitching lips, seeing him still wearing a happy smile, being congratulated, and even acting shy.","[As long as they get married, he'll be able to use Sun Man's assets. Sun Man has always worked hard, and her acting fees and commercial value are very high. He thinks Sun Man will definitely be able to cover his debts.]","[Those calculations are so obvious they're hitting me in the face. You really dare to dream, huh? Where on earth does your confidence come from, thinking that someone you've deceived before will still marry you and help you pay off your debts?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong also found it extremely absurd. This was way too far-fetched.","They casually found seats in the audience area to wait and watch the drama unfold.","\"Tsk, why is there even a live stream?\" Pei Mingxuan's sharp eyes quickly spotted it, and she hurriedly cautioned, \"You didn't even give a heads up. You two be careful.\"","Ji Fei then noticed that besides the professional camera crew arranged on stage, there were also people among the helpers holding up their phones.","[Oh boy, if he gets rejected, won't that be in front of the entire internet? Is he blindly confident, or is he counting on Sun Man's soft personality to deliberately emotionally blackmail her?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong both felt the possibility of emotional blackmail was higher.","The director and producer probably noticed too and quickly arranged for someone to go up and ask about the situation.","Those people, judging by their attire, were clearly from the rap circle, here to cheer on Lang Zhe.","Live streaming wasn't explicitly forbidden, and since it had already been broadcast, it wouldn't be good for them to demand it be shut down now.","In the end, the producer and director just treated it as a warm-up for the next episode, even though their show didn't really need a warm-up.","Ji Fei took out her phone and started searching for the live stream room. After all, they were sitting far away in the audience and couldn't hear what the people on stage were saying. Having the live stream as an aid would be much better.","At first, there weren't many people in the rapper's live stream room, but as the content of the live stream progressed, many people realized that this was the studio of \"My Acting, Cut!\", and the person being proposed to was Sun Man from the next episode. The popularity of the live stream suddenly skyrocketed.","Everyone flocked in to watch the excitement.","\"The flowers here are all said to be the ones sister-in-law likes. My brother has put in a lot of effort, hasn't he? Lang Zhe really likes Sun Man. He's even prepared a surprise for Sun Man for the proposal. I've never seen him put in so much effort before. He's really determined to spend the rest of his life with her.\"","Probably seeing many questions floating in the live stream comments: Didn't Sun Man and Lang Zhe break up? When did they get back together? How did it progress to marriage so quickly? When did the plot fast-forward?","\"Ah well, breaking up doesn't mean they're not in love, right? Moreover, mother-in-law is quite approving of sister-in-law now.\"","These words made it sound as if the initial breakup was because of the picky mother-in-law, Teacher Lu.","Ji Fei did a quick search.","[Hah! So he's a gambling accomplice. No wonder he's full of lies. How shameless.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong had also watched the live stream. Seeing that person acting like he was helping his good brother secure his future wife was truly nauseating.","\"More importantly, our Lang Zhe has already gotten the support of his future in-laws. Right now, sister-in-law's mother and uncle are helping to keep it a secret from her. Everyone, wait to witness this romantic proposal!\"","After being misled like this, the comments quickly filled with blessings for the 'young couple finally overcoming all obstacles'.","\"These two actually agreed? I remember when Sun Man and Lang Zhe were dating before, these two seemed very displeased,\" Pei Mingxuan said puzzledly.","Ji Fei also found it strange.","[Back then, they were displeased because they were afraid Sun Man would get married after dating and then not be under their control anymore, not be their cash cow. But now...]","Just as Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were listening curiously, someone shouted, \"Quiet, she's coming!\"","The venue instantly fell silent, and the main lights suddenly went out, leaving only the candles on the ground lit.","Suddenly, a leisurely acapella rang out. It was Lang Zhe singing a love song.","After all, he was a singer, so his singing skills were not a problem. It's just that the sweet love song sounded very fake to Ji Fei and the others.","At this time, someone was stepping onto the path formed by candlelight. They seemed to stop halfway, not wanting to continue, but were pulled along to keep walking.","At the end of the candle-lit path, a figure could be vaguely seen kneeling on one knee.","In an instant, all the lights came on, and the onlookers on the stage burst into cheers.","Ji Fei saw Sun's Mother pulling Sun Man on stage, with Sun's Uncle following behind.","Teacher Lu also appeared on the other side of the stage, quietly watching.","The live stream showed a closer view.","All that could be seen was a face born to be a leading lady, without technology or hard work, black hair and black eyes, naturally sweet, but now stiff and pale, with an unpleasant expression.","But Lang Zhe seemed completely oblivious, or simply didn't care.","His face full of deep emotion, he began, \"Man Man, I was wrong, I was really wrong. You know I love you very much. I can't live without you. I was just confused at that time and made you unhappy, but I swear to you, from now on, whatever you want me to do, I'll do it. Whatever you don't want me to do, I absolutely won't do. All the troubles and problems have been dealt with. Please give me another chance.\"","After saying this, Lang Zhe held up the ring box, took out the women's ring inside, his voice almost choked with excitement.","\"Sun Man, please marry me. I know you've always wanted a family, and I want to give you a family, to become the family member who loves you the most. In the future, we'll have children, and we'll definitely have a warm family. I swear, this time I won't let you down.\"","Outsiders didn't know what he meant, they could only think about issues like mother-in-law and daughter-in-law not getting along, and him failing to mediate as the person in the middle.","But Sun Man and Ji Fei's group knew what he was talking about. He was referring to quitting gambling.","This seemed like a person who had truly reformed and was trying hard to win back his love. You could even see his devout gaze and glistening tears in the live stream video.","[Damn, know the face but not the heart. With acting skills like these, it's a waste you're not an actor,] Ji Fei couldn't help but mock in her heart. [Just like Sister Pei said, a man's mouth plus a gambler, double buff. That's not just a ghost tricking people, that's a devil! Determined to suck every last drop of your blood!]"]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Refusal of Proposal","paragraphs":["Lang Zhe finished speaking and immediately put on a deep, affectionate expression as he looked at Sun Man.","He had always known what Sun Man wanted the most.","Sun Man had grown up without a father, living with her mother at her grandfather's house. Her grandfather's family was patriarchal, and her mother was a classic \"sister who supports her brother.\" It was easy to imagine the kind of unloving environment she had grown up in, bound by her original family, wanting to escape but feeling morally constrained, always feeling powerless.","When she was dating Lang Zhe, she had mentioned that she didn't need to marry a wealthy man; she just wanted a warm home and someone who truly loved and respected her to be by her side. She also wanted children and would treat her children well, hoping to fill her home with laughter and joy.","In fact, Sun Man had said this with great courage, hinting to Lang Zhe that she was different from other actresses; she was willing to get married early because all she wanted was to be an actress, not a star, and her purpose in acting was not to make money.","But Lang Zhe avoided this topic. He had dated Sun Man because she was a completely naive girl in matters of love. Even if she discovered his secrets, she wouldn't expose him, making her relatively safe. Plus, she was willing to obediently spend money on him. Although he liked Sun Man, he didn't want to settle down so early.","Unexpectedly, Sun Man broke up with him as soon as she found out he was gambling.","At first, Lang Zhe was quite disdainful, thinking that Sun Man was only interested in money and that her talk of truly loving him and wanting to build a home with him was just empty words.","But when he found himself at a dead end, he realized that only Sun Man would be soft-hearted enough to help him.","So he decided to give Sun Man something she couldn't refuse. This naive girl would surely return to his side.","Moreover, Sun Man had a strong sense of family. Even if she discovered the truth after marriage, she would diligently help him repay his debts. To put it bluntly, she was the kind of person who was destined to be hardworking.","Confidently thinking this, Lang Zhe reached out to take Sun Man's hand and put a ring on it.","But the next second, Sun Man suddenly pulled her hand back.","Lang Zhe almost stumbled and looked up in surprise to see Sun Man frowning at him. Her usually sweet face was now gradually filled with anger.","The surrounding people were awkwardly silent because of that moment.","Ji Fei was desperately pinching her thigh to keep from laughing out loud in the quiet hall.","Turning her head, she saw Qin Zhao and Qin Rong also pinching their thighs, while Pei Mingxuan raised an eyebrow, suddenly very interested.","The live stream's chat was momentarily chaotic.","\"What's going on?\"","\"Was Lang Zhe rejected?\"","\"Given the atmosphere the host created, I thought everything was going smoothly.\"","\"Maybe she's just shy or wants to say something more?\"","The netizens were completely confused.","The next second, they heard Sun Man say, \"What are you doing? I thought we made it clear; we've broken up.\"","Lang Zhe's face changed, and his smile became very stiff and forced. \"Man Man, are you still angry with me? Didn't you understand what I just said?\"","\"I understood, but it has nothing to do with me. We've broken up,\" Sun Man said firmly.","Lang Zhe looked at Sun Man in disbelief. He thought he understood girls very well, but Sun Man's reaction completely shattered his fantasies.","\"You... you don't want a home? I'm willing to give you one...\"","\"You're willing to give, but I don't want it,\" Sun Man said indifferently.","[Pfft, she wants a home, and you're offering her a dilapidated building.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong continued to stifle their laughter.","[Lang Zhe thinks he's got a handle on young girls' psychology, but he doesn't realize that a smart, unloved girl, once awakened, will use her sensitivity and timidity to form the strongest defense mechanism, firmly staying away from anything harmful. That's why she could rebel against Uncle Sun and Mother Sun.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong understood and also breathed a sigh of relief. Fortunately, Sun Man was firm enough not to be deceived by a man's false affection.","Lang Zhe, probably hit hard by Sun Man's repeated rejections, was momentarily at a loss for words.","After all, when they broke up, he had begged Sun Man not to expose his gambling, and she had agreed. Even when the tabloids spread rumors that she broke up because she was cheating with a male actor in the same drama, she didn't use his secret to clear her name.","Such a foolish woman should be easy to trick!","Why was it like this?","At this moment, the two people who had been circling around Sun Man jumped out.","Mother Sun, with her triangular eyes and harsh appearance, said, \"Sun Man, when we didn't allow you to date him, you argued with us for him. Now that he's proposing, you refuse. Are you still sulking? If you lose such a good partner because of your temper, you'll regret it.\"","Uncle Sun, with his plump body, also huffed forward and said, \"Sun Man, it's okay to quarrel with your man occasionally, but don't embarrass him in front of so many people. Little Lang is so sincere; if you make a scene now, you're too immature.\"","Sun Man seemed to finally realize something and looked at them in disbelief. \"You want me to marry him? Why?\"","They had never said they wanted her to marry a wealthy man or a member of a prestigious family. Lang Zhe didn't fit that description.","The two exchanged uneasy glances. Mother Sun said, \"Of course, we're doing it for your happiness. You're already this old; as elders, we just want to see you happy, nothing else matters.\"","Uncle Sun also tried to put on a kind smile and said, \"Little Lang is sincere to you; we trust him with you.\"","Sun Man stared at them as if she didn't know them. These days, they had been in a cold war because she kept defying them. This sudden show of concern left Sun Man at a loss.","Rarely treated so kindly by her close relatives, Sun Man's eyes wavered slightly, and her expression softened a bit, but her decision didn't change. \"I... I'm not suitable for him.\"","With that, she tried to leave, but was stopped by Mother Sun and Uncle Sun on either side.","\"Daughter, think about it again.\"","\"We all think Little Lang is good; we support you two being together.\"","Ji Fei and the others watched this drama in stunned silence.","Pei Mingxuan directly said, \"If they knew their cash cow lost ten million, would they still be so helpful? I don't think they're the kind of people who genuinely want Sun Man to be happy.\"","\"Their words are really uncomfortable,\" Qin Rong also said.","Qin Zhao sneered, \"Concern is fake; subconsciously looking down on Sun Man is real.\"","Ji Fei inwardly sneered.","[Selfish people naturally focus on interests. It's just that the money-making tool has started to rebel, wanting to regain financial control, and they feel they can't control Sun Man anymore. Just then, Lang Zhe came to them, promising that if they could get married, he wouldn't ask for a dowry and would give them a lot of betrothal gifts. He also promised to persuade Sun Man to reconcile with them and become the obedient, filial girl she used to be.]"]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: Proposal Kidnapping Scene","paragraphs":["Qin Zhao and Qin Rong suddenly understood when they heard the explanation, realizing that there was profit to be made.","At the same time, they felt disgusted.","Close relatives and former lovers were all scheming against this honest and hardworking girl, truly colluding like wolves.","No, more accurately, it was the gambler who had orchestrated everything. Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle were also foolish to believe in Lang Zhe, being used as pawns.","With such intelligence, no wonder they couldn't manage Sun Man's studio well. They probably had money on their minds all the time.","Ji Fei's thoughts soon confirmed their suspicions.","【It's really their blackened hearts that have tainted my eyes. They think that the rebellious Sun Man is already unmanageable. If she marries into a wealthy family, she will be even less likely to listen. It's better to settle for Lang Zhe, who, in their impression, has always been easy-going and well-mannered. Once, when they had an argument with Sun Man, Lang Zhe mediated and even got Sun Man to apologize to them. He seemed to respect his elders. So, at this critical juncture, they chose to settle for Lang Zhe, hoping to marry Sun Man to him and regain control over her.】","【I won't comment on Sun's Uncle, but Sun's Mother too? I really...】","Feeling Ji Fei's exasperation, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong shared the same sentiment.","The last time they saw such bizarre parents was Chu Xinyue's. If the parents of twins were already biased enough to be detestable, then a mother who relentlessly exploits her only daughter for the sake of her maternal family is even more appalling.","【If it weren't for Sun Man's ability to make money, she might have been sold off for a bride price to fund her cousin's wedding.】","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were about to say it couldn't be that bad, that a mother wouldn't favor outsiders over her own child.","But the next moment, they realized there was no limit to how bizarre things could get.","【I can't believe it! There was actually such a situation? Sun Man almost didn't get into film school because it was expensive. The inheritance left by her father was meant to be loaned to her cousin for studying abroad. So, her mother wanted her to attend a regular university, giving the reason that having a brother who succeeds in the future would be a support for her. Wasn't that for her own good?!】","【And she even found a match for her, a boy from another family who was studying at the same university. She wanted Sun Man to take care of him at school, demanding an advance bride price so they could send her nephew to a better school. Wasn't this setting up her nephew's bright future while making her daughter a nanny for someone else at school? The reason given was that she was pretty and might get bullied, so it was better to secure an engagement early and let her fiancé protect her at school?!】","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were dumbfounded.","【Fortunately, they were only capable of emotional blackmail, using noble-sounding reasons like 'it's for your own good' to manipulate her. They didn't dare to force Sun Man, so she secretly arranged her own application and enrollment, and those schemes came to nothing.】","The two of them breathed a sigh of relief, but then felt a sense of frustration. Even after all this, Sun Man hadn't severed ties with these close relatives? She still allowed them to meddle in her life.","It seemed her attachment to family was strong enough to make one want to vomit blood.","But blood ties are hard to sever. No one but Sun Man knows her definition of emotional needs. Perhaps she believes that as long as she becomes strong, those people will remain good relatives by her side.","The only consolation is that Sun Man isn't a complete family-obsessed person; there's still a chance for self-salvation.","At least now, despite being persuaded in such a manner, Sun Man won't change her mind. She's doing her best to take control of her own life.","Seeing that Sun's Uncle and Sun's Mother's persistent persuasion wasn't working, Lang Zhe snapped back to reality.","He immediately became passionate again, saying, \"Man Man, I know you're still angry with me. It's okay, you can punish me however you want, or make me swear an oath, do anything, just give me a chance. Marry me, we can go get our marriage certificate today, and you can witness my changes in the future, okay?\"","At that moment, Lang Zhe gave his friend a look, and the friend immediately started chanting, \"Marry him, marry him! Marry...\"","The surrounding crowd began to join in the commotion.","Many people were simply following the rhythm, with background music playing. The friend who was live-streaming even connected the live broadcast to the big screen. Looking at it, most of the comments on the screen were also chanting, \"Marry him, marry him!\"","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle nudged Sun Man.","The atmosphere was pushed to a climax.","Sun Man, seeing everything, felt the pressure envelop her. Looking around, there wasn't a single person on her side.","Ji Fei and the others watched, feeling utterly helpless, as if a good girl was being pushed into a pit of fire by a group of people.","Lang Zhe knew Sun Man was easily swayed by her soft-heartedness and said with a smile, \"Look, your mother and uncle, my mother, and so many friends all support us being together.\"","Lang Zhe specifically pointed to Teacher Lu standing in the corner.","Lu Fei's hair was tied up high, looking strict and serious. Seeing her son point at her, she frowned slightly but didn't say anything.","\"I even fantasized about you two performing together as real mother-in-law and daughter-in-law,\" Lang Zhe said happily.","Sun Man's face changed slightly, realizing that if she refused now, the relationship she had just mended with Teacher Lu might be damaged, and the subsequent program recording... Should she just go along with it for now and clarify later when no one was around?","Seeing Sun Man wavering, Lang Zhe pressed on, \"This is being live-streamed to all netizens. Do you really want to ruin this beautiful memory by being angry with me now?\"","\"Man Man, I love you! Marry me.\"","Sun Man's face turned pale. If she went along with it now, it would be a happy ending without too much of a scene. She could just not marry later, but her reason told her she should clarify it right away.","It was strange. Although it felt like coercion, she inexplicably felt guilty.","But soon, when Lang Zhe tried to grab her hand to put a ring on it, Sun Man's eyes changed, and she followed her heart, pulling her hand back.","Lang Zhe, caught off guard by the rejection, immediately became furious and grabbed her hand forcefully.","Sun Man couldn't pull her hand back and said without hesitation, \"I don't want to!\"","Although the background music was festive and loud, Sun Man's shout was still heard by everyone, clearly audible in the live broadcast.","\"Sun Man, don't be willful!\" Lang Zhe was truly enraged, almost grinding his teeth.","Others were about to chime in with their opinions.","Teacher Lu, however, frowned and stepped forward to pull her son away.","Suddenly, the background music was turned off, and the scene became quiet. A voice echoed softly.","\"Oh? Isn't it against our marriage law to force a marriage against a woman's will? How come? Did you not understand the word 'no'? Or did you not hear it? I thought such things only happened to victims of human trafficking in remote mountains. I didn't expect to witness a live version here.\""]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: Don't Be Rude by Getting Involved Again","paragraphs":["The sarcastic words instantly disrupted Lang Zhe's rhythm, giving Sun Man a chance to break free.","Others also looked in shock towards the source of the sound. How could someone say such unpleasant things during a proposal? As a result, everyone fell silent when they saw who it was.","At this moment, the danmu (live comments) began to change direction.","After all, there were many fans of the show in the live stream, and they could immediately recognize that sarcastic voice. It was as if they could visualize someone slapping faces.","The camera didn't even need to turn.","They knew the judge of the entertainment industry had arrived.","The minds that seemed to have been clouded by the commotion suddenly cleared.","\"Even my Sister Fei couldn't stand it anymore!\"","\"She already said no! Do you really think this is just playing hard to get?\"","\"How is your production team so dramatic both on and off screen?\"","\"I thought I was going to witness a proposal, but instead I witnessed a forced marriage.\"","\"I found it strange from the beginning, they hadn't even gotten back together, and suddenly there's talk of a proposal? Does that make sense?\"","\"To those of you who like to make surprise proposals, can you please understand your position first?\"","\"When you think someone doesn't even want to marry you, do you think they'll just agree if you propose and create an atmosphere?\"","\"How is this any different from holding a sword to someone's throat and asking if they love you?\"","\"Can marriage be forced like this? Please wake up.\"","\"Support Sun Man, a good horse doesn't eat old grass. If they broke up before, there must have been reasons they couldn't continue. It's not something that can just change with time.\"","Because of Ji Fei's lead, more and more rational analyses appeared. In the end, the danmu in the live stream actually turned into a unanimous \"She said no!\"","It was truly a spectacular sight in its own way.","\"What are you doing?\" Sun's Mother anxiously said, \"How can you ruin someone else's happy moment? My daughter is just... just too shy to accept.\"","Sun's Uncle also looked at them with displeasure. Even if the other party was very popular now, how could they say such things during someone's proposal?","Lang Zhe frowned at them. He didn't know about his godmother's encounter with the Qin Family, he only knew that his godmother had some connection with the Qin Family, so he couldn't help but say, \"I don't know how I've offended you, but I hope you won't disturb us.\"","\"Huh, it seems you really don't care about Sun's wishes,\" Qin Zhao directly sneered, then said to Sun Man, \"Miss Sun, do you want me to call the police for you?\"","Everyone was shocked, they didn't expect Qin Zhao to speak so harshly.","Sun Man came back to her senses and immediately said, \"Teacher Ji, Teacher Qin, thank you for speaking up for me.\"","Sun Man continued, looking at Lang Zhe, \"I am rejecting you. After our breakup, I can't possibly have any more entanglements with you. Your current behavior is causing me distress. Please stop. Have I made myself clear enough?\"","As Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle were about to say something, Sun Man turned to them and said, \"You have no right to decide my life. I said I won't marry him, are you going to force me?\"","The surroundings fell completely silent, with awkwardness spreading invisibly.","Lang Zhe stared at Sun Man in a daze, his face gradually becoming extremely unpleasant. He clearly understood Sun Man's determination now.","But Lang Zhe wasn't willing to give up. That was fifty million, how could he repay it? He wanted to say something more, but was stopped by Lu Fei grabbing his arm.","\"Enough, any more persistence would be uncivilized.\"","Lang Zhe's body stiffened, completely suppressed by blood ties, not daring to act up.","Lu Fei met Sun Man's uneasy gaze, nodded, and said in a gentle tone, \"Actually, I also think my son isn't good enough for you. If you want to refuse, then refuse. Don't worry about it.\"","Sun Man didn't expect Lu Fei's attitude to remain completely unchanged. Her tense nerves immediately relaxed, and she respectfully nodded to Lu Fei.","Lu Fei then said to Lang Zhe, \"Clean this place up and leave with your friends. You've already delayed the staff here for too long.\"","Lang Zhe looked up at his mother with some resentment, but in the end, he could only obey obediently. After all, it had all been live-streamed, and making more of a scene would only embarrass himself.","To avoid awkwardness, Lu Fei directly took Sun Man's hand and led her off the stage towards the director and producer.","\"It seems Teacher Lu likes Sun Man even more than her own son,\" Ji Fei laughed, \"She's a fair mother.\"","Qin Rong said, \"If Sun Man is willing, Teacher Lu would probably very much like her as a daughter-in-law. I saw how seriously Teacher Lu was teaching Sun Man before.\"","Qin Zhao stood up and said, \"Alright, the show's over, let's go.\"","But when he turned around, he found that Pei Mingxuan hadn't gotten up yet, so he called out to her.","Pei Mingxuan, holding her phone, stood up and looked at Ji Fei with some resentment, \"You're trending on social media again.\"","Ji Fei was startled and gave an embarrassed smile. \"Did I do something wrong?\"","Pei Mingxuan put away her phone and said, \"Doing good is naturally right, but you're really daring to take risks.\"","Ji Fei knew what Pei Mingxuan meant. She didn't know the behind-the-scenes drama, so she might have a bit of doubt, wondering if it was a deliberate rejection to play hard to get. If Sun Man had agreed after all that persuasion, then Ji Fei, who had said those things, would have been in an awkward position.","Sometimes Pei Mingxuan was really startled by Ji Fei's sudden actions.","The director and producer had the same thoughts as Pei Mingxuan.","They were worried that before the show even started filming, there would be conflict between the two groups. But compared to previous incidents, today was just a minor issue. They accepted it well, but were very surprised by the rejected proposal. Now they had to worry about whether Teacher Lu and Sun Man could work well together afterwards.","Soon they sat together, and the director and producer used a drawing method to choose the theme for the next scene.","Ji Fei really suspected that this world was just one big amateur operation.","[Isn't the theme 'family' a bit too deliberate? Combined with today's events, the internet is going to explode. Who are the director and producer targeting? Well, they're sweating now, obviously they didn't expect such a coincidence. Haha, it's hilarious, I bet their hearts are trembling.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong also wanted to laugh, but didn't dare to.","Teacher Lu maintained a composed face, immediately thinking about the theme, while Sun Man was naturally very uncomfortable.","After filming some more discussion footage, today's task was considered complete.","When they were dispersing, they found that Lang Zhe's proposal team had already left, and he was standing at the end of the corridor with Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle, waiting for people.","As soon as Ji Fei saw this situation, she quickly pulled their group back, waiting for Sun Man and Lu Fei to pass them.","The others, already familiar with Ji Fei's operations, naturally knew she was waiting to watch the drama unfold. Well, they wanted to watch too, so their footsteps unconsciously turned into shuffling.","However, to their surprise, Lu Fei and Sun Man also separated.","Lu Fei continued walking forward, while Sun Man stopped, seemingly wanting to talk to them.","Sun Man is a person who understands gratitude very well. Regarding what just happened, she thanked them again and again, because she understood that they had also offended people for her sake.","\"Stick to your refusal all the way,\" Ji Fei said with a smile.","Sun Man didn't expect Ji Fei to say this, and smiled with her eyes curved, \"Mmm, I will.\"","Pei Mingxuan, seizing the opportunity, took out a business card and handed it to Sun Man.","Sun Man was startled.","Pei Mingxuan smiled and said, \"If you want to play more and better roles, if you want to fully immerse yourself in your roles, if you don't want to be exploited and squeezed anymore, you might need a professional agent. Welcome to our studio. Our studio's current mission is to pave a bright path for female actors.\"","Qin Zhao: ? When did we get this mission?","Ji Fei: [Haha, Sister Pei's sales pitch is so awkward.]"]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: The rule of adulthood is to involve others as little as possible in one's own affairs.","paragraphs":["Lu Fei had already walked over, and Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle greeted her with smiles.","Lang Zhe, with a sinister look, stared at Sun Man from a distance and then said, \"Mom, let's all have dinner together later.\"","Lu Fei frowned immediately and said, \"When did I teach you to be so disrespectful to women?\"","\"When did I ever...\"","\"You have no rapport with her, and she's not being capricious. What gave you the courage to propose in public? You think you're touching others, but you're just self-indulgent, making others feel so awkward. What kind of respect for women is that?\"","\"She rejected me, she made things difficult for me! She disrespected me!\"","Lu Fei furrowed her brow deeply, \"What? Have your values gone crooked, and your brain gone bad too?\"","She found this son of hers increasingly unfamiliar. Although he wasn't outstanding or smart before, he was at least obedient and docile. Now he was doing all sorts of bizarre things.","\"Mom, I'm your son. Since you like Sun Man too, why don't you...\" Lang Zhe couldn't help but angrily question.","\"Because she's not the kind of girl who can be pursued relentlessly. I don't care why you lost her, but I know you're out of her heart.\"","Lu Fei was good at reading people. Such gentle-natured girls don't easily give up on someone, but once they do, they don't look back.","\"Mother-in-law, you're saying...\" Sun's Mother began, but Lu Fei's stern look and imposing manner made her falter.","\"Who are you calling mother-in-law? Don't call me that. Are you her real mother?\" Lu Fei directly asked.","Sun's Mother's face showed an awkward flicker, \"Of course I am.\"","\"Then you should act like a real mother. I've never seen a mother so indifferent to her own daughter. You have a good daughter, cherish her.\" Lu Fei, with her high status in the circle and military background, always spoke straightforwardly, leaving no room for detours. She made Sun's Mother blush with shame.","Sun's Uncle couldn't stand it, \"Hey, don't think we're the ones chasing you. It's your son who wants to marry our Sun Man.\"","Lu Fei glanced at Sun's Uncle and didn't even bother to speak to him, directly telling Lang Zhe, \"Come, let's go home.\"","Lang Zhe hesitated, but Lu Fei's stern rebuke, backed by blood ties, forced him to stop bothering Sun Man.","Only after they left did Sun Man breathe a sigh of relief and bid farewell to Ji Fei and the others.","\"I wish everyone a smooth final performance,\" Sun Man said with a smile.","\"Don't worry, the judge of the entertainment industry won't get to you,\" Pei Mingxuan said with a smile, \"She's already shown her power.\"","Everyone laughed, and Ji Fei looked innocent.","Indeed, she had shown her power, as today's internet hot searches were once again dominated by them.","The Qin Family only got the news when they returned home. The most idle Qin's Father and Qin's Mom immediately regretted missing the live excitement.","After dinner, the whole family watched the replay of the marriage proposal live stream.","Those who had seen it continued to feast on the internet gossip.","Lang Zhe's friends in the rap circle all came out to support him, believing that Sun Man had wronged him and deliberately released footage of Lang Zhe heartbroken and drunk, calling out Sun Man's name. Many fans of the rap circle also spoke out, even attacking Sun Man, accusing her of playing hard to get and acting. Some even brought up past rumors that were too fake to be believed.","However, they clearly underestimated the general public. Without needing Sun Man to speak, and not even being her fans, netizens directly lashed out.","\"Stop with the moral blackmail, netizens don't fall for that anymore!\"","\"Our judge of the entertainment industry said you're wrong, do you have a problem with that?\"","\"Your sadness, your sincerity, that's your business. The rule for adults is to keep your own affairs to yourself!\"","\"Post such videos on your own social media, do we know each other? You put it out there for us to judge.\"","\"Looking for people to empathize with you? There aren't many as self-righteous and thick-skinned as you.\"","In the end, the person who posted the blog deleted it.","The final situation was that netizens overwhelmingly mocked Lang Zhe, no one sympathized with him for proposing without asking first and then playing the victim after failing.","Sun Man was clearly affected, her first rehearsal had dark circles under her eyes, but she still greeted them enthusiastically.","Ji Fei checked and found that Sun's Mother, Sun's Uncle, and Lang Zhe were still brainwashing her.","However, things got better when they met again later, likely due to her own adjustment.","It was clear that there was no estrangement between Lu Fei and Sun Man, they were like teacher and student, one teaching earnestly, the other learning earnestly.","Yu Rouyin, who came to assist with the performance, remarked, \"Previously, people online were speculating about how they would get along later. It seems netizens underestimated women? Women helping women isn't anything special.\"","The director and producer, seeing such harmony, finally set their minds at ease. Of course, what made them even more relieved was that the top-tier group finally submitted a script that wasn't kept secret.","It was said that when the director and producer received the script, they hugged and cheered, tears streaming down their faces, as if they had finally heard the bell for a peaceful retirement.","Ji Fei also encountered Sun Man and Pei Mingxuan chatting in the corridor.","It was clear that Pei Mingxuan was continuing to recommend, and Sun Man's reaction showed she was very interested.","In fact, she knew it was time to get rid of the pests around her. She would fulfill her duty of support, but she wouldn't let them affect her life anymore.","Pei Mingxuan returned for the last time and told them that it was almost a sure thing.","It was also agreed that the signing would happen after the stage performance.","The script for Sun Man's group was about a mother and daughter's home, the great love of a mother, the filial piety of the child, a warm script showing how two women, working together, made life better, proving that children from single-parent families shouldn't be labeled.","The script was carefully selected by Sun Man, which was also her inner desire. She probably wanted to have such a family, to grow up like this, without needing her mother's so-called family support, just the two of them heart to heart, to grow up without lacking love.","Teacher Lu was also satisfied with the script. Hearing that Sun Man planned to dissolve her studio and join Ji Fei's group, she supported her and promised that if she needed any help, she should just ask.","Until the day before the live broadcast of the program, all peace and tranquility was shattered by an urgent online report.","#Sun Man found overdosing on sleeping pills, currently being rushed to the hospital for emergency treatment.#","When Ji Fei and Qin Zhao saw this news in the studio,","Pei Mingxuan was the first to receive the news and was immediately dumbfounded.","How could someone who was fine the day before suddenly be in trouble?","Pei Mingxuan even suspected that there was a conflict with her family over the signing and she was harmed, making her want to call the police.","Ji Fei suddenly pulled Pei Mingxuan, her face heavy, and said, \"It should... be that she wanted to commit suicide herself. Let's go to the hospital.\"","Qin Zhao looked at Ji Fei in surprise, hearing Ji Fei curse in her heart.","[Damn it, Lang Zhe, you're really a beast!]"]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: Acting Guilty Here","paragraphs":["Although Pei Mingxuan wasn't sure how Ji Fei had come to that conclusion, going to the hospital first was the right move.","After all, Pei Mingxuan was about to sign a contract with Sun Man, so she couldn't ignore her at this time.","Originally, Pei Mingxuan didn't want Qin Zhao and Ji Fei to go, to avoid being photographed and causing trouble, but Ji Fei insisted on going, so Pei Mingxuan had no choice. Naturally, Qin Zhao followed along as well.","In the car, Pei Mingxuan frantically searched for connections to investigate the situation, but people in the industry were also confused and didn't know what had happened, feeling bewildered when they heard the news.","However, Pei Mingxuan soon saw some new negative information on the Weibo accounts of Sun Man's anti-fans.","\"These people are really despicable, photoshopping such pictures. Aren't they afraid of being sued? It's probably just some mindless haters with skewed values.\"","Pei Mingxuan couldn't help but curse irritably. She didn't connect the two incidents, as it was normal for more famous celebrities to have this level of negative publicity. If Pei Mingxuan were already Sun Man's manager, she could handle it in minutes.","Ji Fei held her phone, her hand trembling slightly as she looked at those photos.","In one of them, Sun Man was lying face down on the bed, seemingly asleep. It wasn't clear if she was wearing anything, with only a blanket covering the crucial areas, but there were ambiguous marks left on her body. It was obviously a photo taken after some kind of intimate activity.","This type of photo was right on the edge of what could pass censorship, so it hadn't been taken down even after being online for so long.","Gradually, people started reposting these photos, and they began to spread on a small scale.","But most people were reporting the blogger, thinking they were sick. How could someone with such a beautiful and kind image like Sun Man take such photos? She had never even shown this much skin in her acting roles.","So the photos must be fake, posted by someone trying to tarnish her reputation now that she was popular.","Qin Zhao had naturally seen those photos too. He frowned slightly and turned to look at Ji Fei beside him. It was the first time he had seen Ji Fei's face so dark, and he couldn't hear her thoughts, clearly too angry to think.","And that curse from earlier - it seemed Sun Man's suicide was related to Lang Zhe.","Looking at these photos again, it wasn't hard for Qin Zhao to connect some dots. For example, these photos might have been leaked from Lang Zhe's side. He had heard that some men liked to take intimate photos with their girlfriends, but once such things are saved, there's always a risk of exposure. Perhaps Sun Man was just that unlucky this time.","But actually, looking at these photos and the netizens' reactions, Qin Zhao felt that Sun Man's personality shouldn't be so fragile as to be unable to withstand this blow. How did it escalate to the point of suicide?","The group quickly arrived at the hospital and soon found out the ward number. As they were heading there, they saw Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle standing at the door, talking in low voices with grim expressions.","Qin Zhao heard Ji Fei snort coldly, [If Lang Zhe is a beast, these two are worse than beasts. If it weren't for them, Sun Man wouldn't have been driven to suicide in desperation.]","Qin Zhao became even more curious. His phone was vibrating; it was their family group chat. Everyone had seen the news and knew they had gone to the hospital.","In this situation, it wasn't appropriate for them to come along, but they were really curious about what had happened. If necessary, they were definitely ready to wield the fist of justice to help.","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle quickly noticed their arrival, and their faces immediately darkened, especially when they saw Pei Mingxuan.","\"What are you doing here?!\" Sun's Uncle asked rudely.","Pei Mingxuan didn't beat around the bush with them, saying directly, \"Sun Man will soon be my artist. I'm here to see if there's anything I can help with.\"","\"Bullshit, Sun Man would never dissolve her studio,\" Sun's Uncle immediately cursed. He had obviously learned of Sun Man's decision and deeply resented it.","Sun's Mother also glared fiercely, saying, \"We don't need you meddling in our affairs. Please leave.\"","\"First forcing your daughter to get married, now blocking friends from visiting. Am I right to suspect that you're actually the ones who harmed Sun Man?\" Ji Fei said coldly. \"If you don't let us in to see Sun Man, we'll have to call the police.\"","In fact, Ji Fei's words didn't really hold water; at most, they could use public opinion to scare them. But Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle weren't timid people, so both Pei Mingxuan and Qin Zhao thought these words wouldn't work.","However, in the next second, they saw Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle's faces turn pale, their eyes darting about evasively. Although they still put on fierce expressions, they didn't dare to drive the visitors away.","\"What nonsense, we're her closest family, how could we harm her?\"","\"That's right, don't think you can say whatever you want just because you're some entertainment industry judge. We're the ones who... who should call the police.\"","This obvious guilty conscience made Pei Mingxuan's expression change instantly, and she immediately took out her phone.","Seeing her about to make a call, Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle thought she was calling the police and were terrified.","Sun's Mother quickly said, \"If you want to go in, then go. She's not awake anyway.\" After saying this, she hurriedly stepped aside.","Ji Fei snorted coldly and led the way in.","Pei Mingxuan and Qin Zhao followed. It wasn't until the ward door closed that Pei Mingxuan couldn't help but say, \"Could it be...\"","Qin Zhao glanced at Ji Fei and said, \"They must have done something wrong, that's why they're guilty.\"","[Of course they're guilty. When Sun Man desperately asked them for money for emergency treatment, they discovered that their years of savings had been secretly transferred to their cousin long ago. Sun Man should have still had that 10 million in her hands, so Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle thought they wouldn't be exposed. But they didn't know that Sun Man's money had already been swindled away by Lang Zhe. So Sun Man could only ask them for money, but unexpectedly, this last lifeline was gone. Being constantly deceived by her ex-lover and closest family, under this double blow, she suddenly couldn't take it anymore, so...]","Hearing this, Qin Zhao finally understood part of the truth. He was so angry that he clenched his fists, wanting to turn around and go beat them up.","Because of Chu Xinyue's situation, Qin Zhao really hated parents who didn't love their children. He would definitely make them pay when he got the chance.","But coming back to the point, what exactly had driven Sun Man to such desperation?","Just as they passed through the entrance, they saw Lu Fei walking out.","\"Teacher Lu?\" The three were surprised.","Lu Fei nodded and said, \"I heard voices and thought there might be some conflict, so I came out.\" She knew about the manager situation, so naturally, she knew those two would give them a hard time. That's why she came to receive them personally.","Probably still dreaming of becoming in-laws, those two had no objections to Lu Fei being here.","Seeing Lu Fei, Ji Fei's expression changed slightly, and she strode quickly towards the inside.","Qin Zhao clearly saw the murderous intent in Ji Fei's eyes.","Soon, Ji Fei's steps halted, her gaze fixed fiercely on the person in front of the hospital bed.","There, Lang Zhe sat with a blank expression, tightly gripping his phone.","He looked as if he couldn't accept the fact that his loved one had attempted suicide, causing Pei Mingxuan to frown slightly. Even Qin Zhao started to agree that Lang Zhe might have accidentally leaked the photos, leading to some unfortunate events.","But in the next second, he heard Ji Fei's scornful internal monologue.","[Shameless dog, acting remorseful here. Didn't you think about her committing suicide when you were planning to blackmail Sun Man for money with your self-directed drama?]","Qin Zhao's gaze towards Lang Zhe immediately became troubled.","Self-directed drama?","Blackmail?"]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: What kind of look is that Resentment","paragraphs":["Qin Zhao's mind was still in shock when he heard Ji Fei's resentful voice again.","[Damn, so it wasn't guilt towards Sun Man, but helplessness and fear about not being able to get money to pay off debts in time.]","With this, Qin Zhao finally understood.","It turned out that Lang Zhe had not given up and was still targeting Sun Man. Since the proposal failed, he switched to blackmail?","So those photos were actively sent out by Lang Zhe... He might have made even worse threats, which led to Sun Man being so frightened that she paid to avoid disaster, only to end up losing the money as well.","This beastly behavior made Qin Zhao want to rush forward and punch him. His eyes were practically shooting daggers at Lang Zhe.","But Lang Zhe was completely oblivious, his gaze blank as if he wasn't even there.","\"What exactly happened?\" Pei Mingxuan directly asked Lu Fei.","Lu Fei sighed and looked worriedly at Sun Man on the bed, saying: \"We're not sure either. We only know that she didn't show up for rehearsal time. When we contacted her mother, we heard something had happened, so we rushed over.\"","\"When we asked her mother and uncle, they claimed to know nothing, but they were acting suspiciously. I suspect Sun Man's incident has something to do with them,\" Lu Fei said disdainfully.","Pei Mingxuan sighed, \"She was such a strong girl. What could have happened to make her feel so hopeless?\"","As this conversation unfolded, the dazed Lang Zhe finally showed some reaction, looking at the unconscious Sun Man with an extremely poor expression.","[Damn, I can't stand it anymore. What kind of look is that? Blame? Blaming Sun Man for having low tolerance? Upset that her suicide attempt is delaying his debt repayment progress?]","Ji Fei was practically fuming with rage.","Before Ji Fei could think of a way to deal with him, Qin Zhao suddenly took a few steps forward to Lang Zhe's side, as if he was going to greet him.","But then he stumbled, taking a fall on flat ground. To keep his balance, Qin Zhao instinctively reached out his hand to steady himself, and Lang Zhe, who was sitting in the chair, was unexpectedly pushed over.","With a cry of pain, Lang Zhe tumbled from the chair, his body slamming hard against the nearby wall. The commotion was quite significant, startling everyone.","Lang Zhe was seen grimacing in pain, his wrist swelling rapidly.","\"Are you alright?\" Qin Zhao anxiously went to help him up, grabbing his wrist, which only added to the torment. The pain made Lang Zhe howl again, his face turning red. He had no energy to think about anything else, only feeling the pain. He had rarely suffered like this in his life.","This chaotic scene left everyone stunned. When they came to their senses, Lu Fei and Pei Mingxuan rushed forward to check the situation.","\"You...\" Pei Mingxuan was too surprised to speak. How could such an unlucky accident happen to Qin Zhao? It seemed too coincidental.","If they didn't have a history free of grudges, she would have suspected Qin Zhao did it on purpose.","Lu Fei naturally felt sorry for her son, but she couldn't imagine Qin Zhao would do this intentionally. She had been focused on talking to Pei Mingxuan and hadn't noticed their side. Otherwise, with her abilities, she should have been able to see through Qin Zhao's act. At this point, she could only chalk it up to bad luck.","Only Ji Fei realized what had happened and nearly burst out laughing, silently giving Qin Zhao a thumbs up in her mind.","Whether it was a freak accident or not, as long as it made that beast suffer, it was fine by her.","Qin Zhao was naturally gloating inside as well. After hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, he simply couldn't resist and had to pull this move, giving Lang Zhe a taste of righteous iron fist, considering it as interest paid.","In the end, Qin Zhao, of course, kindly called for a doctor to treat Lang Zhe's injury.","After all the commotion, Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle also came in, trying to get everyone to leave. They were probably afraid that when Sun Man woke up, some things would be exposed, and they still had their reputation to consider.","But just then, Sun Man woke up.","She opened her eyes hazily. Pei Mingxuan noticed first and quickly went forward, asking, \"Sun Man? Are you feeling better?\"","Lu Fei also crowded around worriedly.","Sun Man was confused for a moment, then saw her mother and uncle squeezing in, mouthing words of concern and reproach, but their eyes couldn't meet Sun Man's gaze.","\"You silly girl, how could you be so thoughtless to do such a thing? If you were gone, how could I go on living?\"","\"That's right, Sun Man, you need to reflect on this. We're all family, what's the big deal?\"","Sun Man seemed to finally remember, her pupils constricting, her eyes gradually filling with bloodshot. She almost viciously sat up, staring hard at her two closest relatives.","The hatred in her eyes was clear even to Qin Zhao standing nearby.","In his ear was Ji Fei's sigh.","[It seems that compared to being blackmailed, the people Sun Man hates more now are actually these two relatives. Think about it, it makes sense. She doesn't know who's behind the blackmail, although she might guess where the photos leaked from, but she couldn't possibly imagine that the person blackmailing her is actually Lang Zhe.]","[She only knows that when she was desperate and helpless, too afraid to seek help from the police, only daring to turn to her family, her family gave her the most fatal blow. That kind of betrayal is truly soul-crushing. How could she not hate them? How could she not despair? It's understandable that she might have acted rashly in the moment, but now... she probably won't anymore.]","They had probably never seen Sun Man look at them with such eyes before.","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle became cowardly at this moment.","Sun's Mother tried to reach out to hold Sun Man, but Sun Man grabbed something from the bedside table and threw it at her mother and uncle without hesitation.","\"I don't have relatives like you. What family? Have you ever treated me as family? You only see me as a money tree, you just want to suck my blood!\"","Sun's Mother and Uncle scrambled to dodge, but still got hit.","Seeing the large bump on her brother's head, Sun's Mother immediately scolded, \"How could you throw things at your uncle!\"","\"Mom, I almost died,\" Sun Man said painfully.","\"That's because you were foolish enough to attempt suicide. Trying to end your life over money, I never knew you were so obsessed with money before,\" Sun's Mother said disapprovingly.","Even now, they still thought Sun Man had only attempted suicide after discovering the money transfer.","Sun Man's expression became completely blank.","Ji Fei worried that she might be triggered again and was about to speak when she saw Sun Man's expression gradually turn cold. With a self-mocking smile, she said, \"Indeed, I was foolish and did something stupid.\"","Though her whole body was trembling, Sun Man spoke word by word: \"Now that I'm awake, I'm telling you that I will take back every penny you took from me! I won't compromise anymore, just you wait! If you don't return it, I'll report you to the police and sue you.\"","With these words, the hospital room fell silent.","\"You... you ungrateful child! If you dare do that, I'll disown you as my daughter!\"","But this kind of threat could no longer control Sun Man, after all, she had already died once.","\"Then you can write up a statement severing our relationship. I'll definitely sign it,\" Sun Man said expressionlessly."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: It's My Fault for Misjudging People","paragraphs":["It seemed Sun Man had never spoken so harshly before, leaving her mother completely stunned. After all, in her mother's mind, her daughter could never abandon her.","\"What's all this fuss about? Once your cousin starts making money, he'll naturally pay you back,\" Sun's Uncle said, still maintaining a stern expression.","For the first time, Sun Man openly mocked them, \"That good-for-nothing? Are you still dreaming? I bet the money's already been squandered.\"","As if a veil had been lifted, shame and anger immediately spread across the faces of Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle.","\"If there's no money, we can earn more. What's the big deal? Why make such a fuss?\" Sun's Uncle angrily retorted.","\"That was MY money. How dare you say such things!\" Sun Man seemed to have transformed suddenly, no longer holding back. \"I'm done arguing with you. Just leave. If I don't see you repaying the money tomorrow, expect a court summons.\"","Faced with such a resolute Sun Man, Sun's Uncle and Sun's Mother began to panic.","Sun's Mother pleaded, \"How can that be, Manman? Let me be honest with you, we really don't have the money. It was all invested in your cousin's business. We truly can't pay it back. Even if you kill him, there's nothing to get. Can we please stop fighting? We'll definitely pay you back later. Just give him one more year... no, three years.\"","Suddenly, there was a commotion at the hospital room door. Lang Zhe walked in, supporting his arm, his face pale.","His pupils trembled, and his lips quivered as he looked at Sun Man and the others.","Ji Fei was amused by Lang Zhe's expression.","[Oh my, he's panicking. He's just realized that all of Sun Man's money has been transferred away. Even if he tries to blackmail her with those secretly taken photos, he won't be able to squeeze out a single penny. Now that he knows the truth, isn't he feeling desperate? All that effort wasted, and time lost too.]","Qin Zhao also silently sneered at Lang Zhe's pathetic appearance.","Seeing Lang Zhe open and close his mouth, unable to find words, only made Ji Fei and Qin Zhao more amused.","[He can't even dare to question her now. Look at how constrained his face is, veins about to pop out.]","\"What... what have you done to Sun Man?\" Lang Zhe asked Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle, his voice distorted.","Others assumed Lang Zhe was questioning out of love, while Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle didn't dare face him directly.","However, Sun Man remained calm and said, \"Lang Zhe, why did you secretly photograph me when we were together? Were you the one who spread those photos?\"","Lang Zhe's expression immediately changed several times.","Everyone turned to look at Lang Zhe, and although many were confused, they realized that Sun Man's suicide attempt might not be so simple.","\"What photos? What secret photography?\" Lu Fei immediately asked.","Lang Zhe hadn't expected Sun Man to openly discuss such matters in public.","He was momentarily stunned but still forced himself to say, \"Manman, I really don't know. I had some business to attend to earlier and my phone was off. I only turned it on when I heard about your incident, and that's when I saw your messages. I wasn't avoiding you, I truly didn't know what had happened.\"","[I said before that his acting was good. He plays this despicable role the best.]","Qin Zhao, watching Lang Zhe pretend to be innocent, felt his fists clench again.","Sun Man stared at him intently, \"You haven't answered my question. Why did you do it?\"","\"Lang Zhe, what did you do?\" Lu Fei asked anxiously.","Pei Mingxuan, however, seemed to catch on, exclaiming in surprise, \"Could it be those revealing photos the trolls posted?\"","Sun Man's body trembled as she looked up at Pei Mingxuan and asked, \"Pei-jie, has it completely spread online...\"","Seeing Sun Man's expression, Pei Mingxuan quickly took out her phone to show her, \"It's just some revealing photos. Even if they're real, it's not a big deal. We can definitely handle this with proper PR. You really didn't need to...\"","Pei Mingxuan had seen all sorts of celebrity issues, and this was nothing but a minor problem to her.","Sun Man saw that they were still the same photos she had first seen, and was confused. Had her suicide attempt caused such a stir that the other party didn't take further action?","\"Let me see,\" Lu Fei quickly took the phone and looked. Her face immediately darkened, and remembering what Sun Man had just said, she shot a sharp glance at Lang Zhe. \"Did you do this?\"","Although Lu Fei was referring to Lang Zhe taking the photos, it still made the guilty Lang Zhe's legs go weak, almost losing his balance.","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle sensed something was amiss and rushed over to look. They gasped in shock when they saw the photos.","Sun's Mother exclaimed, \"Sun Man, what have you done? How could you do something so shameful!\"","No one had expected Sun's Mother to react this way.","[Good heavens, what are their brains made of? It was explained so clearly just now, how can they still blame Sun Man? Are some parents and relatives always quick to blame their own children whenever something goes wrong?]","Ji Fei couldn't help but say, \"Auntie Sun really knows how to side with outsiders, doesn't she? Usually, it's her relatives, and now it's even the perpetrator. It seems anyone is more precious to Auntie Sun than her own daughter.\"","Sun's Mother didn't react immediately, but Sun's Uncle's face turned red as he shouted, \"What nonsense are you spouting!\"","\"Am I wrong? These photos were clearly taken while she was asleep. She's the victim. Instead of protecting your own daughter and feeling sorry for her, you scold her... tsk tsk tsk.\"","Sun's Mother's face alternated between red and pale. \"As her mother, can't I say anything when she does something wrong? It's her fault for not being careful.\"","Sun's Uncle glanced at Lang Zhe, and although he seemed displeased, he still blamed Sun Man, saying, \"She really has no self-respect!\"","\"She's an adult with a boyfriend. Intimate contact is normal, but taking photos without her consent - is that her fault?\" Ji Fei pointed out directly.","Lang Zhe's face darkened.","But Sun Man said, \"It is my fault. I misjudged someone's character. So, my affairs are none of your business. You don't need to stand here giving orders. Instead of wasting time here, why don't you hurry back and prepare to repay my money! Do you really think I'm joking this time? I will follow through. I've already died once, I'm not afraid of anything anymore!\"","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle looked at Sun Man in shock. They had thought that after experiencing such a thing, Sun Man would seek their help and want them by her side. They hadn't expected this reaction, and immediately fell silent.","Sun Man couldn't be bothered with them anymore and turned her fierce, though disheveled, gaze towards Lang Zhe.","Lang Zhe naturally forced himself to make up an excuse, \"Manman, I've wronged you in this matter. I really don't know how those photos got out. I just... when we were dating, I liked you so much that I secretly took some photos. I think it might be related to my phone being lost recently. I really didn't mean for this to happen, I...\"","Hearing this, Sun Man seemed to have her suspicions confirmed and gave up hope. She closed her eyes briefly and said, \"You didn't just take these photos, there are videos too, do you know that? I was blackmailed. They first released a batch of photos to threaten me, then demanded 60 million yuan. If I didn't pay, they threatened to release the videos, sell them to foreign websites, and ruin my reputation forever, making it impossible for me to show my face in public!\""]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: No Need, I Choose to Call the Police","paragraphs":["【Six million! You little bastard! You're not only thinking about paying off the five million in gambling debts but also extorting an extra million to use as gambling capital, huh?】","Ji Fei quickly skimmed through the messages and didn't notice this detail. The disgusting stuff is always nauseating no matter how many times you see it.","Qin Zhao was also disgusted to the core and couldn't vent his frustration, so he kept sharing it in the gossip group to let everyone else feel the disgust.","Six million is no small amount, almost enough to drain Sun Man of all her assets, but she had no choice but to do it.","Originally, Pei Mingxuan and the others thought it was just those explicit photos, which would be easy to handle in the country.","But then they heard there were also videos, secretly recorded, that could drive Sun Man to the brink of suicide. It was pretty clear what kind of videos they were.","If such videos were released, the domestic internet might quickly handle it, but there would still be a period of spread.","If it were just that, Sun Man might not collapse so quickly.","But the method of the threat was too vicious.","He also planned to sell them to foreign websites, which would turn it into a permanent scandal following her.","Sun Man was still very traditional and disciplined at heart. The thought of her videos being spread like that was unbearable for her.","Perhaps a strong-willed woman would dare to report everything to the police, but at that moment, Sun Man didn't dare. She didn't want to face it, just wanted to settle the matter quietly. Unable to find Lang Zhe to ask about the situation, she could only instinctively seek help from her relatives, only to find that there was no way out ahead, and even her relatives were harming her.","She had no one to help her, and the despair at that moment surpassed all her will to live.","Now, she was questioning the person who had brought her to this state, not knowing that it was all a self-directed, self-acted scam for money.","Facing her questioning, Lang Zhe looked quite regretful, \"I really didn't know it would turn out like this. I really didn't mean it, Man Man, I...\"","\"You scoundrel!\" Lu Fei heard this and, without a word, rushed up and slapped Lang Zhe twice, so hard that he fell to the ground.","Lang Zhe's mouth was bleeding, and he looked at Lu Fei in astonishment. After all, even his mother had never hit him like that.","\"How did I give birth to such a fool? Get down on your knees to Sun Man!\" Lu Fei knew this was a serious matter, one that could ruin a person's life. This girl, with such good acting skills, was just about to step onto the bright path of life. How could she bear this!","\"Oh, what a sin, what are we going to do now?\" Sun's Mother wailed.","Sun's Uncle, however, rolled his eyes and said, \"This... Sun Man, is this why you asked us for money? But even if we did, it's too late, we can't gather that much. Why waste it? Or... or just let it go. After all, you're an artist, artists can do anything, right? Just consider it a self-breakthrough. And if it really blows up, it could be a wave of publicity, maybe even boost your popularity. Some foreign stars market themselves with such videos, don't they?\"","\"You know quite a lot,\" Pei Mingxuan directly mocked. \"Why don't you make one and I'll help you become famous.\"","\"How could I...\" Sun's Uncle was immediately stumped and saw Sun Man's almost murderous gaze, which made him quiet down. \"Isn't this just a last resort?\"","At this moment, Lang Zhe, who was forced to kneel, quickly said, \"Man Man, the videos absolutely cannot be released. You know I don't have money, otherwise I would definitely give you money to solve this problem. Think of a way to borrow money from someone else, okay?\"","After saying that, his gaze even swept over Qin Zhao and Ji Fei.","At that moment, both of them felt like they had 'fat sheep' written on their heads.","【You want to die! Do I look like someone with that much money? You're actually targeting me, I see, you're tired of living.】","Qin Zhao also sneered in his heart, thinking Lang Zhe really dared to dream.","But it wasn't their turn to say anything, just as Lu Fei said, \"Since it's my son who caused this, if you really want to do this, I'll pay the money.\"","Lu Fei didn't try to persuade Sun Man to report to the police, because no one knew what the outcome of that would be. Catching the person was certain, but what if the video leaked before they were caught?","As outsiders, they didn't dare to gamble with the future of the person involved. But since her son was at fault, she would take responsibility.","Everyone was a bit surprised looking at Lu Fei.","Lang Zhe was even more stunned for a moment, then lowered his head, as if he had accepted this statement.","【What a good son, turning a scam on his ex-girlfriend into a scam on his mother. As long as it gets you money, right?】","Qin Zhao sneered in his heart. It was said that gambling addicts were ruthless to their own kin, and now he had seen it for himself.","If there was a better way, he might really choose to scam his mother, and even scam more money. After all, Qin Zhao suspected that the so-called six million was actually the maximum Lang Zhe thought Sun Man could come up with.","But since they already knew the truth, they couldn't just let things go on. But how to expose it?","Qin Zhao couldn't think of a good way, so he went to the group chat to see, and the group exploded.","Seeing the extreme limits of human nature, the group was filled with all kinds of curses.","Only Qin Xian replied, \"Since it's self-directed and self-acted, everything can still be salvaged. The videos and photos should still be in his hands. Sun Man will probably report to the police. To prevent Lang Zhe from going to extremes, it's best to find all the files first.\"","Qin Zhao was stunned and immediately started looking for Lang Zhe's phone, but then thought, what if he stored them somewhere else?","Then he heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","【Not sure if it's lucky or unlucky, but at least the videos that Sun Man was worried about haven't really been spread. They're all still on Lang Zhe's phone. He just used some means to disguise them as someone else's account and sent the photos to blackmailers, then sent some photo and video clips to scare Sun Man. If we can catch Lang Zhe immediately, everything will be fine. If not, it's troublesome. Should we listen to Lu Fei's suggestion? First, confirm the extortion charge and then catch him? To prevent him from running out of money and thinking of selling the videos... I always feel he's capable of such shameless acts. Or the simplest way, destroy the phone? But then there would be no evidence to convict him, right?】","Qin Zhao suddenly jolted, combining his brother and sister-in-law's words, it was almost certain that all the materials were in Lang Zhe's current phone.","And his brother's suggestion was to find those files, meaning not to destroy them, because destroying them would mean no evidence to punish this scoundrel.","But to prevent Lang Zhe from going to extremes, it seemed they had to control the phone first and then report to the police. But how to avoid suspicion of them knowing the truth in advance?","Ji Fei was also pondering when he heard Sun Man say, \"No need, I choose to report to the police.\"","Qin Zhao was helpless, just as his brother predicted, wouldn't Lang Zhe panic?","Pei Mingxuan also nodded, \"Actually, reporting to the police is the best. Extortion once means there will be a second. But... you're gambling with your future, Sun Man, have you thought it through?\"","Sun Man's eyes were filled with sorrow but she nodded, \"Sorry, Pei Jie, I can't sign with you for now.\"","Who knew what her future would be? But she didn't want to give in to those ugly people, she was willing to face all the storms.","\"No!\"","Lang Zhe suddenly stood up in a hurry. \"My mom is going to help you, why are you being stubborn! What if those leak out...\"","\"Don't worry, I've seen those videos, the angles don't show you.\" Sun Man said, but then paused slightly, probably feeling something was off.","\"Is that what I care about? I care about you.\" Lang Zhe quickly said, \"Since you've already made such a big scene about suicide, I believe the other party wouldn't dare. It should only be this once, let's just consider it paying for disaster.\"","Sun Man, however, insisted, \"I said I've died once, I don't care, I just want those who harmed me to pay the price!\"","Lang Zhe's face finally couldn't hold it. His eyes hid a trace of undetectable ferocity, \"Or, let's wait for news, maybe there's still a way to turn it around.\""]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Haven't Deleted Those Things You Took Yet","paragraphs":["Lang Zhe knew he had to buy time and find the right opportunity to intimidate Sun Man, preventing her from doing anything foolish.","\"Lang Zhe, what are you talking about? We absolutely do not negotiate with criminals,\" Lu Fei suddenly spoke up.","\"Mom, this isn't the time to—\" Lang Zhe quickly tried to interrupt, but he couldn't stop his mother.","Lu Fei grabbed Sun Man's hand and said, \"My dear, I've said that this incident was caused by Lang Zhe, so our family will take responsibility. If you want to pay money to resolve this, I'll provide it. If you want to report it to the police, leave it to me. I may not have many abilities, but I do have some military connections and can make things happen. I guarantee the criminals won't escape, but... I must warn you, I can't ensure your videos and photos won't be leaked before then. The perpetrators might retaliate out of desperation...\"","Although Sun Man resented Lang Zhe, she didn't redirect her anger towards Lu Fei. Hearing these words, her eyes reddened slightly. Having an elder willing to stand up and handle everything for her at this time was indeed touching.","Unlike her own family...","\"Thank you, Professor Lu. I want to report this to the police,\" Sun Man said firmly.","Lu Fei nodded and took out her phone to call the police.","Lang Zhe's face contorted almost instantly.","[Haha, an unexpected twist! Lang Zhe, you didn't expect your mother to be the one to defeat you, not your ex-girlfriend. I'm curious though, what expression will Professor Lu have if she ends up catching her own son? I feel a bit sorry for her.]","Lang Zhe didn't give Lu Fei a chance to call the police. He quickly snatched her phone and said, \"No, Mom!\"","\"What are you doing!\" Lu Fei shouted angrily.","Even Pei Mingxuan found Lang Zhe's behavior strange at this point. \"Lang Zhe, Sun Man already said you're not visible in the video, so it won't affect you. You're not her boyfriend anymore, so it seems you don't have the right to keep interfering like this.\"","Sun Man looked at Lang Zhe, initially thinking his actions were due to a possessive ex-boyfriend's desire to prevent her private moments from being exposed.","However, Ji Fei suddenly said, \"Are you worried that the police will come looking for you after we report this?\"","Lang Zhe immediately lost his composure. \"What nonsense are you talking about? Why would the police look for me? This has nothing to do with me.\"","[He's panicking, he's panicking! You're panicking.]","Seeing Lang Zhe's strange behavior, Lu Fei frowned and said, \"Why are you getting so worked up?\"","Lang Zhe froze.","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow and smiled, \"My, why so agitated? The photos and videos were leaked from your phone, so it's normal for the police to want to examine it for evidence, isn't it? I just thought you might be worried about the inconvenience. Your reaction is so strong, one might think I accused you of being the criminal and that the police are coming to arrest you! You gave me quite a fright.\"","[Oh my, someone's putting on a show of 'the guilty party protests too much', aren't they?]","Ji Fei looked reproachful, while Lang Zhe's face went through a range of colors.","Qin Zhao almost laughed out loud, wanting to give his sister-in-law a thumbs up. She had nearly exposed the truth without arousing suspicion.","At this moment, Qin Zhao had to add fuel to the fire. \"Why are you sweating? That's strange. What are you nervous and afraid of? Could it be...\"","[Bravo, the third brother is quite perceptive. He's noticed something off about Lang Zhe. If they keep this up, they might just K.O. Lang Zhe.]","Qin Zhao, hearing the praise, was so focused on playing along that he didn't notice his phone's notification light blinking frequently.","Qin Zhao and Ji Fei had no choice but to tread carefully, as Lang Zhe still held leverage over them. One wrong move could ruin Sun Man's situation, so they couldn't act rashly and had to take it one step at a time.","By now, everyone else was looking at Lang Zhe with various suspicions.","\"Lang Zhe, are you hiding something from us?\" Lu Fei couldn't possibly imagine her son involved in anything illicit, so she just assumed he was concealing some information.","At this point, Lang Zhe truly couldn't handle the pressure. Feeling like he was about to be exposed, he resorted to angry attacks.","\"What could I possibly be hiding? I'm just angry because they're going too far. What kind of relationship do I have with Man Man? How could I hurt her? What are you all speculating about? I lost my phone, does that make me a criminal in your eyes?\"","Qin Zhao scoffed, \"Lang Zhe, you're overthinking this. I never said anything about criminals. I was wondering if... perhaps you hadn't deleted those things you recorded, which is why you're so nervous about the police coming to examine your phone.\"","Lang Zhe's hand unconsciously moved towards his pocket, his pupils quivering. He immediately shouted, \"Of course I deleted them!\"","\"Is that so? Well, in this situation, Sun Man is still the victim. It's necessary to check, just to be sure. That way, if anything else comes out later, it can't be blamed on you. It's good for everyone's mutual trust. You don't mind, do you?\" Ji Fei seized the opportunity and immediately demanded Lang Zhe's phone.","Lang Zhe's face turned ashen. \"Don't push it.\"","Ji Fei feigned innocence, \"Huh? How can you refuse such a reasonable request?\"","Sun Man and Lu Fei were both stunned for a moment. They had instinctively assumed that after such an incident, Lang Zhe would have already deleted the incriminating material. How could any normal person keep it, risking further trouble if the phone was lost again?","But seeing Lang Zhe's reaction, if he had really deleted everything, why was he so sensitive about it?","Pei Mingxuan narrowed her eyes slightly. Having seen all sorts of things in the entertainment industry, and already knowing about the gambling and debt issues, she pondered for a moment and came to the most unbelievable conclusion.","Could it be that he orchestrated this himself?","Suddenly, Pei Mingxuan spoke up, \"Sun Man is the main subject of the videos and photos. Taking them without permission is illegal in itself. You say you've deleted them, but there's no proof. It's better if we check for ourselves to be sure, unless... you're lying.\"","Lang Zhe could barely stop himself from taking a step back.","Sun Man's expression changed several times. Perhaps this young woman had finally started to think about her boyfriend of several sweet years in the worst possible light.","It wasn't as simple as gambling and failing to repay debts.","Lu Fei's face changed. \"Hand over the phone.\"","Lang Zhe was truly out of options. He could only say, \"I see you've all lost your minds. I won't bother explaining. My phone is my privacy, and I won't show it to anyone.\" After this righteous declaration, he turned to leave.","It seemed he wanted to escape the situation.","This was the scenario Ji Fei and Qin Zhao feared most, as they had no valid reason to stop Lang Zhe.","But in this situation, they could only resort to forceful intervention.","However, before Lang Zhe could reach the entrance, they heard three knocks on the door, followed by someone entering.","\"Police. We're here on official business.\"","An authoritative male voice rang out, accompanied by footsteps. Two male police officers walked in, one after the other.","When Lang Zhe saw the police, he froze. Without thinking, he foolishly tried to break through and run out.","This sudden movement naturally startled the police, who thought someone was trying to attack them.","Without hesitation, the lead young officer executed a skillful takedown, pinning Lang Zhe to the ground.","\"Who are you? What are you trying to do? Handcuff him first!\"","This turn of events caught everyone by surprise.","Even Ji Fei was stunned. She hadn't called the police, and no one had the opportunity to do so secretly.","Besides, who would dare to report such a matter to the police without the victim's consent?"]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Take Away, Take Away, All Taken Away","paragraphs":["It wasn't until Qin Zhao greeted everyone that they snapped back to reality.","\"Brother Luo?\"","The handsome police officer who had executed the arrest stood up, handcuffing the bewildered Lang Zhe behind his back with one hand. He greeted cheerfully, \"Qin Third, long time no see.\"","After speaking, his keen eagle-like eyes swept over Ji Fei, but he only nodded, giving a perfunctory greeting.","Ji Fei had been admiring the handsome police officer, thinking his looks were perfect for promotional videos. If he went on a livestream, the screen would surely be filled with viewers calling him \"husband\" - he was truly a feast for the eyes. But seeing that he knew Qin Zhao and noticing his attitude, she carefully observed his features and tried to recall.","[Oh, I remember now. Luo Fei, one of Qin Xian's good friends. He was college classmates with Qin Xian and Yu Zhi. He really shipped those two, and also knew the truth about their marriage back then... No wonder he's so cold towards me. It seems that after that, even the Qin Family stopped visiting, thinking the Qin family had forced Qin Xian to marry without regard for his happiness.]","Qin Zhao felt awkward hearing this, not expecting his sister-in-law to know so much. But he was quite surprised to see Luo Fei here.","\"What are you doing here?\" Qin Zhao asked.","\"Didn't you call the police?\" Luo Fei said, gesturing towards his phone.","Qin Zhao was confused and quickly checked his phone. Earlier, he had casually mentioned to everyone the information he got from Ji Fei that all the evidence was in Lang Zhe's phone, so Qin Xian had given the final plan.","The plan was to call the police while the suspect was still unaware, catching him off guard and taking him to the police station along with the evidence. This way, there would be nothing to worry about.","As it happened, Luo Fei had just returned from a case, so Qin Xian contacted him directly to handle this incident.","Qin Xian had hinted to Luo Fei that based on his discreet investigation, Lang Zhe might be crying thief to catch a thief. But they couldn't reveal themselves to say this, so they asked Luo Fei to investigate on his own. They had only one request: to secure the phone with the evidence the moment they caught him, to avoid causing secondary harm to the victim.","It's easier to get things done with someone you know. Naturally, Luo Fei trusted Qin Xian's judgment, so he directly treated Lang Zhe as a suspect. This completely resolved the concerns Ji Fei and Qin Zhao had.","They didn't expect Lang Zhe to be so stupid as to perform a public act of resisting arrest before anything had even happened, nearly turning himself into a fugitive.","Since things had been arranged this way, Qin Zhao immediately played along.","\"Oh my, I'm sorry. I just heard you were going to call the police, so I drafted a message to help Professor Sun find someone familiar to help. I didn't expect to accidentally send it just now,\" Qin Zhao said.","[Damn! Third Brother, that's brilliant. The timing was perfect. And it's someone we know, so we can hint at things later, right? This is foolproof!]","Qin Zhao sheepishly accepted the praise, apologizing internally to his second brother for stealing his thunder.","Turning to the dumbfounded group, he said, \"Since the police are here, Professor Sun, do you want to file a report?\"","Sun Man hadn't yet recovered from her earlier suspicions, and facing the police always brought an extra measure of reverence. She quickly took out her phone and honestly explained the whole situation from beginning to end.","\"So you're saying the photos were leaked from your phone?\" Luo Fei looked directly at Lang Zhe.","Lang Zhe had come to his senses and tried to struggle. \"It was an accident. Why are you arresting me?\"","Lu Fei couldn't help but step forward, unable to bear seeing her own son being arrested.","\"Then you're mistaken. From now on, you're the prime suspect,\" Luo Fei said without wasting words, directly taking the phone from Lang Zhe's pocket and preserving it as evidence.","\"What are you doing!\" Lang Zhe almost screamed. He couldn't believe how things had developed this way.","\"Prime suspect?\" Lu Fei said in shock.","\"Yes, usually in these cases, it's someone familiar with the victim. And his claim about losing his phone is just his word. As long as we can find a possibility that he needed a large sum of money recently, he would have an absolute motive to stage a blackmail case. For example, if he has any bad habits, any financial disputes...\"","\"Does gambling count?\" Pei Mingxuan chimed in with perfect timing.","Her words were like a thunderclap out of clear sky. The secret that they thought was well-hidden, that his ex-girlfriend had sworn not to reveal, was suddenly exposed.","\"You... you... what did you say?\" Lang Zhe couldn't handle the shock, his eyes almost rolling back. He then glared angrily at Sun Man.","Sun Man was also stunned for a moment.","Pei Mingxuan innocently said, \"Don't blame me. The police are asking questions, and we ordinary citizens must cooperate and tell everything we know. Besides, if you don't want others to know, don't do it in the first place. I can still hear some rumors in the industry.\"","This was also a statement that the gambling information didn't come from Sun Man, to prevent Lang Zhe from causing trouble for Sun Man later if he was released without charge.","\"I... I didn't!\" Lang Zhe no longer dared to raise his head. He could feel the burning gaze from his mother's direction.","\"He gambles, I can confirm that,\" Sun Man suddenly spoke up.","With everyone helping her like this, she couldn't possibly let them down at this moment.","Lang Zhe looked at Sun Man in disbelief. Such an obedient girl should respect promises the most. Even though they had broken up, Sun Man shouldn't be capable of exposing someone else's secrets.","But Sun Man looked at him with a numb and sad expression. After all, they were once in love, and sometimes those who are most deeply deceived are also those who understand each other best.","\"He once tricked me out of ten million to pay off gambling debts. We broke up after that.\"","She just never imagined that some people could be so ruthless for the sake of gambling.","But once this setting was accepted, some coincidences were no longer coincidences.","The truth seemed clear even without investigation.","Before anyone could react, Lu Fei slapped Lang Zhe. Luo Fei was very adaptable, quickly moving aside and pretending to break up the fight, letting Lu Fei vent her anger first.","\"Was it you? Was it you who did it, you damn brat? What have you done? How could you do such a thing? How can you face Sun Man? How can you face your father and me? How can you face...\"","\"I didn't, I didn't...\"","In the end, Lang Zhe's face was covered in blood, and he was crying as the police who arrived later took him away.","\"Ms. Sun, please rest assured. We will have professionals track and handle all photos and videos. We will protect the personal safety, property, and reputation of every citizen,\" Luo Fei said.","Hearing these words, Sun Man finally teared up again, crying with relief.","Originally, she had prepared herself to face all the storms, but unexpectedly, everything was resolved so suddenly. She didn't know which deity had helped her, but she was grateful to heaven for not pushing her to the brink.","After completing the relevant records, Luo Fei asked, \"Ms. Sun, is there anything else you want to request? For example, recovering that ten million?\"","Before Sun Man could answer, the previously silent Lu Fei said, \"We will pay it back.\"","Lu Fei looked at Sun Man, who suddenly felt at a loss. Kind-hearted people always tend to feel indebted to others.","Lu Fei said reluctantly, \"Don't be like that. We've wronged you. You don't need to have any psychological burden. You're a good child. It's my fault for not disciplining my son properly, which led him to hurt you like this.\"","She wouldn't blame Sun Man for not telling her about Lang Zhe's gambling and borrowing money. After all, Sun Man was only Lang Zhe's girlfriend at that time and had no real relationship with her. Sun Man had no obligation to help her discipline her child.","Lu Fei could distinguish right from wrong. And she also knew that Lang Zhe had made such a big mistake, it was no longer something she could correct through education.","\"You don't need to worry about anything else in this case. Whatever the investigation reveals, handle it accordingly. I won't plead for leniency, nor will I take care of him. It's time for him to learn a lesson,\" Lu Fei said. As a tiger mom, she could be ruthless when necessary.","\"Then, Ms. Sun, can you come to the police station tomorrow after being discharged?\" Luo Fei asked.","Sun Man was stunned, her eyes flickering. Just as she was about to nod, Ji Fei suddenly interjected, \"So tomorrow's livestream really can't happen?\"","[Looks like the director and producer are really going to hang themselves.]","Qin Zhao coughed, seeing Luo Fei's dissatisfied expression. He said, \"This might be too difficult for Sun Man.\"","Just as Sun Man didn't know what to say, Lu Fei spoke up, \"I'm willing to accompany you to complete this last stage. We can't let that brat ruin your big event. Do you want to give up this opportunity?\"","Sun Man's eyes flickered, and she bit her lip. Finally, she spoke up, \"I want to perform on stage.\"","In the end, Luo Fei also agreed to help them work things out. As they were wrapping up, Sun Man made a bold decision and reported everything, including the lawsuit against her mother and uncle.","Luo Fei looked at Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle, who were shocked, and raised an eyebrow, saying, \"There's a lot to handle today. We'll need to call in more brothers.\" He immediately contacted some people.","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle were so anxious that they started cursing at Sun Man.","Sun Man remained unmoved, but Luo Fei stepped in to rebuke them, \"Enough! One more word and it'll be considered threatening the victim.\"","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle were incredulous and cowered.","In the end, when Luo Fei was leaving, the most enthusiastic person seeing him off was unexpectedly Pei Mingxuan.","[What's Sister Pei up to? Has she taken a liking to him and wants to recruit him into the circle as an artist?]","Qin Zhao nearly stumbled. From the first part, he thought she might be interested in pursuing him, but the latter part made him realize that Ji Fei and Pei Mingxuan were, in a sense, cut from the same cloth.","However, both guesses were probably wrong.","Sister Pei was likely asking for a friendly cameo appearance in their stage play."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Prohibit Unreasonable Expectations for Domestic Entertainment Judges","paragraphs":["Due to the popularity of the show, paparazzi were naturally keeping a close eye on Sun Man, so the news of Lang Zhe being taken away by the police immediately exploded online.","However, with no details leaked, nobody knew exactly what had happened, so people could only speculate about relationship troubles.","At first, when Peng Li saw the news about Sun Man's revealing photos, she wanted to contact her godson again to emphasize that Sun Man was problematic and he shouldn't be with her. But before she could reach out, she was hit by the trending news.","Her godson had actually been arrested by the police!","Peng Li immediately contacted Lu Fei, \"What happened to Lang Zhe? Did that little hussy Sun Man call the police? What is she trying to do? How could she harm Lang Zhe like this!\"","Lu Fei's tone was even colder as she replied, \"Let me ask you, did you know about Lang Zhe's gambling problem?\"","Peng Li was stunned and asked confusedly, \"What?\"","Lu Fei continued, \"If you didn't know, then forget it. I'll say this once again - he is my son. Please don't interfere with how I discipline my child in the future.\"","She hung up after saying that, leaving Peng Li furious. She had always felt that although Lang Zhe was born to Lu Fei, she had cared for him for many years and treated him like her own son. How could Lu Fei obstruct their mother-son relationship?","A biological mother allowing her son to be bullied by outsiders - she, as the godmother, wouldn't stand for it.","So without hesitation, she brought along a lawyer who worked with the Peng Family Group and rushed to the police station, determined to get Lang Zhe released.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao didn't get involved in what happened afterward. They went back home to gossip with the Qin family about their thrilling experience that day. Although everyone already knew beforehand, they couldn't help but criticize when hearing it again.","Qin's Mom couldn't help saying, \"Men who love gambling are really no good.\"","Qin's Father also nodded and said, \"It's just that when things aren't going well in other areas, they want to show their prowess at the casino, thinking they can dominate, but end up failing miserably.\"","Qin Yan sighed in relief, \"Fortunately, you guys acted in time this time, preventing a tragedy from happening.\"","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"It's all thanks to Qin Zhao, he did a great job this time.\"","Qin Xian's gaze swept over, while Qin Zhao looked innocent, thinking to himself that looking at him was useless, as Qin Xian had arranged it all himself.","The others held back their laughter.","Qin Rong couldn't help asking, \"So can she get all her money back? She earned it with such hard work.\"","Ji Fei was also very concerned about this question, \"Teacher Lu arranged for someone to handle that one million on the spot, but as for the money taken by her mother and uncle, it's hard to say.\"","Everyone sighed.","By this time, discussions online had spiraled out of control. The official Weibo account was almost paralyzed.","Everyone was concerned about whether tomorrow's show could still go on.","After all, Sun Man was still in the hospital, and her condition was unknown.","The son of the other main character in the duo had been arrested, and according to general speculation, it was likely that Sun Man had called the police to arrest him. So could Sun Man and Lu Fei's relationship still be good now?","Therefore, people had already begun to conclude that tomorrow's show definitely couldn't go on.","However, soon after, Sun Man proactively posted a message stating that she had momentarily lost hope due to personal matters and felt very sorry. She said her condition was now stable, and she was fine, and would complete the show.","The show's official Weibo account immediately reposted, stating that everything would proceed as usual.","People were shocked. Could they really continue to perform? Would Lu Fei be willing to go on stage?","Unexpectedly, Lu Fei quickly reposted the Weibo, expressing that they would work hard together.","Netizens really couldn't understand this operation. Was it that the two actresses were too professional, or were they bound by contract with no choice, or were the rumors all false? Was there some hidden truth to everything?","Netizens frantically inquired about the reason for Sun Man's suicide attempt and the truth behind Lang Zhe's arrest, but after the key people gave brief statements, they collectively fell silent. It seemed they didn't intend to respond to this matter anymore, driving netizens nearly crazy with curiosity. It was like a civet cat sneaking into a melon patch - the melon was right at its mouth, but fate had grabbed it by the scruff of its neck.","In the end, they all flocked to Ji Fei's Weibo to demand the truth.","\"Sister Fei, you must know the truth, right?\"","\"You're the Entertainment Industry Judge, did you step in, so someone got arrested?\"","\"Sister Fei, who's always at the forefront of gossip, surely won't disappoint us, right? What's the real scoop? Let us in on it!\"","\"If you don't tell me, I won't be able to sleep tonight. Don't make me beg on my knees.\"","\"Sister Fei, Sister Fei, tell me secretly, I promise I won't tell anyone else!\"","\"According to the Entertainment Industry Judge's usual way of doing things, she's definitely going to drop a bombshell during the live broadcast. Everyone just wait and see!\"","\"The person above is right, thumbs up for them.\"","As a result, 'The Entertainment Industry Judge's Final Verdict' was trending on Weibo.","Ji Fei was completely bewildered by this.","[Who on earth created such strange expectations?]","Ji Fei quickly contacted Pei Mingxuan, requesting to remove the trending topic.","However, Pei Mingxuan said that natural positive attention wasn't a bad thing.","The Qin family members who were following the gossip wanted to laugh but didn't dare to. However, this time, netizens were bound to be disappointed. After all, this particular drama had truly ended - the person had already been arrested. Although details might be revealed later, it really had nothing to do with their stage performance.","On the other hand, those with guilty consciences in the entertainment industry were trembling with fear, finding it harder to sleep than the netizens that night. They were afraid that Ji Fei would drop another bombshell and take down a bunch of people with her descending palm technique.","Cleaning up the entertainment industry was no joke. Due to Ji Fei's recent active involvement, the industry's atmosphere had indeed improved quite a bit. Those with typically poor character were now behaving themselves, afraid of getting implicated and ruining their future and careers.","It was as if Ji Fei held a judgment list in her hand. Nobody knew which group of undesirable people in the entertainment industry she was targeting this time. The question was - are you afraid?","Various people trying to get information through their connections had all reached out to the Qin family members, leaving them both amused and exasperated.","Even until they arrived at the recording site, people online were still placing bets. In the end, both the director and producer came to inquire discreetly.","\"Actually, we don't mind anymore, but you need to give us some mental preparation so we can handle public opinion in time,\" the producer said sincerely.","Pei Mingxuan also smiled helplessly and said, \"This time it really has nothing to do with us. We just went to visit a patient. And didn't we give you the script? We guarantee we'll perform according to it.\"","However, at this moment, Teacher Lu, who was getting her makeup done nearby, suddenly received a phone call. Her expression immediately changed. She patted Sun Man's shoulder next to her, then turned and left with her people.","The director and producer watched with their hearts in their throats, but at this point, they couldn't very well follow to see what was happening. They could only wait.","Meanwhile, Qin Rong, who was distractedly keeping Qin Zhao and Ji Fei company as they had their makeup done, suddenly couldn't help but exclaim in surprise.","Ji Fei asked curiously, \"What's wrong?\"","Qin Rong quickly leaned over with her phone to gossip, \"Brother Luo says Lang Zhe has been bailed out.\"","Ji Fei's expression immediately changed, and she quickly checked her system.","[Damn, this is too shameless. Lang Zhe actually said he did this to win Sun Man back, so it wasn't really extortion.]"]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: This is Blocking the Way Completely","paragraphs":["Ji Fei discovered that all of this was the advice given to Lang Zhe by the lawyer Peng Li had brought in, completely downgrading the severity of the situation to a romantic dispute between a man and a woman.","Generally, when dealing with parties who previously had a romantic relationship, it's handled similarly to 'domestic violence' cases, with education as the primary approach.","It was only because of Sun Man's suicide attempt that the circumstances were considered slightly more serious.","Lang Zhe insisted that he didn't know Sun Man would be unable to bear the pressure and consider suicide. This wasn't really his fault, as Sun Man's relatives had swindled her out of her money, coincidentally leaving her with no way out.","Most importantly, after being blackmailed, Sun Man hadn't actually transferred any money, and there was no evidence found of Lang Zhe having gambling debts. The only things that could be proven were that Lang Zhe had sent the photos and threatening messages, and the photos were just a bit risqué.","So as long as Lang Zhe insisted that this was all just a small ploy to win back his girlfriend, it was truly difficult to judge it as a severe case.","With Peng Li's help, Lang Zhe was quickly released.","The only good news was that the police had deleted all the private photos and videos from Lang Zhe's phone and ensured there were no remnants in any storage spaces, so Sun Man no longer had any compromising material in Lang Zhe's possession.","As for further prosecution, Sun Man would need to consult with a lawyer again. The case was still ongoing, but they'd need to approach it from a different angle to seek justice.","However, Luo Fei didn't elaborate that he hadn't given up on investigating Lang Zhe's gambling debts. If there were gambling debts that couldn't be traced, it was likely an underground illegal casino. If following this lead uncovered any criminal organizations, it would be a goldmine for career advancement.","But on the surface, Luo Fei still advised them to inform Sun Man that the performance was over and to proceed with handling the case as soon as possible.","As Qin Rong briefly explained the situation, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's expressions darkened.","\"He really knows how to cover his tracks, and that Peng Li is such a fool... Wait, she even dared to call and argue with Teacher Lu, firmly believing that Lang Zhe just made a mistake out of confusion for Sun Man's sake, that Sun Man shouldn't have called the police to arrest him, causing her precious godson to be traumatized.\"","\"She actually doesn't believe that Lang Zhe got addicted to gambling. This blind support for her godson is really something...\"","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong couldn't help but recall how Peng Li had behaved when she came to their house, shaking their heads in disgust.","She was truly a clueless godmother. With a godmother like that, it's no wonder Lang Zhe turned out this way. No matter what mistakes he made, he knew someone would always take his side.","\"But it's strange, why doesn't Lang Zhe just tell Peng Li about the gambling debts? Why hide it? By hiding it, how will he repay the debt?\"","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were also puzzled when they heard this.","\"Oh, I see. Because the police are suspicious, he doesn't dare to ask for large sums of money anymore. He's really backed himself into a corner, haha. I'm really curious, what will he do if debt collectors come knocking?\"","Suddenly, it seemed that not being arrested by the police might not be such a good thing after all. Who knows what those forces behind the scenes might make him do?","Meanwhile, Lu Fei hung up on Peng Li's incessant chatter. Peng Li had been blaming her, saying she didn't trust her son but believed an outsider, that she wasn't helping her son out of trouble but instead helping the culprit put on an act. She even flew into a rage, saying she'd come settle accounts with Sun Man soon.","Lu Fei couldn't be bothered with this madwoman. She was just disappointed that even now, her son had chosen to lie to the judicial authorities instead of recognizing his mistakes and facing the consequences.","Lu Fei told Sun Man the result, saying, \"Don't worry, I won't let them bother you. As for the case, you should pursue it to the end. I can't let him think he can get away with doing something like this so easily.\"","Sun Man felt a bit dazed and looked at Lu Fei with reluctance, \"Teacher Lu...\"","\"If possible, I hope you can make public the course of events, to prevent him from thinking he can escape everything and harm others in the future,\" Lu Fei steeled herself and said, \"Don't worry, I'll stand by your side.\"","Sun Man was shocked. She had been ignoring responses from netizens, allowing them to speculate, which was actually disadvantageous to her. After all, she was the victim in this incident and could have gone public with everything to gain sympathy. She had indeed considered going all out afterwards, making everything public to get revenge on Lang Zhe for everything he had done to her.","Not to mention that now there was no possibility of more indecent photos or videos being leaked.","But doing so would completely ruin Lang Zhe. It wasn't that she cared about Lang Zhe, but she felt some pity for this elder who had always protected her.","Probably seeing through Sun Man's thoughts, Lu Fei said directly, \"Don't feel any psychological burden. These things would come out sooner or later anyway. You don't know how his godmother might try various ways to attack you for his sake. Rather than waiting passively, you should take the initiative and lay everything out in the open.\"","Having been in the entertainment industry for so long, Lu Fei certainly knew many tactics. She couldn't let Peng Li continue to stir up trouble with her son. She wanted to knock her son down completely in one go, to start over from scratch with his education.","Lu Fei knew the principle of \"no pain, no gain.\" If she didn't come down hard on him once and for all, Lang Zhe would make even bigger mistakes. Perhaps by then, it would be difficult for her to bring her son back for re-education.","\"Alright, I've already decided to sign with Sister Pei. I'll ask her later about the specific arrangements,\" Sun Man saw Lu Fei's determination and steadied herself. In a sense, this could be considered the last time she helped Lang Zhe, guiding him back to the right path.","Lu Fei smiled, but her eyes couldn't hide her fatigue. However, in the blink of an eye, she was once again the strong tiger mom. She then sent a final warning to Lang Zhe.","\"No matter how much debt you have, I will repay it for you this time, but on the condition that you take responsibility for your mistakes and don't try to evade them. As long as you can admit your wrongs and change, everything can still be turned around.\"","Sun Man looked at Lu Fei. If they were mother and daughter, there would surely be a beautiful ending like in a stage play, proving that single mothers can also build a wonderful family with their children and provide a complete education.","Unfortunately, their combination was all wrong.","Lang Zhe, who received the message, was in Peng Li's car.","He looked at his phone, his thoughts wavering. Suddenly, he received an anonymous message. He froze, his eyes widening in disbelief.","In his ears, Peng Li's voice continued: \"Son, don't be afraid. Godmother will help you get justice right away. Your mom is going too far. Not only did you do nothing wrong, even if you had, so what? You're her own son, she should unconditionally support you. Letting you be arrested like this, making it known all over the internet, losing all face. How can she be so intolerant of your success? You might as well cut ties with her and stay with godmother from now on. I'll raise and protect you. When I pass away, I'll definitely file a complaint with your dad, blaming him for his poor judgement in choosing such a cold-hearted and heartless woman back then.\"","As she was speaking, Lang Zhe said in a deep voice, \"Godmother, please stop at the supermarket ahead.\"","\"Hm? What's wrong?\"","\"I... I need to use the bathroom.\"","After saying this, Lang Zhe replied to Lu Fei's message: \"Mom, you've really misunderstood me. How could I possibly have gambling debts? You and Sun Man have both misunderstood. She was mistaken last time too. I threatened her really just to win her back, I just used the wrong method. I'll explain everything to you later.\""]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Not Better Than Acting","paragraphs":["The car stopped in front of a large supermarket.","Lang Zhe went to the restroom in the supermarket.","He made a phone call according to the instructions in the anonymous text message.","\"If it wasn't an emergency, we wouldn't give you this opportunity... As long as you follow our instructions, it won't arouse any suspicion. After tonight, the 50 million debt will be completely erased, as if no one would ever discover you had gambling debts. We keep our word.\"","Lang Zhe's Adam's apple bobbed as his gaze gradually became determined.","As long as this 50 million debt disappeared into thin air, no one could say he was deceiving Sun Man because of the debt.","He could explain this incident as an attempt to win Sun Man back. Even if it was exposed and criticized, it would be better than being seen as a calculating fraudster.","He was just a simple boy who did something foolish for love, loved to the extreme, and took a wrong turn. He never meant to hurt anyone.","This way, he wouldn't have to face the strange looks from his mother and friends.","He would never gamble again in the future. Everything could go back to normal, as if nothing had happened. There would be no blemish around him.","Meanwhile, after receiving the message, Lu Fei was incredibly disappointed. This further strengthened Lu Fei's desire for Sun Man to go public.","When the two returned to find Pei Mingxuan, the producer and director were still talking to her. They seemed to be repeatedly ensuring that the top-tier group wouldn't cause any big commotion.","As the countdown to the premiere approached, rumors online were growing stronger. People of status and influence kept contacting them, and the entire entertainment industry seemed to be trembling, making them all nervous.","After multiple confirmations, the producer finally felt relieved and was about to leave with the director.","However, Pei Mingxuan suddenly said, \"Oh, by the way, we need to change an actor.\"","The director and producer whirled around, with a 'as expected, I guessed it' expression on their faces.","They even said with a somewhat twisted excitement, \"Go ahead, we can handle it.\"","Pei Mingxuan's mouth twitched, thinking that Ji Fei's image might be too intense, which wasn't good for development. Since nothing happened this time, it was a good opportunity to tone it down a bit.","Seeing the director and producer's burning gazes, Pei Mingxuan even began to wonder if they had been tortured into rebellion, with an attitude of 'let's see what other surprises you have that we don't know about.'","Pei Mingxuan said, \"It's just an animal actor.\"","The director and producer immediately lost interest.","The theme of this stage performance was 'Home'. Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's group was performing a story from the perspective of great love and country, roughly depicting the story of sending a child to become a soldier who later sacrifices himself - there is no home without a country.","The animal actors in this performance were military dogs, from the son first bringing a puppy to show his mother, to the end where only the injured retired military dog returns to accompany the mother.","Two animal actors were needed. The puppy was easy to arrange, but the adult old dog had higher requirements.","Originally, they planned to use ordinary animal actors, which could cooperate well after training. But Pei Mingxuan was never satisfied with the effect, feeling that the dog's eyes and posture weren't right, not impactful enough.","As a manager, Pei Mingxuan had other considerations. The theme of this stage play was so positive, equivalent to promoting patriotic spirit. So why not make the effect as extreme as possible? It might even attract official attention.","Although this wasn't the main purpose, if the artist could fortunately catch official attention, it would definitely be a stacking of buffs. So Pei Mingxuan hoped that this stage performance could truly reach a level that touches people's hearts. In this case, if they could really borrow a retired military dog, it would definitely create a buzz.","Unfortunately, they had no connections. Military dogs were precious and couldn't be casually borrowed for such performances.","But then Pei Mingxuan ran into Luo Fei. If military dogs weren't possible, police dogs would be completely okay!","Then Pei Mingxuan persuaded Luo Fei using the grand significance expressed in the performance. Whether it was for the consideration of positive publicity or for Qin Xian's sake, Luo Fei eventually helped find a police dog that had just retired due to injury.","Actually, not much was needed. Being able to follow commands for simple cooperation was enough. The most important thing was the demeanor.","Police dogs didn't even need to rehearse. As long as the trainer was present, they could cooperate with anything.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao rehearsed once and perfectly met the requirements. They just hadn't had time to tell the director and producer.","The animal breed was the same, so if they didn't mention it, no one would know. However, Pei Mingxuan still informed them that they had borrowed a retired police dog with meritorious service.","Knowing this could be a publicity point and there was nothing to worry about, the director and producer nodded and left.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao finished their makeup and wanted to go to the rest room. The police dog and trainer were in the rest room.","After all, where else could they encounter a police dog? It was so big and majestic, looking very cool. And when not in work mode, it was very friendly. The three were captivated and found every opportunity to play with it.","But when they saw Sun Man coming to find Pei Mingxuan, they couldn't help but stay to gossip.","After hearing their ideas, Pei Mingxuan expressed agreement. But she still reminded, \"This will also bear certain public opinion risks, such as the undefined gambling debts or love debts, and the matter of calling the police to arrest Lang Zhe.\"","If a person directly accuses another person, regardless of whether the matter is true or false, there will always be some smart alecks jumping out with various conspiracy theories or moral kidnapping.","Suddenly, Qin Rong, who had been eavesdropping, spoke up, \"Why not act it out?\"","Everyone looked at her.","Qin Rong immediately felt a bit uncomfortable, scratching her ear shyly and said, \"I just saw that our group always does it this way. Doesn't your group's performance have a daughter encountering difficulties and seeking help from her mother? Can't this difficulty be changed to this incident?\"","Pei Mingxuan's eyes immediately lit up. That's right, in the past their group acted things out mainly because many incidents lacked evidence, so they could only rely on performances to provoke the audience's thoughts and let them collect evidence. This situation was similar.","If they acted it out like before, it would be more convincing on this special stage than a direct statement. Although it wasn't the Internal Entertainment Judge acting it out, Sun Man was going to join their studio in the future anyway, so it could indirectly disperse Ji Fei's exaggerated image.","Pei Mingxuan was very tempted but hesitated, \"But, changing it at the last minute...\"","Yu Rouyin, who had just finished her makeup, walked over and smiled, \"Sun Man has that ability.\"","They had all seriously studied their opponents on the same stage and naturally knew each other's capabilities.","Sun Man's personality actually made her a bit uncomfortable with \"directly speaking out about right and wrong\", so acting it out was better.","She looked at Lu Fei in the distance.","After all, they all knew the whole truth, which was equivalent to knowing the entire script. Sun Man was a gifted performer, and Lu Fei was a national-level actress. Changing just a small segment wouldn't be difficult for them.","Lu Fei naturally had no objections and nodded, \"Let's discuss how to change it specifically. Acting it out can also serve as a warning and education, letting girls know how to respond correctly when encountering such situations.\"","After Lu Fei finished speaking seriously, she saw Sun Man embarrassed and wishing the ground would swallow her up.","Everyone burst into laughter.","The live broadcast began, and the barrage army arrived, with all kinds of speculations rising noisily.","Until Sun Man and Lu Fei's stage appearance, along with their superb performance and the portrayal of the fraud plot, it immediately triggered an online storm."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: The Melon You Didn't Explode, Everyone Wouldn't Really Eat It.","paragraphs":["Down in the audience, the Qin Family members were dumbfounded.","\"Did they just act out the truth?\" Qin's Father asked in shock.","\"But didn't Little Luo say...\" Qin's Mom looked worriedly at the man holding flowers beside her.","This time, Qin Xian was also present, as it was Ji Fei's last stage performance.","Qin Xian said, \"This is actually a smarter approach. Even if the other party doesn't admit it, they can't sue the stage for defamation. It's quite good.\"","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom breathed sighs of relief.","Qin Yan exclaimed in admiration, \"So you're saying they made this decision at the last minute? That means they improvised just like Teacher Yu, no wonder they signed Sun Man, her acting is so good, you can't tell at all that it was made up on the spot.\"","The other Qin Family members nodded in agreement.","However, after seeing this part of the plot, the surrounding audience had already started to gossip frantically.","After all, Sun Man's suicide and Lang Zhe's arrest had caused quite a stir. If you removed all the intermediate cause and effect, it basically matched up with the stage performance.","Internet users were even more explosive now, because they were on the front lines of surfing the web. They had just seen news that Lang Zhe had been released, and Peng Li's lawyer had already contacted marketing accounts to start releasing information as a test before the incident broke out, putting out guesses about Lang Zhe's wrongdoings for love, which had already attracted small-scale attention.","But now it was all overwhelmed by the stage performance.","The barrage of comments was scrolling at lightning speed.","\"What's going on? Wasn't Lang Zhe just released? If we go by their performance, Lang Zhe committed a full-on crime, he shouldn't have been released at all!\"","\"Am I the only one who finds this surreal? Why would Teacher Lu act out this plot with Sun Man? Whose mother is she really?\"","\"Why else? This is like condemning her own flesh and blood. When the mother confirms it, the truth must definitely be like this.\"","\"I don't believe it, Lang Zhe must be innocent. Being released is the biggest proof. I'll always support Lang Zhe, Sun Man is the one with problems! Those risqué photos are the evidence.\"","\"Come on, sis, are your eyes glued shut with sleep? Those photos were clearly taken without consent no matter how you look at it.\"","\"I think the stage's explanation is very reasonable - the boyfriend took photos while his girlfriend was asleep without permission.\"","\"Taking photos is just a small intimate act between lovers. What's performed on this stage definitely isn't true. I heard that the so-called threat was actually just a show to force Sun Man to come back. As for the fraud money, Lang Zhe's family is already rich, okay? Besides, isn't this kind of obsessive love very domineering and romantic?\"","\"What kind of novels have you been reading to rot your brain like this? Tell me so I can avoid them. If you encounter this kind of thing in real life, please call the police.\"","\"Regardless of what happened afterward, the point of secret photography alone is indisputable. Men like this are all fucking disgusting!\"","\"I've also been secretly photographed, but I was even more stupid. Because I found out, but when he looked at me with eyes full of love and told me it was because he loved me, wanted to look at them from time to time, save them, hoping that when we're old and gray we could look at these photos and remember how passionately we loved each other then. So I didn't make him delete them. As a result, when he stopped loving me, got tired of me, after we broke up those photos became his capital for boasting on forums, and works for men to discuss.\"","\"The one above is really stupid. Sun Man's case of not knowing is one thing, but yours is just not knowing how to protect yourself, thinking you're the most special person in a man's life, thinking you're so unique, that he would never bear to hurt you. Actually, you just have no brains. When a man loves you it's true, when he doesn't love you anymore it's also truly ruthless.\"","\"Aiya! In my opinion, what does it matter? Even if it's exposed, can you prove who it is? After all, face-swapping technology is so advanced now. If the other party insists it's you, just tell them to provide evidence to prove it.\"","\"We're born naked, it's all fleeting clouds, everything is trivial compared to life. Anyway, everyone only has a three-minute attention span, they'll forget after seeing it, no one is the protagonist of the world. Why care about others' opinions, just live your own life well.\"","\"Exactly! But girls still need to be careful. No matter how much you love your man, no matter how good your man is at this moment, no matter how cute and coquettish he is to soften your heart, you must always keep a final bit of vigilance. Believe that someone who truly loves you will not give this world any chance to hurt you! If he does this, it can only prove that his interest overrides the potential harm to you.\"","\"I'm a guy, and I wouldn't dare to photograph my lover. What if I lose my phone? What if my computer gets a virus? The internet is so unsafe now, I would never take photos, okay! Men who want to take photos all have something wrong with their brains.\"","\"I thought Lang Zhe had character issues when I saw him forcefully proposing before.\"","\"Huh? I suddenly thought, was Lang Zhe's forced proposal also for money to pay off gambling debts? Did he threaten her when the proposal failed?\"","\"It's also possible that he proposed for love, and then threatened for love when the proposal failed. That makes sense too.\"","\"So does that mean this stage performance is lying?\"","\"I dare not say. Maybe it really is just a coincidence in the plot. After all, it's not the stage of our entertainment industry's judge, Sister Fei. I'm keeping an open mind.\"","Things didn't develop entirely according to Pei Mingxuan and the others' best-case scenario, but it did achieve the purpose of telling the truth.","Because the matters of extortion and gambling were really too abrupt, so everyone's focus of discussion wasn't on this for the time being.","However, Lang Zhe's reputation had already been overwhelmingly condemned.","Backstage, Pei Mingxuan clicked her tongue twice and turned to Ji Fei, saying, \"It looks like your persona has been welded shut. You're the anti-counterfeiting mark. If it's not gossip you expose, people really won't believe it.\"","Ji Fei's mouth twitched, and she muttered in her heart, [Is it possible that if I praise their performance during the interview after the show ends, everyone will believe it? Thinking about it this way, I'm under a lot of pressure!]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were holding back their laughter behind them. Come to think of it, it was really possible. It would be equivalent to passing the authentication of the entertainment industry's judge.","Soon, Sun Man and Lu Fei's performance was coming to an end.","The trainer led the police dog into the backstage and met with Ji Fei and the others. Ji Fei and Qin Zhao greeted the police dog, and saw its tail wagging happily.","\"We'll be counting on you later,\" Ji Fei smiled as she patted the dog's head.","\"Don't be nervous,\" Qin Zhao said seriously.","The trainer laughed, \"Don't worry, our Little Seven has seen it all. It's so excited now. Since retirement, it hasn't had a chance to carry out a mission. It's been dying of boredom.\"","Little Seven proudly raised its head and chest, eager to get started.","As applause rang out from outside, their stage performance began.","At this time, Peng Li had already driven Lang Zhe to the studio. She had just received a call from the lawyer and watched the live replay, instantly turning red with anger.","\"How could your mother do this? She's going to ruin you! Does she not believe in you at all? No, we have to go find her!\"","Lang Zhe's face also turned ashen as he looked at the trending topics. He was trying every way to salvage everything, but they wanted to destroy him!","The lawyer told them that fortunately it was just a performance, and netizens were also taking a wait-and-see attitude towards it. The best thing for them to do now was to find a chance to clarify during the live broadcast, otherwise it would be very troublesome.","Peng Li thought the same. Since Sun Man was being so unjust, she didn't care anymore. This time she was going to expose the theft incident as well!","She angrily touched the pearl necklace on her neck.","Didn't Sun Man want to ruin Lang Zhe just to play the victim and elevate herself? Peng Li would absolutely not allow her to step on her precious godson to rise up!","After Peng Li got out of the car, she saw that Lang Zhe hadn't moved. \"Lang Zhe, don't waste time, let's go!\"","Lang Zhe was about to get up but hesitated, his movements stiffening. But seeing that there were surveillance cameras all around, it would be too conspicuous to stay in the car alone, so he had no choice but to follow Peng Li to the studio.","By the time they arrived, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's performance was already halfway through."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: So, this issue of the entertainment industry judge is not整顿the entertainment industry","paragraphs":["The top-tier group's stage play was quite moving, and it was also Ji Fei's first time properly playing a character.","Her acting was still raw and inexperienced, but it wasn't embarrassing.","With Qin Zhao and Yu Rouyin's help in getting into character, the stage performance was guaranteed to be good.","However, netizens felt somewhat disappointed while watching the stage performance.","\"It feels like we're addicted to drama, and it's unsatisfying when the top-tier group doesn't create any.\"","\"A stage without slaps feels like it's missing its soul.\"","\"I thought after the previous group's dramatic performance, they would have some reaction.\"","\"Remember in the first episode when the acclaimed actors' group also caused drama, but the top-tier group countered it with their performance. Since there's no rebuttal this time, maybe it proves that Sun Man's performance was true, which could be seen as a kind of acknowledgment.\"","\"That's hard to say...\"","\"So this episode's Entertainment Judge isn't going to clean up the entertainment industry?\"","\"Come on, the entertainment industry has already been cut to its major artery, what more drama can you fans expect from Ji Fei!\"","\"I feel the same way. Everything that could be exposed has reached its limit. There's nothing left to judge, and Ji Fei can't keep making enemies either.\"","\"So now she's seriously acting, which makes sense. After all, Sister Fei wants to be an actress, and acting skill is what matters most.\"","\"Over these episodes, you can really see that Sister Fei's acting is genuinely improving.\"","\"If it's just based on acting performance, it's hard to say who will win this episode.\"","\"Well, no drama is fine. This stage play was good, full of patriotic spirit.\"","\"The top-tier group shows social responsibility, knowing they're at their peak popularity, so they perform such scripts to guide young people.\"","\"Yes, the top-tier group's plays always have educational value.\"","\"Not to mention... right now, I'm feeling the urge to join the army.\"","\"Am I the only one who was completely charmed by that little Seven who just came on stage? It must be a real military dog.\"","\"It seems to have an injury on its hind leg, probably retired. Hard to say if it was a military dog though.\"","Backstage.","Other members of the Qin family were asking Qin Xian, \"Is this the one Little Luo helped borrow?\"","Qin Xian nodded: \"Yes, a retired drug detection dog.\"","\"That's a hero!\" Qin's Father exclaimed excitedly.","Qin Xian nodded: \"It has accomplished many achievements, very capable.\"","\"It worked so well with Third Brother and Ji Fei,\" Qin's Mom said in surprise.","Qin Xian pointed to someone in the filming area nearby: \"Its trainer is over there, directing at all times.\"","While the family was discussing, they suddenly heard a greeting from nearby.","\"You're all here too.\" Although Peng Li had an unpleasant encounter with them last time, a few days had passed, and bygones were bygones. Seeing the family there, she couldn't help but approach them, as she had heard it was Qin Zhao who reported to the police.","For the protective Peng Li, this was hitting a raw nerve.","The Qin family wasn't too surprised to see Peng Li and Lang Zhe coming over together.","\"Getting someone arrested by the police, and yet you're so at ease. I must say I'm impressed with your family. It's clear you don't take our Peng family seriously at all.\"","Qin's Mom raised her eyebrows, but when she caught sight of the bright pearl necklace on Peng Li's neck, she immediately stepped back a bit, as Peng Li was standing closest to her.","Looking at Lang Zhe behind, with his gloomy expression and face mask, Qin's Mom's expression became even more peculiar.","\"What? Finally feeling guilty? He's my godson, practically your junior. Look what your son has done!\" Peng Li's eyes were red with anger as she spoke.","\"I think you're the one who doesn't know what your godson has done,\" Qin's Mom couldn't help but mutter, \"Why are you here? Looking for trouble?\"","Peng Li snorted coldly, \"We're here to settle scores!\" She was about to continue.","Qin Xian immediately warned in a low voice: \"Please don't disturb the performance.\"","Peng Li was somewhat intimidated by Qin Xian.","The audience in the back rows was already unhappy with these two people standing in the aisle.","As attention focused on them, Lang Zhe became anxious, pulled down his baseball cap, and led Peng Li to find empty seats. Being in the VIP seating area, there were some available spots.","However, the moment Lang Zhe sat down, his body tensed for a moment, and his expression darkened further.","Peng Li and Lang Zhe had pulled strings to get in, and naturally weren't foolish enough to interrupt the stage performance now. Following their lawyer's advice, if they wanted to clarify things, they could rush onto the stage during the interview segment of the livestream to reveal the truth.","The lawyer suggested they should communicate with the involved parties before going on stage, so they had actually tried to find Lu Fei first.","However, Lu Fei not only didn't answer their calls but was also backstage with Sun Man.","Peng Li didn't want to meet Sun Man at all; she wanted to catch Sun Man off guard and destroy her, so she didn't force her way backstage but came to the audience seats to wait for the final interview segment. When she saw the Qin family, she couldn't resist confronting them.","However, after actually sitting down, Peng Li stopped bothering the Qin family.","The Qin family had been on guard, worried about retaliation for Qin Zhao and Ji Fei's police report, but seeing them so quiet, they understood the situation.","Qin Yan immediately messaged Qin Rong, who was still backstage, to explain the situation.","Pei Mingxuan, who was discussing contract details with Sun Man backstage, immediately received the news from Qin Rong and frowned: \"What are they trying to do?\"","\"They're here for us,\" Lu Fei snorted: \"With Peng Li's mentality, she's probably planning to do something crazy when we go on stage.\"","Back when she was pursuing Lu Fei's husband, Peng Li had been quite wild, not at all like a noble family's daughter, just doing whatever she pleased.","\"She definitely wants to go after Sun Man, and my foolish son certainly wants to clear his name, so there will definitely be some sudden developments later,\" Lu Fei said with a dark expression: \"It's going to be a fierce battle.\"","Sun Man's face turned pale, truly regretting countless times how she ever got involved with such people.","Pei Mingxuan patted Sun Man's shoulder: \"Don't worry, you'll be going on stage with Ji Fei and Qin Zhao. I've never seen anyone get the upper hand on a livestream stage when Ji Fei and Qin Zhao are present. Just let them know about the situation.\"","Actually, Pei Mingxuan wasn't completely confident. Who knew what desperate people might do, especially with a noble lady among them.","However, she had an inexplicable confidence in Ji Fei. Although Ji Fei usually seemed lazy and casual, she always gave people a strange sense of security at crucial moments.","The worst-case scenario would be if neither side could suppress the other. Then they would have to rely on Ji Fei's Entertainment Judge persona to guide public opinion, but since they had truth on their side, there was no need to feel insecure.","Nobody could come up with any concrete solutions, so they decided to deal with things as they came.","Thus, everyone moved to the side of the stage, waiting for the play to end."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Little Seven's Warning","paragraphs":["As the plot progressed, everyone watched as Qin Zhao's character, playing the son, died in battle, and finally Ji Fei, playing the mother, welcomed home the injured and retired Little Seven.","Ji Fei looked at Little Seven, who hung his head and whimpered, as if apologizing to Ji Fei for not bringing her son back safely.","Ji Fei, with a choked voice, stepped forward and stroked Little Seven's head, \"Good boy, welcome home.\"","Finally, accompanied by a background music depicting the passage of time, and stage lighting demonstrating the four seasons, Ji Fei led Little Seven slowly to the front of the stage. Her figure gradually became hunched as she faced the audience area, struggling to sit down, cuddling with the dog while gazing into the distance.","Behind them, the large screen gradually displayed various photographs of military families, ultimately forming the nation's border line.","This scene was powerful and moving, not only did the audience's breathing become heavy, but even the online comments were filled with emotional tears.","\"There's actually no drama, but... it's so beautiful, wuwuwu.\"","\"Our peaceful lives are because some people are bearing the burden for us, wuwuwu.\"","\"I just wanted to watch a variety show, wuwuwu, how did it become... wuwuwu...\"","\"They are the big brothers and sisters of our great family! The bravest and most fearless ones who will always stand in front of us to protect us from bad people.\"","\"Suddenly all those scandals created by misbehaving celebrities seem like jokes!\"","\"Yes, they're just jokes!\"","\"I looked it up, Little Seven is actually a drug-detecting dog! But it's good, his handler retired too and is fine, otherwise I would have cried myself to death online today.\"","\"Didn't expect a drama-free stage play to be so good, the top-tier group is amazing!\"","As the stage play's countdown ended, the director and producer finally let out the breath they'd been holding.","After all, they had just been quite shocked by Sun Man and Lu Fei's last-minute stage changes. This way of openly performing the truth... it was like a troublemaker who finally agreed to behave but ended up stirring things up differently, just like a contagious disease.","However, they had already learned to handle such situations smoothly. They just started getting nervous, worried that the top-tier group might be affected and cause some issues.","They were mentally prepared for any impact.","But unexpectedly... it ended safely.","Everything was proper and normal... so normal that it felt abnormal to them.","So the previous group used the stage to resolve some personal grudges, but the top-tier group didn't plan to use this opportunity to regulate others in the entertainment industry?","Finally, the director and producer dared to reply to those friends who were anxiously asking about the situation.","Although their friends weren't the ones feeling guilty, their friends' friends were a different story.","Everyone was on edge because of the top-tier group's performance.","Group message: Apart from Sun Man and Lang Zhe's matter, nothing happened tonight, the entertainment industry's judge is taking a break.","Then they received a message from Pei Mingxuan.","The director and producer immediately felt uneasy. But after opening it, they breathed a sigh of relief.","Knowing that someone might cause trouble later, they weren't worried. Whether in terms of popularity or entertainment industry connections, the director and producer confidently considered it a minor issue. It would just add one last wave of heat to the show, nothing too serious.","Just as they were about to reply, they saw the trainer in the filming area suddenly walk forward, \"Little Seven?\"","The audience area also erupted with questioning sounds.","The director and producer looked up to see Little Seven, who had just been obediently sitting as Ji Fei's support, suddenly stand up, showing a fierce expression, barking at a particular direction, his body half-crouched as if ready to pounce at any moment.","He was targeting the direction where the Qin family was sitting.","A large dog suddenly acting this way was quite frightening, even Ji Fei was startled, \"L-Little Seven.\"","Little Seven's trainer was even more shocked, wanting to give hand signals, but noticed that Little Seven kept staring at one spot, clearly showing warning signs of detecting a target.","Having been retired for over two years, this sudden behavior caught even the trainer off guard.","Little Seven's barking became more urgent, and the people closest to him were scared and started screaming, continuously moving to the side.","Peng Li, frightened by the barking, was still cursing, \"Why bring an animal to a performance, see what happens? Be careful your precious daughter-in-law doesn't get bitten!\"","\"Shut your filthy mouth, that's a drug-detecting dog, smarter than you!\" Qin's Mom immediately shouted back.","When Lang Zhe heard this, he immediately stood up in fear, cold sweat pouring down his forehead, ignoring the sharp pain caused by his sudden movement.","He also felt that the dog was staring directly at him, their straight-line distance was no more than five meters.","Lang Zhe immediately turned to run.","But dog barks followed closely behind, accompanied by audience gasps, a large black shadow leaped through the air.","Just as Lang Zhe stepped onto the stairs, he was tackled down, and with a scream, Little Seven bit down hard on his leg, preventing his escape.","His hat fell off, and someone recognized the unfortunate man, exclaiming, \"That's Lang Zhe!\"","The studio exploded with chaos.","Cameras instinctively pointed in that direction, and the live stream comments went wild.","\"What's going on? Lang Zhe is here too? And got bitten by the dog?\"","\"So, dogs can tell who's a scumbag and who's bad?\"","\"This isn't just any dog, it's the dog brought by our entertainment industry judge, so there was still judgment after all?\"","\"No, wait, everyone, Little Seven is a drug-detecting dog! He's a professional! Even retired, he wouldn't bite people randomly!\"","\"I've seen videos like this, Little Seven was giving warning signals just now, proving he detected drugs.\"","The comments were buzzing with discussion, and the scene was chaos.","No one noticed Ji Fei still on stage.","Actually, when Little Seven lunged forward, Ji Fei instinctively stood up, wanting to stop him, but couldn't match Little Seven's speed, causing her to lose balance at the edge.","As Ji Fei was thinking about what position to jump down in to minimize injury, through the noisy studio, she heard a deep voice filled with urgency yet giving infinite security.","\"Don't be afraid, fall back, I'll catch you.\"","Ji Fei's brain couldn't process the situation that quickly, but she could tell it was Qin Xian's voice.","For a moment, Ji Fei actually wanted to obey, abandon self-preservation, and fall backward, feeling somehow certain that Qin Xian would keep his word and she didn't need to worry.","But her instinctive nature made her reflexively choose self-preservation at the last moment, twisting her body to jump down facing forward.","As she jumped, she saw Qin Xian ready to catch her below the stage, his deep eyes not reflecting the chaotic surroundings, only Ji Fei's complete figure.","She didn't know when he had rushed to the stage.","He had his arms open, the solid arm lines visible through his fitted suit clearly showing strength.","If she had really let him catch her, she would definitely have been held securely.","Ji Fei actually felt a moment of regret.","As a result, Ji Fei jumped with force while Qin Xian was catching, and they collided.","Ji Fei's impact made him grunt, while she managed to bear-hug his solid frame.","Fortunately, Qin Xian was stable enough, otherwise Ji Fei's impact would have knocked him to the ground.","After steadying Ji Fei, Qin Xian put her down but didn't let go, instead loosely embracing her while looking down with concern, \"Are you alright?\"","\"I'm fine... thank you.\"","Ji Fei inexplicably felt her heart racing and couldn't quite look at Qin Xian.","Peng Li's scream came from nearby.","\"Ah, you damn dog, get away! Don't bite my godson!\"","Ji Fei came back to her senses, stepped out of the embrace, and immediately looked over at the situation.","[Strange, what's wrong with Little Seven? Too bad I can't see the dog's information... wait, let me check Lang Zhe's...]","Other members of the Qin family also heard the thoughts and turned to look, seeing Ji Fei and Qin Xian standing together.","Just as they were wondering, they heard Ji Fei's thoughts emit a sharp ringing, almost drowning out the surrounding chaos.","[Oh my god! Is he crazy? Actually helping transport drugs! And hiding them there!]"]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: Heaven-sent Merit","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's inner thoughts left the Qin Family stunned.","If it weren't for Little Seven's identity and behavior, the Qin Family would have thought they were hearing things.","Drug trafficking? Was it what they thought it was? Could it really be that?","The Qin Family's eyes darted between Ji Fei and Lang Zhe, unsure where to look.","Ji Fei was also shocked beyond belief. She hadn't expected Lang Zhe to be so brazen. The fraud he committed was already full of holes, and now he dared to traffic drugs? It was simply inconceivable.","Ji Fei couldn't help but investigate further.","[He's completely lost his mind. Is he so afraid of facing his mistakes? Even now he's trying to cover everything up, which is why he agreed to the underground casino boss's conditions.]","[He thought it was simple enough - just help the boss transport the batch of goods that the police were watching, hand it over to someone else, and his debts would be cleared.]","[This crowded public place was perfect - the handoff would be easier to conceal in the bathroom corridor when crowds of audience members were leaving after the show.]","[Lang Zhe couldn't openly carry the package, and he was scared, so he thought of his old method of hiding pearl necklaces... but he never expected... haha, Little Seven is still contributing even after retirement.]","[Lang Zhe, you're asking for death. Your original crime wasn't that serious, there wasn't even enough evidence for conviction, but now, you've really destroyed yourself...]","Thinking of this, Ji Fei's expression changed. They had just performed such a drama, and now seeing Lang Zhe recklessly participating in drug trafficking to cover up his mistakes made her feel utterly disgusted.","[Does he even know how many people sacrificed themselves to prevent these things from entering our families?]","Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, the Qin Family's expressions also changed.","Ji Fei was so angry that she missed some details, but after listening, Qin Xian immediately took out his phone to contact Luo Fei.","\"Little Seven has given warning, keep eyes on Lang Zhe. When he arrived, his posture was off, and he seemed extremely concerned about time.\"","This was Qin Xian's improvisation, but he knew that given Luo Fei's cautious nature, he would immediately suspect that Lang Zhe might be hiding drugs and planning to make an exchange here.","Luo Fei had actually been watching the livestream, as he was curious about the current relationship between Qin Xian and Ji Fei, and since Little Seven was borrowed through his connections, he needed to keep an eye on things.","When he saw Little Seven's behavior, he already sensed something was wrong and began arranging for people to head to the studio.","At that time, Luo Fei only thought this minor celebrity was using drugs.","But after receiving the message, Luo Fei's expression changed, and he immediately contacted the Narcotics Squad. The lead they couldn't follow up on last time might have new developments now.","The Narcotics Squad was stunned by the news - how did Captain Luo manage to crack a case while casually watching an entertainment show? What incredible luck!","The police station nearest to the studio immediately took action, ensuring that not a single person could slip out of the building from that moment on.","Meanwhile, chaos still reigned in the studio.","Pei Mingxuan had arrived with her people.","Lu Fei, seeing her son being bitten, anxiously rushed forward but was stopped by the trainer.","The trainer had already sensed something was wrong and immediately began dispersing the crowd.","\"Everyone stay back! Lang Zhe, please cooperate. If you keep struggling, I'll have to use force!\"","However, Peng Li lunged forward and grabbed at the trainer, \"What are you saying? Who are you going to use force on? Tell your dead dog to let go of Lang Zhe!\"","The trainer, currently without official authority, found it difficult to respond and could only say, \"If he stops struggling, I'll have Little Seven release him!\"","But how could Lang Zhe not struggle? When he agreed to transport the goods, it had seemed easy enough, but now his entire heart was filled with fear and guilt, like a condemned criminal awaiting execution.","So despite being badly bitten, he still tried to crawl away pathetically, even trying to kick Little Seven's head with his free leg.","Little Seven skillfully dodged and released his grip, but before Lang Zhe could get up, he was bitten on the leg again.","Lu Fei had initially wanted to rush to her son's side, but after hearing the conversation between the trainer and others, her face changed dramatically.","Many relatives in Lu Fei and her husband's family were in the military.","She trusted police dog judgments more than most people.","Especially when she saw that Little Seven wasn't trying to attack Lang Zhe, but only preventing him from escaping, she became more certain of one thing.","Her son was involved in something terrible...","Considering Little Seven's function, her face turned pale.","She stood frozen in disbelief, her brain completely unable to process it. With such a family background, to be involved in such things - it was almost devastating enough to destroy her completely.","Finally, security was called over by the Director and Producer.","When Ji Fei saw them approach, her face looked as sour as a well-pickled cucumber.","Of course, they came to help, but Qin Xian stepped forward and said, \"Help disperse the crowd.\"","The Director and Producer were anxious when they heard Qin Xian say, \"The police will probably be here soon. Prepare to calm the crowd.\"","Director and Producer: ????!!!!!","Weren't they just filming a show? Why would the police come? What exactly was going on?","Who could understand this situation? They thought the storm had passed and everything would end perfectly, but suddenly this happened. They really shouldn't have underestimated any member of the top-tier group!","\"What are you standing there for? Save him!\" Peng Li was so anxious her eyes had turned red.","The Director and Producer's minds were still racing, and without orders from above, the security guards also stood confused.","Just then, the police arrived, found the Director and Producer, and began controlling the scene.","The Director and Producer's faces had lost all expression, completely numb, following and doing whatever they were told.","When they heard about possibly arresting drug traffickers, the Director and Producer nearly lost their footing.","The moment the police appeared, Lang Zhe reflexively jumped up, only to be knocked down again by Little Seven.","Little Seven's expression seemed to say: A done deal, a merit at hand - you think I'd let you escape?","Soon, Lang Zhe was detained separately.","Yet Peng Li still tried to argue with the police, insisting they should arrest the dog instead.","Everyone looked at her as if she were a madwoman.","As a result, when the police confirmed she was acting together with Lang Zhe, they handcuffed her too.","Peng Li was completely dumbfounded.","Afterward, everyone present fell into a state of confusion and surrealism.","They were watching a show, right? How did it turn into a detention situation?","However, seeing the performers also quietly taking their seats, the audience didn't panic but instead sat in their places, furiously whispering and checking their phones.","The livestream had actually been cut off long ago.","The Director and Producer couldn't possibly let audiences keep watching a scene of a dog biting someone - this had turned into a live broadcast incident.","Though the livestream was closed, online discussions had exploded.","Only then did the people in the studio realize the situation outside - they were completely surrounded by police cars."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: This Time It's a Hornet's Nest","paragraphs":["\"Can someone tell me what exactly happened?\"","\"Looking at the police car photos and Little Seven's behavior, can't you all guess?\"","\"So Lang Zhe was really involved in drug trafficking?\"","\"Could this be part of the Top Flow Group's stage play? Cooperating with the police? A cover operation? That would be so meaningful.\"","\"What a coincidence that no one knew the Top Flow Group actually brought drug-sniffing dogs, and Lang Zhe just happened to show up at the scene. Did he walk into a trap?\"","\"If it's a coincidence, it's hilarious. Everyone was arguing about Lang Zhe's innocence before, but now there's nothing left to argue about.\"","\"Good heavens, an entertainment show turned into a criminal case! I knew the Top Flow Group's performance couldn't end normally!\"","\"Hold on, Entertainment Judge, it's one thing to judge the entertainment industry's misconduct, but now you're dealing with actual crimes? Crossing professional boundaries? Ji Fei is really making me laugh!\"","\"Well, that's Ji Fei for you, never failing to entertain the spectators.\"","Ji Fei was sitting in the audience seats waiting for instructions, browsing the internet and feeling frustrated seeing everyone talking about her again.","[How did this become about me? What does this have to do with me? Little Seven was borrowed from Miss Pei, and the drugs were Lang Zhe's own doing. I'm just an innocent bystander throughout all this. This is so unfair.]","The Qin family members sitting nearby couldn't help but find the situation both amusing and exasperating.","This turn of events was truly unexpected for everyone.","Sun Man, sitting nearby, was still in shock after hearing bits of news about the drug trafficking, which was completely beyond her imagination.","Lu Fei wasn't present, as she was Lang Zhe's mother and had voluntarily gone to assist with the investigation.","The show's outcome didn't matter anymore; they were just waiting for the police to catch the contact person hiding in the bathroom before ending the lockdown.","They conducted identity checks and released people one by one.","When the Qin family went through the inspection, they saw the busy Luo Fei.","Luo Fei came over to greet them, and despite being busy, he wore a smile and looked at Ji Fei much more kindly.","Although it was a coincidence, they had to admit that without Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's stage play, they wouldn't have caught this big fish.","Moreover, their live performance was playing on computers at the Police Station, and many colleagues were captivated by the plot.","Being able to perform such roles and storylines made Luo Fei view Ji Fei through a different lens.","Many young police officers were now looking at Ji Fei and Qin Zhao with admiration.","\"You've been a great help. I'll treat you all to dinner later to properly thank you,\" Luo Fei said.","\"Just a coincidence,\" Qin Xian replied.","[Huh, I hadn't even thought about the contact person in the bathroom. Can't believe they've already caught them. Tonight was quite productive indeed. Hey, if I could take a look at the contact person, maybe I could... damn, why didn't I think of this earlier! Let me see!]","Qin Xian's expression changed. Could it work like that?","[What? I can't see? Why... oh well, secrets that interfere too much with the real world can't be revealed. As expected, this system only allows me to know about personal gossip. Sigh, what a shame.]","Qin Xian finally understood that Ji Fei wasn't omniscient; she could only know simple information and influence individuals or those related through cause and effect.","For instance, knowing about Lang Zhe's information affected the contact person, and if Ji Fei were to look at the contact person, she might see some trivial information about related people that the police could investigate anyway. However, it would be impossible to immediately know about the masterminds behind it all, as that would have too great an impact.","Qin Xian also felt it was a pity but understood. If she really could do that, Ji Fei's abilities would be too powerful.","As it was just a minor incident, Ji Fei and Qin Xian didn't dwell on it.","Qin Xian exchanged a few brief words with Luo Fei before leading his family out.","At the entrance, they encountered Little Seven resting on the ground.","Upon seeing Ji Fei, Little Seven stood up, whimpering and wagging its tail frantically.","The trainer smiled nearby and said, \"Little Seven is apologizing for not completing the performance with you.\"","Ji Fei laughed and stepped forward to pat the dog's head. \"No need for that! Little Seven is so cool. What you did was much more meaningful than my performance! Good job, Little Seven!\"","Little Seven was overjoyed at the praise, constantly rubbing against Ji Fei's legs.","Everyone couldn't resist asking for photos with Little Seven before leaving the studio.","Outside, they saw the director and producer, looking completely drained as they dealt with the aftermath.","Pei Mingxuan went forward to check on them.","Then two slightly resentful gazes fell upon Ji Fei in the crowd.","Ji Fei: ?","\"This time it really wasn't my fault. I had no idea beforehand,\" Ji Fei protested her innocence. \"Besides, isn't this a good thing? We caught criminals.\"","\"We're very happy to have done our civic duty, but our hearts can't take it anymore. We'd like to live a few more years,\" the producer said, almost in tears.","The director added emotionally, \"Next time, could you please avoid our shows when you participate in programs? I feel like our destinies might be incompatible.\"","Everyone: ... They wanted to laugh but didn't dare.","Indeed, who else's show would turn out so dramatic? But since it was just a coincidence, what could they do? They could only pat their shoulders in sympathy.","However, they didn't know that this storm was just beginning.","While the internet was buzzing with various speculations about the incident, neither the production team nor the participating artists could say much before the police announcement.","Only audience members who were present in the studio would leak information, though its authenticity was questionable.","But after midnight, the direction of the leaked information changed.","\"My neighbor is XX, and I saw police coming to their house in the middle of the night!\"","\"Does anyone understand what's happening? My girlfriend works in an artist's PR team and was called away from my arms at midnight for overtime work.\"","\"Has anyone called in a tip to the police? The room above mine is occasionally noisy at night, and I've been tolerating it. Never expected the police to show up today. I sneaked a peek and discovered it was the actor XXX living upstairs.\"","\"Paparazzi caught several artists being taken to the Police Station.\"","\"Whoa, what's going on? Wasn't it just Lang Zhe who got in trouble tonight?\"","By the next morning, the discussions had become increasingly mysterious.","Ji Fei woke up and was eating breakfast when she saw the chaos on Weibo, leaving her equally confused.","At the breakfast table, everyone was gossiping about it.","\"What's happening?\" Qin Rong asked in surprise.","\"Apparently, many artists' homes were raided last night,\" Qin Zhao said while scrolling through his phone. \"Some of them were rumored in the industry to be users.\"","Qin's Father asked, \"So it's related to Lang Zhe's arrest? Wasn't he just trafficking, not using?\"","Qin's Mom, browsing her phone, exclaimed in shock, \"My goodness, if this is really related, these artists with good reputations are going to fall from grace!\"","Qin Yan said, \"Being a fan really comes with risks!\"","Ji Fei quickly checked and [Oh, I see. It wasn't Lang Zhe, it was that contact person. They actually worked in the entertainment industry and was responsible for selling drugs to artists. So the most valuable thing they had was the list of artists involved in transactions. Damn... they've stirred up a hornet's nest? How many artists are going to fall? I can already imagine the fans' heartbreak.]"]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: You're Such a Failure as a Son","paragraphs":["When the Qin Family heard the news, they immediately realized that this time, the Chinese entertainment industry was about to experience a major earthquake.","Numerous artists were being arrested, banned, and having their contracts terminated. Many productions had to be suspended, and these artists would inevitably implicate even more people. It was unimaginable how busy the industry's staff would be in the coming days.","One could say that this would be a thorough cleansing of everyone in the entertainment circle who had been involved with these unsavory elements.","And all of this happened just because a stage play borrowed a retired drug-sniffing dog - who could have predicted that?","\"Our Qin Corporation also has affiliated entertainment companies, and their artists...\" Qin's Father said with a frown.","Qin Zhao smiled, \"No wonder my second brother was in such a good mood when he left this morning.\"","\"Does that mean there are no problems?\" Qin's Mom asked.","Qin Zhao replied, \"Who knows? I guess second brother sees this as an opportunity to eliminate the bad elements, which would benefit future development.\"","Just then, Ji Fei suddenly said, \"There's news!\"","Everyone immediately checked their phones, and sure enough, an official announcement had appeared, instantly taking the top spot on the trending list.","However, this announcement was about Lang Someone's case from last night.","The drug trafficking charges were confirmed, and a prison sentence of several years was inevitable. The reason for the drug trafficking was also revealed - it was to pay off gambling debts. This even implicated other friends in the industry who also had gambling debts, leading to an underground casino being shut down.","This naturally dispelled all previous rumors.","\"He kept saying he did wrong things because of obsessive love, it's absolutely disgusting.\"","\"It gives me chills thinking about how their circle ganged up to force marriage - they were just looking for a wealthy target!\"","\"It's truly tragic how love and marriage are being used for schemes.\"","\"When schemes fail, they resort to setting traps. It's making me develop a fear of men.\"","\"There are still many good men in the world, let's not discriminate based on gender.\"","\"Gambling, secret filming - sisters, remember to stay away from men with such behaviors! Don't fantasize about saving them.\"","\"Sigh, I remember when Lang Zhe said in an interview that many of his elders were military personnel and he admired those heroes, but he himself...\"","At that moment in the Police Station, Lang Zhe was crying out: \"Mom, Mom, save me! I didn't mean to, I really didn't want this, how did it become so serious?! I don't want to go to jail, I don't want to go to jail, please use your connections, our family...\"","Before Lang Zhe could finish crying, Lu Fei slapped him across the face, and the police didn't stop her.","\"You still have the nerve to mention family? Can you face your Grandparents? When you did these things, did you ever think about our family's reputation?\" Lu Fei's eyes were bloodshot, her heart aching, her gaze filled with deep disappointment.","Lang Zhe was stunned by the slap. He had... he had thought about them, that's why he refused to admit to the fraud! Why couldn't his mother understand him?","\"Your father in heaven would wish he never had a child like you!\" Lu Fei spoke harshly in her anger.","As soon as she said this, Lang Zhe suddenly looked up, his eyes fierce as he stared at Lu Fei, \"It's all your fault that I turned out this way! Do you know why I started gambling? It's because of you!\"","Lu Fei stared at him in shock, tears still unshed in her eyes. \"What did you say?\"","Lang Zhe's eyes were filled with hatred, \"If you hadn't been so controlling, always forbidding me from doing this and that since I was young, making me unable to handle the pressure, I wouldn't have secretly started gambling. I just wanted to relax, but then... If it wasn't for your face, for not wanting to disappoint you, I wouldn't have denied the gambling and fraud. If it wasn't for trying to cover it up, I wouldn't have hidden drugs. Actually, this is all because of you. You're a failed mother! You're the last person who has any right to criticize me!\"","Lang Zhe ranted like a madman, making all the surrounding police officers frown.","Lu Fei stumbled backward as if she could barely stand. She had indeed been strict with Lang Zhe, but without a husband's support, she was afraid of raising her child wrong and could only fortify herself.","She believed she had respected her child's choices. She actually didn't like Lang Zhe becoming a rap artist - if possible, she would have preferred him to join the military or become an actor, areas where their elders could help. But when her son said it was his dream, even though it didn't make money and he could barely support himself, even though he had achieved nothing so far, she didn't interfere because he liked it.","She was strict but also cared deeply for her son, yet in the end, she was still wrong in his eyes.","At this point, Luo Fei stepped forward with a serious expression, \"Adults should take responsibility for their own actions because you're the one who made all the decisions! At your age, still making your mother worry - you're truly a failed son! You're the last person who has any right to criticize your mom!\"","If Ji Fei were here, she would certainly applaud. Why could Lang Zhe criticize his mother, but Lu Fei couldn't criticize her son? Just because of the title 'mother,' should she bear all these accusations?","Lang Zhe's face alternated between pale and flushed at these words, but when the police were about to take him away, he instinctively started trembling and crying out for his mother to save him.","But Lu Fei's heart had already been completely broken by her son. Perhaps she really was a failure.","As Lang Zhe was being led away, he happened to pass by the room where Peng Li was being held.","Hearing her godson's miserable cries, Peng Li immediately started shouting anxiously, \"This must be a misunderstanding, you must have made a mistake, how could my godson possibly traffic drugs! Release him immediately!\"","The two police officers questioning her grew impatient, \"Ms. Peng, your own issues aren't resolved yet, so don't worry about others! Please explain again, why did you drive him to that supermarket, and why did you then go to the broadcast hall? Did you know about their transaction?\"","Peng Li had already been questioned several times, and now knowing that Lang Zhe had been taken away, she started making a scene, \"You're treating me like a criminal too, but I'm the young lady of the Peng Group, I... I won't say anything more, wait for my lawyer, I'm going to report you all!\"","\"Please cooperate!\"","Peng Li's refusal to cooperate and challenge to legal authority immediately made the police officers' faces turn cold.","Finally, someone arrived, but instead of her elderly parents with a lawyer as Peng Li expected, it was a young woman.","The young woman was dressed professionally and said she was there to handle Peng Li's case.","Peng Li asked confused, \"Who are you? Who sent you? Are you a lawyer? Why would they send such a young girl!\"","The woman gave her a cold look and reported her name to the police.","The familiar name made Peng Li's expression twist - it turned out the arrival was her long-estranged Daughter.","The Daughter had just happened to be back visiting her Grandparents when her foolish mother got caught up in this scandal. Her Grandparents were so angry they became unwell, so she had no choice but to come and understand the situation.","Peng Li was unaware of Lang Zhe's drug trafficking, but her behavior and attitude were highly suspicious, and she had indeed been passively involved, so the handling was complicated. In any case, she wouldn't be leaving the police station today.","\"Stay put, I'll arrange for a lawyer to handle this,\" the Daughter said coldly without even looking at Peng Li.","But Peng Li looked at her with what seemed like hatred, saying, \"Then why did you come? To see me humiliated? Are you planning to not try your best and use this chance to get revenge on me!\"","The Daughter gave a cold laugh. \"Get revenge on you? You're not worth my time for that. If it weren't for my Grandparents' sake, I wouldn't even be involved! Though I really didn't expect...\""]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: Wailing and Moaning Everywhere","paragraphs":["Peng Li's face suddenly changed. Though she didn't like this daughter, she still wanted her to show complete respect. Seeing her mocking expression and half-finished sentences, she couldn't help but burst out, \"What are you trying to say!\"","Wu Xingqing sneered, \"I heard that you dislike me, your own daughter, because you had a dream that I would cause your downfall and imprisonment.\"","Peng Li froze, and Wu Xingqing continued with a laugh, \"Now who's causing your downfall and imprisonment? Is it me? No! It's your precious godson! Congratulations, your dream came true in a different way.\"","The police officer nearby almost couldn't hold back his laughter.","Peng Li's expression twisted as she tried to raise her hand to strike Wu Xingqing, but Wu Xingqing caught her wrist and said, \"You gave up your custody rights, so you have no right to discipline me!\"","After saying this, Wu Xingqing released Peng Li's hand and walked away, ignoring her mother's devastated expression.","As she opened the door, Sun Man happened to be passing by. She was there to handle matters related to the fraud case, with Luo Fei standing beside her, about to escort her in.","Wu Xingqing didn't know them, so naturally wouldn't greet them. As she was about to leave, she sensed movement behind her. Looking back, she saw Peng Li gesturing wildly at Sun Man.","\"It's all because of you, you worthless woman! If it weren't for you, things wouldn't have gotten to this point! It's all your fault! You're actually the bad one here. Tell me, did you set this up to frame him?\"","Luo Fei openly rolled his eyes, surprising Wu Xingqing who was facing him. She had assumed domestic police officers would be more serious, so seeing one so... casual was unexpected. Strangely, she felt she had seen him somewhere before and found him somewhat familiar.","Hearing Peng Li's roaring, Sun Man finally spoke coldly, \"Is Ms. Peng still living in her own fantasy? They found drugs on Lang Zhe, how can you blame that on me? Oh, and I just remembered something.\"","Sun Man suddenly frowned mysteriously and said, \"You had a bad impression of me because you suspected I stole your necklace.\"","Peng Li was stunned that Sun Man dared to bring this up publicly.","\"Actually, your necklace really did go missing back then, but if it was truly stolen, Lang Zhe must have been the thief.\"","\"What! Are you crazy! He's my godson!\"","Sun Man smiled, \"So what? He was once my boyfriend too, yet he still secretly filmed me for fraud. I only know that during that time, he had already started paying off gambling debts. Stealing your jewelry... yes, that string around your neck would have been more than enough to cover his debts.\"","Everyone around looked at the pearl necklace on Peng Li's neck.","Peng Li suddenly seemed uncomfortable, touching her necklace nervously, \"Stop trying to frame him. If he stole it, where could he have hidden it?\"","Sun Man replied, \"That's why I didn't suspect him at first, thinking you must have been mistaken. But now I see he could have easily hidden these pearls using the same method he used to hide drugs.\"","Practice makes perfect, otherwise, he wouldn't have thought of using this method for transport so smoothly.","If he hadn't been discovered and Peng Li hadn't threatened to call the police, he wouldn't have taken it out. Now Sun Man was just grateful for her general disinterest in jewelry, which meant she had never touched that necklace.","Otherwise, she would have been utterly disgusted now.","Peng Li was stunned, and everyone present, including Luo Fei, stepped back with awkward expressions.","\"He could fit such a large pearl necklace in there? Then his drug transport amount was actually quite conservative,\" Luo Fei couldn't help saying. \"I wonder if the proctologist got everything out.\"","These words hit Peng Li like a thunderbolt, nearly causing her to collapse.","But with her wearing the necklace, no one dared to touch her or help her up. Wu Xingqing had also realized what was being implied and turned pale with disgust, naturally unwilling to help. Finally, Peng Li had to steady herself.","When she came to her senses, she frantically tried to pull off the necklace but froze mid-motion. Despite regular maintenance, still...","It was as if a poisonous snake was coiled around her neck - she dared not touch it but couldn't bear having it there. Finally, the overwhelmed Peng Li's eyes rolled back and she fainted.","Medical personnel had to come and carry her away.","This forced Wu Xingqing to follow along, which was quite troublesome.","Luo Fei came out with Wu Xingqing, \"You're Ms. Peng's daughter? Are you going with the ambulance?\"","\"I'll take my own car,\" Wu Xingqing had no desire to stay with that woman. After saying this, she felt awkward, knowing that to outsiders they were mother and daughter, and her coldness would surely be criticized. She probably expected a lecture from the police officer.","However, Luo Fei didn't interfere and simply arranged for police officers to follow the ambulance.","This caused Wu Xingqing to give Luo Fei another look.","\"Qingqing.\"","Suddenly someone called out to Wu Xingqing. Looking back, she saw a young man, who paused in his steps when he noticed Luo Fei turning around with her, showing a moment of discomfort.","As a police officer, Luo Fei naturally caught the man's strange expression toward him. But he was certain he didn't know this man.","The man quickly recovered and approached, asking with concern, \"I just saw auntie being taken away, did something happen?\"","\"Yes, she fainted. We're going to the hospital,\" Wu Xingqing said flatly.","The man put his arm around Wu Xingqing's shoulders, \"Let's go then.\"","They were clearly in a relationship.","Wu Xingqing nodded to Luo Fei in acknowledgment, and the man also smiled and nodded at him, though his final glance carried a meaningful smile.","Luo Fei frowned slightly, feeling something odd about the situation. However, the station was busy, and he had no time to dwell on it, with a pile of celebrity drug use announcements still needing to be handled.","After compiling and releasing the list of all involved celebrities, Weibo's servers crashed within a minute.","Even other apps that mainly discussed celebrity gossip subsequently crashed.","Seeing the Qin family frantically refreshing their pages gave a good idea of what other netizens were doing.","\"Wow, someone quick-fingered shared screenshots to our group. My classmates' group is crying so hard! Several of their favorites have fallen,\" Qin Rong said excitedly.","Qin Yan also said in surprise, \"Our hospital work group is also exploding with discussion.\"","Qin's Father said, \"The Qin Corporation's group is quiet, but some celebrities who collaborated with our products were involved.\"","Qin's Mom said, \"I guess our second son won't be coming home tonight.\"","Qin Zhao said, \"This isn't too troublesome, just release a statement terminating the collaborations.\"","Ji Feile spoke up, \"Sister Pei is also cursing in our studio's small group chat because one of the male actors is the supporting actor in Yu Rouyin's current filming project. All his scenes need to be reshot, delaying the schedule. Fortunately, she successfully signed Sun Man, so she's in a good mood, otherwise her anger would be hard to calm down right now.\"","Soon, the apps recovered, and everyone rushed back to surf the internet.","The public square was filled with homeless fans, a scene of complete devastation.","But before they could fully take in the drama, they heard Ji Fei curse.","[Damn, why am I still trending number one!]","The Qin family: What? Is this true? Quick, let's check!"]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: From now on, let's change the name to \"The King of Hell's Roll Call\"","paragraphs":["The Qin family checked and found that not only was it the top trending topic, but the top three trending topics were all about Ji Fei, followed by news about the fallen celebrities.","#Trust our Sister Fei, Entertainment Industry Judge, Law-abiding, Forever Standing#","#Dear, want to follow a star who'll never fall? Choose Sister Fei's verification#","#Sister Fei, please help verify for me!#","[This sounds like a massive brainwashing scene, oh my god! Who started this trend?!]","The Qin family wanted to laugh but didn't dare, looking around to see shoulders shaking everywhere.","Ji Fei, seeing that these fallen celebrities had lower trending numbers than her, seriously suspected that some people were using her as a scapegoat. However, after contacting Pei Mingxuan, she had to accept that no one had actually bought trending topics for her.","[This is pure love from netizens, damn it!!!]","The Qin family responded with a series of suppressed coughs.","Ji Fei looked at them reproachfully, suspecting they were all laughing at her because of the trending topics.","Feeling her gaze, the Qin family immediately started gossiping about the celebrities who had suddenly fallen from grace.","The situation was quite serious. Besides those who had shown some signs before, even some seemingly clean-cut celebrities were involved, including one who had previously promoted anti-drug campaigns.","Overnight, numerous films, TV shows, and entertainment videos were locked, many brands removed their materials and announced termination of partnerships, and many programs still in production went crazy with censoring.","Industry workers were truly outraged, with complaints everywhere.","It was a genuine bloodless purge.","The involved celebrities' Weibo accounts were banned, leaving only lonely statements from their studios and their super fans changing their avatars to black.","Many fans refused to face reality, asking about the situation everywhere or finding excuses for their idols.","Some overseas fans even claimed these things weren't a big deal, saying the Chinese entertainment industry was making mountains out of molehills.","But most domestic audiences firmly opposed celebrities' drug use.","\"Previously we withheld judgment due to incomplete information, now we know everything and request action. Those mindless fans should stop making excuses for their idols. He even played a police officer role, isn't that disgusting?\"","\"They're supposed to be role models, is this how they want to influence minors?\"","\"Look how they've warped young people's values. It's terrifying.\"","\"Values follow faces only until major rights and wrongs come into play.\"","\"Ban these tainted celebrities, never let them return.\"","\"I really don't understand people who use these things. It harms their bodies and is stained with compatriots' blood. How can they even bring themselves to use it?\"","\"So those brain-dead fans should stop making excuses. They're just society's scum.\"","\"If you make excuses for these tainted celebrities, how can those heroes who sacrificed themselves on the front lines of drug enforcement rest in peace?\"","\"In my opinion, thanks to this Entertainment Industry Judge show, if these buyers hadn't been caught, those heroes' sacrifices would have been in vain.\"","\"But I really want to comment on one thing - a show that could discover someone like Sister Fei as the entertainment industry judge, the director and producer must be talented.\"","\"Hahaha, 'My Acting, Cut!' should be renamed to 'The King of Hell's Roll Call.' Everyone who appears gets exposed.\"","\"I was wrong, I underestimated Sister Fei. I thought all the big revelations were done in the first three episodes, that Sister Fei's abilities had reached their limit and couldn't reveal more, that the popularity would decline. But Sister Fei is still Sister Fei, directly crossing boundaries, finishing moral rectification and moving on to legal programs.\"","Online, people were both cursing and laughing, and even official accounts liked the stage play brought by the show team and top-tier celebrities, indicating recognition of their contributions.","However, during this storm, some people tried to fish in troubled waters. Some were falsely accused as others attempted to take advantage of the chaos to smear them. After all, with so much happening at once, it was hard to distinguish truth from lies, and some netizens might be misled.","Initially, the falsely accused artists could only issue statements, thinking that their unlocked Weibo accounts should be proof enough of their innocence, but this had little effect.","Until the smearing of Sun Man appeared.","Ji Fei was stunned when she saw the new trending topic.","\"Someone's saying Sun Man also uses that stuff?\"","The Qin family immediately searched for topics related to Sun Man, and were also shocked by what they found.","\"Because of Lang Zheyun, Sun Man as his ex-girlfriend must have used it too - what kind of logic is this?!\" Qin Rong exclaimed.","\"Does Sun Man have any industry rivals?\" Qin's Mom asked curiously.","\"The industry should know by now that we've signed Sun Man. At this time, who would dare to crash into the Entertainment Industry Judge?\" Qin Zhao raised an eyebrow.","Ji Fei found it ridiculous but agreed internally.","\"So it's likely someone from outside the industry?\" Qin's Father said.","Qin Yan suddenly thought: \"Could it be her relatives? Weren't they being sued? Maybe they're trying to bite back?\"","Ji Fei immediately felt this made sense and quickly checked with her system.","[It really is Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle. Because they felt Sun Man's determination to sue them was going too far, they decided to take this opportunity to bite back. They're truly foolish.]","Hearing this answer, the Qin family also felt their behavior was extremely stupid.","But the development of events was somewhat unexpected.","When Sun Man learned of the news, she immediately posted a clarification on Weibo. However, Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle quickly appeared on video holding their ID cards, reporting her while crying about family loyalty, repeatedly accusing Sun Man of being unfilial and cruel to her mother who raised her alone.","As close relatives, when they claimed Sun Man used drugs, most netizens lost their ability to judge. After all, what mother would harm her child with such accusations!","However, loyal fans of the show remained skeptical.","\"How is this possible? If Sun Man used drugs, she would have been accomplices with Lang Zhe. How could they have had such a big falling out?\"","\"Exactly, being so close to Lang Zhe, if she used drugs, she would definitely be on the list.\"","\"If I remember correctly, when Sun Man was being forced into marriage, this mother and uncle showed their ugly sides then too.\"","Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle's Weibo accounts quickly filled with questioning comments, but these were successively deleted, immediately triggering netizens' rebellious spirit.","The arguments were quite lively.","However, Sun Man was no longer the helpless victim that anyone could bully.","Pei Mingxuan directly ignored Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle's accusations, and started interacting with Sun Man on Weibo, with the theme: Celebrating another powerful addition to the studio.","Then Qin Zhao, Ji Fei, and Yu Rouyin, under Pei Mingxuan's arrangement, successively reposted to welcome Sun Man.","This time, they truly witnessed Ji Fei's guiding ability - with her repost, 99% of people firmly believed in Sun Man's innocence.","No matter how much Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle cried and presented false evidence, very few people paid attention.","Finally, Pei Mingxuan joked: The first step to joining our studio is naturally a health check-up for our employees."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Temporarily Withdraw from the Entertainment Industry","paragraphs":["That evening, Pei Mingxuan posted photos showing her taking Sun Man for a medical examination, indirectly using various test results to prove Sun Man wasn't using drugs.","With this double verification, who would dare to defame Sun Man anymore?","After the test results came out, Pei Mingxuan quickly issued a statement: she would be filing appeals against Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle for their slanderous allegations.","This immediately triggered new waves of discussion.","With this precedent set, other wrongfully accused artists who were innocent also stepped up to defend their interests.","However, the shamelessness of Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle was beyond imagination. They started playing victims again, claiming they were uneducated and didn't understand such matters, pretending to be innocent due to ignorance.","They said they only noticed some strange behavior from Sun Man and misunderstood the situation, claiming they acted this way only because they were worried their relative might go astray - it was all out of good intentions.","Seeing such responses, the Qin Family was thoroughly disgusted.","\"I can only say, this is disgust opening doors for more disgust - utterly revolting.\"","The Qin Family: Some people are just like walnuts - they need to be cracked!","Soon, Pei Mingxuan came with her thunder hammer, directly releasing relevant documents that exposed their shame, proving these two people had been discovered transferring Sun Man's assets, and used slander as a low-blow tactic when Sun Man demanded her property back.","To prevent future troubles, Pei Mingxuan wrote a detailed account, thoroughly explaining how Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle had treated Sun Man over the years.","This was to avoid future emotional manipulation and moral blackmail using family ties.","\"Heavens, I've never seen a mother who works against her own daughter's interests like this. Is this what they call the 'brother-supporting demon' or 'nephew-supporting demon'?\"","\"Let's not even talk about Sun's Uncle, but Sun's Mother deserves to be struck by lightning. What's wrong with her brain, helping her brother and nephew suck her own daughter's blood, and even falsely accusing her daughter? Doesn't she know this could destroy Sun Man's career?\"","\"Some women just worship men, nothing matters more to them than that bit of flesh. I guarantee if Sun Man were a man, Sun's Mother would be a son-protecting fanatic.\"","\"Sun's Mother looks down on herself, so she looks down on her daughter too. She used to think that as a single mother, she could only survive by relying on men. Even though their whole family later lived off Sun Man, she still firmly believed they couldn't manage without brothers' support. Even if you crack open her skull and explain it to her, she wouldn't listen.\"","\"It's pure selfishness. She knows offending her daughter won't have serious consequences, but offending her brother and nephew would mean being abandoned, so she sacrifices her daughter to keep both sides.\"","Seeing the online criticism, Sun's Mother broke down.","They hadn't left Sun Man's house yet, and Sun's Mother was trying to figure out solutions with Sun's Uncle and nephew.","The nephew, seeing that netizens were about to dig into his background, immediately shook off Sun's Mother's hand and angrily accused, \"It's all your fault for not being able to control your daughter. If I get cyberbullied, it's all because of you!\"","Sun's Uncle, looking at the lawyer's letter he received, said with a grim expression, \"I'm warning you, if this goes to court, you must say everything was your idea, that you did it all, and we knew nothing about it. If you don't take all the blame, I'll never acknowledge you as my sister again, and my son won't have you as an aunt anymore. Do you understand?\"","Sun's Mother turned pale, \"What do you mean, you want me alone to...\"","\"Yes, whether it's jail time, fines, or whatever, you'll take it all,\" Sun's Uncle shouted angrily. \"Your daughter's actions, of course you should bear the responsibility. I really don't believe she'd let you die!\"","Sun's Mother was at her wit's end, truly not knowing what to do. She could only call her daughter for help, believing that if she just cried a little, the other party would surely soften and forgive them.","But when the call connected, it was Pei Mingxuan who answered.","\"Sorry, before the court hearing, all of Sun Man's calls will be handled by me. Don't waste your time calling. Let the law judge everything.\"","Unable to contact anyone, Sun's Mother completely panicked. She seemed to suddenly understand something.","Sun's Uncle and his son never truly belonged to her, and she had lost what actually belonged to her.","But no matter how much she cried and screamed, even threatening suicide, it was useless now.","Except for cold, remote handling of matters, Sun's Mother would never see Sun Man again.","After all, that false accusation had truly frozen Sun Man's heart.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei, staying at the Qin family home, was secretly following the drama...","\"Well done, Sister Pei! Pitiful people must have detestable aspects - you can't coddle this type. They still want to use family ties for emotional blackmail? Dream on! But don't let Sun's Uncle and his son off either! Expose them!\"","In recent days, except for Qin Xian, Qin Zhao, and Qin Yan, everyone else in the Qin family stayed home with Ji Fei, convenient for following the drama.","Ji Fei thought they were just idle and surfing the internet, sharing interesting gossip with everyone when they found it.","After all, this incident had such wide implications that it took a whole week of intense drama before settling down - people were stuffed full with gossip. Various marketing accounts probably achieved their annual KPIs ahead of schedule.","In the end, Sun Man's case didn't disappoint. Sun's Mother and Sun's Uncle were both convicted, the nephew didn't get any benefits, and they recovered all the real estate that hadn't been sold off.","Although there were considerable losses, it meant finally getting rid of the family of parasites, with only legally required support payments remaining in the future.","However, after the results came out, some people online still made snide remarks, saying Sun Man was too harsh on her own mother.","\"Sure enough, as soon as someone acts a bit strictly, a bunch of moral guardians jump out to criticize. Since they're not the ones being whipped, they don't care if others are in pain, they just want to 'educate' others from their moral high ground. Let's report all of them.\"","The Qin family quietly joined in clicking the report buttons.","Sun Man's reaction didn't disappoint Ji Fei. She ignored these voices that couldn't stand seeing others do well, occasionally checking on senior Lu Fei, while quietly recovering and waiting for Sister Pei's next instructions.","Until she went to prison, Sun's Mother never saw Sun Man. According to Sister Pei, Sun's Mother cried until she seemed to lose her soul, constantly mumbling: \"I was wrong, I was wrong...\"","But it was too late.","After this storm, the entertainment industry truly became much cleaner.","Of course, it also affected many capitalists' interests, as this essentially cut off many people's money trees.","Even with Qin Corporation as backing, some people were preparing to teach Qin Zhao and Ji Fei a lesson.","However, before their new work could come out, Qin Zhao announced his temporary withdrawal statement, saying he would leave the domestic entertainment industry temporarily to work behind the scenes in the international entertainment industry.","This was beyond their reach, so apart from top star Qin Zhao's fans tearfully bidding farewell, those who wanted to cause trouble could only tearfully shift their target to focus solely on Ji Fei.","But unexpectedly, after waiting for a long time and hearing about many work opportunities being actively offered, everyone thought Pei Mingxuan would ride the wave of being the domestic entertainment industry's judge to make Ji Fei the next top star.","However, they waited and waited, and even after Sun Man had started taking work, Ji Fei didn't appear, as if she had just taken a brief tour of the entertainment industry.","Was she really just playing around?","But careful observers would notice that the original studio owner had changed, with Qin Zhao completely withdrawing, leaving only Ji Fei.","Instead of being an artist, had she switched to being a boss?","There were many speculations until fans pushed messages of concern for Ji Fei to trending topics, forcing her to respond with: \"Still here, resting, just taking a break.\"","In the studio, Pei Mingxuan rolled her eyes in annoyance. She actually really wanted to arrange work, as work invitations were at their peak now, but someone was just lying around like a salted fish...","\"Well, it's not bad to retreat while at the peak. The title of domestic entertainment judge is too prominent and troublesome. We'll arrange work for you after the heat dies down,\" Pei Mingxuan could only comfort herself.","Ji Fei obediently agreed. She had to be obedient at this point, after all, she had already taken too much advantage.","Even now, Ji Fei still looked somewhat incredulously at the two men at the desk beside her.","Qin Xian and Qin Zhao were handling the final document processing.","Qin Zhao shrugged and said, \"I've withdrawn part of the funds to take with me, the rest that can't be moved will be a gift for my second sister-in-law.\"","Qin Xian nodded and said, \"I will inject one-third of the funds in the name of Qin Corporation, but the share won't exceed Ji Fei's investment. In the future, Ji Fei will be the sole boss here.\"","Pei Mingxuan smiled with satisfaction, as this meant letting others know they had the backing of Qin Corporation. Her attitude towards Ji Fei instantly changed from frustration to a smile as she said, \"Thank you, thank you.\"","Qin Xian turned to look at Ji Fei, and seeing her somewhat dazed expression, he asked with a smile, \"Are you satisfied with this arrangement?\"","Ji Fei nodded frantically, though she felt a bit guilty.","\"Maybe... I should use my money that's invested with you for my share of the investment,\" she suggested.","Ji Fei couldn't quite understand why her investments were being funded by Qin Xian when she had her own money. Was it not enough?","Qin Xian's eyes darkened slightly. Investing all of Ji Fei's money that he managed into the studio would be quite risky, and moreover... someone might immediately feel emboldened to divorce him. He... didn't want to give Ji Fei that idea.","\"The money you invested hasn't been transferred out yet, so it can't be used,\" Qin Xian explained.","Ji Fei still felt uncomfortable, thinking to herself, [Would this be mine after the divorce?]","Qin Xian: ...","Qin Zhao: I didn't hear anything.","Qin Xian could only add, \"Besides, as your husband, my money is your money, but whatever is under your name will always be yours. Simply put, all future profits from this studio will be yours.\"","While she didn't understand much about investments, this explanation made Ji Fei's eyes light up. What did feeling guilty matter when losing money would be the real pain?","[Hehe, now I have Yu Rouyin and Sun Man making money for me, what do I have to worry about? I can just lay back and relax, and when I get too bored, I'll jump back into the circle to watch the drama unfold.]","Qin Xian's gaze grew increasingly indulgent - let her be happy however she wanted.","Beside them, Qin Zhao watched with growing amazement, thinking that only his sister-in-law could make his brother show his emotions so openly.","Suddenly remembering their evening plans, he couldn't help but ask, \"Are you two really going to attend your class reunion tonight?\"","Qin Zhao shot meaningful glances at his brother.","Qin Xian nodded indifferently - it was Ji Fei who had insisted on attending after hearing about it."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: What Reunion It's Clearly a Melon Field","paragraphs":["Although Ji Fei has changed a lot now, Qin Zhao still remembers the disaster from his second brother's last class reunion.","It was the first class reunion after Qin Xian and Ji Fei got their marriage certificate.","As a married couple, even if just in name, Qin Xian would always respect Ji Fei's choices regarding these kinds of social gatherings where couples typically attend together.","Back then, Ji Fei had become extremely paranoid due to people's disapproval of their marriage, closely guarding all of Qin Xian's social interactions, especially events like class reunions where gossip tends to flourish.","That time, Ji Fei went specifically to assert her position as his wife, and the results were predictable.","Many of Qin Xian's brothers had just returned from abroad, and upon hearing about this unexpected marriage, they were quite hostile toward Ji Fei, who they believed had schemed against their brother. Though they remained outwardly polite for Qin Xian's sake, they were far from welcoming, maintaining only basic courtesies.","Qin Xian maintained his typically aloof demeanor, and perhaps due to Ji Fei's oversensitivity, she began to sulk when she couldn't fit into the atmosphere.","Then someone accidentally brought up a memory from university days, saying, \"Back then, Yu Zhi...\"","Realizing the mistake, they quickly stopped and apologized, but the next second, Ji Fei lost control.","She not only threw a drink in a female classmate's face but also slapped a male student who came to defend her. When someone stood up to scold her, she flipped the table and started screaming curses. Qin Xian couldn't stop her at all.","This completely ruined the reunion, leaving everyone embarrassed and angry. Even though the Qin family was known for protecting their own, Qin Xian could only apologize in this situation and quickly leave with Ji Fei.","Afterward, Ji Fei returned home crying, feeling wronged and convinced that Qin Xian's brothers looked down on her. She smashed things around the house, disturbing the entire family's peace.","After that, whenever there were class reunions, Qin Xian declined all invitations.","This time, however, Luo Fei personally delivered the invitation to Ji Fei at the Qin residence. Perhaps the recent events had changed Luo Fei's opinion of Ji Fei, making this a genuine invitation.","But the last reunion had been so awkward.","Who knows what Ji Fei was thinking - perhaps she felt she had gone too far last time and wanted to apologize and try to get along better with second brother's classmates?","Qin Zhao wasn't too worried about most of the classmates, but some of his second brother's friends had quite a temper. After such a major conflict last time, who knew how this meeting would go.","Knowing Ji Fei was going to attend the reunion, the whole family was worried and still discussing it in their private group chat.","That's why Qin Zhao couldn't help but ask again. If he were Ji Fei, he wouldn't want to face those people ever again. Meeting people one-on-one like Luo Fei would be fine, but a reunion? Just thinking about it made his toes curl with embarrassment.","Just then, Qin Xian finished handling everything and handed it over to his assistant, then walked up to Ji Fei saying, \"We should get ready to leave.\"","Ji Fei had been thinking about recruiting more workers for her studio when she heard his voice and remembered today's main event.","She immediately stood up, looking excited.","Qin Zhao asked suspiciously, \"You're this excited about second brother's class reunion?\" Surely she hadn't forgotten what she did last time.","Ji Fei nodded, while internally cheering.","[What class reunion? It's clearly a drama field! Oh my god, I can finally witness the juicy gossip up close! Qin Xian's brothers, oh my, the drama around them is explosive. Hehe!]","Her uncontrollable smile revealed her excitement.","Qin Xian: ...So it was for the gossip? He thought... wait, were his brothers really that... dramatic?","Qin Zhao: Why does this suddenly make so much sense? Damn, now I'm curious! How explosive is it exactly?","[One has an ex-girlfriend who became his sister-in-law and they're still entangled, another is raising a substitute for his true love but it's actually paid arrangement, one's crush is about to marry his cousin, and another's father is about to marry someone their age, Luo Fei is actually the most normal among them, though I heard he and his girlfriend had a premarital pregnancy with some redemption story - there's drama everywhere!]","Qin Xian: ...Wait, what? Who's she talking about?","Even though Qin Xian didn't usually interfere in others' private affairs, he should have heard about these things. Except for the news about one of them having a father who was marrying a young girl, which was already circulating in upper society circles, what were all these other stories?","Qin Xian was beginning to wonder if Ji Fei was talking about a different class reunion altogether.","Or perhaps she was talking about completely different people than his brothers.","Qin Zhao's eyes widened: What? What! Are my brother's friends involved in such dramatic situations?","Damn, I really want to go witness this drama in person!","But for this kind of gathering, he couldn't possibly sneak in. With no other choice, Qin Zhao shared what he'd heard in the family group chat.","Joy shared is joy doubled.","The Qin family members, suddenly bombarded with gossip but unable to attend in person: Are you sure this is sharing joy?!","By this time, Qin Xian was already dazedly heading out with Ji Fei.","They arrived relatively late, and by then, most of Qin Xian's brothers had already arrived.","When Luo Fei arrived with his girlfriend, everyone's attention turned to them, especially from the most notable table.","Even at a class reunion, there were still distinct social circles.","Their table was considered the most prestigious group.","Luo Zhou led the criticism, his face unfriendly: \"Have you lost your mind? You actually invited that madwoman from Qin Xian's house?\"","Xuan Yi, sitting beside Luo Zhou, spoke up: \"Luo Zhou, she is still Qin Xian's wife. It's not polite to call her that.\"","Luo Zhou frowned impatiently, \"This is a class reunion. Are you here as our classmate or as my sister-in-law? Save the lectures for other occasions.\"","Xuan Yi's expression changed slightly.","Some of those present wisely kept their thoughts to themselves, while others teased Luo Zhou.","Yu Yue: \"What's wrong? Uncomfortable with our class monitor becoming your sister-in-law? It's been over two years, aren't you used to it yet?\"","His equally tactless girlfriend Bai Xiaoxi also laughed: \"If I remember correctly, when Xuan Yi misspoke and Ji Fei threw a drink at her, weren't you the first one to stand up and defend her? You even got slapped! I get it now - even though you don't accept her as your sister-in-law, you still consider her family. Luo Zhou, you're so awkward, haha!\"","Others looked at this clueless couple with exasperation.","\"Shut up,\" Luo Zhou said coldly.","Qi Li shrugged from the side, with one arm around a quiet girl, pointing at Luo Fei: \"He betrayed us back when he was borrowing the police dog.\"","Hearing this, Cen Ting, who had just hung up her phone, spoke: \"I saw that show. Ji Fei performed well and has done many good deeds. She's currently the most popular in the entertainment industry with very high exposure. I think she might have changed.\"","\"It's just for show. Doesn't your fiancé work in the entertainment industry? Hasn't he told you these are all fake personas?\" Luo Zhou said disdainfully.","Cen Ting didn't want to argue and left it at that.","Jing Yan, sitting next to Cen Ting, glanced at her before addressing Luo Fei, who was helping his girlfriend sit down and ignoring everyone else: \"Weren't you the one who disliked her the most before?\"","Though Luo Fei seemed to have no conflict with Ji Fei, he was actually the one who initially disliked her the most."]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Will They Meet and Pull Each Other's Hair Out","paragraphs":["Luo Fei is a man with a strong sense of justice. He has known Qin Xian the longest and they are the closest of friends.","Qin Xian's personality has always been cool and detached since childhood, and he is quite slow to react emotionally. Luo Fei is always worried that someone might take advantage of Qin Xian, but in reality, Qin Xian is so smart that it's hard for anyone to bully him. It's just that Luo Fei has a strong protective instinct towards Qin Xian.","So, Luo Fei has been quite critical of Qin Xian's marriage, feeling that Qin Xian was taken advantage of. Not to mention the last class reunion, where Qin Xian, who is usually very good at handling social situations, rarely needs to apologize, had to bow his head and apologize for Ji Fei's mistake. It was truly uncomfortable for everyone to witness.","At that time, everyone was thinking, regardless of whether Qin Xian and Yu Zhi, who had suddenly broken up, had a chance to reconcile, even if their classmate Jin Yue took the opportunity to step in, it would be fine.","Although they didn't quite approve of Jin Yue's approach to getting close to Qin Xian, as it felt a bit like trying to steal her best friend's boyfriend, since Qin Xian didn't seem to notice Jin Yue's feelings, they naturally wouldn't meddle. However, they didn't expect Ji Fei to suddenly appear.","In the end, Jin Yue ended up suffering the consequences of her own actions.","It was simply unbelievable.","But they still didn't approve of Ji Fei.","Qin Xian is a man of good character, strong abilities, and is exceptionally excellent, even perfect. Having such a brother and classmate, they never envied, only felt incredibly proud and honored.","Not to mention, their families almost treat the fact that Qin Xian is their brother as an advantage.","Both personally and professionally, they all like Qin Xian very much.","When Qin Xian was with Yu Zhi, they felt everything was so perfect.","It was like witnessing something beautiful. They were totally shipping the couple.","But Ji Fei's appearance ruined Qin Xian's perfection. How could they possibly like Ji Fei?","So, when Luo Fei actively invited Ji Fei to join them and even sent them messages about it, everyone expressed great confusion.","Even now, despite Ji Fei's improved reputation due to her participation in a variety show, they still believe it's all fake.","It's also because they haven't seen Qin Xian in almost half a year, either busy with their own relationships or out of town, so they really don't know about Ji Fei's drastic changes.","After listening to his friends' complaints, Luo Fei first poured a cup of hot tea for his girlfriend and arranged everything before speaking, \"I invited her here for two reasons.\"","Everyone became curious and quiet.","\"First, she has really changed. Now she looks quite pleasing to the eye, just like... how Ji Fei was described by Qin Xian's parents before.\"","Most of the people present didn't know how Ji Fei was described by Qin Xian's parents, but Luo Fei and Jing Yan did.","Jing Yan raised an eyebrow, \"The lively, cute, mischievous, and sunny Ji Fei?\"","\"What? That shrew?\" Luo Zhou's disgusted expression showed he was quite repulsed.","Qi Li curiously loosened his embrace of the girl he was holding, \"Really? She used to be like that? The one who argued with me and flipped the table? Maybe Qin Xian's parents were looking at her through rose-colored glasses?\"","Luo Fei shrugged, \"Anyway, the current Ji Fei is quite interesting. I'm not sure about others, but she and Qin Zhao did help with the Sun Man case.\"","\"Maybe Qin Zhao led the way...\" Yu Yue pondered.","\"No way, his younger brother used to dislike Ji Fei a lot too,\" Bai Xiaoxi said, leaning on Yu Yue's arm, who immediately nodded, agreeing with his girlfriend.","Cen Ting wanted to say something but thought better of it and remained silent.","Xuan Yi, however, felt guilty, \"Maybe last time she was really provoked by me.\"","Everyone was hesitant to comment.","Luo Fei continued, \"The second reason is that I found Qin Xian quite attentive to Ji Fei, so I'm very curious.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone, except Qi Li's date and Luo Fei's girlfriend, who were out of the loop, were Qin Xian's friends. Their expressions were shocked, as if thinking, 'What are you talking about?'","It's not surprising they thought that, because even when Qin Xian was with Yu Zhi.","No one ever said Qin Xian was attentive to her.","Although they were a good match, they didn't seem like a lovey-dovey couple, more like best partners.","So... attentive... does Qin Xian even have that in him?","\"I get it, Qin Xian's biggest flaw is that he's too responsible. Ji Fei is his wife, so he's attentive,\" Luo Zhou said, as if relieved.","Everyone also seemed to breathe a sigh of relief, thinking this explanation made sense.","But Luo Fei shook his head and detailed the situation.","At the time, Qin Xian suddenly asked him to handle the Sun Man case.","Luo Fei was puzzled if Qin Xian had any connection with Sun Man.","Qin Xian replied to Luo Fei, \"That's a prospective artist from my wife's studio.\"","Actually, Luo Fei could have just sent someone else to handle it, but Qin Xian's words shocked him. Qin Xian actually came to him for help because of his wife, and even had his younger brother stay with her. Luo Fei felt like the world had changed so much while he was away for half a year.","After all, such a matter could have been handled by simply calling the police.","And it was a relationship that involved many twists and turns.","When he arrived, Qin Zhao was also surprised, clearly not expecting his older brother to do such a thing.","Qin Xian's actions really showed he was attentive, as if he didn't want anything to go wrong for his wife.","So, combining these two points, Luo Fei really wanted to see what the current situation between the two was.","He truly regards Qin Xian as a brother. If his brother is really attentive, he will naturally respect that, not let personal likes and dislikes affect his judgment, and will also take good care of his sister-in-law.","He also wanted to let these people see, so they don't end up disrespecting Ji Fei, which would be like slapping Qin Xian in the face.","After hearing Luo Fei's description.","Although it didn't feel very strong, for those who have known Qin Xian for many years, it really felt a bit surreal.","In the midst of this eerie silence, Xuan Yi suddenly exclaimed, \"Ah!\"","Luo Zhou reflexively leaned in, frowning, \"What's wrong?\"","Xuan Yi awkwardly glanced at Luo Zhou and showed her phone to everyone, \"I just received a message... Yu Zhi is back in the country. She heard about the class reunion and asked where we are, she wants to join us, this...\"","Everyone's faces changed.","Even though Luo Fei said Ji Fei had changed.","But last time, just mentioning her name made her go crazy and attack everyone. If they really meet, would they tear each other's hair out?","The thought of that scene was unbearable!","Luo Zhou sneered, \"Let her come, it's a class reunion, naturally for classmates to attend.\"","Qi Li raised an eyebrow, \"We're not trying to stir up trouble, we just want to see... whose heart Qin Xian is really in.\"","Everyone couldn't help but want to watch this drama.","Only Luo Fei's mouth twitched. He was the one who invited people over, and if anything happened, Ji Fei would blame him.","He didn't want to be the scapegoat, so he immediately prepared to send a message to Qin Xian, explaining the situation. Whether they come or not is up to them.","Others saw him trying to tip off the situation and wanted to stop him.","There were quite a few people who wanted to watch the drama and join in the fun.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei, who also wanted to watch the drama and join in the fun, was already excitedly walking quickly. Seeing Qin Xian walking slower than her, she couldn't help but turn back and say, \"Hurry up, we're almost late.\"","Qin Xian frowned, still thinking, who is with whom?!"]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: The Makeup Artist Who Keeps a Mooch","paragraphs":["In her eagerness to catch up on the latest gossip, Ji Fei was walking quickly when, at a corner, she encountered someone who suddenly lost their balance. The box in their hands toppled directly towards Ji Fei.","Unable to stop in time, Ji Fei was about to be hit by the scattered items spilling from the box when she felt a strong force around her waist pulling her backward.","In an instant, Ji Fei found herself pressed against a solid chest, and remarkably, none of the scattered items had touched her.","Now, with Qin Xian's arm wrapped around her waist and his other arm shielding her face, it was clear why nothing had reached her - any flying objects had been blocked by Qin Xian's protective stance.","\"Are you alright?\" A deep voice resonated above her head, its inherent coolness unable to mask the underlying concern.","Ji Fei was momentarily stunned.","\"I'm fine, I'm fine.\"","Qin Xian released Ji Fei, and they both looked up to see a young woman with a high ponytail and black face mask sitting awkwardly on the ground, surrounded by scattered makeup items from her fallen box.","The woman quickly got up, pulled down her mask, and bowed apologetically, \"I'm so sorry, I hope you weren't hurt... Teacher Ji?!\"","Ji Fei recognized her too - she was the makeup assistant assigned to Ji Fei's group on the show \"My Acting, Cut!\" She only remembered her being called Little Tang.","\"Little Tang? Is that you?\"","Tang Jiang seemed surprised that Ji Fei remembered her and immediately apologized again, \"I'm sorry, Teacher Ji. It's all my fault for not holding it properly.\"","\"Don't worry about it, but you... don't look so well,\" Ji Fei frowned as she observed her.","Tang Jiang's face was pale with dark circles under her eyes, clearly showing signs of exhaustion. She had obviously not been resting well and looked terribly worn out, which explained her stumbling earlier.","Tang Jiang, however, maintained an indomitable spirit and quickly put on a smile, \"I'm fine, just too busy to eat properly. I got a bit dizzy from low blood sugar.\"","Just then, someone called for Little Tang from a distance.","Tang Jiang hurriedly said to Ji Fei, \"Please don't let me keep you, Teacher Ji.\"","As she spoke, she cast a controlled glance at Qin Xian standing beside Ji Fei.","As their group's makeup artist, she had naturally seen Qin Xian several times and never failed to be amazed by his looks and presence that rivaled top celebrity Qin Zhao. As a makeup artist, she couldn't help but marvel at his superior genes.","She had occasionally heard that these two were married, but they kept a low profile. Being discreet and not one to gossip about insider information, Tang Jiang showed no particular curiosity about their presence together tonight.","She just thought they looked striking together - being a makeup artist with high aesthetic standards, she couldn't help but appreciate such an attractive couple.","After speaking, Tang Jiang quickly began picking up the makeup items from the floor. Seeing her hurry, Ji Fei naturally bent down to help, and Qin Xian silently joined in despite Tang Jiang's frantic protests.","They finished gathering everything quickly. Tang Jiang's face was flushed with embarrassment, but she also felt that these two must truly be from high society - well-mannered and refined, showing no superiority despite the obvious social gap she felt.","The last item Qin Xian picked up was a delicate bracelet, which made him pause briefly.","\"Oh, thank you, thank you! Oh no, it's broken... thank goodness it wasn't lost.\" Tang Jiang didn't notice his reaction as she took the bracelet, looking relieved. She examined it carefully before tucking it safely in her pocket.","The calls for her grew more urgent, so Tang Jiang thanked them again and left.","After she was gone, Ji Fei clicked her tongue, \"One look at that bracelet and you can tell it's from her boyfriend. I must say, that freeloader knows how to sweet-talk girls. The bracelet looks quite tasteful, though I wonder what brand it is.\"","Qin Xian replied, \"It's custom-made.\"","Ji Fei exclaimed, \"Oh? Is it expensive?\"","Qin Xian wasn't sure how to respond, \"Her particular one isn't.\"","Ji Fei shrugged, \"I thought as much. Hey, you know what...\"","As they continued walking, Ji Fei couldn't resist sharing the gossip with Qin Xian. Since this was common knowledge from their time filming the show, not secret information from the system, Ji Fei felt no hesitation in sharing.","Hearing Ji Fei's tone, Qin Xian tilted his head closer, listening attentively.","\"She's a makeup assistant for 'My Acting, Cut!' with decent pay, but she also takes freelance makeup jobs everywhere. You can see how exhausted she is, and it's all because she's supporting a freeloader.\"","\"A freeloader?\"","\"She has a boyfriend she's been supporting for two years. He lives off her completely, claiming he's starting an online business, so he never goes out to work. All living expenses come from Little Tang. She won't even let him experience any hardship, always giving him the best of everything. She even takes care of all his daily needs, firmly believing he truly has talent and will succeed, that he's not just freeloading. She gets upset when others point this out, so even her mentor has given up trying to reason with her.\"","\"Her boyfriend sees her exhausted like this and doesn't care?\" Qin Xian raised an eyebrow.","Ji Fei nodded, \"Maybe there really are men who need to focus entirely on their business ventures and temporarily rely on their women's support, but I don't think her boyfriend is one of those...\"","\"Indeed. If he were truly in a desperate situation, he should refuse when she tries to provide such a comfortable lifestyle. It's not right for him to enjoy while his girlfriend suffers.\"","Ji Fei immediately patted Qin Xian's shoulder, \"Exactly! And I've seen her asking her mentor for advance payment because her boyfriend crashed into someone's luxury car and got into an argument with them. They couldn't negotiate, so she had to empty her savings to pay for the damages. Her boyfriend is just an angry good-for-nothing. I don't know what she sees in him. Did he save her life or something?\"","Ji Fei felt quite sympathetic towards Little Tang, hence her harsh words, but she never considered intervening.","Unlike other victims of exploitation, Little Tang didn't seem to find her situation difficult and might even be content with it. Ji Fei absolutely wouldn't interfere with others' fate. She didn't even consider using the system to gossip about her thoughts.","At most, she would just vent to others.","Qin Xian, having heard all this, found it even more peculiar how that bracelet had come into her possession.","Since Ji Fei loved gossip, Qin Xian thought she might be interested in hearing about this discovery.","In their relationship, he couldn't let Ji Fei do all the talking; he needed to try to change too.","Just as he was about to speak, they saw someone approaching from the end of the corridor.","When Luo Fei came out, he saw the two of them walking down the corridor, heads close together, whispering to each other.","Qin Xian's eyebrows were raised, seemingly reacting to something he heard, while Ji Fei's face was animated with gossip.","Luo Fei: ...rubbing his eyes, although he had seen them together before, this moment felt somehow surreal."]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: The White Moonlight is Coming","paragraphs":["Luo Fei came out obviously to shake off those people who were trying to make phone calls to spread the news, but seeing that the two had already arrived, he could only awkwardly give a greeting first.","\"You're here.\"","Qin Xian nodded.","Ji Fei, however, smiled warmly and said, \"Hello.\"","She then began to look Luo Fei up and down.","[Oh ho, he brought his girlfriend who's pregnant before marriage, what? The pregnancy news hasn't been announced yet? Well, it makes sense, after all, it was an unexpected pregnancy, and Luo Fei only found out after returning from his business trip. They'll probably announce it soon and then prepare for the wedding.]","Qin Xian's gaze at Luo Fei changed uncontrollably.","He only knew that Luo Fei had always wanted to marry his girlfriend of many years, but she kept saying to wait a little longer. He didn't expect them to have... double happiness so suddenly.","Luo Fei didn't pay attention to their gazes, but said uncomfortably, \"Um... Qin Xian, come with me for a moment. Ji Fei, would you mind waiting here for us?\"","Qin Xian looked at him strangely.","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow: [What does he mean? He can't possibly be afraid to go to the bathroom alone and need Qin Xian to accompany him, right?]","Qin Xian was immediately speechless - what nonsense.","Ji Fei: [Oh, I get it, maybe the people inside don't like me and don't want me to participate, so Luo Fei is coming to warn Qin Xian?]","Qin Xian's expression changed slightly, thinking this might be possible. After all, that incident did end very unpleasantly.","\"If you have something to say, just say it,\" Qin Xian said coldly.","Although he didn't know what the matter was, there was nothing to hide from Ji Fei if it concerned him.","But after hearing this, Luo Fei's face almost turned purple.","How the hell was he supposed to bring this up? The last person who tried got wine thrown at them by Ji Fei.","Luo Fei could only force a smile and hint at Qin Xian, \"No... I don't have anything to say... would you just accompany me to the bathroom?\"","Qin Xian: ...","Ji Fei: [Pffft hahaha, I was just joking, how come he's stealing my idea? Though his expression is really weird.]","Ji Fei's eyes sparkled as she pushed Qin Xian, saying, \"Go ahead then, I'll wait here.\"","Luo Fei immediately breathed a sigh of relief, thinking Ji Fei had really changed to become so agreeable.","Qin Xian could only silently turn and follow Luo Fei toward the bathroom.","He really hoped it wasn't actually about accompanying him to the bathroom...","But just after walking a short distance, Luo Fei nervously leaned in close and whispered, \"I need to tell you...\"","[Holy crap!]","An exclamation of shock came through in her thoughts.","Two voices spoke simultaneously.","\"Your ex-girlfriend Yu Zhi is coming tonight.\"","[The first love is back in the country! And she's coming here right away!!!]","Qin Xian froze, looking at Luo Fei in surprise, his eyes darting to Ji Fei in the distance.","Ji Fei was standing there with wide eyes, her pupils trembling, seemingly processing this news.","\"I'm not worried about you, I'm worried about her. It wouldn't be good for them to meet, right?\" Luo Fei said worriedly. \"While she still doesn't know, what do you think we should do?\"","Qin Xian gave him a helpless look - she already knows, and knows more clearly than any of you.","[How could I have forgotten? That email mentioned when she'd be back. I was too busy gossiping...]","Ji Fei's inner thoughts seemed frustrated, while Qin Xian's lips curved slightly upward - finally feeling anxious?","[I almost missed something big! The contract I signed today really was a great deal. When we divorce, I'll have two hundred million, plus the investments Qin Xian helped me with, and a studio. Calculating carefully, I'm about to achieve complete financial freedom!]","Qin Xian's face suddenly darkened.","[God, when such good fortune falls from the sky, at least give some warning! I haven't even had time to freshen up to welcome this blessed moment!]","Qin Xian took a deep breath.","[No, I should appear haggard and anxious. That way, when Qin Xian divorces me for his first love, the whole family will sympathize with me. Besides, I've been behaving well lately, so Qin Xian shouldn't be too cruel. Maybe with a wave of his hand, I'll get even more. Hehe... I must put on an act when I see her.]","Qin Xian: ... Act? Let's see how you act later.","He had originally planned to see if Ji Fei wanted to attend, since the previous Ji Fei really was very wary of Yu Zhi.","But now they must attend.","He wanted Ji Fei to see with her own eyes whether he would divorce her for someone irrelevant.","Want a divorce? Not a chance!","Qin Xian didn't listen to Luo Fei's continued rambling, but strode directly toward Ji Fei.","Seeing Qin Xian's suddenly frozen expression, Luo Fei thought he probably also minded this situation and might be planning to leave with Ji Fei to avoid awkwardness.","But then he saw Qin Xian walk up to Ji Fei, who hadn't yet reacted, and put his arm around her before walking forward.","They were actually heading into the banquet hall.","Luo Fei was surprised - what was going on? Based on what he knew of his friend, there definitely weren't any lingering feelings. When they broke up back then, Qin Xian didn't even show any signs of heartbreak, making Luo Fei wonder if Qin Xian had ever really liked Yu Zhi at all.","But what was happening now?","Why did he feel like Qin Xian was angry?","Ji Fei had been quietly standing there, so it couldn't be anger at her. Was he angry at Yu Zhi? That didn't make sense.","Luo Fei was completely confused, unable to understand, and could only follow along in bewilderment.","Ji Fei was still fantasizing about her beautiful future life. Although... there was a moment when her breath caught, making her feel like she was drowning, she quickly got carried away by her pleasant fantasies again.","Unexpectedly, she was suddenly pulled into an embrace.","Actually, it wasn't really an embrace, just a formal support at the small of her back, like protecting someone while walking forward, but the force was a bit strong, almost making Ji Fei stumble.","\"Let's go,\" Qin Xian said coldly, looking straight ahead.","Ji Fei felt like he seemed a bit unhappy.","[Sure enough! Here it comes, here comes, he's playing his cards!]","Qin Xian ignored Ji Fei's nonsense, knowing that whatever she said right now, he wouldn't want to hear it.","[Hearing that his first love is coming, his emotions are fluctuating! Now he can't wait to rush to see her, and he insists on bringing me along, even maintaining such an intimate posture - isn't it all just for show? Sigh, I've really become a tool.]","Qin Xian's forehead vein was throbbing.","[But, dear future ex-husband, your precious first love hasn't even arrived yet! You're acting too early!]","Qin Xian was so angry his chest hurt, but he could only grit his teeth and endure.","[Breaking up and going abroad, not returning for many years, then coming back for a passionate love story, misunderstandings cleared up, broken mirror made whole again! Although I should technically play the role of the evil original wife as a catalyst, for the sake of the divorce settlement, your humble servant can't take that risk!]","Qin Xian felt like his soul was leaving his body, and his supporting arm unconsciously applied more force. From Luo Fei's perspective, he was completely embracing Ji Fei, looking extremely intimate.","Luo Fei couldn't help but widen his eyes.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei didn't know what was happening, her mind becoming increasingly active, racing at high speed for some reason, completely ignoring their gradually increasing intimacy.","[Wonder how stimulating it will be later, will future ex-husband lose his composure when he sees her... Ouch! Why are you pinching me!]","When the waiter saw them approaching, he immediately opened the doors.","In an instant, all eyes in the restaurant focused on them.","They saw Qin Xian standing at the entrance, one arm tightly holding Ji Fei, the other hand pinching her cheek, the two of them extremely close, looking as intimate as a young couple flirting.","Everyone was stunned, because they had never seen Qin Xian with such animated expressions or such playful behavior.","Never before..."]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: Did They Get Struck by Lightning","paragraphs":["Perhaps because Qin Xian's action was too bewildering, the bustling restaurant suddenly fell so quiet you could hear a pin drop.","Two familiar yet somehow strange figures stood at the entrance.","Today was the class reunion, and out of courtesy, Ji Fei had made an effort to dress up before going out.","She wore a sky-blue dress with a white silk scarf around her neck. Even in such simple attire, her perfect proportions made her look like she was walking on a fashion runway.","Her black, voluminous hair seemed to catch the light, with each strand appearing to reflect a lustrous sheen.","Her lightly made-up face beautifully highlighted her natural features, with ruby lips and pearly white teeth, all flowing in graceful lines.","Her almond-shaped eyes were clear and bright, with distinct black and white contrast. Now widened from being pinched, they appeared rather adorably coquettish.","Her red lips were slightly pursed, showing both surprise and anger at Qin Xian's action.","This was different from their meeting two years ago when Ji Fei's gloomy expression had masked her beauty, making her rather unpleasant to look at.","Now, everyone could finally understand why she could make it as an entertainer - with that face and figure alone, she could certainly succeed in the industry.","At that table, those who didn't hold strong prejudices against Ji Fei made an unbiased comparison.","In terms of appearance, Ji Fei completely surpassed their memory of Yu Zhi.","And... how to put it? Was it because they were standing so close to each other? Why did these two seem even more compatible than he and Yu Zhi had been back then?","Looking at Qin Xian, his eyes were still as bright as black gems, extraordinarily handsome, wearing a perfectly tailored suit that wrapped his perfect figure as if he were a model.","Even knowing he was taken, many female classmates still blushed at the sight of their former campus idol, their eyes showing girlish shyness.","One could say that Qin Xian had been somewhat immature back then, but now, with his added aura of business world decisiveness, his entire charm had reached another level.","Powerful men are always desirable - if such a man were to hold and gaze at you, your knees would probably go weak.","What made the women even more unable to look away was how different Qin Xian appeared now.","During university, although everyone knew the campus idol and beauty were a couple, and had witnessed them together.","But it was completely different from now.","How to describe it...","When Qin Xian stood with Yu Zhi, he was still Qin Xian, his behavior and expressions like a perfect sculpture, unchanging regardless of who stood beside him.","But Qin Xian standing with Ji Fei... he wasn't the flawless, impeccable Qin Xian anymore.","And this version of Qin Xian made the hearts of those who had secretly admired him flutter even more. It was as if a worshipped deity had descended to earth, stirring desires to compete for his attention.","Undeniably, Ji Fei's appearance and their single interaction had planted seeds of doubt in most people's minds.","Everyone had just heard from that table about today's excitement - Yu Zhi was coming too.","Yu Zhi was the one who had plucked the high-hanging flower, becoming Qin Xian's first love and cherished memory.","Moreover, their breakup had come without warning - the campus idol was dumped, and the campus beauty went abroad.","Such a breakup should logically be filled with lingering feelings and regret, like an unfinished movie waiting for its sequel.","Not to mention the constant rumors about problems with Qin Xian's marriage, and how the wedding ceremony still hadn't been held.","So everyone thought that if Yu Zhi came back, willing to apologize and make amends, there would definitely be a chance to rekindle their relationship.","But now... no, no, no, Qin Xian and Yu Zhi had several years of history together, and they matched in appearance... at least in family background and abilities. Ji Fei surely couldn't compare.","Everyone's minds were buzzing.","Ji Fei's mind was buzzing too - what was the meaning of this? Not only did he pinch her, but she felt those long black eyes glaring at her too. As if he had some grudge against her.","\"Why did you pinch me?\"","Seeing that Ji Fei's inner monologue had finally calmed down, Qin Xian's head finally stopped buzzing with anger.","He released his grip, noticed her fair cheek had turned slightly red from his pinch, and his eyes flickered.","Seems he'd used too much force. He couldn't help but softly brush it with his thumb, feeling a twinge of tenderness.","Seeing Ji Fei's disgruntled look at him.","\"...There was something on it,\" Qin Xian made up an excuse.","Ji Fei gave him a suspicious glance.","[Well, I didn't do anything, so he had no reason to suddenly pinch me. He probably wanted to help wipe something off but couldn't control his strength. Thanks a lot - you nearly gave me dimples. Don't you know to be gentler with girls?]","Hearing Ji Fei's sarcastic internal complaints, Qin Xian's mood inexplicably improved.","Just as he was about to loosen his arm, he heard Ji Fei think: [Wait, could this be his moment of weakness? Because he heard news about his ex-girlfriend, he's lost his composure in everything he does, even his strength... Ah!]","Before Ji Fei could continue her wild thoughts, Qin Xian had already tightened his hold on her again and led her toward that table.","Ji Fei felt like she was being pushed onto the stage. She quickly reined in her thoughts, and by the time she'd restored her polite smile, Qin Xian had already brought her before everyone.","\"Sorry we're late,\" Qin Xian said in his deep voice.","Facing these gossip-providers who would surely bring her endless entertainment, Ji Fei was being friendly and accommodating. Just as she was about to greet them, she looked up to find a group of dumbfounded expressions.","Ji Fei: ?","[Were they... struck by lightning? What kind of expressions are these?]","Qin Xian was also puzzled by everyone's reactions and was about to speak.","Luo Fei, who had followed behind them, quickly coughed to remind everyone.","But everyone still hadn't recovered from their shock when a woman in a pink and white knit dress, who had been sitting with her back to them, suddenly stood up and turned to face them.","Her long curled hair was tied to one side below her ear, falling softly on her shoulder. With downcast eyes and a pitiful look that instantly aroused protective instincts.","However, her demeanor was somewhat timid, and her current expression showed anxious vulnerability. One hand held her bag while the other instinctively rested on her stomach.","Without acknowledging the newly arrived Qin Xian and Ji Fei, she immediately spoke to Luo Fei: \"Brother Fei, just now... Qing contacted me, there might be a problem with our work from earlier today. I'm worried about her handling it alone, so I need to go back. I won't be able to stay for the reunion.\"","This sudden situation caught Luo Fei off guard, especially since he had brought her today to formally announce their early wedding plans due to her pregnancy and to invite everyone.","Such news would naturally be better announced by both of them together.","But leaving for sudden work... although Luo Fei respected her, he felt somewhat uncomfortable at this moment.","However, seeing her urgent expression, he couldn't bear to make her unhappy and immediately said, \"Alright, I'll take you there.\"","A flash of joy crossed the woman's face, but she quickly lowered her eyes again, \"No need, it's rare for you to have a class reunion, don't let me interrupt. I can just take a taxi.\"","After saying this, she hurriedly bid goodbye to everyone, nodded apologetically as she passed Qin Xian and Ji Fei, and quickly left.","Although she refused Luo Fei's offer to send her, he still worried and accompanied her out to get a taxi.","Because of this small incident, everyone finally recovered from their earlier shock and gradually began greeting Qin Xian and Ji Fei.","Qin Xian pulled Ji Fei to sit down.","Everyone's eyes never left the two of them, looking at Ji Fei with curious gazes.","Naturally, Ji Fei was also carefully observing this field of melons (gossip) before her."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: A Salary of 500,000 What a... Great Job","paragraphs":["The atmosphere had suddenly become somewhat strange.","The two people with the best personalities took the initiative to break the awkwardness.","\"We've met too few times. Ji Fei, do you not recognize us anymore? Haha, I'm Bai Xiaoxi, do you remember?\"","Bai Xiaoxi, who happened to be sitting right next to Ji Fei, was warm and proactive.","Everyone present was actually four to five years older than Ji Fei, and Bai Xiaoxi spoke with a tone as if talking to a little sister.","But looking at her sweet, youthful appearance, Ji Fei thought she looked even younger than herself.","Bai Xiaoxi was a typical privileged beauty - naive, sweet, and sheltered. She was raised with doting parents, representing someone blessed with both good character and good fortune, naturally likeable.","The last time Ji Fei caused a scene by flipping a table, it had nearly affected Bai Xiaoxi, who was completely frightened. The fact that she could still be so warm now was partly out of respect for Qin Xian, and partly due to genuine curiosity about Ji Fei's dramatic change in personality.","\"I'm her boyfriend, and also your husband's former college roommate, Yu Yue.\" Yu Yue embraced Bai Xiaoxi from behind, grinning with his handsome, sunny face.","Yu Yue appeared as carefree as Bai Xiaoxi, but he had actually lost his mother early in life, and constant replacement stepmothers had made him sensitive inside. Before meeting Bai Xiaoxi, he was actually a gloomy rich kid. It wasn't until he fell in love with Bai Xiaoxi at first sight that he was completely transformed, and they became known as the silly couple.","From college until now, even through periods of long-distance relationship, they remained passionately in love. They were considered a well-matched pair in their social circle, blessed and approved by everyone.","Looking at such a couple really did improve one's mood.","\"Hello, of course I remember you. Your relationship is still as wonderful as ever.\"","[Not bad at all. Apart from Yu Yue's good-for-nothing father wanting to marry another young wife and being forced to come back for the wedding, the young couple had no worries and were even planning to discuss marriage.]","The silly couple loved nothing more than being praised for their relationship, and their fondness for Ji Fei instantly increased.","Bai Xiaoxi's eyes curved into crescents as she smiled: \"Your relationship has improved too.\"","Qin Xian, who had been listening to Ji Fei's inner thoughts, suddenly felt an inexplicable joy when he heard Bai Xiaoxi's comment.","His expression softened almost imperceptibly.","The others at the table, who had thought Bai Xiaoxi was being careless with her words, were stunned by Qin Xian's reaction.","Ji Fei didn't criticize this statement, after all, compared to how the original Ji Fei had interacted with Qin Xian, she was at least trying not to make him hate her. All for the breakup fee!","However, Ji Fei understood that wasn't what Bai Xiaoxi meant.","[Now that she's said this... when Yu Zhi arrives later, won't it be awkward when she realizes? After all, she used to be close with Yu Zhi too. Such a soft and naive little bunny, it'll be quite entertaining to watch her get embarrassed later. Hehe~]","Qin Xian: ...","Looking at the still oblivious Bai Xiaoxi, Qin Xian felt Ji Fei was bullying her, but he had no proof.","Yu Yue remembered that Yu Zhi would be coming later, and to prevent his dear wife from feeling awkward later, he quickly changed the subject, saying to Ji Fei: \"Do you remember the others? Let me introduce them.\"","Ji Fei had already turned to look at the others, as these two didn't have any juicy gossip.","\"No need for introductions, I'll do it myself. Long time no see, I'm Jing Yan.\"","The one who spoke up was a refined, scholarly man wearing glasses. His demeanor was friendly and proper, though his gaze was profound. He was sitting next to Yu Yue, with an empty seat on his other side. He seemed to be the only single person present.","However, after greeting him, Ji Fei immediately turned to the woman sitting diagonally across. That woman had a cool and quiet exterior, sat with elegant posture, and wore uniquely designed jade jewelry that was luxurious without being flashy.","Seeing Ji Fei suddenly look her way, she was startled, not understanding why the attention had suddenly shifted to her.","Back where he sat, Jing Yan's body shifted slightly at this unexpected turn.","\"You remember Cen Ting, ah, I know - is it because you heard she's about to become Jing Yan's cousin-in-law? We'll all be attending their wedding soon,\" Bai Xiaoxi said with a smile.","Qin Xian recalled the information Ji Fei had revealed earlier.","'Someone's object of unrequited love is about to marry their cousin.'","Mentioning the cousin, he immediately thought of how Jing Yan's cousin was getting married, but the bride was clearly their friend Cen Ting.","Although they were all friends in the same circle, there were varying degrees of closeness. According to Qin Xian's memory, Jing Yan and Cen Ting had barely spoken to each other even in college, and after graduation, they never met privately except at their group gatherings.","So even after guessing, Qin Xian couldn't be completely certain.","Until Ji Fei's inner thoughts rang out.","[Holy crap, this is incredible. Jing Yan has been secretly in love with Cen Ting for almost ten years, but in her eyes, they barely know each other. Not only does Cen Ting think this, but everyone in their circle thinks they're not close, just coincidentally connected through this marriage alliance. God, is Jing Yan a ninja turtle or what?]","Qin Xian: So it was true!","Ten years, and not only had he not noticed, but no one else had either?!","Qin Xian couldn't understand why Jing Yan hadn't tried to confess his feelings after secretly loving her for so long.","[Oh, so that's how it is... Is that really the case? My goodness... I'm speechless... Well, let him watch the woman he loves marry someone else then.]","Qin Xian: ... Wait, don't just finish your contemplation without revealing any information! What's the reason?!","Qin Xian rarely felt such urgency to know the gossip.","Jing Yan and Cen Ting both looked strangely at Ji Fei.","Because Ji Fei's gaze on them was rather peculiar.","However, Ji Fei quickly shifted her attention.","Because someone was calling her.","\"Hey, remember me?\" Qi Li raised an eyebrow, his tone not exactly friendly but not confrontational either. He was still somewhat bothered by Ji Fei's previous insults.","Qi Li wanted to see what kind of awkward expression the current Ji Fei would have when facing him.","But Ji Fei just glanced at him briefly before looking at the girl beside him.","That interested, examining look immediately made Qi Li sensitive.","\"What are you looking at!\" Qi Li said.","\"She is...\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","\"She's Han Ziyu.\" Qi Li didn't mention that this was his girlfriend, and nudged Han Ziyu to greet everyone.","The others' expressions became subtle for a moment, only Qin Xian looked over curiously, suddenly understanding who Ji Fei had been criticizing earlier.","Han Ziyu was very young but seemed to have deliberately put on makeup, intentionally styling herself to look a certain way. She looked exactly like one of their classmates.","[Oh, so she's the substitute for that first love. Wow, fifty thousand yuan monthly salary! That's really... quite a nice job! Eh? Hahaha, Qi Li actually thinks that even though she's taking the money, she really likes him! He thinks she's only taking the money to hide her true feelings because they have an agreement that she's not allowed to fall in love with him! Where does he get such confidence from?! Pfft, he doesn't know that the young lady has almost saved enough money and is planning to end their arrangement after getting this month's salary!]"]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Is it true that the sea king has a sea queen to counter him","paragraphs":["\"Hello,\" Han Ziyu greeted, her eyes brightening slightly when looking at Ji Fei, her tone lifting momentarily before suddenly seeming to realize something and immediately composing herself back into a gentle, obedient demeanor.","Han Ziyu had particularly beautiful peach blossom eyes; anyone who made eye contact with her could easily be captivated by them.","And Qi Li's former girlfriend, his \"first love\" Guo Yalan, had exactly the same kind of eyes.","Since Ji Fei had just met Han Ziyu, she began updating her gossip about paying to keep a \"first love\" substitute from Han Ziyu's perspective.","However, there was a small interlude.","[Oh, this college girl is actually my fan, not bad, she has good taste. No wonder she had that excited look when she saw me earlier. If we weren't at work right now, she probably would have rushed over for an autograph and photo.]","Qin Xian: At work...","Qin Xian wanted to hold his head in his hands.","Previously, regarding the gossip about Jing Yan, Qin Xian thought Ji Fei had revealed too little, leaving him confused.","But now, Qin Xian felt he had heard too much. He was embarrassed on behalf of his friend for doing something so foolish.","Hiring a young girl to be Guo Yalan's substitute - could any normal person do such a thing?","Qin Xian really couldn't understand Qi Li's thought process.","But he still remembered the scene when those two broke up...","[Hahaha, turns out the reason his \"first love\" dumped him was quite simple - she felt she couldn't maintain a long-distance relationship, her feelings had faded, and she wanted to try something new with foreign boyfriends. So she announced the breakup publicly, avoiding any reputation for cheating. This sister was decisive, hahaha.]","Qin Xian's mouth twitched. Guo Yalan was indeed free-spirited, and just as she said, she dated several foreign boyfriends afterward. She seemed to be living quite an exciting life abroad. Even someone like him who barely checks social media once a year could see her regularly updated posts whenever he did look.","[I wonder how colorful Qi Li's face was at that time.]","Qin Xian recalled - it was indeed quite multi-colored.","[Even though he was deeply infatuated with Guo Yalan, for the sake of his pride, he could only act tough and declare that if Guo Yalan left, he would never look back, telling her not to regret it. But she really left without looking back, not taking it seriously at all.]","Qin Xian: ...and before leaving, she even blew him a kiss and said: \"Forget about me.\"","[Hohoho, at first Qi Li was still holding up appearances. When Guo Yalan got a boyfriend, he would get a girlfriend too, like he was trying to prove something, to show he didn't care and could live better. Really, did he think Guo Yalan, who left on her own accord, would care?]","Qin Xian: ...Why do I feel a bit sorry for Qi Li...","Actually, he was somewhat surprised. After all, Qi Li used to be quite the playboy, changing girlfriends quickly, with girls always falling head over heels for him. He even went through a philandering phase after breaking up with Guo Yalan. Who would have thought that in the end, Qi Li still couldn't forget Guo Yalan.","[Is this a case of the player finally meeting his match?]","Qin Xian: That might actually be true...","[Until recently when he happened to meet Han Ziyu working part-time, that's when he got the idea of keeping a substitute. He loves Guo Yalan but can't stand her personality, so he has Han Ziyu study Guo Yalan's videos to learn her behavior and speech patterns, but requires her to act gentle and obedient.]","Qin Xian frowned slightly, looking at his friend with disapproval. This behavior was hard to evaluate.","[This guy is really good at self-deception. If he can't reach the highest, he'll just modify one to suit himself?]","Qin Xian silently sighed. Fortunately, this Han Ziyu didn't have other intentions; it was just a mutually beneficial arrangement. Otherwise, it would have been truly harmful.","[Ah! I get it now. In this kind of situation, since he doesn't really see Han Ziyu as his girlfriend but still brought her along, he must be playing mind games. He wants to use this class reunion to get news back to Guo Yalan abroad. Wait, brother, do you really think you can use Han Ziyu to provoke Guo Yalan into coming back and create a drama of two women fighting over one man?]","Qin Xian: Huh?","[How childish can you get? It depends on whether both girls want to play along with your drama. I don't know about Guo Yalan, but Han Ziyu is about to quit anyway, hahaha. This guy... arrogant and overconfident. I really want to see his expression when Han Ziyu quits and Guo Yalan still doesn't come back.]","Ji Fei was frantically consuming this gossip in her mind. She could barely suppress her smile.","Especially when she saw Qi Li's imperious manner, treating Han Ziyu like his possession, she had to try even harder not to laugh.","Qin Xian, sitting next to Ji Fei, could feel her body shaking.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian just wanted to cover his face, embarrassed for Qi Li. His little scheme had been completely seen through by Ji Fei.","After Han Ziyu's greeting, Ji Fei kept looking back and forth between the two, her expression showing barely contained 'excitement'? It made Qi Li's skin crawl.","\"What are you staring at?\" Qi Li found Ji Fei's gaze unsettling.","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"I've never seen such a pretty young lady, just want to look a bit more.\"","When Han Ziyu heard this, being praised by her idol, her eyes immediately lit up. \"Teacher Ji is actually...\"","Before Han Ziyu could finish, Qi Li, clearly displeased with her tone of joy that didn't match her assigned character, immediately raised his hand and pulled her into his embrace with a frown and a glare.","Couldn't this girl see that he disliked Ji Fei? Why was she being so friendly with her!","Han Ziyu stiffened for a moment before quickly playing along, staying docile.","Meanwhile, Qi Li spoke condescendingly, \"Ji Fei, your taste is as terrible as ever. What's so pretty about her? If she hadn't desperately clung to me, acting like she couldn't live without me, I wouldn't have even given her the chance to be my date. Isn't that right...\"","After speaking, Qi Li raised an eyebrow at Han Ziyu in his arms, prompting her to agree.","Han Ziyu nodded shyly and awkwardly, appearing just like a shameless woman chasing after a man.","But internally she couldn't help but think: Endure it, endure it. 500,000 yuan, I'm not myself, I'm now Guo Yalan 2.0. It doesn't matter if the boss is difficult, this is my job, I need to be professional. The orphanage reconstruction fund is almost there.","Qi Li was very satisfied with Han Ziyu's reaction, even thinking that she performed so well because she must have some genuine feelings. He felt that his words might have hurt her heart, but this hurt would also serve as a constant reminder for her not to forget her place.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei could no longer control herself and had to pinch her thigh hard to keep from laughing out loud.","[I must hold it in! Oh, Qi Li, Qi Li, is this what you fantasize about Guo Yalan doing? Desperately clinging to you, unable to live without you, while you look down on her... pfft pfft pfft, the more you act like this, the more it shows... sigh, you've become some kind of pure love warrior in your own way.]"]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Are All Those Crazy People Trying to Annoy Me","paragraphs":["Qin Xian lowered his eyelids, as he truly couldn't bear to watch anymore.","But others didn't notice this. How could they possibly know that Qi Li's love was so humble? They merely thought that among the women who happened to seduce Qi Li, one of them looked very similar to Guo Yalan and was deliberately imitating her to please him. That's why everyone rather disliked Han Ziyu.","Not to mention the recent conversation, which clearly implied that his relationship with Han Ziyu was just casual fun, not worthy of being called girlfriend material.","This naturally made others at the table look down on Han Ziyu's presence, unwilling to waste time on her.","Especially the young man sitting in the middle - he casually leaned against his chair, dressed in high-end custom clothing and auction-grade accessories. His hair was slicked back, revealing handsome features, though his expression carried a hint of rebelliousness. He liked to tilt his head back and look down at people, appearing rather contemptuous.","\"Qi Li, just have fun but don't get too invested. After all, most women are just after money and will do anything for it,\" Luo Zhou sneered, \"Be careful not to fall for their disguise!\"","These words were harsh, but Ji Fei found them even more amusing.","[Hmm... although... but why wouldn't working people be considered doing things for money? I can't argue with that. Well, looking at Han Ziyu's expression, she seems quite accepting, clearly agreeing that Luo Zhou has a point about her!]","Qin Xian, who knew the whole story, felt that 'second-hand embarrassment' was becoming his chronic condition as he listened to these comments.","Luo Zhou spoke directly in front of Han Ziyu, with obvious intent to humiliate, but the one who looked upset wasn't Han Ziyu but Xuan Yi beside him.","Not only did she look upset, but her eyes also seemed to redden instantly. Others who knew some of the background also showed changes in their expressions.","Luo Zhou even glanced at Xuan Yi after speaking.","[Oh my, so it wasn't about Han Ziyu at all! He's actually making indirect accusations here. Indeed, what a messy situation. Well done, Luo Zhou, doesn't he realize this is like cuckolding his own brother?]","Qin Xian almost spat out his water.","Qin Xian was already numb - of all the gossip Ji Fei had mentioned before, only one remained: the ex-girlfriend becoming a sister-in-law while maintaining ambiguous relations - was this about Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi?","Luo Zhou... had dated Xuan Yi?","And they were still entangled?","Qin Xian's memory world was starting to crumble.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei was thoroughly enjoying this drama.","[They had secretly dated for a while, not many people knew about it. Given Luo Zhou's personality, agreeing to keep it secret meant he really cared for Xuan Yi. But Xuan Yi was just uncertain about marrying him, worried about her future reputation, which is why she insisted on keeping it secret.]","[Later, when Xuan Yi's family hit a development bottleneck, she knew that marrying Luo Zhou, who couldn't inherit the Luo family business and could only be a rich playboy, wouldn't give them the ability or qualification to help them climb higher. So Xuan Yi used her connection with Luo Zhou to actively approach Luo Cheng. By the time Luo Zhou found out, both families had already arranged the marriage.]","[When Luo Zhou confronted Xuan Yi, she could only painfully express that although she loved him, she wanted to climb higher and bring more benefits to her family. Since then, Luo Zhou has viewed Xuan Yi as a selfish woman who could sacrifice her own love for money. So he can't help but target her, yet can't help but still care... ahem, I really don't want to watch this uncle-sister-in-law drama.]","Qin Xian: He didn't want to watch it either.","No wonder there was a period when he always looked particularly tormented and often used money to mess with girls who pursued him. Who would have thought this was the reason?","Luo Zhou's elder brother Luo Cheng was a very good business partner of Qin Xian's, and he was certain Luo Cheng still knew nothing about this.","Looking at their current reactions, Qin Xian felt this problem was getting serious. It was obvious they hadn't let go internally - wouldn't this cause trouble?","Suddenly, Qin Xian felt Ji Fei turn to look at him, and while he was wondering why,","He heard Ji Fei sigh in her mind: [They really are brothers in misfortune. Excluding Luo Fei and Yu Yue, the rest of you all... can only watch helplessly as your loved ones drift away from you. Love without reciprocation, unable to forget - you're all considered tall, rich, and handsome, how can your love lives be so unfortunate!]","Qin Xian: ...He was different from these people!","Qin Xian didn't understand why Ji Fei, who loved gossip so much, never spent any time looking into his heart.","Perhaps... his luck in love was truly that bad.","With this sigh, Qin Xian suddenly froze, his expression becoming unnatural, his mind turning to mush, his ears gradually turning red. He instinctively wanted to reach out and hold Ji Fei's hand.","But then he heard Ji Fei's mind exclaim: [What!]","Qin Xian's thoughts were interrupted, and when he came back to his senses, he heard that the table discussion had progressed to talking about Luo Zhou's current girlfriend.","Wait, Luo Zhou has a girlfriend?!","It turned out that although Luo Zhou's earlier words had ulterior motives, they essentially challenged Qi Li. Despite being friends, neither would back down.","Qi Li had indeed spent money, but he didn't want to admit it, so hearing those words made him unhappy. He wanted to argue back, but seeing Luo Zhou's gloomy face, he suddenly realized something. He immediately started stirring up trouble: \"Yeah, yeah, you're experienced in this area, so is that why you're being so careful with your current girlfriend? What's wrong? Didn't bring her today because you haven't figured out her true intentions yet?\"","These words surprised many people present.","Xuan Yi's face stiffened.","This time, Luo Zhou didn't look at Xuan Yi. A flash of discomfort crossed his face before he forced a casual tone: \"I wanted to bring her, but she had work today.\"","Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi, hearing this for the first time, immediately started asking questions.","\"She's from an ordinary family? You're like Luo Fei, looking outside our circle?\" Yu Yue asked in surprise, \"That's strange. Given your personality, Young Master Luo Zhou, I wouldn't expect you to be as accommodating as Luo Fei, letting your girlfriend leave just because she says she has overtime work?\"","\"Why are you talking about me behind my back?\" As these words were spoken, Luo Fei had returned and immediately put Yu Yue in a headlock, making Yu Yue beg for mercy.","Actually, no one at the table really cared about Luo Fei's girlfriend leaving, since she wasn't from their circle anyway. They basically ignored her, not out of contempt, but because they found it difficult to connect with her. They only occasionally acknowledged her out of respect for Luo Fei, as he was the only one with a hero complex who didn't care about social background.","\"We're saying Luo Zhou has become a good man like you,\" Bai Xiaoxi said, shaking with laughter.","\"Huh?\" Luo Fei looked confused.","At this point, Jing Yan directly revealed the truth: \"I bet you haven't told her your real identity yet? Be careful not to play with fire and get burned.\"","\"What? You're dating while hiding your identity?\" Even the usually calm Cen Ting was surprised at this.","Seeing Cen Ting's interest, Jing Yan immediately sold out his friend completely: \"That's right, he's pretending to be poor over there to test her sincerity.\"","Cen Ting frowned: \"That's a bit unethical.\"","Qi Li added salt to the wound: \"What's even more unethical is that our Young Master Luo Zhou has let her support him for two years and still wants to continue? I'd say that girl must be quite naive.\"","Now Luo Zhou's expression was genuinely uncomfortable, but his arrogant nature wouldn't let him lose face.","\"What do you all know? She fell in love with me at first sight, and I saw her sincerity, so I'm just giving her a chance. I have no other requirements for my partner except that they truly love me, regardless of whether they're poor or rich. She's doing well... so, barring any accidents, she'll be my marriage partner. Although I let her support me for two years, I'll give her a life of luxury that her social class could never dream of in the future, which makes up for it.\"","Luo Zhou spoke arrogantly, but his expression was actually serious, which surprised everyone at the table.","\"Really getting married? Do you really like her?\" Bai Xiaoxi asked curiously.","Luo Zhou paused for a moment, then nodded, a fleeting tenderness passing through his eyes.","Xuan Yi lowered her gaze, pressed her lips together, and gripped her phone tightly.","Luo Fei frowned and said, \"This way... you're basically playing with her genuine feelings. If she's really as good as you say, she might not be able to accept the truth calmly. You'd better explain everything soon, apologize properly, and ask for forgiveness. Otherwise...\"","But Luo Zhou suddenly spoke with some urgency: \"That won't happen. You don't know how much she loves me, how she can't live without me.\"","\"Oh, that sounds familiar, Qi Li just said the same thing,\" Jing Yan said with a faint smile.","Qi Li immediately glared back.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian, who had been quietly listening to them, suddenly changed expression, his brows furrowing tightly.","Was this just a coincidence?","Turning her head, she saw Ji Fei's expression had already changed, showing a look of disbelief.","Sure enough, her inner thoughts soon exploded.","[Damn! In this desolate land of Ba Mountain and Chu waters, even this lunatic comes to disgust me?!]","[To think that the kept man Little Tang's been supporting is actually Luo Zhou!!! What kind of poor girl and rich boy love game is this?! Does Luo Zhou know how much Little Tang suffered because of him?! Is there something wrong with his head?]","[Just because Xuan Yi deceived him emotionally, he has to turn around and play with someone else's feelings? If you've got the guts, why don't you go take revenge on the person who deceived you... Xuan Yi, she... wait! What did she do?! She... she... she... Damn! There's going to be major drama today!]","At this moment, in a small private room on the same floor specifically reserved for guests to touch up their makeup, Yu Zhi arrived with her girlfriends.","Inside, two makeup artists were already prepared."]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: In Fact, the Wedding Can Be Held Anytime as Long as Feifei Agrees","paragraphs":["Qin Xian hadn't yet recovered from learning about Luo Zhou's act of pretending to be poor to test someone's sincerity when he heard there was more dramatic news, and it involved Xuan Yi.","What did Ji Fei mean? What had Xuan Yi done?","Wait, wasn't today's chance encounter a bit too coincidental? Could someone have deliberately arranged it?","Just as Qin Xian was thinking this, Ji Fei revealed everything.","[What does she mean, choosing the older brother but still can't let go of the younger one? Does she enjoy it when Luo Zhou's attention is on her and he keeps provoking her? So when she discovered Tang was a threat, she orchestrated all this?!]","Qin Xian's brows were so tightly knitted they could kill a fly. His gaze swept toward Xuan Yi, who wore a gloomy expression, clearly unhappy about Luo Zhou constantly mentioning Tang.","What a mess!","[With this kind of deception, if Luo Zhou confesses voluntarily, there might still be a chance to salvage things. But if Tang discovers on her own that she's been deceived all along, the consequences... unless Tang truly loves money, or as Luo Zhou claims, loves him so much she can't leave him, otherwise it's over.]","Qin Xian was speechless. Sure enough, Xuan Yi had deliberately arranged for Tang to work here, intending for her to discover Luo Zhou's true identity and completely destroy their relationship.","[I can already imagine what kind of drama is about to unfold. Right now, I really wish I could turn into an octopus and slap these two jerks in turns. Why should that poor girl suffer for your love games?]","However, Ji Fei's feelings were quite complicated.","[Better to rip off the bandaid quickly. It's good for Tang to see through this scumbag all at once. Best if she dumps Luo Zhou in public, gives him a few slaps, and if played right, I could even help her demand money from Luo Zhou on the spot. After all, hard-earned money shouldn't go to supporting such a heartless jerk. Love can be lost, but money can't!]","Listening to Ji Fei's calculations, Qin Xian couldn't help but find it amusing. If that's how it would play out, he'd help demand money too - ten times compensation, or even a hundred times if needed.","However, looking at Tang's demeanor, she probably valued feelings more than money.","[Sigh, we can't be sure how Tang will react. If it's mutual consent between them, we can only watch the drama unfold.]","Watching Ji Fei's expressions shift between worried and eager, anxious yet impatient, her changing expressions were quite adorable.","Qin Xian found himself staring unconsciously.","Then he heard Luo Zhou say from across, \"What's with that weird expression?\"","Qin Xian: ...","Ji Fei blinked and pointed at herself, \"You mean me?\"","\"Yeah, do you have some problem with me?\" Luo Zhou was displeased, feeling that Ji Fei had just been looking at him with extreme contempt, as if she wanted to slap him.","She was actually the first woman who had ever really slapped him! If it weren't for Qin Xian's sake, he wouldn't let this grudge go so easily.","Besides, he felt that while others might have opinions about his actions, what right did Ji Fei have to look down on him, given all the trouble she'd caused Qin Xian?","Seeing Luo Zhou's annoyed expression, Ji Fei's eyes suddenly gleamed.","[You brought this on yourself, don't blame me.]","Hearing this tone, Qin Xian immediately sat up straight.","Then Ji Fei said with a sweet smile, \"Oh my, I'm just surprised! So you have a girlfriend? I really thought you two were a couple!\" She pointed at them both.","Luo Zhou's face froze.","Xuan Yi was also stunned.","Those in the know were shocked by Ji Fei's boldness.","Those unaware looked around in confusion, sensing only the weird and awkward atmosphere.","But as long as Ji Fei wasn't embarrassed, it was fine.","\"I was just about to ask Qin Xian why one of you wears a ring and the other doesn't. I almost teased you about having a fight, hahaha!\"","Luo Zhou's face turned green, so angry he forgot to retort. Though they had dated before, saying such things openly now was just embarrassing them, wasn't it?","Xuan Yi recovered and her expression changed dramatically. Suppressing her anger, she pretended to be hurt and said, \"Ji Fei, are you still upset about what happened before, so you're deliberately saying these things?\"","Then she looked awkwardly at Qin Xian and said, \"Look at this, maybe I should apologize to Ji Fei again...\"","[Wow, playing the green tea act?! Impressive, turning the tables on me!]","Qin Xian: Not everyone could turn tables on his wife.","So he seriously said to Ji Fei, \"Our last meeting was rushed, and I never mentioned it to you afterward, so you probably forgot about their relationship.\"","Ji Fei barely contained her delight and quickly put on an innocent face. \"Huh?\"","[Well done, Qin Xian, perfect way to smooth things over! Are you a mind reader? So clever!]","Qin Xian curved his lips slightly and played along, \"She's his sister-in-law.\"","Ji Fei immediately acted enlightened, \"Oh, no wonder I saw you two exchanging glances earlier. So it was just in-law communication! Haha, it's your fault for being too good-looking, made me start shipping you accidentally.\"","What kind of talk was this, suggesting they were making eyes at each other? Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi were completely dumbfounded, not expecting someone to speak so inappropriately.","If you can't speak properly, better not speak at all.","Both were so provoked they almost couldn't breathe, but since they had actually done those things, they felt too guilty to refute.","Others in the know: ... Was this deliberate? Doesn't seem like it, she even complimented their looks... But... why does it feel so passive-aggressive?","Yu Yue seemed to realize something and widened her eyes, but Bai Xiaoxi innocently joked, \"Really? I didn't notice. How can you ship random couples like that, haha!\"","Ji Fei sighed regretfully, \"I'm so sorry, I only remembered how you defended each other last time, so I got confused.\"","Then she looked at Xuan Yi with an affected innocent expression, \"You won't blame me, right? You know how I am, speaking without thinking. I really didn't mean it, let me apologize.\"","Luo Zhou felt like he was choking on blood, unable to either swallow it or spit it out. His expression was stiff and somewhat fierce, but he could only grunt.","He regretted asking this crazy woman anything!","Xuan Yi was already breathing heavily with anger. She sensed Ji Fei was doing this deliberately, but since she felt guilty about the matter herself, and with the other person apologizing first, she had no way to counterattack.","But how could she keep losing to Ji Fei?","Last time she hadn't expected Ji Fei to be so unhinged, directly resorting to violence.","This time...","\"Since it's all a misunderstanding, it's fine. Actually, this is Qin Xian's fault,\" Xuan Yi suddenly said with a smile, in a joking tone.","Qin Xian was startled. \"Mine?\"","Ji Fei slightly narrowed her eyes to look at her.","[Oh? Can't counterattack, so changing to attack strategy? Want to attack my person? Bring it on.]","Although Xuan Yi's actions would let Tang know the truth early, it was at the cost of disregarding Tang's feelings.","Ji Fei equally disliked Xuan Yi for hurting an innocent girl due to her personal desires.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian, who heard Ji Fei's thoughts, suddenly tensed up.","'My person'?","Though he knew she probably meant it casually, likely meaning 'someone on our side.'","Still, a hot surge flowed from his chest, leaving Qin Xian at a loss, his cheeks feeling warm.","\"Yes, if Qin Xian had held a wedding with you, my husband and I would definitely attend to celebrate, then you wouldn't have made this mistake.\"","Qin Xian's face instantly turned cold as he looked at Xuan Yi.","Everyone present exchanged glances at these words.","The next second, Xuan Yi stiffened slightly, then awkwardly pressed her lips together and avoided eye contact, as if realizing she'd said something wrong. \"Just joking, let's talk about something else...\"","[Damn! Still attacking me! Same trick as two years ago! Tch, troublesome, should I react to this situation?]","Xuan Yi naturally felt Qin Xian's grim warning gaze.","With Brother Luo's status being no less than Qin Xian's, Xuan Yi wasn't afraid of him, and besides, she was saying something nice, wasn't she? Just teasing them, hoping they'd have their wedding soon? Whatever Ji Fei might think of it had nothing to do with her.","Even if Ji Fei dodged this one, she wanted to see what kind of interesting reaction Ji Fei would have when Yu Zhi arrived later and she remembered everything.","Deep down, everyone knew the reason there was no wedding ceremony was because Qin Xian never truly accepted this wife. If Ji Fei hadn't appeared, perhaps Qin Xian would have waited for Yu Zhi's return.","Before Ji Fei could think of a way to counter, the main doors opened. The previously lively venue gradually fell silent as all eyes turned toward the entrance.","Under the lights, a woman in an elegant long dress appeared at the doorway. Her features were exquisite, her bearing graceful, and her aura extraordinary.","Everyone recognized her almost instantly - she was the former celebrity of their school, the campus beauty, and also Qin Xian's first love who had left him, Yu Zhi.","Xuan Yi was the first to notice Yu Zhi's arrival, and her eyes immediately lit up - this was truly heaven-sent help.","She saw that Yu Zhi had already spotted them, her gaze fixed steadily on Qin Xian's back.","Just as Xuan Yi was about to rise and speak, with a smirk playing on her lips.","In the sudden silence of the great hall, Qin Xian's deep and resonant voice spread out.","\"Actually, as long as Fei Fei agrees, we can have the wedding ceremony anytime.\""]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: What is she doing Watching a play","paragraphs":["Qin Xian's words struck like thunder from a clear sky, stunning everyone into silence.","Even Ji Fei was dumbfounded, her heart skipping a beat.","Her inner thoughts amplified infinitely.","[Good heavens, has he gone mad? Why would he say such things?!]","Qin Xian curved his lips into a smile.","He just wanted to give this irritating little girl a shock.","[Could it be that Qin Xian is so petty that when someone annoys him, he'll say anything, even nonsense, just to get back at them?]","Qin Xian raised his eyebrows helplessly - it wasn't nonsense at all, but his true feelings.","Back then, it was indeed because Ji Fei was too restless, fraying everyone's nerves, so the wedding kept getting delayed.","And now... he suddenly found himself looking forward to seeing Ji Fei in a wedding dress.","But Ji Fei's mind was still racing frantically. Suddenly, she noticed something wasn't right - why was it so quiet? And why were their tablemates all open-mouthed, their stunned gazes constantly shifting between Qin Xian and something behind them?","Ji Fei didn't even need to turn around.","[Hah! I knew it, I'm just being used as a tool again!]","Qin Xian: ?","[He must have noticed Yu Zhi arriving, that's why he deliberately said such mushy things and called me 'Fei Fei' - just to provoke his first love. These CEO types really are full of schemes.]","Qin Xian felt like coughing blood when he heard this: ...what on earth was she talking about?!","Though... had Yu Zhi really arrived?","[Suddenly I'm so envious of Han Ziyu, at least she got paid to help make an ex jealous. I'm just an ordinary tool, and a free one at that. If Qin Xian doesn't give me extra money after the divorce, he's just a heartless capitalist!]","Qin Xian: Very well, I'm thinking about our wedding, and you're thinking about divorce?","Qin Xian was both amused and annoyed - the longest journey he'd ever traveled was through Ji Fei's convoluted thought processes. How could she imagine things like this?!","[Well, let me see just how much of a perfect goddess this Yu Zhi is.]","Although she'd seen photos, Ji Fei had never met Yu Zhi in person.","Following everyone's gaze, she turned around.","[Oh ho, she really is an elegant beauty. Oh look, is she about to cry? The script is really playing out! He says harsh words, she cries, he acts tough, she pretends not to care, he...]","Qin Xian: Stop with the 'he'!","Qin Xian turned around directly, determined to prove tonight that his breakup with his ex was amicable with no lingering attachments.","When he turned around, his eyes met Yu Zhi's.","Qin Xian was taken aback - it had been so long since he'd seen Yu Zhi that she seemed almost like a stranger.","But her current expression was familiar to him.","When they broke up, Yu Zhi had worn the same expression - face deathly pale, eyes brimming with tears, looking like a willow about to break in the wind.","Qin Xian's thought process had been: she looks quite upset, and if she's insisting on breaking up while feeling this sad, she must be determined. There's no need to ask questions - just wish her well for the future.","Then they broke up and never saw or contacted each other again.","Seeing her again now, Qin Xian suddenly had a revelation.","It wasn't possible to come to a class reunion and suddenly wear such an expression - it must be because of what he just said. Did this mean Yu Zhi still had feelings for him?","Then back then, when she left, that expression... could it have been hoping for him to ask questions and try to keep her?","Qin Xian, who had done nothing and calmly accepted the breakup while offering his blessings, suddenly felt quite awkward.","[That expression, that look, tsk tsk tsk, it really tugs at the heartstrings!]","Qin Xian was exasperated - what are you feeling sympathetic about?","[But... Little Tang's makeup skills are amazing!]","Qin Xian: ?","[This heartbroken, pitiful makeup look - men definitely wouldn't notice it, and even women wouldn't unless they looked carefully. Technical master, Little Tang is absolutely a technical master.]","Qin Xian's gaze instantly became filled with curious scrutiny. As a man, he... well, he really hadn't noticed.","But that didn't prevent Qin Xian's awkward old habit from acting up.","So it was all fake? An act?","When Yu Zhi saw Qin Xian staring at her, she felt triumphant inside, but lowered her eyes pitifully, as if she felt too awkward to take a step forward.","[So it was indeed Xuan Yi who found the makeup artist for Yu Zhi, helping both Yu Zhi and herself?! Killing two birds with one stone, specifically targeting Qin Xian and Luo Zhou!]","Qin Xian: As for Luo Zhou, he didn't know, but he himself definitely wasn't a bird!","Because no one had spoken, the atmosphere remained frozen.","Everyone's eyes were wide open, almost holding their breath, not wanting to miss even the slightest detail.","It was spectacular, absolutely spectacular - at a class reunion, meeting a first love while having a wife by one's side, and having just announced wedding plans. If they didn't keep them in suspense, it would be like riding a roller coaster - what an exciting scene!","Even their tablemates were watching with excitement.","[Unexpected, truly unexpected, I've become the subject of others' gossip, everyone's gazes are practically creating sparks as they dart between the three of us. Although I can't fully experience their joy as spectators, but... I can still somewhat enjoy this drama. I can't wait to see how they'll react next. Hurry up!]","Qin Xian: ...So you really have no sense of self-awareness or responsibility as the legitimate wife?!","This time, he didn't want to indulge Ji Fei's drama-watching.","Qin Xian's gaze was calm and undisturbed - he neither deliberately ignored nor warmly greeted, just nodded slightly as one would to an acquaintance, counting as an acknowledgment.","And he treated not only Yu Zhi this way but also extended the same indifferent treatment to the girl standing behind Yu Zhi, whom everyone had overlooked.","It was then that people noticed there was another person, also their classmate, who used to always be by Yu Zhi's side - Zhu Lingling.","But now Zhu Lingling was glaring at Qin Xian with anger, seemingly very dissatisfied with him.","While Qin Xian's manner was perfectly proper, it was filled with such detachment that all the gossip-hungry onlookers felt let down, as if they'd been built up only to be disappointed.","Is that it? Just that!","Ji Fei, who had been secretly watching Qin Xian, was shocked.","[What kind of reaction is this? It's way too calm! That's your ex-girlfriend, your first love! Is he pretending? Acting? Is he actually experiencing emotional turmoil inside?!]","Qin Xian had given up trying to stop Ji Fei's wild imagination, he could only stick to the principle that the innocent need not defend themselves.","Faced with Qin Xian's reaction, a flash of disappointment crossed Yu Zhi's eyes, but knowing his personality well, she knew he was just naturally indifferent, so she didn't dwell on it too much.","Expecting strong emotional reactions from Qin Xian was impossible, and such a person tends to be nostalgic and protective.","In other words, the longer someone got along harmoniously with him, the more likely they were to receive his care.","Even though Qin Xian was married and took his responsibilities seriously, Yu Zhi still felt she had a chance, after all, she had been the woman who had stayed by Qin Xian's side as a lover for the longest time.","Plus, since she had left before, she believed she must hold a special place in Qin Xian's heart.","Yu Zhi wasn't discouraged - this time she had returned determined to win back her man.","Yu Zhi gave Xuan Yi a look.","Xuan Yi immediately spoke up: \"Yu Zhi, Zhu Lingling, welcome back to the country. We thought you wouldn't make it to the reunion, but you've arrived just in time.\"","Xuan Yi was about to stand up, but then cast an awkward glance at Ji Fei and carefully said, \"We only have empty seats at our table, everyone...\"","\"Come on over, what's the big deal?\" Qi Li spoke up directly: \"We're all old friends. Where else would you sit, with people you don't know well?\"","Luo Zhou also seized the chance to make things uncomfortable, \"Exactly, unless someone here isn't welcoming?\"","Though everyone felt awkward, being called out by Luo Zhou, they quickly shook their heads and put on smiles.","Well, actually everyone wanted Yu Zhi to come over - how could they let such an exciting drama slip away?","But Yu Zhi now acted as if she wanted to avoid any awkwardness, reluctant to go over, instead looking around trying to find other empty seats.","In the end, it was Zhu Lingling who 'forcefully' dragged her over.","\"Just sit here, I'd like to see who dares to chase you away!\" After Zhu Lingling's forceful declaration, she shot a warning look at Ji Fei.","Everyone nervously looked over, afraid that Ji Fei might get upset and cause history to repeat itself.","But Ji Fei's reaction was... completely no reaction!","Yu Zhi's gaze swept over Ji Fei. Having heard many stories from Jin Yue about how stupid, foolish, and impulsive she was, her eyes couldn't hide their disdain. However, when their eyes met, she was stunned.","Because Ji Fei's gaze was completely pure, even containing a hint of amusement, making Yu Zhi feel extremely uncomfortable.","What is she doing? Watching the show?!","But didn't Xuan Yi say that Ji Fei would go crazy at the mere mention of her?","She had thought that once she appeared, just a brief exchange of glances with Qin Xian would be enough to make Ji Fei throw a hysterical fit and cause a scene at the venue.","This would make herself appear more innocent, while proving Ji Fei was unworthy of Qin Xian.","But Ji Fei's current reaction left Yu Zhi disappointed.","However, she still had an ace up her sleeve - that presumptuous email would surely bring Ji Fei down completely.","Perhaps she wouldn't even need to rack her brains; one move would be enough to deal with this fool."]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: Even a high-quality man like Qin Xian has a day when he becomes a backup.","paragraphs":["After Yu Zhi and Zhu Lingling sat down, everyone at the table expected the atmosphere to be tense, their hearts both anxious and excited, ready for the storm that was about to break.","People at other tables were probably straining their ears to eavesdrop.","However, to everyone's surprise, not only Qin Xian but also Ji Fei's reactions were completely unexpected.","It was as if the person who arrived wasn't Qin Xian's ex-girlfriend at all, but rather someone completely irrelevant.","Yet everyone felt this was the calm before the storm.","No one at the table took the initiative to speak, making the atmosphere somewhat oppressive.","Some were waiting eagerly for drama to unfold, almost hoping for more awkwardness, while others were genuinely uncomfortable, unsure whether to continue the previous discussion about the wedding or inquire about Yu Zhi's recent return from abroad. Every topic seemed like walking on eggshells.","Fortunately, it was time for the food to be served, and the busy movements of the wait staff interrupted everything.","After all the dishes were served, Luo Fei seized the opportunity to discuss the delicious food with Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi, trying to ease the tension and change the subject.","Luo Fei now somewhat sided with Ji Fei and didn't want her to feel uncomfortable. Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi, who had gotten along well with Ji Fei earlier, played along.","Soon, Cen Ting and Jing Yan joined the conversation. They brought up how Yu Yue once made an entire feast of Bai Xiaoxi's favorite dishes after making her angry, even hiring eight chefs for guidance.","Yu Yue said with a grin, \"A man's best dowry is knowing when to apologize and how to cook. None of you can compare to how well I treat my wife.\"","Hearing this, Qin Xian looked up at Yu Yue, his eyes showing a hint of curiosity.","Really? Is that what it means to cherish one's wife?","Glancing around, he noticed Ji Fei lost in thought, mechanically sipping her soup, even ignoring her favorite crab legs as they passed by.","She was clearly absorbed in secretly observing the drama, so much that she'd forgotten everything else.","Qin Xian felt somewhat helpless and took a portion for her, a gesture that surprised everyone present.","Everyone knew that Qin Xian had a mild allergy to seafood and rarely touched it, so why now...?","The next moment, everyone was even more shocked to see Qin Xian put on gloves, take up the tools, and carefully extract the crab meat piece by piece, placing it in Ji Fei's bowl, even preparing the accompanying sauce.","These actions were performed slowly and elegantly, as if taking care of the person beside him was something entirely natural.","Yu Zhi, who had been secretly watching the situation, almost teared up at this sight.","How could Qin Xian take such good care of another woman, especially right in front of her?","Zhu Lingling, being a fan of the Qin Xian and Yu Zhi pairing, watched with wide eyes and immediately whispered in Yu Zhi's ear, \"He must be doing this deliberately for you to see!\"","Yu Zhi's eyes flickered. Deliberately?","Yes, it must be deliberate. After all, everyone knew that Ji Fei had schemed to marry Qin Xian - how could he genuinely care for a woman who had manipulated him?","The others, however, were puzzled.","Was he putting on a show? That wasn't like Qin Xian's personality.","Genuinely caring for his wife... that seemed even more incredible... though since their arrival, many unbelievable things had already happened.","Ji Fei had no idea that Qin Xian's casual gesture had stirred up such emotions around the table.","She was too busy gossiping in her mind. She hadn't even noticed Qin Xian preparing the crab meat for her, eating it automatically.","Her attention was still fixed on the juicy gossip she'd just discovered.","After seeing Yu Zhi, what Ji Fei was most curious about was why Yu Zhi had dumped Qin Xian in the first place. After all, Yu Zhi now always appeared to have unexpressed feelings, making people wonder if there was some hidden hardship.","Qin Xian wasn't curious at all, feeling that exploring the past was meaningless.","But because Ji Fei was so nosy, Qin Xian had to listen even if he wasn't interested.","[What? What? What? What? Did I read that wrong?]","Qin Xian's initial lack of curiosity was forcibly transformed into interest by Ji Fei's progressively higher-pitched \"whats.\"","[I thought it would be some tragic story - I had already thought of three possible reasons: cancer, car accident, or amnesia. But you're telling me it's similar to Xuan Yi's reason - just climbing the social ladder, abandoning love for status. To think that even a high-quality man like Qin Xian could be someone's backup plan!]","Qin Xian: ????!","[So, she failed to marry into old money nobility abroad, tried for years but they still looked down on her. Seeing Qin Xian becoming more and more successful, she finally couldn't resist and discussed with her family before deciding to return home to pursue Qin Xian.]","Qin Xian's expression was subtle. So that's how it was. Such things weren't uncommon in their circles. Although he had been someone's backup plan, Qin Xian felt no emotional fluctuation - that was someone else's thinking, it had nothing to do with him really.","Not only did he feel no emotional fluctuation, he even thought this gossip was quite interesting.","It served Ji Fei right for always thinking they would get back together, even when he said there was nothing between him and Yu Zhi anymore. Ji Fei never believed it and would always imagine he was just saying the opposite of what he felt.","Now that she knew Yu Zhi's intentions were never pure, would Ji Fei finally give up those ridiculous thoughts?","[How could she do this! Damn! That's too much!]","The sudden angry tone made Qin Xian pause, then slowly smile.","He wasn't angry, but Ji Fei was this angry - was she concerned about him?","[How are we supposed to get divorced now with this situation!]","Qin Xian: ...","[I thought I was helping true lovers get together, but now I can't just watch Qin Xian jump into a fire pit. But if he doesn't jump, then my divorce seems far away.]","Qin Xian: ...","[I've been single for so long, and I'm waiting to get my share of the money to find a young hottie with an eight-pack! Yu Zhi, you fool, why couldn't you just purely love him! You should have fought for love! You're making this really difficult for me!]","Qin Xian: ...","While everyone was chatting casually and watching Qin Xian's novel behavior of taking care of his wife,","Suddenly, they saw Qin Xian's face darken as he put down the half-peeled crab claw and removed his gloves.","Then he started eating his own food, as if sulking.","This... was it really because of Yu Zhi? After all, Ji Fei had been quietly eating, and they had just asked about how Yu Zhi had been doing abroad all these years.","Yu Zhi answered vaguely, \"Pretty well.\"","Seeing Qin Xian's reaction after her response, Yu Zhi felt secretly pleased - clearly, Qin Xian cared about her.","Then seeing Ji Fei look up at her with obvious disapproval, she could barely contain her satisfaction.","\"How could it be good when you spent so long in a nursing home? We're all old friends here, Yu Zhi, don't hide it. Some people shouldn't keep criticizing you about the past!\" Zhu Lingling immediately retorted.","\"Lingling, don't...\" Yu Zhi appeared anxious to stop Zhu Lingling.","But Zhu Lingling burst out like a firecracker, \"All these years, Yu Zhi never let me tell anyone, but today I can't hold it in anymore - I have to say it. Back then, Yu Zhi left because she had a serious illness. She didn't know what the future held, and because she didn't want to be a burden to others, she secretly went abroad for treatment.\""]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: Wow, that's so classic...","paragraphs":["After discovering the truth, Ji Fei felt deeply depressed.","Ji Fei couldn't initiate a divorce herself; only Qin Xian could propose it. But given his responsible nature, even without love, he wouldn't suggest it.","The only hope was to wait for Qin Xian and Yu Zhi to reconcile, which would give her back her freedom.","She had thought that Yu Zhi's return would mark the beginning of a new chapter in her life, but things weren't turning out that way at all.","Yu Zhi wasn't a good person.","Ji Fei certainly couldn't matchmake someone like that with Qin Xian. After all, Qin Xian and his family had treated her very well, and she couldn't do something so heartless.","She could only swallow her frustration.","So when everyone was shocked by Zhu Lingling's words, Qin Xian was still brooding in his own world, while Ji Fei's gaze toward Yu Zhi grew increasingly resentful.","Yu Zhi was secretly amused, knowing that once this reason was revealed, Ji Fei, the illegitimate Mrs. Qin, would tremble in fear.","Yu Zhi kept her head down, her expression awkward and embarrassed, as if indicating she had never intended to gain sympathy and didn't want others to know about her past hardships.","\"What exactly happened?\"","\"Illness? What illness?\"","\"Have you been recovering all these years? No wonder we hadn't heard from you.\"","\"How are you now? Have you recovered?\"","\"Why didn't you explain clearly back then?\"","These were old friends after all. When Yu Zhi left years ago, her distressed manner had convinced everyone she must have had her reasons. But she wouldn't tell anyone, leaving them only to worry, and eventually watch her leave and lose contact. Now, hearing the truth suddenly, even Xuan Yi was surprised.","Perhaps because no one expected someone from a wealthy family like Yu Zhi to tell such a lie, everyone immediately believed it without question.","Ji Fei almost laughed in anger.","[If only you really had been seriously ill! Going to the nursing home was just to help care for that family's elders, trying to gain their favor. Zhu Lingling is such a fool, believing everything you say and even defending you. Oh, I get it, you're putting on a show for Qin Xian, wanting him to regret and feel sorry for you? Keep acting, no one can outact you!]","[When you left back then, you put on that act in front of everyone just to leave yourself a way back. And that nursing home exclusively serves the nobility, so they would never leak anyone's information. Your lies will never be exposed. How brilliantly calculated!]","If this drama hadn't destroyed Ji Fei's hopes, she would have enjoyed it thoroughly and applauded. But now she just wanted to criticize harshly!","Ji Fei looked at everyone's reactions, completely fooled, and felt exasperated.","Suddenly she froze, stealing a glance at Qin Xian, seeing him eating with a stern face, showing no intention of joining the group chat, his thoughts unknown.","[Ex-girlfriend forced to break up and leave because of illness, not wanting to burden boyfriend with worry, now returns healthy only to find him married, leaving them both speechless... hmm... if he didn't know the truth, Qin Xian would definitely be fooled!]","Qin Xian paused his eating, his eyes brightening. Finally, she was showing concern for him!","Perhaps Ji Fei would do something for him, to prevent him from being deceived.","Just thinking about this possibility made Qin Xian's heart race.","[Then because I'm soft-hearted, I'd want to warn Qin Xian that Yu Zhi isn't a good person, but since all the information comes from the system, I can't explain it clearly. In the end, I'd be suspected of trying to drive them apart. After all, Yu Zhi has already established her role as the sympathetic female lead. They'll end up with a happy ending together, while I'll be left as collateral damage, probably won't even get breakup compensation, despised by everyone. Damn, this is too cliché...]","Qin Xian: ???? How could you possibly think this way!!!!","[Sorry, better you than me. At most, I won't help evil prevail. If you make the mistake of loving wrongly, it's your own fault, showing it's your destined tribulation. I can't save you; I'm just here to watch the drama unfold.]","Qin Xian: You are my biggest tribulation!","Ji Fei felt she had finally worked through this mental loop, and could only wait to see how things developed to protect herself.","But Qin Xian was nearly losing his composure from her wild imagination. If he wasn't uncertain whether publicly revealing his mind-reading ability would cause Ji Fei harm beyond human control, he really wanted to straighten out her confused thoughts directly.","Perhaps sensing the change in atmosphere, everyone fell silent, as if a chilling aura was emanating from Qin Xian's direction.","This was truly strange.","After all, having known him for years, Qin Xian's emotions had always been relatively stable. His slow-to-warm emotional nature meant he rarely got angry at people or events. Yet tonight, even they could see his emotional fluctuations...","It must be because he learned the truth about why Yu Zhi broke up with him that his emotions were so volatile.","Several people cast sympathetic glances at Ji Fei. If Yu Zhi had truly been forced to leave back then, and Qin Xian could still be so affected by her, could their marriage even continue?","Just as they were thinking this, they saw Qin Xian suddenly turn to look at Ji Fei with a somewhat dejected expression.","Does she really not care about me?","While in others' eyes: It's over, just as they predicted. Qin Xian must be feeling sorry for Ji Fei now. Is he planning to give up on Ji Fei? Making such a quick decision?","Yu Zhi thought the same, so she felt excited inside.","Ji Fei also noticed Qin Xian looking at her and turned to meet his gaze, encountering a pair of dark eyes that seemed like black whirlpools, as if they would draw in all her attention, making her heart skip a beat.","Ji Fei inexplicably felt guilty under his gaze.","\"What... what is it?\"","Qin Xian wasn't a weak person, so he quickly composed himself. \"There's something on your mouth corner.\"","As he spoke, he took a napkin and wiped the sauce from the corner of her mouth. The gesture was intimate, his attention completely focused. It was as if they were in a different space from everyone else, just the two of them interacting.","Ji Fei was stunned.","Not just Ji Fei, everyone at the table was confused by Qin Xian's action.","Previously, if Qin Xian had done this, everyone would have guessed he was deliberately doing it for Yu Zhi to see.","But at this moment, it made no sense at all.","So... was he genuinely taking care of his wife?","But that wasn't right either. Even strangers would show some concern after hearing such news, let alone an ex-girlfriend!","How could the person involved react this way!","[What is he doing? After hearing such important information, even if he's not filled with regret, shouldn't he at least feel sad? At the very least, be suspicious! Why is he concerned about my mouth! I really don't understand!]","Qin Xian's eyes flickered, hoping Ji Fei would peek into his mind while trying to understand.","Since she didn't believe what he said.","The best solution was for Ji Fei to see his heart.","Ji Fei usually didn't peek into the minds of familiar people around her, only observing surface drama.","But this time she was truly too curious and wanted to investigate.","[Could it be... he was lost in thought and didn't hear? Let me see... Huh?]"]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Uh... Then I Wish You a Speedy Recovery","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's sigh made Qin Xian's heart skip a beat.","[Strange... this is too strange!]","Qin Xian was startled - what was strange? Was it strange that he didn't like Yu Zhi? Or were his current feelings for Ji Fei strange?","His restless heart settled a bit as he reflected. He knew he had always been slow when it came to matters of the heart, sometimes not even realizing when people around him had feelings for him. Only when someone pursued him openly and passionately, like Yu Zhi and Ji Fei had done in the past, would he notice their affection.","Conversely, he was equally slow to recognize his own feelings towards others.","Only recently had he realized that his college romance had been nothing but a passing cloud - he had never truly had feelings for Yu Zhi. Back then, he simply didn't understand or care, just going with the flow. But now... someone had made him understand.","Because Ji Fei had invaded his mental world in an odd way, making him think of her unconsciously, causing his emotions to fluctuate because of her - anger, happiness, worry, disappointment... Previously everything had been calm, but now his feelings were constantly rising and falling.","Though he didn't like this feeling of losing control, he couldn't help being drawn to her. Even with his emotional obtuseness, rational analysis led him to the answer.","He had developed feelings for Ji Fei.","But to what extent, he couldn't tell, nor did he feel the need to analyze it. Because his heart only moved for Ji Fei, and she was the only one he had a legal marriage with. Everything made sense, so he had developed a personal desire - previously he didn't want an irresponsible divorce out of respect for marriage, but now... he simply didn't want a divorce at all.","The usually calm, self-possessed, clear-headed, and logical President Qin once again found himself overthinking and his thoughts scattered because of Ji Fei.","Like a teenager, inexperienced and confused.","If true feelings for someone marked a first love, then Ji Fei was his real first love.","As Qin Xian pondered this, he became somewhat nervous.","Because he suddenly remembered what Ji Fei had said before, about how late-blooming affection was worth less than grass.","Could it be that upon suddenly seeing his feelings and remembering his past coldness, that's why she repeatedly said it was strange?","But there was nothing he could do about it. With the previous Ji Fei, he truly only felt responsibility. If it weren't the same person, he would have thought they were two different people. He only felt drawn to the current Ji Fei.","As Qin Xian was reminiscing, he suddenly froze as a memory flashed through his mind - a little girl, brightly smiling at him, asking: \"Second Brother Qin, why are you so quiet? Can't you talk? Then I'll talk more, and you'll learn to talk after listening enough. Let me tell you some gossip, at my home...\"","\"Second Brother Qin, you're so handsome. In the future, I'm going to earn lots and lots of money and keep you as my sugar baby!\"","\"Second Brother Qin, you're so skinny, eat more, I like six-pack abs...\"","\"Mua, haha, I got Second Brother Qin's first kiss!\"","Qin Xian was stunned. Was that... Ji Fei when she was little?","Because their families had a good relationship, even though they didn't live in the same city, they often met up, so it was normal that they had met as children. However, since he didn't usually live with the current Qin family at that time, his memories were limited compared to his other siblings. Had they played together as children?","His memories were fuzzy, and then he heard Ji Fei arguing with the system in his mind.","[Why is it pixelated?! Why! I could clearly see his secrets before, like how he's still a virgin! Why is everything pixelated now?!]","Qin Xian nearly choked.","But he couldn't dwell on being exposed like this. Just as he thought his suffering was about to end, hearing these words left him completely confused.","What was going on? Couldn't see? Pixelated?","[System, you must be broken. Weren't you supposed to be able to check personal gossip except for predicting the future? Request for upgrade and repair! Not broken? Then why... why can't I access information about directly related people? What do you mean by directly related people? People who will directly affect my life? What does that mean? I don't understand! Is it because we're not divorced? Is he my primary person of responsibility?! That doesn't make sense, we weren't divorced before either!]","Qin Xian: ?","[What does 'directly related person' mean? Someone who will directly affect my life? What's that about? I don't understand! Could it be because we're not divorced! He's my primary responsibility?! That doesn't make sense, we weren't divorced before either!]","Although Ji Fei wasn't obsessed with invading privacy, she really couldn't understand. Her last failed query was because the information might have too great an impact on the world and was restricted. But now there was a restriction specifically targeting Qin Xian.","No matter how much she argued with the system, it was useless - she just couldn't access the information.","Qin Xian wondered if perhaps... he was acknowledged by the system as someone she had feelings for, and to allow their relationship to develop healthily, it wouldn't let Ji Fei peek into his heart?","This was just Qin Xian's wild speculation, after all, it was an unpredictable power.","Moreover, there was something else Qin Xian found strange - Ji Fei seemed to never be able to know about their ability to read minds. Could this also be related to how it would affect her life?","Indeed, this matter still couldn't be revealed to Ji Fei.","Actually, Qin Xian also wanted to get to know Ji Fei better on equal terms; he never wanted to retain this power to peek into her heart.","But things had come to this point, and he could only wait and see. Although Qin Xian was very frustrated now that his innocence still hadn't been proven.","However, it didn't matter if she couldn't see.","Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei, his lips curving into a smile, his gaze becoming softer.","It seemed that every time he sorted through and analyzed his feelings, he became more aware of how special Ji Fei was to him.","He could work hard to prove it - prove that he wanted to continue forward with Ji Fei.","He just hoped that after today, when he explained things to Ji Fei again, she wouldn't think of him as a 'hypocritical CEO' anymore.","While Qin Xian was completely out of touch with the situation, Ji Fei was also freaking out in her own little world.","But everyone else in the room was about to pop their eyes out.","Because as they watched, they saw that Qin Xian wasn't simply wiping Ji Fei's mouth corner, but as he wiped, his fingertip gently touched Ji Fei's full, cherry-red lips.","This counted as flirting, right?!","This kind of gesture wasn't unfamiliar to Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue - they were exactly that kind of lovey-dovey couple. Yu Yue also liked to brush Bai Xiaoxi's lips with his fingers, it was a gesture full of tenderness.","The others also thought of the silly couple Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue, so they were all dumbfounded.","Was this real, or... deliberate?","At this point, the sympathetic gazes that had been directed at Ji Fei finally couldn't withstand the reality of the scene, and secretly turned toward Yu Zhi, because it was really hard to say this was intentional.","Yu Zhi's face had turned pale, because only she knew that even though they had publicly portrayed their love as sweet, Qin Xian had never made such a gesture toward her.","She panicked, shaken deeply for the first time.","\"Qin Xian!\" Zhu Lingling exploded.","Both Ji Fei and Qin Xian were startled.","However, because Ji Fei was too concerned about the system's bug, she hadn't noticed the fingertip lingering on her lips when she turned her head at the shout.","But Qin Xian noticed at the moment he was startled awake, and suddenly felt as if his fingertip had been scalded, leaving him at a loss.","It seemed that when he recalled that \"Mua, haha, I got Second Brother Qin's first kiss!\" his hand had unconsciously reached out to touch.","Actually, a child's kiss wasn't anything special, he had even forgotten that scene, only the echo had crept into his mind when he recalled it, making him unconsciously want to find that lingering sensation from back then.","But he couldn't remember anything.","Because he felt so uncomfortable, he didn't immediately acknowledge Zhu Lingling after being startled awake.","Seeing Qin Xian still looking at Ji Fei, Zhu Lingling nearly fainted from anger.","However, Qin Xian did politely turn to look at her.","\"What?\" But his expression still showed that infuriating 'complete confusion'.","Zhu Lingling's sharp intake of breath was very obvious as she glared at them fiercely, suppressing her anger as she questioned.","\"Everyone is so concerned about Yu Zhi, how can you have no reaction at all? Don't you have a heart? Even if you're still hung up on past events, now that you know the truth, shouldn't you understand Yu Zhi had no choice? Don't you have anything to say to Yu Zhi?\"","Yu Zhi made a show of desperately pulling at Zhu Lingling, as if she didn't want her to trouble Qin Xian, while carefully glancing at Ji Fei, appearing truly afraid of angering Ji Fei and destroying their harmonious relationship.","\"Stop it, Zhu Lingling! It's all in the past, really, stop it!\"","\"Say something, Qin Xian!\" But Zhu Lingling wouldn't let it go.","Seeing that she couldn't stop Zhu Lingling, Yu Zhi looked at Qin Xian with tears welling up in her eyes. The scene was so moving that the people sitting at the same table couldn't help but feel sympathetic, and some even gave Qin Xian disapproving looks.","Qin Xian maintained a calm expression and, after a moment's thought, said, \"Uh... well, get well soon.\""]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Is it a distortion of human nature, or a moral decay, what on earth is he talking about","paragraphs":["Silence. An eerie silence.","[Is it a distortion of human nature, or a collapse of morality? What on earth is he talking about?!]","Qin Xian was dumbfounded, insisting on his innocence.","Wasn't this just normal courtesy?","Since Yu Zhi wanted to lie about being seriously ill, he simply acknowledged her illness and wished her recovery - perfectly reasonable, right?","But his logical response had stunned everyone into silence.","Even Zhu Lingling, who had been aggressively questioning him, was left speechless and dazed.","As for Yu Zhi, whether from genuine distress or forgetting to maintain her carefully crafted image of misty-eyed beauty in her confusion, tears began falling directly down her face.","When everyone finally came to their senses, several people around her scrambled to comfort the crying Yu Zhi.","Yu Zhi also snapped back to reality, quickly putting on a brave face and explaining, \"I'm fine, it's just... some chili pepper got into my eye.\"","Though her mind was still in a daze, years of acting experience instinctively led her to choose the most sympathy-inducing response.","Sure enough, her behavior made everyone even more critical of Qin Xian.","Some wanted to speak up, but reason told them that Qin Xian's response was actually impeccable - how could they lecture him? Should they say he shouldn't have offered well-wishes?","Meanwhile, Qin Xian acted as if nothing had happened, having said what needed to be said, as though simply completing a task.","Noticing Ji Fei's empty bowl, he picked up a crab leg and continued peeling crab meat for his wife.","This time, Ji Fei saw Qin Xian's actions and felt completely uncomfortable.","It wasn't that she found his attentiveness inappropriate - he had done this before when they dined together, and she had simply attributed it to his sense of responsibility as a husband.","But doing this right now was completely unreasonable!","[Could it be... hatred born from love! Is he angry that she left without explaining the truth back then?!]","Qin Xian's movements froze.","Here we go again?!","This time he didn't put down the crab leg, after all, Ji Fei's bowl was empty.","He could only continue peeling while suppressing his frustration.","[No, wait... he seems genuinely indifferent, almost like he wants to avoid the situation. Could it be... my guess was wrong? Was he telling the truth before? Did he really move on after their breakup?]","Qin Xian paused again, his anger dissipating as a smile played at the corners of his mouth.","Sure enough, as long as he stayed true to himself and acted with integrity, the truth would eventually come to light.","Qin Xian poured Ji Fei some ginger tea, whispering like lovers do, \"Stop eating after this bowl.\"","Ji Fei responded with a dazed \"mm-hmm.\"","Though quiet, everyone at the table could hear them.","Witnessing his completely different attitudes, people still couldn't figure out whether this was deliberate or if there was some mystifying truth to it all.","Unable to make sense of it, they could only awkwardly curl their toes in discomfort.","Meanwhile, Yu Zhi was choking back sobs, though trying to keep them quiet, making everyone at the table even more uncomfortable, not to mention the stares from other directions.","Even Ji Fei couldn't take it anymore and leaned closer to Qin Xian.","When Qin Xian felt Ji Fei moving closer, his body instinctively leaned toward her without thinking, their heads almost bumping together before Ji Fei managed to stop.","She whispered even more quietly: \"She's... crying, you...\"","Ji Fei naturally wasn't suggesting that Qin Xian should comfort Yu Zhi, as they already knew Yu Zhi wasn't a good person, and her current performance was 90% acting.","Ji Fei just couldn't read Qin Xian's true feelings, and she felt like she was stumbling blindly through this drama like a confused animal in a melon field.","She desperately wanted to ask WHY! Why are you reacting this way?!","But Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei seriously and said, \"She's not crying.\"","[Are you blind?! When did that happen?!]","Qin Xian: ...","The commotion at the table quieted down.","Qin Xian raised an eyebrow, \"Wasn't it just chili pepper getting in her eye that caused the irritation?\"","The silence at the table grew even more bizarre.","Even the sobbing stopped.","Ji Fei suddenly felt a laugh bubbling up, almost bursting out.","[Hahahahaha, what is he even saying?! Hahahahaha, though I don't know why he's saying this, why is it so funny?! Everyone else is reading between the lines, but he's just taking everything literally?!]","Hearing Ji Fei's wild laughter in her mind, Qin Xian also smiled.","Well, that's what she said herself.","If previously Qin Xian had maintained some friendship with his ex-girlfriend Yu Zhi despite their love being a misunderstanding, after learning about her various lies and her intention to break up his marriage with Ji Fei, he now felt nothing but disgust toward her.","\"Qin Xian, you...\" Zhu Lingling seemed to have finally found her voice again. \"How could you be so cruel!\"","Qin Xian looked at her in confusion, his cold gaze making Zhu Lingling's words catch in her throat. Her eyes even reddened.","[This Zhu Lingling, is she really just protecting her friend? She... ah! So that's it, I see now!]","Qin Xian was startled, becoming curious.","He had always thought Zhu Lingling was rather brainless. Although others at the table might have once hoped for him and Yu Zhi to be together, they had never mentioned such things after his marriage, at most just thinking about it.","The reason was simple - breaking up someone's marriage and supporting a third party was wrong, so how could anyone openly do such things?","So Qin Xian was really curious about what was going on in Zhu Lingling's head.","[So she's been secretly in love with Qin Xian all along!]","Qin Xian: ... Well, he wasn't that curious anymore.","[So, she's both a fangirl of Qin Xian and a shipper of him with Yu Zhi? In other words, besides Yu Zhi, she won't accept anyone else being with Qin Xian. Tsk tsk, that's an illness that needs treatment.]","Qin Xian: Yes, she's sick.","[Oh, Yu Zhi knew about her feelings, so she's just using her as a tool?]","Qin Xian: ... Even more disgusted now.","But others certainly didn't know this, they just thought Zhu Lingling was standing up for Yu Zhi. They also felt that given their past relationship, Qin Xian's current reaction was really hard to accept...","\"Zhu Lingling, stop,\" Yu Zhi waited a while for Zhu Lingling to speak up for her, but finally had to step in herself. Then, with a tearful smile, she said, \"It really was the chili pepper that made me cry. Oh, and Qin Xian, thank you for your well wishes. I have recovered, though the treatment process was difficult, but there was always one belief supporting me... I've said too much. I'm fine, I'm really fine.\"","Her trembling voice made listeners' hearts ache.","Then Yu Zhi turned to Ji Fei and said, \"Seeing how happy you both are now, I can rest easy. I wish you happiness.\"","At this, Zhu Lingling finally remembered her mission.","\"What happiness? Qin Xian, do you even know what your wife has been doing behind your back?\"","Ji Fei, who had been watching Yu Zhi's performance, was startled.","[What did I do?]","Qin Xian, ignoring Yu Zhi's act, also looked at Zhu Lingling in confusion.","Zhu Lingling took out her phone and began denouncing Ji Fei's actions to everyone at the table.","\"Yu Zhi once sent you messages, wanting to meet in person to clear up the misunderstandings from back then, but look at what your wife did - not only did she read your emails secretly, she also warned Yu Zhi off while pretending to be you...\""]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: Isn't This an Opportunity","paragraphs":["\"Yu Zhi had no other intentions; she just wanted to explain everything clearly and resolve your misunderstanding,\" Zhu Lingling said emotionally.","Everyone looked at the phone.","It was Yu Zhi's email inbox.","An email replied from Qin Xian's email address: \"This is Ji Fei, Mrs. Qin. My husband asked me to handle this email. Miss Yu, I don't want you meeting with my husband anymore. Please stop contacting him.\"","Everyone's eyes widened in shock, not because there was anything wrong with Mrs. Qin Ji Fei responding this way.","As a wife, being cautious about her husband's ex was understandable.","But this was Qin Xian's personal email account - how could someone who valued privacy and boundaries so much allow others to use his email?","After all, Ji Fei and Qin Xian weren't the type of couple who trusted each other completely.","Without much thought, it was obvious that Ji Fei must have accidentally seen this email and handled it secretly to deal with her rival, without Qin Xian knowing.","Everyone turned to look at Ji Fei.","They saw that Ji Fei had already stood up, leaning forward, staring intently at Zhu Lingling's phone.","Everyone felt embarrassed for Ji Fei, guessing she hadn't expected her little scheme to be exposed publicly by Zhu Lingling - and right in front of Qin Xian!","Looking at Qin Xian, his expression had frozen.","Indeed! Qin Xian hadn't known that Yu Zhi had tried to contact him!","Seeing Ji Fei's reaction, Zhu Lingling said to Qin Xian: \"Is your cold and heartless attitude toward Yu Zhi because she made up something that caused you to misunderstand, just like this hidden email? If you really have any grievances against Yu Zhi, have the courage to say it openly, and we can confront each other face to face!\"","Zhu Lingling couldn't believe Qin Xian would treat Yu Zhi this way. Besides someone interfering and causing misunderstandings between them, she couldn't think of any other reason.","Actually, Yu Zhi thought the same way. Ji Fei had once used any means necessary to get Qin Xian, and now that he was treating her this way, it must be because Ji Fei had done something again!","Everyone was stunned by these words.","They had just been thinking how inexplicable Qin Xian's attitude toward Yu Zhi was. Although they had fantasized about the two getting back together, knowing Qin Xian's personality, they thought he would at least be outwardly friendly when meeting again, regardless of his inner feelings.","But now Qin Xian was being genuinely cold to Yu Zhi, unmoved even after learning the truth about the past. People couldn't help but imagine all sorts of dramatic misunderstandings.","And the prime suspect for causing such misunderstandings was naturally Ji Fei.","The curious onlookers' gazes swept toward Ji Fei.","Ji Fei was stunned.","Qin Xian remained silent.","This made both Zhu Lingling and Yu Zhi think their plan had succeeded - they had exposed Ji Fei and revealed the conspiracy to Qin Xian. They should have used this trump card against Ji Fei earlier.","This move would nail Ji Fei to the pillar of shame.","Feeling triumphant, Zhu Lingling turned on Ji Fei fiercely: \"Don't think having a marriage certificate makes you special. Everyone knows how you got the position of Mrs. Qin. In love, the one who isn't loved is the real third wheel. All your schemes and tricks are useless!\"","\"Ahem, ahem!\" Luo Fei finally couldn't hold back: \"Zhu Lingling, are you drunk? What nonsense are you spouting!\"","\"What's wrong with using some tactics to protect your own marriage?\" Bai Xiaoxi couldn't help but criticize. She wasn't defending Ji Fei, just purely criticizing Zhu Lingling's logic.","Yu Yue nodded: \"My darling is right.\"","As a complete outsider and fangirl, Han Ziyu silently watched everything, feeling heartbroken for her idol. The entertainment industry's judge who had protected so many innocent women on stage actually had so many problems in his own marriage.","They were clearly bullying Sister Fei. Indeed, these so-called upper-class people had such low moral standards!","\"A homewrecker is just a homewrecker...\" she muttered.","\"What are you mumbling about?\" Qi Li immediately looked at Han Ziyu with displeasure, not allowing her to show her personality.","Han Ziyu could only keep quiet.","Although Jing Yan and Cen Ting had been quite interested in watching the drama unfold and were curious about what choice Qin Xian would make, they didn't want things to get so ugly. They felt somewhat sympathetic toward Ji Fei, who had been suddenly exposed.","It was as if they were watching a pitiful woman struggling to maintain her marriage.","\"I thought you had changed, but clearly not, heh,\" Luo Zhou seized the opportunity to express his displeasure.","Just as Luo Zhou spoke, he felt a gaze suddenly coming from the doorway.","Although everyone in the hall was focused on watching the drama unfold here.","But that gaze had a particularly strong presence.","Luo Zhou suddenly turned around, but only saw servers coming and going, and the door closing. He suddenly felt empty inside. He had wanted to say a few harsh words to Ji Fei, but now lost interest, thinking of Tang Jiang. She said she had work tonight; he wondered if she had eaten yet.","Only Luo Zhou was suddenly distracted; everyone else continued their attacks.","\"Ji Fei, how could you do this? Sigh, Qin Xian, don't be angry with Ji Fei... It's just really unfair to Yu Zhi. Why don't you apologize?!\" Xuan Yi immediately said with fake sincerity.","\"No need, no need. It's my fault. I shouldn't have contacted Qin Xian. Ji Fei did the right thing,\" Yu Zhi said in a hoarse voice with tears, addressing Ji Fei: \"I followed what you said and haven't contacted Qin Xian again. I didn't want to come to the class reunion today, but I really missed everyone after not seeing them for so long, that's why I came. You don't need to mind what Lingling said... it's all in the past.\"","\"Yu Zhi, you're just too kind. Who knows what this woman has done behind both your backs to deepen your misunderstandings!\" Zhu Lingling seemed convinced this was the absolute truth.","[My native language is speechlessness - aren't they being too dramatic?! Although the drama is interesting, it's not fun when the drama backfires!]","Qin Xian also recovered from his immense shock and embarrassment. He had probably never experienced such a socially mortifying moment in his life; his whole body felt like it was burning.","He realized he truly couldn't understand women's thinking. He had never imagined this email would be used to attack Ji Fei.","At this moment, he deeply understood the meaning of the word 'embarrassment.'","Just as he was about to stand up and explain everything clearly, he heard Ji Fei's internal rant.","[I don't even need to investigate to know this is clearly fabricated by them to frame me. They really are determined to get Qin Xian!]","Qin Xian: ...well, actually it's not.","[Throwing mud at me? I'll plant lotus flowers with your ashes! Let me think about how to deal with you two idiots!]","Qin Xian: No need, I'll handle it.","[Wait! I'm at a disadvantage for counterattacking! After all, in this kind of relationship network, if I counterattack without Qin Xian's support, I'll be the only one laughed at in the end! Ah, got it! Isn't this an opportunity? I'll explain weakly that I didn't send it, Qin Xian naturally won't believe me easily since they've put on such a complete show, then I'll argue with Qin Xian and the others, try to escalate things! Finally, when it becomes irreconcilable, then I can... hehehe...]","Qin Xian: ...Yes, it is indeed an opportunity!","Ji Fei suddenly stood up with heightened intensity.","But before she could speak, Qin Xian beside her also stood up, reached out his long arm, and pulled Ji Fei into his embrace."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Why Am I Struggling to Understand My Native Language","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's grand and ambitious plans were interrupted by this sudden pull!","Before she could react, Qin Xian's deep voice came from above her head.","\"I apologize, this matter was my fault.\"","While everyone was confused by Qin Xian's action of pulling Ji Fei into his embrace, his apology was even more shocking.","\"Qin Xian, you don't need to apologize for her, what she did should be...\"","Two years ago, it was Qin Xian who apologized for Ji Fei's outburst, so everyone naturally assumed he was apologizing for her again.","But before Zhu Lingling could finish, Qin Xian clearly lowered his head and said to Ji Fei, who was staring at him with wide eyes in his arms: \"I'm sorry for causing this misunderstanding.\"","[What? Is he talking to me? Why am I suddenly having trouble understanding my native language?]","A slight smile tugged at Qin Xian's lips as he turned to address everyone: \"That email was sent by me using my wife's name.\"","Everyone present: Sorry, but at this moment, we're also having trouble understanding our native language!","This time, Yu Zhi was the first to lose her composure, \"Qin Xian, even if you want to cover for her, you can't...\"","Qin Xian was still quite embarrassed, but he took this opportunity to explain: \"That day when you sent an email requesting to meet me, my wife did see the email first, but she told me about it right away. I just felt it wouldn't be appropriate for me to reply directly, since any response would mean contact with an ex. I believed that since we had broken up, out of respect for my current relationship, there shouldn't be any private interactions. So I asked my wife to help me reply, but...\"","Qin Xian looked down at Ji Fei in his arms again, raising his eyebrows helplessly: \"My wife didn't want to help, so I had to do it myself.\"","Ji Fei was stunned.","The others were also dumbfounded, but those who knew Qin Xian knew he wouldn't stoop to lying.","So it was true? Was this something Qin Xian would actually do?","It was too childish, too undignified, too un-'Qin Xian-like.'","Like watching their idol's image crumble, Qin Xian's 'devoted fans' were devastated on the spot.","Those stares once again made Qin Xian feel the power of social death, and he was literally breaking out in a cold sweat. For once, even the mighty Mr. Qin wanted to dig a hole and crawl into it.","But he had to face the consequences of his own actions.","He instinctively tightened his hold on the soft warmth in his arms.","Ji Fei hadn't noticed Qin Xian's movement because her mind was currently filled with exclamation marks.","[He doesn't look like he's lying, did he really reply himself after that? Why did he use my name though?!]","Others also voiced Ji Fei's questions.","Qin Xian wasn't afraid of embarrassment anymore and looked directly at Yu Zhi, his gaze seeming to possess the power to see through everything, penetrating deep into one's soul.","Yu Zhi hadn't yet processed this earth-shattering revelation when this gaze made her whole body tremble, making her feel genuinely nervous for the first time.","\"Although there was an element of spite towards my wife, I thought that replying in her name would make any reasonable person understand that we are united as husband and wife, and maintain appropriate boundaries from then on, respecting each other's lives. However...\"","Qin Xian's gaze was like a searchlight, making Yu Zhi feel utterly ashamed.","Even Zhu Lingling beside her felt her face burning with shame, unable to utter any words of defense despite her trembling lips.","While Qin Xian's words were still polite, the impolite implications were silently conveyed.","If one had any sense of shame, after receiving a warning from someone's wife, they should have known their place and not tried to steal someone else's husband or do anything immoral.","Qin Xian had assumed this would solve the problem on the premise that Yu Zhi had some dignity.","At least in Qin Xian's previous understanding of Yu Zhi, she was a well-bred lady, an excellent woman who surely knew about honor and shame.","So Qin Xian never imagined Yu Zhi would team up with Zhu Lingling to bring this matter up.","After methodically explaining everything, Qin Xian still turned to Ji Fei and said: \"I'm sorry.\"","This soft, sincere apology was indeed because his oversight had caused Ji Fei to suffer undeserved consequences.","He only looked at Ji Fei, his eyes seeming to speak, no longer caring about others' reactions.","Ji Fei also stared blankly at Qin Xian, their suddenly meeting eyes showing a moment of panic.","Before Qin Xian could see clearly, Ji Fei calculated: \"I'm claiming compensation for defamation.\"","[Don't think you can get away with just two words, if you're going to be stingy, don't cause trouble for others.]","Qin Xian was helpless, almost whispering in her ear: \"...Alright, that's fair. How about ten million?\"","Ji Fei's eyes instantly lit up. \"Well, I suppose I'll have to accept.\"","[Such a small matter! Worth ten million, scam me, please scam me harder!]","Qin Xian...","[If only I could claim emotional damages from Yu Zhi, thinking back now, Qin Xian really needs this money to comfort his wounded heart, it's too mortifying, I'm even embarrassed for him, how can he remain so calm, is it like if I'm not embarrassed, others will be? Hahaha! Should I comfort him later, will he think I'm deliberately making fun of him?]","Qin Xian: Thanks, but no need for comfort. If you try to comfort me, I might have to leave this heartless world.","The others hadn't noticed the small interaction between the two because they were currently digesting this earth-shattering revelation!","The spectators could swear that among all their class reunions, they had never encountered such explosive drama, especially happening right before their eyes! With twist after twist, it was too intense.","At this point, the rights and wrongs were clear, and everyone's expressions towards Yu Zhi and Zhu Lingling had changed.","They had just been speculating about the wife's malicious interference, but it turned out they were the shameless ones, and the former school beauty's image came crashing down.","So now, no matter how tragic Yu Zhi's expression was, it all seemed extremely fake.","The surrounding crowd began to buzz with discussion.","Yu Zhi couldn't take it anymore, but still stubbornly tried to maintain her image, this time crying even louder to gain sympathy and buy herself some time, as her mind was too chaotic to process how things had developed this way.","But Zhu Lingling had lost it. She liked Qin Xian but was too insecure to pursue him, and when she saw Yu Zhi with him, she thought only someone as beautiful, intelligent, and excellent as Yu Zhi deserved him.","Not someone like Ji Fei who used tricks to get Qin Xian. If using tricks could make one Mrs. Qin, why couldn't it be her? So she couldn't accept seeing Qin Xian protecting Ji Fei like this now, and that constant use of \"wife\" was unbearable to her ears.","\"Qin Xian, have you forgotten that Yu Zhi is your true love? Have you forgotten that you once loved each other? Can you honestly say you don't have any feelings for Yu Zhi now? I understand, you're just too responsible, so you can't let go of this woman. You're just fulfilling your duties as a husband, but deep down you still have feelings for Yu Zhi.\"","Zhu Lingling frantically tried to pull Yu Zhi up, \"Yu Zhi, ask him!\"","Yu Zhi certainly knew the situation was unfavorable, but she didn't want to embarrass herself further, hoping to retreat from this battle and fight another day!","This time, the others at the table remained silent, not daring to speculate anymore.","Although they didn't want to admit it, Qin Xian truly treated Ji Fei differently, compared to Yu Zhi before... it was very different.","Qin Xian's calm gaze swept over, and after a moment's thought, he said: \"Have you been watching too many TV dramas? What true love? There never was any.\"","Perhaps after hearing Ji Fei complain about it too many times, he really hated this term now. This term implied lingering feelings.","But these words stunned Yu Zhi, as if denying everything, and she couldn't stay calm anymore to choose the best way to handle the situation.","\"Qin Xian, you're too heartless, how can you talk about our past like this, you...\"","\"I never said you were my true love, nor did I ever think so,\" Qin Xian coldly interrupted. \"You were just my ex-girlfriend, we broke up peacefully and parted ways amicably. That's our past. As for our previous relationship...\"","Qin Xian's gaze gradually turned cold. He didn't want to be too ruthless, but Yu Zhi and Zhu Lingling's behavior had already crossed the line.","\"I need to apologize to you. Only recently did I realize that I never truly had feelings for you. Starting a relationship without being certain was wrong, and since it was a mistake, there shouldn't be any possibility of it continuing. So, whether it's you or your friends, please stop these meaningless actions - you've already caused trouble for both me and my wife.\""]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Love Fairy Tales Are All Deceptions","paragraphs":["Qin Xian's words fell like thunder, plunging the entire venue into a silence that seemed to freeze time.","At this moment, Yu Zhi was trembling all over, looking at Qin Xian in disbelief.","She hadn't expected Qin Xian to suddenly overturn everything about their past relationship.","Qin Xian's meaning was crystal clear - there had never been any \"first love\" or \"deep, painful romance.\" It was all just everyone's imagination.","The entire gathering was shocked. Had all the romantic stories their classmates had been obsessing over been fake?!","Everyone had been intensely invested in this, treating it as the biggest gossip in campus and the most scandalous story in the business elite circles - was all that heartbreak actually nonexistent?!","The whole venue erupted in commotion, with people at nearby tables whispering among themselves.","\"Well... come to think of it, most of those romantic stories were just forum posts or hearsay.\"","\"Looking back, I never actually saw them being affectionate or clingy with each other on campus.\"","\"When Qin Xian had just broken up, I saw him every day and never once saw him looking sad. I thought he was just mentally strong, but turns out... he simply wasn't heartbroken at all!\"","\"All those romantic fairy tales were lies! My illusions are shattered!\"","Not just the others, even Ji Fei couldn't maintain her composure.","[What's going on? He never had true feelings for her! Is this real?! Were all those juicy stories that Secretary Jin knew about fake?! Was Secretary Jin also fooled by those shipping fans' brainwashing? No wonder, no wonder none of Qin Xian's family members ever mentioned Yu Zhi, and they seemed unaware that he even had an ex-girlfriend - they were the ones who hadn't been influenced by the rumors.]","Qin Xian paused, suddenly enlightened.","No wonder Ji Fei had stubbornly believed Yu Zhi was his \"first love\" and was convinced they would divorce. Even when he explained, Ji Fei would say \"I believe you\" on the surface, but inside she was thinking: \"You're just being stubborn.\"","Ji Fei must have heard lots of gossip from Secretary Jin and assumed he and Yu Zhi were deeply in love, then let her imagination run wild.","[So not only are there no feelings now, there were never any to begin with! Good heavens! What an astronomical misunderstanding! So I've been waiting for something that was never going to happen?! Ahhh, grass is indeed a plant!!!]","Qin Xian's lips curled into a smile, suddenly feeling a sense of relief, as if all his troubles had finally lifted.","At this moment, everyone at the table was staring in shock between Qin Xian and Yu Zhi, clearly stunned by this sudden revelation of truth.","Qin Xian swept his gaze across everyone at the table, as if telling them with his eyes that his previous words were meant for them too.","His stance was protecting Ji Fei, and he was opposing Yu Zhi.","With the previous Ji Fei, Qin Xian had only mechanically fulfilled his obligations, and his friends could naturally sense this. Though they weren't outright hostile to Ji Fei, they truly didn't like her, after all, she was the woman who had schemed against their friend. Even without Yu Zhi's existence, they wouldn't have respected Ji Fei much.","But now Qin Xian was meeting them again at such a formal occasion, bringing Ji Fei along, sending an important signal.","He valued Ji Fei.","Because they were Qin Xian's friends, they needed to respect Ji Fei.","Among the group, there were looks of surprise, acceptance, and some who had seen it coming.","Of course, there were also those who couldn't accept it, like Xuan Yi.","After all, Ji Fei had just offended Xuan Yi.","Seeing Zhu Lingling and Yu Zhi too shocked to recover, she inwardly cursed their uselessness.","Xuan Yi said, \"Qin Xian, you've gone too far. Even if it's to protect your current marriage, even if you can't be with Yu Zhi, you shouldn't completely deny your sweet memories of love...\"","Qin Xian frowned slightly and interrupted directly: \"There's no need to deny memories of love that never existed. I'm just stating facts. Or perhaps you could mention one or two instances, and I'll try to recall them right now?\"","Xuan Yi was dumbfounded, not expecting him to say this. Even Luo Zhou was now signaling Xuan Yi to be quiet, as Qin Xian's attitude was already very clear.","Zhu Lingling, having recovered from her shock, spoke in an almost shrill voice, \"How can you deny it? You loved Yu Zhi so much, you did so many things for her, like in this photo! That snowy night in sophomore year...\"","Zhu Lingling took out her phone, showing a photo of Qin Xian standing under a streetlight on a snowy night, appearing to be waiting for someone, with Yu Zhi running towards him.","Qin Xian felt Ji Fei stir in his arms.","Although he had only truly embraced Ji Fei at the beginning and had been loosely holding her since then, he could still feel her movements.","While Ji Fei's composure might have crumbled, she couldn't help but pause her emotional turmoil to eagerly watch this drama unfold.","Not being enthusiastic about gossip would be a waste.","Ji Fei was already curiously looking at the photo.","\"Enough, stop!\" Yu Zhi suddenly interrupted in panic, breathing heavily. Her eyes trembling, she finally managed to look up, tears welling in her eyes as she gazed at Qin Xian. This time, her appearance of enduring all grievances wasn't fake - she truly looked pitiful.","[Wow, she looks like she's about to break. With acting skills like these, if she ever runs out of money, she could definitely make it in the entertainment industry - she's a natural!]","Zhu Lingling fell silent, her eyes red, \"Yu Zhi, let us confront him!\"","Yu Zhi struggled to maintain her composure, taking a deep breath.","[Here we go! She's about to act again. How is she going to turn this around in this situation?! Can't wait to see the drama unfold, action!]","Qin Xian almost laughed in this serious situation, realizing he had no acting talent himself.","\"There's no need. Mr. Qin is... right about everything. I was delusional, I was presumptuous, I overestimated myself.\"","The expressions of those around changed slightly.","\"I...\"","But Qin Xian had lost his patience.","\"You directed and acted in your own show, spreading various rumors about us being a fairy-tale couple, the golden boy and jade girl, the most well-matched couple in high society. During our relationship, you were willing to show off our romance publicly, create a persona, build a couple's image - whether it was to satisfy your psychological needs or family interests, I didn't care because we were indeed in a relationship then. So I didn't mind the various rumors. But now you're being ambiguous, retreating to advance, trying to destroy the harmony between my wife and me, portraying us as the oppressors - that's not acceptable.\"","Qin Xian analyzed the situation clearly and calmly, directly cutting off Yu Zhi's approach.","Facing Yu Zhi, whose tears were about to fall, Qin Xian's gaze grew increasingly sharp. \"With that expression on your face, saying such things, beating around the bush - what conclusion do you hope everyone here will draw? Do you take me for a fool?\"","Yu Zhi stiffened, almost losing her balance. She suddenly realized that the man standing before her was an undefeated rising star in the business world - how could he not see through her little tricks?","Everyone's thoughts suddenly shifted - indeed, just moments ago, their conclusions had almost completely negated Qin Xian's statements...","\"We did have an amicable relationship, but it was absolutely nothing like the sweet romance that rumors suggested - you know this better than anyone.\" Qin Xian stated plainly, no longer looking at Yu Zhi's almost colorless face. He turned to the stunned Zhu Lingling, glanced at the photo on the phone, then looked around asking, \"How was this photo circulated outside?\""]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: Marketing Account or Actor, Once You Enter the Industry, You Are a Top Talent","paragraphs":["Qin Xian had never paid attention to those rumors, so naturally, he didn't know. But since they brought it up in such an irritating way, making Ji Fei curious, he had to clarify things.","Everyone had seen that photograph and naturally had heard the story behind it.","Luo Fei had already completely believed Qin Xian's words. Although she felt reluctant to say it, feeling it was too hurtful, it was indeed Yu Zhi and her group who had started the drama first. If Qin Xian didn't protect the person he cared about now, he wouldn't be Qin Xian - after all, the Qin Family was known for being protective of their own.","And now Ji Fei was officially under Qin Xian's protection.","\"They say you had a fever and were delirious, and because you missed Yu Zhi so much, you went looking for her in confusion. When you couldn't contact her, you waited under the streetlight until Yu Zhi found you.\"","As soon as Luo Fei finished speaking, the panic on Yu Zhi's face was evident.","Because when others had asked her about it, she had shyly implied it was true, and several people had witnessed this, so they had always thought...","Qin Xian's mouth was already twitching.","\"I seem to remember now - it was Christmas Eve when you went to the hospital and came back the next night with Yu Zhi. You still had a fever when you returned,\" Yu Yue, as his roommate, though believing Qin Xian's words, couldn't help but state the facts.","After Yu Yue's reminder, Qin Xian seemed to remember something and suddenly frowned, looking at Ji Fei. He didn't know how to begin.","Ji Fei blinked. [Why are you looking at me? Could it have something to do with me? Impossible.]","Qin Xian sighed and said, \"Do you remember when you were fifteen and fainted on your first day at our home, ending up in the hospital? It was Christmas Eve.\"","Everyone present knew about how the Qin Family had adopted Ji Fei when she was fifteen after her parents passed away and left her in their care.","Regarding the original memories, Ji Fei naturally knew, but faced with Qin Xian's recollection, she felt somewhat awkward and could only nod, \"I think so.\"","Qin Xian turned and explained, \"My parents were very worried that day, so they called all of us siblings to stay at the hospital, which is why I was there for a day. When I returned the next night, I hadn't gone looking for Yu Zhi - I just happened to be on my way back to the dormitory. As for standing under the streetlight, it was because... I was just thinking about something.\"","Qin Xian also remembered why he had stood there so long in the snowy night - he had been thinking about Ji Fei.","That day, when Ji Fei woke up in the hospital bed and suddenly said to them: \"I'm sorry, and thank you.\"","At that time, he couldn't understand Ji Fei's expression, and when she said she was tired and needed to sleep, he felt as if half his heart had emptied for a moment.","Until the next day when Ji Fei woke up, restored to her spirits, but suddenly started watching him frequently - that kind of gaze inexplicably made him very uncomfortable, so he made an excuse to return to school.","\"...I only got the fever later because I stood thinking for too long. I wasn't in the hospital because of a prior fever,\" Qin Xian calmly stated, \"If you want to verify the truth, everything can be checked with evidence.\"","\"Qin... Xian...\" Yu Zhi was dumbfounded, not expecting Qin Xian to be so cold and ruthless. Since he knew she had made it up, couldn't he show any consideration for their past relationship? Did he have to expose it right there?","Even if... even if there was no love, shouldn't there still be some sentiment from their years together?","Yu Zhi's eyes finally showed reproach. She wanted to question Qin Xian but fell silent when met with his cold gaze.","\"So it all started with one photo, and the whole story was made up? To achieve such an effect - even gossip accounts aren't this capable!\" Suddenly, Ji Fei's voice rang out. Although it was just a small jab, it was like oil hitting a hot pan.","The previously quiet scene instantly became chaotic.","What a major plot twist!","Ji Fei realized she had gotten too caught up in watching the drama and accidentally spoke out, immediately shutting her mouth. After all, in this situation, if she intervened further, she would become involved, and would be attacked. She preferred observing from the sidelines.","If Qin Xian hadn't been holding her, Ji Fei would probably have sat down to watch the show while eating snacks.","\"I can't believe it! It was all fake!\"","\"Fine, fine, fine! Online celebrity couples are fake, and now real-life couples are fake too? Don't NPCs' lives matter? Where's the beautiful love I believed in?!\"","\"I'm really starting to believe that showing off your love leads to quick death!\"","\"Now I understand what it means to lift a rock only to drop it on your own feet. The married couple was living peacefully, but when Yu Zhi came back and pulled this stunt, she ended up hurting herself.\"","\"Hilarious! Zhu Lingling just said the unloved one is the third wheel, but now who's the third wheel?\"","[Tsk tsk tsk, this is truly a satisfying breakdown. I feel like I'm watching countless CP fans facing the horror of their ship being destroyed right before their eyes.]","The discussions grew so loud that Yu Zhi was trembling all over.","Zhu Lingling's face turned pale as she turned to Yu Zhi. \"What he said is true? Your past love was all fake! You lied to me!\"","[Ah, the silence has been shattered, regret comes rushing in~]","Yu Zhi's lips trembled, knowing she had completely lost any chance with Qin Xian and that her image was about to crumble. She had to cut her losses.","Suddenly, Yu Zhi seemed to break down and said, \"Yes, I did it.\"","She looked at Qin Xian and said, \"Back then, although you agreed to date me, you were always so cold. What could I do? I loved you, so I could only deceive myself. Then everyone started believing more and more in our love story, and I was pushed forward with no choice. When I saw you didn't clarify things, I thought you had tacitly approved. Now you come to refute it, making me lose face. Why are you being so cruel to me? I mistakenly thought you were just showing indifference but actually wanted me inside. I was even worried you would suffer because of my illness, would waste your time waiting for me, so I painfully broke up... I finally came back, how could you... treat me like this, wuu wuu wuu.\"","This confession gradually silenced everyone, as they stared at Yu Zhi, momentarily unable to voice any criticism.","\"Saying such things face to face is a bit too harsh!\"","\"Yu Zhi's sincere feelings were just misplaced, it's actually quite pitiful. She left when she was sick, held onto hope to come back and see Qin Xian, only to hear all this - just thinking about it is heartbreaking.\"","\"It's actually understandable. After all, there were rumors that Ji Fei's position wasn't legitimate, so when Yu Zhi came back wanting to test things out, trying to win back her true love... it's not completely unforgivable, right? It's just that we didn't expect the couple to actually be so good together! If I hadn't come today and seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn't have believed it either!\"","...","[If I didn't know the truth, I would have sympathized with Yu Zhi too! Honestly, whether as a marketing account or an actress, you'd be top talent in the industry! At this point, we can't just watch her turn the situation around. We should first question her health issues, then make her prove it. If she doesn't dare to prove it, wouldn't that show she's lying?]","But before Ji Fei could act.","Qin Xian stepped in again, as he couldn't let Ji Fei risk being attacked, even if she would succeed.","\"I remember now, before you went abroad, you participated in the class physical examination at the Qin Corporation's private hospital. Because you were my girlfriend then, someone showed me your medical report... there didn't seem to be any problems. What happened? Did you suddenly get sick during those two days?\"","This made-up lie instantly drained all color from Yu Zhi's face.","Had that really happened?","Why couldn't she remember? At that time, she had been too busy, overwhelmed with many things.","But seeing Qin Xian so calm, was it true?!!!","She was finished..."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Hey, are you picking on me","paragraphs":["Because Qin Xian had always maintained an image of someone who wouldn't lie or deceive others, and since six or seven years had passed, who would remember what happened back then?","Moreover, Qin Xian had just exposed the rumors and clarified the situation, which had repeatedly embarrassed Yu Zhi and Zhu Lingling.","So even though it was bombshell news, everyone immediately believed Qin Xian and turned to look at the person in question, shocked.","\"What does that mean?\" Luo Fei was the first to react, \"Was the illness fake?\"","Qin Xian calmly looked at Yu Zhi.","Yu Zhi was already panicking, wanting to shake her head, but the voices around her were so overwhelming that she could barely breathe.","\"It was fake?\"","\"Come to think of it, we never heard about her being sick. Even if it was well-hidden, there should have been some news.\"","\"I only knew she went abroad, and heard she continued her studies. Their Yu family's business moved overseas at that time too, and they've focused on international markets since then.\"","\"That's what I heard too.\"","\"Oh my god, I can't believe the school beauty was so dramatic. Looking back now, serious illness, breakup, going abroad - isn't this straight out of a TV drama?\"","\"Too bad our Prince Qin wouldn't play along with her act.\"","\"So why did she break up and go abroad back then, acting like she had no choice?\"","\"I have a feeling that now that this lie has been exposed, we might learn the truth soon.\"","The onlookers were excited like they were waiting for a grand finale, all eyes fixed on their table.","Ji Fei hadn't expected that she wouldn't even need to make an appearance - Qin Xian was carrying the whole show. Hearing his words, Ji Fei was stunned.","[So he knew all along! I was wondering why he had no reaction before - turns out he was just pretending not to see what was happening!]","Qin Xian could only say that he had originally planned to ignore it since there was no evidence, and whether she had been sick or not was irrelevant to him - she could make up whatever she wanted. But Yu Zhi had tried to use her supposed serious illness to manipulate others morally.","This was karma.","\"What's really going on here? Yu Zhi, have you been lying to us?\" Bai Xiaoxi couldn't help but ask. Being as innocent as she was, she had genuinely felt sorry earlier and even felt guilty for not keeping in touch with Yu Zhi afterward.","Now being told it was all fake, Bai Xiaoxi was truly angry.","And Cen Ting, who hadn't participated much in the discussion, couldn't help but angrily say: \"Yu Zhi, how could you joke about something like this?\"","Xuan Yi frowned, and although he agreed with Qin Xian's statement, he still couldn't help but suggest: \"Yu Zhi, could this be a misunderstanding? Didn't Zhu Lingling say you were staying in a sanatorium?\"","Zhu Lingling, who had already been devastated by the collapse of her shipped couple, suddenly grabbed Yu Zhi's arm like a betrayed fan and demanded: \"Your illness was real, right? You left because you loved Qin Xian too much, because you couldn't bear to leave him, and now you've recovered, so you've come back to find him, right?!\"","It was as if as long as there was this tragic ending, Zhu Lingling could still see hope for Qin Xian and Yu Zhi to be together.","That way, she could always stay by their side.","Yu Zhi knew she couldn't admit to this. The previous rumors could be explained away as intentional shows of affection, but if the illness was a lie, her image would be completely ruined.","\"Of course it was real. How could I possibly lie about being sick? If it weren't for the illness, why would I have initiated breaking up with Qin Xian?\" After saying this, Yu Zhi quickly got back into character, looking at Qin Xian with heart-wrenching grief.","\"I don't remember the school physical examination, but I had a checkup with my family and discovered the problem. Then I had several follow-up diagnoses. During that time, I often took leave and was in a bad mood - if anyone remembers, they would know. Perhaps... perhaps there was a mistake with the school physical.\" Yu Zhi seemed to grow more confident as she spoke. \"And I did stay in a sanatorium for several years. All of this can be verified, it's just that patient privacy can't be disclosed.\"","Zhu Lingling seemed to finally catch her breath at this point, then turned to Qin Xian, \"Qin Xian, you heard that. I knew you must have misunderstood Yu Zhi, thinking she was lying, that's why you've been treating her this way today. If you don't believe it, you can check if Yu Zhi stayed at the sanatorium!\"","Zhu Lingling was absolutely certain about this point, as she had been studying in that country at the time.","This rebuttal immediately made everyone uncertain. Could it really be a misunderstanding?","Had Qin Xian misunderstood? Was that why he had been so harsh with Yu Zhi today?","[She can even turn this around at the last moment, fighting for survival?! Although it's quite forced, I have to say Yu Zhi's ability to handle pressure is really impressive!]","Qin Xian slightly frowned, not expecting Yu Zhi to be so thick-skinned, still insisting even at this point.","Although there were ways to expose her lies again, it would be very troublesome and impossible to accomplish tonight.","[It seems there's no other way except forcing her to get a medical examination now. After all, that sanatorium is indeed very private, only serving old money nobility in that country. Even Qin Xian can't investigate what goes on inside. Yu Zhi only stayed there so long because she was almost engaged and was trying to curry favor by taking care of that family's elderly patient. But this engagement plan was also kept very secret to prevent interference, so people only knew Yu Zhi had stayed at the sanatorium. But from a normal person's perspective, who would stay at a sanatorium without being sick? They'd naturally assume she was ill!]","Yu Zhi was indeed very clever, just not using it for good purposes. Her actions left almost no loopholes - she only ran into trouble tonight because of running into the anomaly that was Ji Fei.","[Looks like this is as far as it goes...]","Ji Fei felt a bit disappointed, like watching a drama with an unsatisfying ending.","Everyone else was also uncertain about what the truth really was.","Seeing that Qin Xian had stopped speaking, Yu Zhi finally breathed a sigh of relief. She wondered if perhaps he really had seen some medical examination results that made him think she was lying, which explained his attitude tonight - maybe he hadn't stopped caring about her after all.","Yu Zhi still held onto her fantasy, so she couldn't help but look at Qin Xian pitifully again, \"Regardless of everything else, at least I broke up with you because I loved you. I... I'm not the type who uses love as an excuse to restrict and possess others...\"","Everyone's expressions changed slightly.","[Oh, trying to take a shot at me, are we?! Looks like she thinks she's won and is trying to bite back now?! Want to bet whether I'll have you rushed to the hospital for an examination right now?!]","But before Yu Zhi could start playing the victim and stirring up emotions to salvage her image, she saw Qin Xian looking at her with ice-cold eyes.","He took out his phone and made a call.","His assistant answered quickly.","Qin Xian said directly: \"Contact the XX Sanatorium in Country A for me.\""]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: 【Guys, you've got it right】","paragraphs":["Yu Zhi paused, unable to believe her eyes as she looked at Qin Xian.","Everyone else was stunned. No way... Even if Qin Xian is the CEO of Qin Corporation, he can't have his hands in everything overseas, can he?","\"Qin Xian, are you really going to ask...\" Even the most composed observer, Jing Yan, was taken aback. Was he really going to keep pressing like this? It wasn't necessary.","Given the current situation, regardless of the truth, Yu Zhi was sure that Qin Xian's inquiry would only confirm that she had stayed in a sanatorium. Yu Zhi wasn't foolish enough to lie about that.","Such a risky verification was out of character for Qin Xian. It was too impulsive. What if he couldn't get the answer, or if the answer turned out to be exactly as Yu Zhi had said? Wouldn't that be self-humiliation?","Did Qin Xian even care about his image anymore?","Ji Fei also looked at Qin Xian with confusion. She too thought this approach was impulsive. It was almost like indirectly proving Yu Zhi's claims.","Ji Fei's mind raced, filled with random thoughts.","[Maybe he really thinks Yu Zhi is lying, which is why he's treating her like this. Now he's so eager to verify, and then...]","Qin Xian heard her thoughts and shot her an annoyed glance.","\"We'll talk after the call,\" Qin Xian said with a stern voice.","Seeing his bad mood, Ji Fei stopped her random thoughts.","In truth, he shouldn't have used such an offensive method. It wasn't like him to do anything without certainty.","It was just that Yu Zhi had tried to emotionally manipulate him again, and even took a dig at Ji Fei, trying to use her as a comparison. If she succeeded, by the end of tonight's reunion, the circle would be buzzing with how deeply Yu Zhi loved him and how selfish Ji Fei was in climbing to her position.","How could he allow Yu Zhi to target Ji Fei knowing this outcome?","The atmosphere remained awkward.","Yu Zhi hadn't expected Qin Xian to actually doubt her so much. She felt deeply hurt.","At that moment, she woke up and finally stopped fantasizing. Qin Xian had never loved her, and now he wasn't even leaving her any dignity.","Yu Zhi bit her lower lip, her heart filled with hatred. She thought, let him contact them. As long as Qin Xian finds out she stayed there, it would only further prove her point.","Tonight, she had to secure her position as the one to be pitied.","Her family had already returned to the country in disgrace. If she didn't have a good image, it wouldn't benefit the family. A woman in love was always better than a two-faced one.","So this wasn't just about her personal image but also the family's public image.","By then, Qin Xian would feel guilty towards her, right? Maybe, even if there was no love before, under the weight of guilt, she still had a chance! She didn't believe she could lose to Ji Fei, who was brainless and whose family background was practically non-existent.","Soon, Qin Xian's phone rang. Although the call seemed insignificant, everyone waited for the outcome, curious to see what would happen.","Qin Xian put the call on speaker.","A foreign service voice came through.","Though not in English, many present could understand it.","Ji Fei initially thought she wouldn't understand and was frustrated about missing the first-hand gossip. But to her surprise, she understood perfectly.","The joy of this discovery almost overshadowed her excitement for the gossip.","For someone who was terrible at English, suddenly being able to fluently understand another language was like unlocking a skill.","It was strange though. Inheriting memories, but not skills?","Never mind, the gossip was more important. Thanks to her past self! Free foreign language skill acquired.","\"Hello, Mr. Qin, this is the comprehensive service department of XX Sanatorium in Country A. How may we assist you?\"","\"I have a friend...\" Qin Xian began, speaking fluent and pleasant foreign language with grace and composure.","Finally here!","Yu Zhi instinctively held her breath, recalling everything to ensure there wouldn't be any issues, and waited for Qin Xian to ask.","\"She has a rare disease and hopes to be admitted to your facility.\"","The entire audience: Huh?","Weren't they going to ask if Yu Zhi had stayed there?","What kind of question was this?","Everyone was full of questions.","The person on the phone politely asked for the patient's identity information.","Qin Xian made up a friend from the country.","Everyone listened as he spoke convincingly, completely baffled.","Until the other party apologized, \"We're sorry, Mr. Qin, our facility has a rule to only serve guests with noble titles in Country A. We cannot accommodate other guests.\"","At this, Qin Xian's eyes finally relaxed.","Among the crowd, the first to react was Luo Fei, the police officer, who immediately looked at Yu Zhi.","Yu Zhi also seemed to realize something, her eyes widening, pupils contracting, her lips trembling, unable to stop it.","She heard Qin Xian suddenly speak in an unhappy tone to the service staff on the phone, \"A female guest surnamed Yu stayed in your facility for several years. I heard about it from her. As far as I know, she still holds our nationality. That's why I wanted to send my friend there. Now you're telling me no? I think your director should give me a satisfactory answer.\"","Although the sanatorium had high standards, they wouldn't easily offend someone of Qin Xian's international stature.","The service staff, having learned Qin Xian's identity during the previous conversation, quickly explained.","While they couldn't disclose patient information, other details were less sensitive, especially since their facility was well-known and it was normal for people to know who had stayed there.","\"Mr. Qin, I think I can explain this clearly without involving the director. The female surnamed Yu indeed stayed with us for several years, but she was not a patient here and did not receive treatment. She was merely accompanying someone. Our facility has never accommodated guests from your country. We strictly adhere to...\"","Everyone couldn't listen anymore.","Because the truth was out.","Not a patient, no treatment, just accompanying someone who was a patient. So she was there to take care of a patient?","\"Damn! She was really lying!\"","\"My God, how could she lie so much!\"","\"Wait, since the patients there are either rich or noble, and there's no news of the Yu family having foreign noble relatives. Why would the Yu family's daughter do this?\"","\"This kind of situation... there was a similar scandal abroad, about her... taking care of her fiancé's mother, very famous!\"","\"So that means... she was planning to marry into a foreign noble family, so she went to the sanatorium to please the patient?\"","\"I think so!\"","\"Then why did she come back?\"","\"Definitely failed, so she came back to try and get Qin Xian.\"","[You guys got it right!]","The information was too explosive, so everyone was too excited in their discussions, their voices uncontrollable. Ji Fei naturally heard it too.","When Ji Fei heard, everyone else did too. Yu Zhi's face was truly indescribable, almost like a dead person's.","After this call, it meant she was truly finished.","There was no chance for any comeback or explanation.","People were already condemning her, and gossip was spreading through phones.","\"She's treating our Qin Xian as a backup plan?! Now she's settling for second best, is she crazy?!\"","\"If Qin Xian wasn't smart, he'd have been accused of being heartless by now. Her schemes are too deep.\"","\"What a great show, Yu Zhi really knows how to act!\"","\"The key is, she keeps provoking, but if she had stopped even once during that process, she wouldn't have been exposed. I can only say, don't provoke if you don't want to die!\"","[Poor thing, too poor. Poking at him, you really stepped on a durian.]","Before Yu Zhi could process, a loud slap covered all the discussions."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Are Your Backing Up Moves for Real","paragraphs":["Yu Zhi was struck so hard that she staggered out of her seat, her head ringing.","\"Bitch! You lied to me!\"","Zhu Lingling's roar echoed through the hall, leaving everyone in stunned silence as they watched the once-close friends turn against each other.","Yu Zhi, being from a wealthy family, had never been struck before. Her fair cheeks quickly flushed red, and almost instinctively, she turned back, glaring fiercely at Zhu Lingling.","The anger momentarily robbed her of her reason, shattering her usual elegant demeanor.","\"How dare you hit me? Zhu Lingling, are you out of your mind?\"","\"I think you're the one who's lost it! You have no shame! How could you deceive me like this? I supported you, helped you deal with Ji Fei, and even wanted to help you win back Qin Xian! How could you betray me like this? Your illness was fake, your relationship with Qin Xian was fake! You've been lying to me from the start, using me!\"","Zhu Lingling was truly devastated. Now that Yu Zhi's true nature had been exposed, it was all too clear how despicable she was. This was something Zhu Lingling could not accept. In her mind, only a perfect Yu Zhi deserved a perfect Qin Xian, a match made in heaven.","If someone like Yu Zhi could become Qin Xian's girlfriend, then why couldn't she compete? At least she was sincere about her feelings for Qin Xian. If he were willing to be with her, she would overlook any family concerns.","But because Yu Zhi had embellished her relationship with Qin Xian, Zhu Lingling couldn't even feel jealous. She felt there was no hope or chance, so she chose to support their relationship from the start, rather than trying to win Qin Xian for herself.","Now, everything seemed like a joke.","Zhu Lingling felt that her entire life had been wasted by Yu Zhi's deceit.","Yu Zhi's face alternated between shades of green and red. Already having lost everything, Zhu Lingling's betrayal only made matters worse.","Now everyone clearly knew that she had returned to steal a married man and target his wife.","Although such things were common in high society, everyone still maintained a facade of decency. Who would expose it so blatantly?","She could almost hear the mockery growing louder!","This was truly the final straw, stripping away her last shred of dignity.","For some reason, Yu Zhi instinctively looked towards Qin Xian.","[Indeed, when fans turn against you, the damage is the greatest! Hehe, it's getting more and more exciting, fight, fight...]","Qin Xian found Ji Fei's gleeful commentary amusing. However, he seemed to remember something and spoke softly to Ji Fei, completely oblivious to Yu Zhi's pleading gaze.","\"What did that phone call just say...?\" Qin Xian began.","Ji Fei, puzzled, replied, \"I understood it.\"","Qin Xian was taken aback.","Strange, he remembered Ji Fei accompanying him to a meeting with foreign partners once, but she couldn't understand them then.","Had she learned it later?","Qin Xian had his doubts but didn't delve deeper.","Ji Fei simply assumed that Qin Xian didn't know his nominal wife well enough and didn't think much of it. She continued to enjoy the drama.","Meanwhile, Zhu Lingling was in a frenzy, growing more and more furious.","She kept cursing, \"Bitch!\"","Finally, Yu Zhi couldn't take it anymore and completely lost it.","\"You're the bitch! Don't think I don't know why you wanted to be friends with me. You like Qin Xian too, don't you? You just wanted to be by my side as a friend to see Qin Xian every day. I even saw you hugging his coat and secretly sniffing it in a disgusting manner!\"","The revelation left everyone gasping in shock, their eyes darting around in disbelief.","Even Qin Xian froze.","Ji Fei turned to look at Qin Xian, startled.","[I was too busy eating popcorn to pay attention earlier. Let me check... Oh my god, it's true. One treats him as a backup, the other is just plain creepy. What kind of people are these! Sympathies to Qin Xian, I'm lighting a candle for you.]","Qin Xian felt a bit dizzy, given his slight obsession with cleanliness.","Ji Fei, seeing his pale face, patted his shoulder sympathetically.","The others at the table didn't know what to say, overwhelmed by the series of shocks.","But seeing Ji Fei pat Qin Xian in comfort, several couldn't help but chuckle.","Indeed, laughter only shifts, it never disappears.","Zhu Lingling wasn't afraid of being exposed for liking Qin Xian, but being publicly called out for such behavior made her furious. She lunged at Yu Zhi, grabbing her hair and starting a brawl, all the while cursing.","\"I'll kill you, you slut!\"","Yu Zhi, too, abandoned her image as a refined socialite from the upper class and fought back against Zhu Lingling, who was like a rabid dog, refusing to let go.","Everyone was stunned. Such a scene was rare to see, and they quickly pulled out their phones to take covert photos.","The last time such a scene occurred at a reunion was when Ji Fei attended.","Back then, Ji Fei had vented her anger alone, and Qin Xian had intervened in time, preventing a major uproar.","Now, with both women pulling hair and slapping each other, accompanied by curses, the chaos was even more intense.","In the end, Luo Fei, Xuan Yi, and Cen Ting had to step in to break up the fight.","The reunion had to be cut short.","Yu Zhi, probably too ashamed to face anyone, left in tears, likely never to return to the country for development.","Everyone was left in awe. Who could have predicted that tonight would see the male lead himself battling his former love, with the original wife watching the drama unfold?","The group gathered at the hotel entrance, gossiping in small clusters, waiting for their cars.","Qin Xian and Ji Fei stood together, with the others from their table gradually joining them.","Luo Fei spoke first, \"I was planning to announce my marriage to Shi Shi tonight, but the atmosphere was ruined. I'll just send you all invitations later.\"","Qin Xian nodded.","Luo Fei chuckled, glancing between Qin Xian and Ji Fei, \"When will your wedding be...?\"","Tonight, he had seen the depth of his friend's feelings.","The question piqued the interest of the others, who were now mostly indifferent, as long as Qin Xian was happy.","Only Xuan Yi, Luo Zhou, and Qi Li still looked somewhat displeased.","Qin Xian's response remained the same, turning to Ji Fei, \"It's up to her.\"","Ji Fei, who had been thinking about what she might have missed tonight, turned to look at Qin Xian.","\"Huh?\"","[Isn't the drama over? What is he talking about now?]","Qin Xian sighed. Could it be that he had never been acting in the first place?","Could such a thing be faked?","Just as he was about to speak, a voice came from a distance.","\"Qin Xian, I have something to tell you!\" Zhu Lingling suddenly rushed over, standing before Qin Xian.","Qin Xian almost reflexively pulled Ji Fei back a step.","Zhu Lingling's expression changed at the action.","All eyes focused on them.","Ji Fei almost burst out laughing.","[Are you serious with that step back? Look, her face turned green. Hehehe.]"]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: We Will Not Divorce","paragraphs":["Zhu Lingling was actually quite pretty, though her spoiled temperament made her appear somewhat fierce. She must have hurriedly dressed up just now, as she no longer looked as disheveled as she did after the fight.","She took a deep breath, as if unwilling to miss another chance, and loudly declared, \"Qin Xian, I love you, I truly love you. I've loved you for ten years, since the first time I saw you in freshman year. Before, I was deceived by Yu Zhi and didn't want to ruin your happiness, so I never tried to pursue you. But now I can't hold back anymore - I want to be with you!\"","Everyone was stunned, staring at Zhu Lingling in disbelief.","\"Is this normal? Isn't this bizarre?\"","\"Even Yu Zhi tried to steal him secretly!\"","\"His legitimate wife is right there, and Zhu Lingling is publicly declaring she wants to steal someone's husband - how can she be so brazen? Couldn't she at least be discreet about it?\"","\"She must have really lost her mind, her mental state is quite something.\"","\"She was always quite... bold.\"","\"Tonight she's really gone all out.\"","\"If I were her parents, I'd be furious.\"","\"That's not quite right - this kind of personality isn't something ordinary parents could cultivate.\"","\"Come to think of it, I'm quite impressed that Yu Zhi used to be able to keep Zhu Lingling in check.\"","Naturally, Zhu Lingling's earth-shattering confession also shocked Ji Fei and Qin Xian.","[I really thought she was just here as muscle tonight. What's this? The cannon fodder became the boss? I've seen many types of dramatic confrontations, but this is a first. I have to say, being this direct somehow makes it hard to see her as a shameless homewrecker. Is this what happens when you abandon all morals - you don't feel the need to hide what you're doing? There's always a bigger fish! I'm impressed!]","Qin Xian had never encountered this kind of situation either!","[At a time like this, if I were to step in and slap her, would it count as justified self-defense and emergency response? No, no, no - Newton's Third Law means my hand would hurt too. Though netizens call me the Slapping Sister, those were all fake slaps.]","While Ji Fei was lost in her thoughts, her hand was suddenly grabbed by Qin Xian beside her and held up in front of Zhu Lingling.","\"Miss Zhu, can't you see my wife is right here beside me?\" Qin Xian's tone carried displeasure, notably addressing her as 'Miss Zhu.'","This immediately brought tears to Zhu Lingling's eyes, but she was more aggressive than Yu Zhi.","She glared fiercely at Ji Fei and said, \"I'm more suitable for Qin Xian than you. I'm the only precious daughter in my family, and all of the Zhu family's assets will be mine in the future. Our Zhu family's business perfectly complements the Qin Corporation. If he marries me, it would be a powerful alliance. As long as Qin Xian is willing, I and everything the Zhu family owns can be dedicated to him.\"","Zhu Lingling held her head high as if looking down on Ji Fei.","But everyone around looked at Zhu Lingling as if she were crazy.","[Damn, is this what they call extreme love-brain syndrome? You're really killing your parents with this filial piety.]","Just as Ji Fei was about to make some sarcastic remarks.","Zhu Lingling said, \"Just name your price to divorce Qin Xian!\"","Ji Fei froze.","[Huh? What?]","Qin Xian immediately looked at Ji Fei.","\"Several hundred million or whatever assets, I can afford it all, as long as you agree to divorce him.\"","[Several hundred million... that means at least 200 million, right?]","Qin Xian's eyes narrowed dangerously.","[Wow, never expected this - to think this classic 'throw money at someone to leave' scene would actually happen to me! Kind of exciting!]","Qin Xian took a deep breath, \"Miss Zhu, what do you take me for, a commodity to be traded? My wife doesn't need a few hundred million.\"","Ji Fei quickly glanced at Qin Xian. She certainly couldn't make such a deal in public, after all, Zhu Lingling wasn't a good person either, and she couldn't be so unprofessional as to sell her husband. Though she felt a tiny bit of regret.","After all, in her original world, during those difficult times, how she had wished for such a scene to play out!","She had even imagined the dialogue back then.","Now the scene had arrived, but she couldn't take the role.","[Sigh, actually... I do need it.]","Just as Ji Fei casually sighed, she felt the hand holding hers suddenly tighten painfully, though it quickly loosened again.","\"We won't divorce,\" Qin Xian suddenly spoke, then pulled Ji Fei to face him, as if speaking only to her, and seriously repeated, \"We won't divorce.\"","Ji Fei was stunned by Qin Xian's sudden earnestness.","Qin Xian's eyes were very dark, and under the night lights, they sparkled with scattered light, like the depths of the night sky that one longed to explore yet feared getting lost in.","\"Ji Fei will be my only wife.\"","While Ji Fei was still in a daze, Qin Xian had already announced this to everyone present.","It was final.","His wife would only be Ji Fei, never anyone else.","Zhu Lingling looked at Qin Xian with hurt in her eyes, \"Qin Xian, everything I said is true. You're a businessman, don't you understand weighing pros and cons?\"","Qin Xian let out a derisive laugh: \"Ji Fei is my wife. I don't know what kind of family education you received, but our family didn't teach us to weigh pros and cons when it comes to our wives. Besides, even if I were to weigh things, you'd be worthless in my eyes.\"","Perhaps speaking like this would offend the Zhu family, but Zhu Lingling had offended them first.","If you don't mess with me, I won't mess with you - Qin Xian was never one to be pushed around.","Being publicly rejected by her love interest like this, Zhu Lingling naturally couldn't hold back anymore and glared angrily at Ji Fei.","\"You're just an orphan abandoned by your family, living off others' charity, dependent on the Qin family's goodwill. How dare you compete with me for Qin Xian?\"","The moment those words left her mouth, her already swollen face received another slap.","Everyone was shocked.","After a whole evening of drama, Ji Fei, the female lead and Mrs. Qin, had finally taken action!","\"You can say what you want about me, but bringing up my deceased family means you're asking for a beating,\" Ji Fei said coolly.","People thought it was over, but another slap followed.","\"And insulting my in-laws is also not allowed. They've been so good to me!\" Ji Fei was truly done this time.","But after hitting her, she felt a bit scared inside. So she slightly hid behind Qin Xian.","When Zhu Lingling came to her senses and was about to explode in anger, she saw Qin Xian standing in front of Ji Fei, saying coldly, \"Miss Zhu, please show some self-respect. Also, don't appear before my wife and me again.\"","This statement was meant for everyone to hear, essentially announcing the severance of ties with the Zhu family.","In the future, they need not be invited to any events where Zhu Lingling would be present.","Everyone was surprised that even Yu Zhi's actions hadn't resulted in such consequences, yet Zhu Lingling merely said one thing about Ji Fei, and this happened...","It seemed Ji Fei wasn't just a wife Qin Xian acknowledged - it was more than that.","Soon, their car arrived, and Qin Xian left the venue with Ji Fei.","The journey was quiet until Qin Xian transferred some compensation money to Ji Fei for damages to her reputation, which finally brought her back from her thoughts about what had just happened.","\"I'm sorry about tonight's events. It was all because of me,\" Qin Xian apologized sincerely.","Ji Fei, having received the money, naturally smiled cheerfully. \"It's fine, it's fine. You've had it rough too, with your true love treating you like this! And having a stalker eyeing you.\"","Qin Xian frowned, his expression turning unpleasant, \"Still don't believe me? Yu Zhi is not my true love.\"","Ji Fei immediately said, \"I believe you, I really do.\"","[I believe it, I must believe it. If this turns out to be another stubborn love tangle, what awaits won't be just a dramatic scene but dancing on my grave!]","[It's good though, Qin Xian is a good person. It's better that he's not being deceived by bad women.]","Qin Xian drove while waiting to hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","But all the way home, there was complete silence.","Qin Xian: ...Is that it? Nothing more? Hasn't she thought about my other words tonight, my other actions?","Qin Xian's lips moved slightly, his heartbeat gradually accelerating, as if the entire car could hear his heartbeat."]}]);
